window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_AFTER_TRANSMIGRATING_AS_A_TYCOONS_WIFE_MY_THOUGHTS_ARE_HEARD_BY_THE_WHOLE_FAMILY_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201: Because I'm Attracted to You, I Want to Be With You","paragraphs":["When Ji Fei arrived home, she was about to unfasten her seatbelt and get out of the car. She seemed preoccupied, feeling as if she had forgotten something important that evening.","There was nothing she could do about it; after all, tonight had been filled with so much juicy and explosive gossip that her brain was a bit overloaded.","Before she could get out, someone grabbed her wrist.","Ji Fei turned around to see Qin Xian's eyes gleaming as he gazed at her, his expression somewhat uncomfortable, as if he had something to say.","[He's already apologized and paid up, what else could he want?]","\"What is it?\" Ji Fei asked.","\"Ji Fei, didn't you always want to have a wedding ceremony?\" Qin Xian became nervous. \"Now, whenever you want, we can have one.\"","Qin Xian was someone who was very inexperienced in matters of the heart and reserved in expressing himself, especially when it came to these first-time feelings of love, which were truly foreign to him.","So he gave the choice to Ji Fei.","He wasn't stupid; the current Ji Fei was so different from six months ago, probably because their terrible relationship over the past two years had completely discouraged her. That's why she had come to terms with it, let go, given up, and was now fully focused on thoughts of divorce.","He knew Ji Fei no longer had that persistence towards him.","She might like his looks, his money, but as for him... Ji Fei probably didn't like him anymore, after all, that initial like and obsession had come rather inexplicably.","Realizing he had developed feelings, yet understanding Ji Fei's situation, Qin Xian felt anxious and sad about potentially losing her.","It was his fault for not having the patience to discover the real her before, and now it was too late for regrets.","He didn't know what to do, he just instinctively wanted to hold onto Ji Fei, who seemed ready to leave at any moment. As long as Ji Fei didn't actively bring up divorce, he thought he still had a chance to salvage everything.","It was laughable really; he had always been emotionally subdued, and the word 'nervous' seemed to rarely appear in his life.","But right now, he felt tingles throughout his body, and even breathing became somewhat difficult.","Ji Fei's eyes gradually widened in disbelief.","[Is he serious?! Having a wedding ceremony with me? What's he thinking? Even if there isn't a first love... wait? If there was never any first love, why didn't we have a wedding ceremony before... I get it, it must be because we're getting along well now, and after tonight's class reunion, he feels he should give me the proper ceremony, after all, it doesn't look good that the Qin family heir doesn't even have a proper wedding to show for it.]","Qin Xian paused, naturally unable to deny Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","[Without a first love, there won't be all those messy complications to bother me, and now my husband is rich, handsome, and has good character, with harmonious in-law relationships... I have no reason to refuse! But the key question is... when he talks about having a wedding ceremony, does that mean he's willing to sleep with me afterward? After all, I don't want to live as a celibate wife.]","The nervous Qin Xian almost started coughing.","He hadn't expected Ji Fei's analysis to lead to such a bold conclusion. It made Qin Xian too embarrassed to even look at Ji Fei.","His Adam's apple bobbed as he tried to whisper: \"I... I am willing.\"","Lost in her thoughts, Ji Fei naturally didn't hear him, still contemplating the current situation in her mind.","After all, if they really had a wedding ceremony, she would feel like she was truly married, which would be completely different from now.","In her previous life, she had been an orphan, without men, love, or marriage. The various unspeakable difficulties in life made it hard for her to even make friends. If she hadn't been transported here and immediately gotten married, she really doubted whether she could have established this kind of relationship with anyone in this life.","Ji Fei continued her analysis.","[Being the wife of the Qin family heir, enjoying Qin Xian's nearly hundred billion fortune, it's like being born in Rome, winning at life without effort. This is definitely better than the two hundred million breakup fee.]","Hearing this analysis, Qin Xian suddenly felt more confident. Fortunately... fortunately, he still had the advantage of his hundred billion fortune.","Actually, he wanted to add that he also had eight-pack abs, and everything Ji Fei wanted, he had it all.","[But I'm someone who hates trouble, what if this identity later prevents me from living freely? Or if one day Qin Xian develops feelings for someone else, I'm not afraid of another divorce drama, but if we have a wedding ceremony and then divorce, everyone will know I was the former Mrs. Qin, wouldn't it be troublesome to find someone new? Maybe a wedding ceremony is still...]","Ji Fei was lost in her internal monologue, her gaze becoming unfocused.","She felt like something was getting out of control, and she instinctively wanted to escape.","But the next moment, her hand was released, and Qin Xian suddenly opened the car door and got out.","Ji Fei was stunned, wondering if she had been thinking for too long.","She hurriedly got out of the car.","As soon as she did, she saw Qin Xian had already come around to her side, and with one long arm, he trapped her against the car.","Ji Fei was startled by this sudden dominant move, staring at Qin Xian in a daze.","Qin Xian tried to steady his uneven breathing, letting out the breath that had been stuck in his throat.","That breath had made certain words difficult to express. It wasn't about face or anything else, it was just... once he started to directly express his feelings, his throat tightened, as if there was some kind of barrier.","Were these words so hard to say?","He realized that in this life, he had never said such words to any woman.","But hearing Ji Fei's inner thoughts, he knew he had to speak up.","\"Ji Fei, if you agree to have the wedding ceremony, there are some things I must tell you in advance.\"","[Damn, I haven't even agreed yet, is he going to set down rules? Make me fulfill some obligations?]","Qin Xian's gaze grew more profound as he focused intently on Ji Fei, \"As my wife, you can do whatever you want to do, and if you don't want to do anything, that's also your freedom. I don't need you to do anything for me, just stay happy by my side, that's enough. You are you, and being my wife comes second.\"","Ji Fei was completely dumbfounded.","[What's going on! The way he's talking, anyone would think he's proposing!]","Qin Xian's eyes flickered, \"We started very confusingly before, I want to start over. Ji Fei, although I don't have flowers or a ring prepared, I am actually proposing to you right now, do you understand?\"","Ji Fei: [Ahhhhh? Wait, what kind of development is this, proposing? Brother, you're acting like you have feelings for me! How is that possible?!]","Qin Xian ignored Ji Fei's almost atmosphere-breaking inner thoughts.","Finally overcoming his inability to express himself, he leaned forward and, under Ji Fei's trembling gaze, placed a kiss on her smooth, fair forehead.","At that moment, his Adam's apple nervously bobbed again, the cool sensation and faint fragrance making him reluctant to pull away.","But he could feel how rigid she had become beneath him.","Qin Xian moved back, lowered his gaze to meet hers, saw the panic in her eyes, and smiled.","\"Because I've fallen for you, I want to be with you.\""]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202: Take It Slow","paragraphs":["Her heart was stirring, stirring, stirring...","Ji Fei's mind had completely shut down, and she couldn't even wonder why Qin Xian's words always seemed to hit right at the core of her inner doubts.","After Qin Xian finished his handsome declaration, embarrassment washed over him, starting from his ears and spreading across his entire face, yet he could only look timidly at Ji Fei.","He was actually afraid too, worried that once he explained himself, Ji Fei would start avoiding him.","But without saying anything, how could they start anew?","While Qin Xian was nervously waiting, expecting to hear some inner thoughts, he saw Ji Fei suddenly blink and push him away.","Qin Xian's heart clenched.","Ji Fei's eyes were filled with panic as she forced a laugh, \"Huh? Are you sure you're not mistaken?\"","Qin Xian suddenly felt a bit hurt, \"If you don't want to accept it, or need time to think about it, that's fine, but please don't deny it... This is my first time having feelings for a girl.\"","Looking at the CEO Qin Xian with his boyish concerns written all over his face, Ji Fei was truly flustered - she had never dealt with something like this before!","If neither party had feelings involved, weighing the pros and cons would be simple - money or attraction would be fine, but with emotions involved... why did she feel like a con artist trying to swindle money, attraction, and feelings?","Ji Fei's true nature deeply respected genuine feelings.","So now she really didn't know how to respond to Qin Xian's sudden confession.","[Isn't this completely reversed? What happened to his noble and cold demeanor? Wasn't he supposed to be like a flower on a high cliff? Wasn't he supposed to be emotionally detached?]","Ji Fei's reaction... was actually within expectations.","So Qin Xian chose to take a step back.","\"Ji Fei, if you don't know how to answer me, then let me court you. We can date slowly, and whenever you're ready, you can tell me, and then we'll have our wedding.\"","Qin Xian's strategic retreat proved effective, as Ji Fei indeed breathed a sigh of relief after hearing those words.","It was as if someone who was about to break down the roof to catch someone had instead chosen to open the door and extend an invitation.","Ji Fei was naturally lazy by nature and didn't like to think too much about complicated things, preferring to avoid them when possible.","\"Um, okay, let's... let's do that... haha.\"","She quickly fled after speaking, clearly not wanting to face the situation.","\"I'm tired, I'm going to rest first.\"","Although Qin Xian was somewhat disappointed, he didn't say anything more and let Ji Fei escape.","After she went through the main door, Ji Fei had already vanished, and he couldn't even hear her inner thoughts - she had probably already hidden in her room.","But she clearly hadn't eaten enough tonight, and normally she would have already gone to find Auntie to make her a late-night snack. Now... Qin Xian smiled helplessly and turned to find Auntie for her, but suddenly realized why the first floor was so empty - where was everyone?","Since the class reunion had ended early, at this time, family members would usually be active on the first floor.","Just as he was wondering, he passed by a room and heard noises, like many people talking.","Qin Xian turned his head to look - the monitoring room?","He pushed open the door.","\"If sister-in-law isn't infatuated with second brother anymore, will she really leave him?\" Qin Rong asked excitedly.","\"What should we do? I like Ji Fei, I don't want her to leave the Qin family,\" Qin Yan said anxiously.","\"Don't panic, she hasn't rejected him yet, right? I still believe in second brother's charm!\" said Qin Zhao.","Qin's Mom said, \"Could this be what they call... chasing wife through hell and high water?\"","Qin's Father said, \"No, no, no, this should be called 'late-coming love is cheaper than grass!'\"","\"Weren't second uncle and second aunt already husband and wife?\" asked Qin Xi, the first member of the Qin family who couldn't hear Ji Fei's thoughts.","\"I think the second young madam must still have feelings for the young master, she just needs more time to work through it,\" said the Steward, the second person in the Qin family who couldn't hear Ji Fei's thoughts.","\"Yes, yes, they haven't even had a normal dating experience yet. Maybe the second young madam just wants the young master to pamper her and pursue her properly,\" said Auntie, the third person who couldn't hear Ji Fei's thoughts.","Well, well, the entire staff of the main residence was present, watching the live feed in the monitoring room, enjoying the drama.","It was because Qin Xian's car had stayed at the entrance for so long that others naturally became curious. Worried about disturbing their romantic moment under the moon, they didn't dare to go out and could only peek secretly, unexpectedly catching this fresh drama.","Actually, most of the Qin family only knew that Qin Xian and Ji Fei were getting along better and better, and that Qin Xian's attitude toward his wife was becoming increasingly proper.","But the word 'love' seemed so incompatible with Qin Xian that when he said it, the whole family reacted as if they'd heard earth-shattering news.","It was even more exciting than when they had all gathered remotely through various social media platforms to follow the drama of their class reunion.","Originally, they really thought that after clearing up some misunderstandings through Qin Xian's formal statement at the class reunion, the relationship between the two would just become closer, but they never expected Qin Xian to be so decisive when he finally spoke up, catching everyone off guard.","Everyone knew he was decisive in business, but they didn't expect him to handle relationships the same way.","While everyone was discussing intensely, they suddenly noticed someone's presence. They all turned their heads to see Qin Xian standing there with a blank expression, probably too embarrassed to react.","Being caught watching someone else's drama wasn't particularly embarrassing for the Qin family members.","Qin Zhao was the first to speak up: \"Brother, go for it, be brave! I suggest you start asking her out tomorrow, after a few dates, she'll remember her feelings for you!\"","Qin Rong immediately countered: \"No, no, sister-in-law is already avoiding him tonight. I think she needs some time to process this. Take it slow. Girls will resist if they feel pressured.\"","Qin Zhao immediately retorted to Qin Rong: \"That's just you, she has a different personality than yours.\"","Qin Rong argued back: \"You're not second brother either, and given your experience in pursuing girls, you shouldn't be giving advice.\"","Qin Zhao nearly coughed blood. \"Well, you shouldn't give advice either, your experience is all failure too.\"","Seeing them about to argue, Qin Yan started to say: \"I think...\"","The two looked at her, their expressions quite obvious, and Qin Yan immediately closed her mouth. Well, she didn't have any good experience to share with her brother either.","\"How come our love genes weren't passed down to these four?\" Qin's Father said helplessly.","\"They must have had a genetic mutation,\" Qin's Mom said.","\"Madam speaks wisely,\" Qin's Father agreed.","Qin Xian held his head in frustration, \"Just leave it alone and pretend you don't know anything, otherwise she'll feel embarrassed.\"","Ji Fei was the type who loved to gossip about others, but who knows how she'd react if others gossiped about her.","Everyone immediately promised to keep quiet.","Before leaving the monitoring room.","The Qin siblings still marveled at Qin Xian's actions tonight, couldn't help but ask when did he fall in love? How deep were his feelings, how did it suddenly become like this?","Qin Xian didn't answer any of these questions, as he himself didn't have the answers.","But Qin's Father and Mother weren't too curious, because they understood.","Qin Xian's emotions were very internalized, which was actually... related to his past psychological condition. He had experienced autism in his childhood, even refusing to communicate with the outside world for long periods.","But his inner emotions were actually quite intense.","They remembered when Qin Xian was young, due to his refusal to speak, he was taken on vacation to change his mood.","At that time, they vacationed with Ji Fei's family.","For three days, Ji Fei followed Qin Xian around like a little shadow. Qin Xian hadn't said a single word to Ji Fei, seemingly completely indifferent to this little sister.","But when Ji Fei left with her family.","Qin Xian suddenly broke down crying. At that time, they thought he was having an episode, quickly called for doctors and medication - they couldn't possibly call Ji Fei back.","After he recovered, he seemed to become indifferent to everything.","But actually, once feelings accumulated to a certain degree, they would burst out all at once. With Ji Fei, it was probably like this.","As for Ji Fei's situation...","Actually, Ji Fei's initial intense attachment to Qin Xian had seemed very strange to them, after all, before adopting her, the two had only met a handful of times. There was even a gap of nearly ten years when they hadn't seen each other.","When she was young, Ji Fei was like a little sun, always enthusiastic and friendly to everyone, so even when she was nice to Qin Xian during their first meeting, it wasn't particularly special - in the adults' eyes, it was just children playing together.","Later, after moving into the Qin family, she was indifferent and cold to others, but Qin's parents attributed it to the trauma of losing her parents, so they were tolerant of all her uncomfortable behaviors.","Qin Zhao didn't get along with Ji Fei and ignored her. Qin Rong was younger than Ji Fei, but when she noticed Ji Fei was unwilling to play with her, she didn't dare to interact much. Qin Yan had married and moved out early.","Qin Xian was still in college and rarely came home. However, Ji Fei seemed to fall in love with Qin Xian at first sight, actively seeking contact whenever he returned home. Qin Xian maintained basic politeness until he was set up.","In the two years after marriage, Ji Fei's pursuit became increasingly intense, with behavior that was often embarrassing to witness.","But whether Ji Fei truly loved Qin Xian or simply wanted the status of being Mrs. Qin as a shelter for life was unclear.","As for now, since Qin Xian had developed feelings, they were naturally delighted and hoped the two would fall in love.","Before leaving, Qin's Father patted Qin Xian's shoulder and said, \"Actually, pursuing someone is simple - just use your sincere heart.\"","Qin's Mom also smiled and said, \"With this kind of destiny between you two, I believe you'll end up together.\"","However, Ji Fei avoided Qin Xian for a week.","A week later, when the Luo Family sent an invitation, Ji Fei suddenly remembered what she had forgotten.","[Tang hasn't broken up? And Xuan Yi invited her to be the makeup artist at the Luo Family again? No, since Xuan Yi has already married the eldest Luo brother and become his wife, why meddle in her ex-boyfriend and brother-in-law's affairs?]","[Wait, the key point is, Tang hasn't broken up! Hmm... I want to go witness this drama in person.]","Ji Fei finally looked at Qin Xian, who was holding the invitation."]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203: Xiao Tang Suddenly Asks Him to Borrow Five Hundred Thousand","paragraphs":["That week, the atmosphere in the Qin family was like servants being more anxious than the emperor himself.","The whole family was eagerly shipping the couple, wanting to witness firsthand how Qin Xian would pursue Ji Fei.","But they clearly underestimated Ji Fei's ability to avoid the situation. There was absolutely no visible progress between them, after all, Qin Xian wasn't the type of playboy who knew how to charm girls.","Ji Fei couldn't help it either; everything felt too awkward. It was all Qin Xian's fault - she couldn't even face him naturally anymore.","Fortunately, Qin Xian was a real CEO, not like those overbearing presidents in TV dramas who had nothing better to do than chase after women all day, as if their business empires ran themselves. Qin Xian remained very busy, so there weren't many situations where they had to face each other. Compared to before, the only difference was that they texted more frequently.","He would message at specific times, sending good morning greetings when she was likely still in bed, actively asking questions and sharing things, and saying goodnight before going to sleep.","It was as if during every break between his work, he would contact her.","Silently expressing that in that moment, he was thinking of her, so he reached out.","Although he hadn't done anything specific to make Ji Fei feel pressured, she could genuinely sense that their relationship had changed. After all, the previous Qin Xian would never have done such unnecessary things.","Ji Fei could handle these online interactions, as long as they weren't face-to-face...","But this time, Ji Fei really couldn't resist and didn't immediately slip away after dinner.","Because her gossip-loving soul was burning with curiosity. All the awkwardness and discomfort didn't matter anymore.","[It's all Qin Xian's fault. He made me so confused this week that I forgot about the follow-up to this huge drama. After all, Xuan Yi planned it that way that day. Logically, Tang should know about Luo Zhou's identity by now, right? If they haven't broken up, could it be because Tang missed the truth when the class reunion ended early that night?]","Holding the invitation, Qin Xian smiled. Confused? It was good that she could be confused because of him.","The other family members at the table didn't have Qin Xian's ability to find sweetness in the smallest details. Their attention had completely shifted to the gossip Ji Fei just revealed.","Because Qin Xian hadn't been diligent in sharing Tang's drama when he returned.","So only Qin Zhao had brought back partial information to discuss with the family.","They had analyzed every possible corresponding person.","Naturally, they had also guessed who the two people were in the ex-girlfriend-turned-sister-in-law situation with lingering feelings.","Now hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, everything was further verified. But who was Tang?!","When Ji Fei called her Tang and mentioned she became a makeup artist, Qin Rong immediately remembered someone, as she was familiar with the staff who worked together since Tang had been an assistant to Qin Zhao and Ji Fei for a while.","Although everyone at the dinner table was drinking tea, except for Ji Fei and Qin Xian, they all simultaneously picked up their phones.","Qin Rong quickly shared all the gossip she knew.","Combined with Ji Fei's thoughts, an absurd and outrageous speculation emerged.","Soon, Ji Fei confirmed it for them.","[Did Tang find out? Did she discover that her boyfriend, whom she supported for two years and who claimed he wanted to start his own business, was actually the second young master of the wealthy Luo Family, just hiding his identity and pretending to be poor while by her side? That day when she saw Luo Zhou's wealthy and imposing manner, she didn't expose him on the spot but fled in panic instead?!]","The Qin family members all gasped.","Qin's Father: It's really this outrageous.","Qin's Mom: Is the Luo Family's second son's brain broken?","Qin Yan: How despicable!","Qin Zhao: Deliberately playing with a girl's feelings? Wasn't he still entangled with his sister-in-law?","Qin Rong was the most angry because she had gotten along well with Tang. She had witnessed Tang's mentor criticizing her before, but Tang would just smile foolishly. Afterward, when Qin Rong asked Tang if she really didn't mind her boyfriend being like that?","Tang didn't care. She felt that although it was hard now, she was happy and had something to look forward to. She believed that man would definitely succeed in the future because in her eyes, he seemed very smart and knowledgeable about everything. He just needed an opportunity.","Now Qin Rong finally believed it a bit. Smart and knowledgeable? Of course a young master raised in a wealthy family would appear smart and knowledgeable in front of an ordinary girl.","But Tang seemed like someone who valued relationships greatly, how could she tolerate such deception?","[So that's it. Luo Zhou had mentioned to Tang before that he had something important to tell her on her birthday. He was actually planning to officially come clean with Tang. This left an opening in Tang's heart - she was waiting for Luo Zhou to confess the truth himself, also unsure what choice she would make, after all, she had loved Luo Zhou for two years and had become somewhat emotionally dependent on him. Perhaps she was still harboring some self-deception.]","The Qin family: So, now... the birthday hasn't passed yet?","After all, Tang was called to be a makeup artist again, and if everything had been revealed between them, Luo Zhou wouldn't have allowed Tang to take this job.","[Damn, I guess even heaven couldn't bear to watch anymore, so it deliberately created obstacles to keep them apart.]","Everyone immediately perked up their ears - what happened, how did heaven get involved?","[The birthday passed, but Luo Zhou didn't say anything that day, he didn't even see Tang, just because Tang suddenly asked to borrow 500,000 yuan from him the day before her birthday. Luo Zhou got angry and started giving Tang the cold shoulder.]","Everyone: WHY? Why suddenly borrow 500,000 yuan?","Besides, what's there to give the cold shoulder about for just borrowing money?","Qin Xian originally wasn't listening carefully to this gossip, instead thinking about how to take Ji Fei to the banquet together, and whether he could take her on a private date afterward.","But hearing this, even he couldn't help but be curious about his brother's thought process.","What kind of nonsense was this guy up to?","[I finally understand why Tang used to be so tolerant of her freeloading boyfriend. Tang has three siblings - an older sister and a younger brother, with her stuck in the middle as the one neither parent particularly doted on. Although her parents weren't the kind of weird parents who deliberately showed favoritism or didn't love their children, it was indeed a case of fingers being of different lengths, hard to balance.]","[Often in such families, a strange phenomenon occurs - the more neglected child becomes more obedient, which naturally results in the more obedient child being more neglected, creating a vicious cycle. Parents' love for their children often stems from how much they have to invest in that child, so Tang naturally became invisible at home.]","[Lack of love and the need to feel needed are traits she can never eliminate from her nature. So when she met Luo Zhou, who seemed to strongly need her care and could live with her, appearing to have only her in his life, he became an existence she couldn't let go of.]","Hearing about Tang's life, the Qin family couldn't help but sigh. Hearing about how Tang misunderstood Luo Zhou, their fists clenched in anger.","What need for her care? It was just Luo Zhou's test.","What only having her in his life? That was Luo Zhou being guarded, never letting her contact his social circle, so Tang thought he had no social life except for her.","Wait, why were Ji Fei's thoughts jumping from one thing to another? Wasn't she just talking about...","Just as they were confused, they heard the key point."]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204: The Whole Family Goes Out to Eat Big Melons","paragraphs":["[This time, Tang's family suddenly had an emergency that required money to resolve. When her parents had no other options, they turned to Tang for help. Tang instinctively tried to borrow money from others, but unfortunately couldn't get any loans. With no other choice, she had to ask Luo Zhou. She thought that if Luo Zhou would tell the truth this time and help her, she would consider forgiving his deception.]","[But Luo Zhou's attitude changed immediately. He said he had no money and accused her of making up stories, telling her to just be honest. Tang didn't expect Luo Zhou to react this way. She insisted she wasn't lying, but Luo Zhou stormed off angrily.]","The Qin family was stunned and couldn't believe it. What was there not to believe?","He was the one deceiving others, how dare he accuse someone else of lying?","Do the most guilty people like to deflect blame onto others?","[I knew Luo Zhou was being stupid - so this was Xuan Yi's scheme!]","Qin family: What? What did she do?","[During the first setup, Xuan Yi thought Tang would make a scene and have a falling out with Luo Zhou right at the class reunion. But unexpectedly, not only was there no drama at the reunion, everything remained quiet afterward. When the upcoming banquet was mentioned, Luo Zhou even told his family he might bring his girlfriend. This made Xuan Yi uneasy. She wasn't sure if Tang knew the truth or not, but after doing some basic investigation, she discovered that Tang was trying to borrow money everywhere. So she told Luo Zhou...]","The Qin family listened anxiously.","What did she say?!","[She told him his test was meaningless since Luo Zhou's identity wasn't really a secret - if Tang wanted to investigate, she could easily find out. Maybe Tang had known his identity all along and was just pretending not to mind his poverty, trying to deceive him emotionally to become his wife.]","Qin family: Those words were clearly meant to sow discord.","[At first, Luo Zhou didn't believe it, but Xuan Yi hinted that he should judge for himself whether Tang would deliberately act like she needed money in front of him and then find an opportunity to ask him for money. Damn... what a perfectly laid trap!]","The Qin family was dumbfounded. They never expected that such an elegant socialite could be so scheming behind the scenes.","Although Qin Xian and Xuan Yi used to be classmates, his impression of her was now completely overturned.","However, he couldn't understand - even if Xuan Yi had set a trap, didn't Luo Zhou say he truly loved Tang? How could he misunderstand Tang so easily?","Everyone continued eavesdropping on the gossip.","Ji Fei also saw the crucial part.","[Since Tang initially tried to borrow money from others, when Luo Zhou found out, he felt it matched what Xuan Yi had said. Of course, he didn't believe it right away, so after asking Tang about the reason, he secretly investigated but found no trace of the Tang Family borrowing money anywhere.]","The Qin family was confused by this twist - was it fake? Had Tang been deceived by her family?","[He deserves to be single! If it were Qin Xian, he would have investigated thoroughly. But this fool only scratched the surface, not knowing that the Tang Family had actually committed some violations and couldn't let others know about it. That's why they could only ask Tang, who was far away, to secretly raise money to help them through the crisis. Otherwise, if someone reported them, their family would be in trouble.]","Professional gossip-loving Qin family: So that's what happened.","Gap-finding sweet-tooth Qin Xian: It seems she's complimenting me...","[So he only discovered that the Tang Family hadn't borrowed money from others and concluded Tang was lying. When Tang had no choice but to ask him for help, he assumed she already knew his identity and was putting on an act to get money from him. He even became dramatically heartbroken and wanted to break up right there... Well, if you're so capable, why don't you actually break up? Why run away and give the cold shoulder? How impressive!]","After catching up on a week's worth of gossip, Ji Fei finally couldn't hold back anymore.","Although everything seemed to be a misunderstanding, that guy Luo Zhou... was so infuriating!","The Qin family listened with their heads buzzing. They couldn't imagine how devastating this must have been for Tang.","The most tragic part was that even if Tang told him now that she knew everything, Luo Zhou would still suspect she was after his money.","But wasn't this entirely Luo Zhou's fault? He was the one who built their relationship on deception from the start.","[Keep jumping around, you'll soon realize you're just a clown on the beam. Because of your rejection, Tang had no choice but to accept Xuan Yi's employment offer to become a makeup artist and wedding stylist for your mother and sister-in-law.]","The Qin family couldn't help but criticize - this Xuan Yi really couldn't stay quiet, could she?!","Was she afraid they hadn't hurt each other enough, so she had to expose everything in person?","Besides, the boyfriend is the young master of the house, while the girlfriend works as their makeup artist. Although there's no hierarchy in different jobs, from Xuan Yi's perspective, wasn't this deliberate humiliation?","[I want to see how Luo Zhou will react when he sees Tang.]","After finishing the gossip, Ji Fei looked at the invitation in Qin Xian's hand and asked, \"So... are you going?\"","Since it was a wine tasting party, Ji Fei had seen Qin Xian refuse similar invitations before, so she was worried he wouldn't go. If he didn't go, it wouldn't be appropriate for her to attend either.","\"It's your friend's event, you should go.\"","Seeing Ji Fei's hopeful expression made Qin Xian's heart melt.","Looking at Ji Fei with an indulgent smile, even though he normally wouldn't attend such events, he would naturally accompany his wife if she wanted to go.","\"Yes, we two...\" Before Qin Xian could finish.","\"The invitation is for our whole family, right?\" Qin's Mom suddenly said.","Qin's Father said, \"It's been a while since we attended a wine tasting. Old Luo should welcome us.\"","\"I happen to be free,\" Qin Yan immediately added.","Qin Zhao coughed, \"I want to buy some gifts to take abroad, and Luo family's wine is quite good.\"","\"I... I... I actually wanted to learn about wine recently,\" Qin Rong finally found an excuse.","\"Oh really! Then let's all go together!\"","[Great, I don't have to face Qin Xian alone, hurray!]","Qin Xian: ...","His gaze swept across everyone present.","Everyone lowered their heads.","Sorry, although they wanted to help Qin Xian and Ji Fei's relationship, they couldn't waste such juicy gossip for their mere one percent chance of progress.","At this moment, gossip lovers, gossip souls, gossip was everything.","Perhaps because Qin Xian's gaze was too resentful, the whole family felt even more guilty.","Come on, once they get there, they'll just try not to move around with them, why be so petty.","Although Qin Xian was a hundred percent unwilling, on the day of the Luo family's wine tasting, the whole family still went together.","And they arrived earlier than all other guests.","Why? Obviously for the gossip!","Makeup artists usually arrive early.","What if the big drama explodes early?","Wouldn't it be a waste if they missed it?","But for families of the Qin family's status, having one representative would have been enough. Moreover, the relationship between the Luo and Qin families was really just between Luo Zhou and Qin Xian.","So when the whole family showed up together, the Luo family members who got the news were quite flattered and all came out to welcome them.","They gave them a warm welcome, wondering if they were planning to deepen their business cooperation.","They didn't notice.","After this family arrived, although they exchanged polite greetings, their eyes kept wandering around Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi, though the honest older brother also received some attention."]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205: Is he waiting for Xiao Tang to contact him","paragraphs":["The elders from both families led their younger members to exchange greetings. As the eldest son of the Luo family and the host of this banquet, Luo Cheng naturally took on the main role of entertaining guests.","His speech was refined and courteous. Though not as handsome as Luo Zhou, he possessed an extraordinary demeanor. While he might not be as exceptionally talented as Qin Xian among the younger generation, he was still outstanding in his own right.","No wonder the Luo family easily decided to make the eldest son their heir.","[Xuan Yi is already living such a good life, yet she's still eyeing more. How greedy can she be?]","Some members of the Qin family were meeting Luo Cheng for the first time, but their first impression was very positive, so they couldn't help but agree with Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","The elder brother was excellent in every way; Xuan Yi truly didn't know how blessed she was.","Thinking about how Xuan Yi had been scheming behind the scenes for her brother-in-law's sake, they looked at Luo Cheng with even more sympathy.","Luo Cheng, who was in the middle of exchanging pleasantries, inexplicably felt a chill down his spine and couldn't help but shiver.","\"The wine tasting venue in the main hall is ready. Please forgive our inadequate hospitality as we still have some preparations to complete. Perhaps Luo Zhou could escort everyone to the main hall first.\"","Since Qin Xian and Luo Zhou were close friends, Luo Cheng naturally wanted Luo Zhou to properly entertain his friend.","But when he turned around, he saw Luo Zhou looking distracted. Reportedly, he had quarreled with his girlfriend. Though Luo Cheng didn't know what exactly his brother was up to, he couldn't let emotions affect guest hospitality on such an important day.","Luo Cheng patted Luo Zhou's back and reminded him with a smile, \"Zhou, stop spacing out and go attend to your friend.\"","Luo Zhou had dark circles under his eyes and looked quite unwell, truly appearing like someone tormented by love.","Coming back to his senses, Luo Zhou could only muster his spirits and lead the Qin family members to the main hall.","Mr. Luo and Mrs. Luo naturally accompanied Qin's Father and Qin's Mom, while Luo Cheng continued with the preparations.","\"Honey, I haven't finished my makeup yet. I'm going to do that now,\" Xuan Yi said softly beside Luo Cheng.","Luo Cheng nodded in agreement.","Seeing that Xuan Yi wasn't going with them, and noticing she seemed to be only halfway through her styling, Ji Fei immediately realized something.","[Oh my goodness, I almost missed the exciting drama!]","The Qin family members immediately perked up their ears.","[Tang has already arrived! Luo Zhou has been sulking in his room, so he hasn't discovered that Tang has already entered his territory. What perfect timing - not too early, but just right. Tang is already waiting in the wings, and we've arrived just in time for the opening credits!]","The Qin family members: !!!!","At this moment, they entered the venue to see various wine bottles, glasses, and related equipment arranged in beautiful displays under crystal chandeliers, making it look like a fairy tale world.","Each exhibition stand had an attendant specifically for pouring wine for guests to taste.","In one corner, various musical instruments were placed, indicating that a band had been invited to perform later to enhance the atmosphere.","The Qin family members couldn't help but show surprised expressions, which the Luo family members assumed was due to the impressive venue.","The Luo couple felt somewhat proud.","Mrs. Luo smiled and said, \"All of this was designed and arranged by the young couple, Luo Cheng and Xuan Yi.\"","Though the Qin family's surprise wasn't initially about this, they naturally had to praise the arrangements, which were indeed quite impressive.","\"This is our family's first wine tasting event, and we're not sure if there are any shortcomings. We just hope it meets our guests' expectations,\" Mr. Luo said with a smile.","\"The arrangements are very nice indeed,\" Qin's Father commented objectively.","\"As long as we can leave an impression on everyone, that's good enough, haha!\" Mr. Luo said cheerfully.","[Sigh, I feel sorry for Mr. Luo. This was meant to be an important project for their family to develop, but their daughter-in-law is risking it to deal with their younger son's girlfriend. Tsk tsk, if things go wrong, tonight might really leave a deep impression on the guests.]","Hearing Ji Fei's sarcastic thoughts and seeing the beaming faces of the Luo couple, everyone felt sorry for them. The saying goes that one should marry a virtuous wife - with such a daughter-in-law, they could only endure.","The Luo couple: Strange, why are they looking at us like that? Is something wrong with the arrangements?","After everyone was seated, Luo Zhou, despite sitting next to Qin Xian, showed none of the usual enthusiasm for seeing his good friend, instead frequently checking his phone.","[Is he waiting for Tang to contact him first?]","Everyone secretly glanced at Luo Zhou.","Indeed, Luo Zhou looked gloomy. It had been three days of cold war with Tang Jiang, who hadn't contacted him at all. What did this mean?","Was it guilt preventing contact?","Or was it deliberate playing hard to get?","If there were any true feelings, shouldn't she have contacted him to explain and apologize?","The more Luo Zhou thought about it, the angrier he became. He almost didn't want to stay for the wine tasting, desperately wanting to go find her and demand answers.","But his pride and dignity prevented him from acting.","Seeing Ji Fei's face full of suppressed excitement beside him, Qin Xian thought for a moment and deliberately created an opportunity for his wife to hear some gossip.","He asked Luo Zhou, \"What's wrong? You seem off today.\"","Luo Zhou, also feeling pent up, was about to complain when he noticed Ji Fei practically leaning on Qin Xian's shoulder. Though she wasn't looking their way, she was clearly listening intently. Her obvious eagerness for gossip killed his desire to confide.","Moreover, with various elders around, he naturally didn't want to speak up, \"It's nothing.\"","[Waited all this time just for that? You really are speechless.]","Qin Xian gave Ji Fei a helpless glance, but feeling the weight on his shoulder and the scented breath drifting from the side, he couldn't help but smile, not daring to move a muscle, hoping Ji Fei would lean on him longer.","But suddenly, Ji Fei sat up straight.","[It's starting! Xuan Yi is casually chatting with Tang about her boyfriend. Is she starting her scheme? Ah ah ah, I want to go to the makeup room to watch it live! What should I do? Find an excuse to go upstairs? What would be a suitable excuse...]","The Qin family members also got excited, but being able to witness this drama from here was already good enough. It would be difficult to find a suitable reason to go to such a specific location.","Qin Xian quietly glanced at his shoulder, pursed his lips, looked at Ji Fei, his eyes flickering, and raised his hand.","While Ji Fei was still thinking of a plan, she suddenly felt a finger brush against her lips.","This wasn't the first time Qin Xian had done this, and Ji Fei had a particularly vivid memory of this sensation, so she immediately realized what happened and looked at Qin Xian in shock.","[W-w-what is he doing!]","Perhaps because Qin Xian had already confessed, Ji Fei was particularly sensitive to certain actions from him.","\"Your lipstick is smudged,\" Qin Xian said, then turned to Luo Zhou and asked, \"Is there a place where she can touch up her makeup?\""]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206: This is a thousand and one ways to prevent the two from being together.","paragraphs":["As soon as these words were spoken, Ji Fei's mind suddenly jolted to attention.","[Wait, isn't this an opportunity? What a coincidence! My lipstick is so considerate, and you, Qin Xian, you're truly my lucky star!]","Ji Fei immediately looked at Luo Zhou with eyes full of anticipation.","If Luo Zhou hadn't been distracted, he would have been able to see Qin Xian's entire act from his position, but he missed it. Seeing the situation, he prepared to get up to show them the way.","Ji Fei quickly said, \"No need, just tell me where it is, I can find it myself.\"","[I can't let Luo Zhou come along. Regardless of whether Tang came here to confront Luo Zhou face-to-face, I can't interfere with people's fate like this. Watching drama unfold is fine, but actively creating drama isn't - that's the professional integrity of a drama spectator.]","\"Huh?\" Luo Zhou was taken aback.","\"Don't worry, your sister-in-law is still in the makeup room, she'll take care of things.\" Luo Cheng came over at this moment, presumably having overheard their conversation, and said to Ji Fei with a smile: \"It's the first room on the second floor, very easy to find. There's nowhere off-limits in our house, feel free to look around if you're interested. The garden in the back and the rooftop terrace both have nice views.\"","Reading the situation, he had probably noticed their boredom, since the other guests hadn't arrived yet and the wine tasting hadn't officially begun.","The young people in their family were indeed getting bored.","Ji Fei once again felt that Luo Cheng was really nice. In fact, people from such prominent families could treat her very differently, but so far, Luo Cheng's attitude had been gracious and friendly. From another perspective, he respected Qin Xian, so he respected Qin Xian's wife. In this regard, he did better than his wife and brother.","Once again casting a sympathetic look at the elder brother, she thought: how could such an excellent person encounter this kind of situation? He deserves better!","Ji Fei quickly stood up, eager to go watch the drama unfold.","Without noticing, Qin Xian also got up and followed her.","However, before leaving, Qin Xian felt the strong resentment from his family members.","Well, it made sense for him to follow his wife, they couldn't all go together.","Knowing they couldn't go, they could only endure and pray that within range, Ji Fei's inner thoughts could be transmitted down to them, providing a live broadcast of the first-hand drama.","Luo Zhou was stunned for a moment when he saw Qin Xian unhesitatingly following Ji Fei.","Well, from the class reunion until now, he still hadn't gotten used to it.","\"What kind of magic does Ji Fei have, making your second brother change so... unfamiliarly in just half a year?\" Luo Zhou couldn't help but ask Qin Zhao beside him.","Qin Zhao glanced at Luo Zhou and said, \"It's the magic of love. They're husband and wife, it's normal to stick together. What? Don't you and your girlfriend stick together? Don't you like being close?\"","Luo Zhou felt like he'd been unexpectedly hit by an arrow, his expression turning uncomfortable. He assumed Qin Zhao had unintentionally touched a sore spot, so he didn't plan to answer.","Then Qin Rong suddenly joined in: \"Second Brother Luo, where's your girlfriend? Didn't she come?\"","Hit by another arrow, Luo Zhou could only force himself to say, \"She's busy.\"","Finally, Qin Yan said leisurely, \"Oh, so Young Master Luo has a girlfriend? We've never heard about this before.\"","Hit by a third arrow, Luo Zhou: ...","Did they really have to bring up this topic?","Actually, only friends and family knew he was dating someone, and since he had never brought her out in public, and being the rich playboy that he was, most people would hear about it and forget. Even his family didn't really care about this girlfriend whom Luo Zhou had never brought home to meet them, assuming he was just playing around as usual.","After all, they had heard about him dating before, but never saw the person before they broke up, never knowing who the other person was from start to finish.","The Luo family had already gotten used to this.","At this time, other guests were starting to arrive one after another, so Luo Cheng took Luo Zhou to greet the guests.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei had reached the edge of the battlefield, but encountered a small situation. This situation wasn't about Qin Xian following her.","Although Ji Fei was initially confused about Qin Xian following her, before she could think too much about it, she heard voices coming from the makeup room. The voices were very clear, anyone who had come up the stairs could hear them.","\"I don't believe this is a coincidence. You hired me twice, and this time you paid such a ridiculous price to get me here. What's your purpose? I'm not stupid. You don't need to test me, I knew from the first time that my so-called boyfriend was the Luo family's second young master.\"","[Wow, the door isn't closed?! And here I was planning to eavesdrop sneakily from outside.]","Just then, someone gently grabbed her wrist.","Ji Fei turned around to see Qin Xian giving her a look, suggesting they should just listen while leaning against the wall.","[Oh, so Qin Xian is also this gossipy. Well, who could resist eavesdropping when hearing such crucial dialogue?]","Ji Fei was always willing to share, so she specifically took out her phone to type and let Qin Xian know that the person inside was Tang.","Qin Xian cooperatively showed a surprised expression.","Ji Fei became even more excited.","\"So your brother-in-law pretended to be poor to trick Tang into dating him?\"","Qin Xian frowned, expressing disapproval of Luo Zhou's behavior.","Ji Fei felt relieved. Fortunately, they shared the same values and both felt there was something wrong with Luo Zhou.","If typing hadn't been inconvenient, Ji Fei would have wanted to have a good discussion with Qin Xian about this.","The conversation inside continued.","\"So, you knew all along and still maintained the relationship. Sure enough, knowing he's the Luo family's second young master, such a wealthy person, how could a girl like you bear to let go? However, our brother-in-law isn't good either, deceiving you like this. I apologize on his behalf.\"","[Damn, even plastic bags aren't as fake as she is! I really want to see what expression she's making right now.]","Ji Fei casually complained, when suddenly her phone was taken from her hand.","Ji Fei watched in surprise as Qin Xian opened an app on her phone, switched the camera, extended his arm, adjusted the angle, zoomed in the image, and soon, Ji Fei could see the scene inside the room on the phone screen.","Xuan Yi was now standing face to face with Tang.","Seeing these operations, Ji Fei widened her eyes and looked at Qin Xian.","[This guy is too amazing, he even masters paparazzi skills like this?]","Qin Xian's hand trembled, almost ruining the shot, his mouth twitching - this was just basic math and physics.","Ji Fei was delighted; this meant they had both sound and image.","[Hehe, then you can't blame us for peeking... wait? Why isn't the door closed? Aren't they afraid of people finding out? They couldn't possibly think no one would come up, right?]","The Qin family members were eavesdropping downstairs.","Then they saw other Luo family women whispering with Mrs. Luo, and because they were sitting close, they could hear:","\"Is your hair done? Don't you want to go up and fix it?\"","\"No, this is fine.\"","\"Then I won't go up to touch up my makeup either, let's attend to the guests first.\"","[Could it be... damn, it really is. Xuan Yi was waiting for the Luo family women to come up for makeup or touch-ups, to see everything, to let everyone know about the wrong relationship between Tang and Luo Zhou, paving the way for their breakup, completely cutting off any way back. Wait, as a sister-in-law and ex-girlfriend, how can she be so intolerant of the current girlfriend? She's going to great lengths to prevent them from being together.]","\"I hope you don't blame him, he didn't mean to do this... there were... reasons.\""]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207: What Does the Voice of a Male Spirit Sound Like","paragraphs":["When Xuan Yi said this, Ji Fei and Qin Xian, who were eavesdropping, were both stunned.","Because they both knew the reason, and logically speaking, Xuan Yi should have been the last person to dare mention it.","Moreover, why here? What was Xuan Yi trying to do?","Inside, Tang was also taken aback. Originally, she thought this sister-in-law had come to persuade her to leave on behalf of the Luo family, as such scenes were common in wealthy families. But what did this mean now?","\"What?\" Tang actually no longer cared about the reason, but was just confused by Xuan Yi's behavior.","Xuan Yi's eyes flickered as she explained helplessly: \"Actually, it's because of his ex-girlfriend. For the future of the family, she chose to marry someone more suitable, giving up their love. His ex-girlfriend wronged him, but still loved him in her heart. He also loved his ex-girlfriend too much and couldn't accept this outcome. The pain in his heart made him overreact, always wanting to test if women approaching him were just after his money. That's why he deceived you for so long...\"","Tang froze, her expression becoming even worse than before.","[She actually dared to say it, is she crazy? Aren't you afraid others will hear and then... wait? Since her relationship with Luo Zhou was secret, no one knew they were dating. If other members of the Luo family heard this gossip, they wouldn't imagine this so-called ex-girlfriend was actually Xuan Yi. So Xuan Yi wasn't afraid to use this truth to strike Tang's heart. But how did she know this would affect Tang so much?]","Qin Xian frowned in thought, indeed it was so.","Previously, Tang at most thought it was just a rich kid's 'adventure' type of deception.","But now Tang knew that the reason she suffered such treatment was actually because of another woman.","It was hard to say which was more devastating.","[Or maybe she's just subtly showing off?] Ji Fei couldn't help but check, [Damn... she's really calculating. Xuan Yi must be worried that Tang is too love-struck and might stay with Luo Zhou even after being deceived. And for dealing with someone who's love-struck, this kind of revelation would definitely be more devastating.]","Sure enough, even through the phone screen, Ji Fei could see how badly Tang was affected.","For Tang, this was far more insulting than simple deception - it was an insult to her love.","[Tsk tsk, Luo Zhou is completely done for now. Although Tang agreeing to come here meant she had already decided to break up, now, knowing the truth, she's probably beyond furious.]","Although Luo Zhou was Qin Xian's good friend, in this matter, Qin Xian could only mourn for his brother.","[If she knew this sister-in-law was actually the ex-girlfriend, Tang would probably be even more disgusted.]","Qin Xian thought Xuan Yi had already pushed it to the limit. She wouldn't be so impulsive as to expose such a flaw, after all, she couldn't guarantee how Tang would react if she knew the truth.","Just as he was thinking this, they heard Xuan Yi inside seemingly muttering to herself sadly: \"Sigh, the way he torments himself and those around him really makes one worry...\"","This tone could barely pass as a sister-in-law concerned about family, but the hidden sadness made it sound more like someone personally involved.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian, knowing the truth, could only feel disgusted.","Tang, already sensitive and especially about matters concerning Luo Zhou, immediately noticed the odd tone.","She looked up at Xuan Yi puzzled.","Xuan Yi's eyes were filled with sadness as she unconsciously touched a necklace around her neck.","This necklace was one Xuan Yi had just changed into, which Tang hadn't noticed before, but now she did.","Looking at its material and style, Tang's face turned pale instantly.","\"This necklace is...?\" Tang's voice was hoarse, filled with disbelief.","Xuan Yi seemed to just come back to her senses, showing obvious panic, then deliberately avoided Tang's gaze.","\"It's... it's a birthday gift from family. Why? Does Miss Tang like it? I'm afraid you can't buy this - there's only one in the world. Due to the uniqueness of the material, only one necklace could be made, with enough leftover material for a small bracelet as a bonus gift. I just don't know where the bonus gift went, otherwise I could give it to Miss Tang as compensation for Luo Zhou's deception.\"","Ji Fei was a bit confused by this part of the drama.","[Why did Tang suddenly bring up the necklace... Though Xuan Yi's reaction was also strange, as if it was a gift from Luo Zhou... Wait? Could it really be from him? But how would Tang know?]","Suddenly, Qin Xian moved beside her, bumping Ji Fei's shoulder. She looked at him curiously.","Qin Xian's expression was somewhat peculiar as he looked at Ji Fei, using his free hand to grab her wrist where she wore a bracelet, pointing at it and then at Tang on the screen.","Ji Fei still didn't get it.","Just then, elegant music drifted up from downstairs as the band started testing their instruments.","Qin Xian leaned over, bringing his lips close to Ji Fei's ear, almost whispering: \"Tang's bracelet.\"","At this moment, Ji Fei's brain was slow to react, but it wasn't her fault for being slow with the gossip. It was because Qin Xian's breath completely fell on Ji Fei's sensitive ear, instantly making that area heat up. Combined with his deep, magnetic voice, making her ear both itchy and numb, it's no exaggeration to say that Ji Fei, slightly weak to voices, almost went weak in the knees.","Usually, Qin Xian's voice had a naturally cool effect, calm and composed, making people just think it was pleasant without other thoughts.","But at this moment.","[Damn! My ears are going to get pregnant! How can Qin Xian make such a sound, is he deliberately seducing people?! Who knew he had the potential to be such a male enchanter!]","Qin Xian, who truly just wanted to provide his wife with key clues for better gossip appreciation, now had ears redder than Ji Fei's.","Somewhat annoyed and uncomfortable, he gave Ji Fei a look, but could only remain innocently silent in the end.","Meanwhile, the Qin family members downstairs were deeply engrossed in the drama. Although piecing together the truth from fragments of thoughts was troublesome, they weren't mentally prepared for such an unexpected turn in the eavesdropping.","The Qin family members: ...","Who knew Qin Xian had such a side.","Was this potential brought out for pursuing his wife?","So, what exactly does a male enchanter's voice sound like?","They almost lost focus on the main drama.","Fortunately, Ji Fei was a professional drama follower. Though momentarily distracted by beauty, she quickly came to her senses.","[What did Qin Xian just say? Tang's bracelet, the one from when we helped her pick up her things? Huh? Wait, Xuan Yi also mentioned a bracelet, why did she waste words on that? No, it can't be what I'm thinking, let me check... Holy shit! Luo Zhou, you're really dead! Xuan Yi, you're sick too! You're all mentally ill!]"]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208: Just Don't Think Xiao Tang Deserves It","paragraphs":["Luo Zhou greeted Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi, Qi Li and Han Ziyu, and then saw Luo Fei arrive alone at the door.","Everyone couldn't help but be curious.","\"You're all about to get married, aren't you? Why didn't she come? Is she afraid to play with us?\" Bai Xiaoxi asked curiously.","Luo Fei replied, \"She's not in good health, and pregnancy often makes her feel unwell, so I try not to let her travel.\"","Yu Yue joked, \"Ah, as long as she doesn't stand you up on your wedding day, haha.\"","Everyone laughed, also noticing that Luo Zhou seemed in low spirits.","Just as they were about to ask what was wrong, Cen Ting and Jing Yan arrived together in one car, which was unusual since they were usually not seen acting together despite being future family members.","\"Oh, today, how did you two come together?\" Qi Li teased, \"Where's your cousin?\"","Jing Yan said, \"His entertainment company project started, so he couldn't accompany Cen Ting. I happened to be at my aunt's place, so we came together.\"","Cen Ting shrugged and, seeing Luo Fei, said, \"By the way, the wedding ring you asked me to make last time is ready. Come to my shop to pick it up later.\"","Luo Fei immediately nodded with a smile.","\"Wow, so among us, only Qin Xian hasn't ordered any jewelry from Cen Ting because of his partner?\" Bai Xiaoxi laughed. Their couple's rings were also designed by Cen Ting, a genius jewelry designer, using rare materials, handmade and unique.","\"Hey, hey, there's still someone here,\" said Jing Yan, who was single.","Yu Yue laughed, \"Do you plan to stay single for life?\"","Jing Yan was momentarily stumped.","Cen Ting suddenly spoke, \"Actually, only Jing Yan now, because Qin Xian recently asked me to make an engagement ring.\"","Everyone was shocked and immediately began asking questions.","But Cen Ting wasn't one to gossip and couldn't elaborate, only expressing his bewilderment at Qin Xian's requirements.","\"It has to be investment-worthy, made from the most expensive materials, in short, the most valuable.\"","Luo Fei's mouth twitched, as he had just ordered a ring himself and had various ideas about its design concept but had never considered the money aspect.","\"A ring should be designed with sincerity, how can it be measured by commercial value? Qin Xian really lacks emotional intelligence,\" he said.","\"I said the same,\" Cen Ting, who was persistent about jewelry design, was also annoyed by such a nouveau riche request. \"But he said Ji Fei likes this kind of thing.\"","Although everyone was skeptical, they didn't dwell on the issue too much, as just the news of the engagement ring was enough to keep them buzzing.","It really proved once again that Qin Xian had put his heart into his relationship with Ji Fei. Otherwise, given Qin Xian's character and their previous relationship, he would have just bought a ring from a jewelry store instead of specially asking their friend to design one.","After all, asking Cen Ting to design jewelry for one's partner was just a joke they had while drinking together during university.","Now Qin Xian had actually followed through on that agreement, which was quite amusing to think about.","\"Great, with Luo Fei and Qin Xian, we have three couples in our group, safe and sound,\" Bai Xiaoxi laughed.","\"Ah?\" Luo Fei didn't react.","Yu Yue laughed, \"Didn't Qi Li and Luo Zhou both ask Cen Ting to make jewelry before? But they both broke up, so my dear is worried.\"","Cen Ting gave Bai Xiaoxi a speechless look.","Bai Xiaoxi stuck out her tongue, and Qi Li immediately glared at her, not wanting to be reminded of his ex-girlfriend.","Han Ziyu, who was pretending to be a stand-in, acted like she hadn't heard anything, though she remembered that this guy sometimes gave her special earrings to wear when pretending to date, probably those.","Luo Zhou, who had been in low spirits, suddenly froze, thinking of something, and his expression became uneasy.","He had once asked Cen Ting to make a necklace for Xuan Yi, planning to give it to her so that their secret relationship would be revealed among their friends once she wore it.","But the necklace hadn't arrived when she became his sister-in-law.","When the necklace finally arrived, he was naturally furious and wanted to destroy it. However, it happened to be Xuan Yi's birthday, and he didn't prepare a gift for her, not wanting to see her at all.","Unable to ignore his family's dissatisfaction with his neglect of his sister-in-law, he decided to give the necklace as a birthday gift to Xuan Yi, partly out of spite, wanting her to see what she had missed out on in terms of sincerity. He wanted to mock her and make her suffer, which would make him feel better.","But that day, he was so affected by the situation that he overlooked something...","【What a jerk, a big jerk, he doesn't even deserve to say he likes Tang. If he really liked her, could he treat her like this?】","Upstairs, Ji Fei, who was secretly watching, was furious and spewing curses in her heart.","The Qin family downstairs, hearing Ji Fei so agitated, were a bit surprised. Didn't they already know he was pretending to be poor and letting his girlfriend support him? Was there something even worse?","【Tang cherished that bracelet so much, but it was made from the leftover materials of a gift for Xuan Yi, worth less than one percent of the original necklace. They were dating at the time! Even if it was just beginning, dating means having feelings, right? You doing some tests is just you being sick in the head, but what's the point of giving that bracelet?】","Qin Xian was a bit guilty. When he first saw the bracelet, he wondered why a bracelet of the same material was in the hands of a makeup artist, even though it was a gift, it should have been a private order.","It turned out that when he heard Tang was Luo Zhou's girlfriend, he should have connected the dots, but there were too many things going on at the time, so even he overlooked it.","It was only now that he remembered.","【Just because you were in a bad mood that day, you forgot your girlfriend's birthday the next day? And because you didn't prepare any gift, you remembered there was a small bracelet in the necklace box that you had left in the car, so you took it out as a birthday gift for Tang. Seriously, your conscience doesn't hurt?】","Qin Xian was also speechless, feeling that the gift would have been better off not given.","He couldn't understand Luo Zhou's thought process, didn't he feel he was belittling and insulting his girlfriend?","【No, I was wrong, how could you have a conscience? After giving the gift, you weren't guilty, instead, you thought that with the value of this gift, Tang was lucky to get it. You were afraid she would be suspicious of your identity if she was materialistic, so you lied and told her it was only a thousand yuan. So in your eyes, Tang only deserves a thousand-yuan piece of jewelry, you probably didn't know that without supporting you, she could buy many thousand-yuan pieces of jewelry to please herself!】","Qin Xian sighed silently, also doubting Luo Zhou's so-called love.","【What's even more hateful is that Tang, this silly girl, felt sorry for you, thinking you had no money and squeezed out a thousand yuan to buy her the bracelet. She thought you secretly worked part-time to save up for it, making her even better to you and treasuring the bracelet like a treasure. You're really a beast! Why didn't the lightning strike you? How did you deserve such a girlfriend? Did Tang really kill and burn in her past life?】","Ji Fei was so angry every time she thought of Tang cherishing that bracelet that her head buzzed.","【Alright, when you were dating Xuan Yi, you were very generous, but when you were dating Tang, you were stingy, just thinking Tang wasn't worthy, right? Then go and snatch your sister-in-law, she's hinting so hard at Tang about her identity, so restless wanting to show off your love, you two are perfect for each other, scumbags and bitches!】","Qin Xian was really afraid his wife would get too angry, so he couldn't help but pat her head to calm her down, blaming Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi for their immoral actions.","Ji Fei took a while to calm down before looking at the screen. She felt reluctant, as Tang was not only hit by the bracelet but also the truth about her relationship with Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi.","Tang almost couldn't stand, staggering back in shock, staring at Xuan Yi.","\"You... you are...\""]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209: Engagement Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi's Cousin","paragraphs":["Xuan Yi would definitely not admit anything, so she immediately interrupted: \"Miss Tang, what's wrong with you? Please don't be so agitated.\"","Although she said this, her awkward expression and guilty demeanor had already revealed everything.","[What's wrong with Tang? She's hurt by your despicable behavior.] Ji Fei watched Xuan Yi's performance on the screen with a sense of disbelief.","[According to Xuan Yi's original plan, if any of Luo's relatives had heard their conversation, they would at most only know about Tang and Luo Zhou's relationship. As long as they couldn't see their expressions, hearing that previous conversation would only reveal Luo Zhou's past heartbreak. No one would have guessed that the ex-girlfriend Xuan Yi mentioned was herself.]","Qin Xian couldn't help but sneer; indeed, she hadn't left any loose ends.","But truly clever people wouldn't have exposed the ex-girlfriend story to Tang in the first place. It seems Xuan Yi's jealousy had made her lose her rationality to do such a thing.","\"You... shameless!\" Tang finally couldn't help but curse out loud.","Xuan Yi's expression changed slightly, and she immediately threatened, \"Miss Tang, it's not appropriate to insult your employer like this. After all, I helped you out of your urgent situation. You should be thanking me.\"","Tang's whole body trembled with anger as she glared at Xuan Yi. \"Since you called me here to do makeup, then don't talk about unnecessary things. I have no interest in knowing about these disgusting matters!\"","After speaking, Tang seemed completely unwilling to waste any more words with Xuan Yi. She turned her back and began packing up her makeup kit, maintaining her dignity through her work.","From the movements visible on the phone screen, it was clear that Tang was crying, though she was holding back her sobs.","Xuan Yi smiled, finally displaying a superior attitude, and continued condescendingly: \"Actually, it's fine if you're with Luo Zhou for money. It's just a relationship he's using to heal his wounds. Beyond that, I hope you won't dream about things that don't belong to you. Even if Luo Zhou made you some extravagant promises, it was just... out of spite. I invited you here today to show you the gap between you and this family.\"","[Wow, how could she say such things? Could it be that she's gaslighting herself, believing that everything Luo Zhou did was for her? Is she really that confident? If she's really that confident, why come here to harass someone? Poor Tang, getting entangled with two crazy people.]","Qin Xian's expression also turned unfriendly, clearly seeing that Xuan Yi had noticed Luo Zhou's genuine feelings for Tang, which was why she was causing all this trouble. It seemed she didn't want something herself but wouldn't let others have it either. She still thought Luo Zhou was her possession and must remain so.","Tang seemed to have made up her mind to ignore these disgusting people, so she remained silent.","Probably feeling that she had achieved her goal, Xuan Yi stopped pursuing the topic and said directly: \"Oh, right, I'm done with my makeup, and my cousin will be coming for makeup later. I hope you're prepared.\"","Someone else is coming?","Ji Fei and Qin Xian exchanged glances, communicating silently with their eyes, as their current situation wasn't suitable for others to see.","Qin Xian suggested retreating.","Ji Fei hesitated for a moment, but then they heard Xuan Yi's footsteps - she seemed to be coming out. It appeared this drama was ending.","The two quickly left the scene.","Safely back in the first-floor hall, just as Ji Fei was about to look for the Qin family members, Qin Xian pulled her to a corner.","Ji Fei was puzzled until she saw Qin Xian staring at her, uncomfortably pointing at his own lips.","Ji Fei froze, unable to understand Qin Xian's meaning.","He pointed again.","Ji Fei's expression gradually turned strange.","[He couldn't be... wanting me to kiss him, could he?!]","Qin Xian froze.","The Qin family members, who had just been shocked by the drama of the sister-in-law bullying the poor girl, nearly threw out their backs when they heard this thought.","What? What? Their second son, how did he suddenly become so forward, progressing so fast!","But shouldn't there be some build-up? Suddenly asking for a kiss?!","Should they go watch? They seem to be just around the corner.","No, no, how could they watch such things? Wouldn't that be disturbing them?","It's all because Ji Fei got them addicted to drama-watching, now they want to peek at even these kinds of moments.","So... did they kiss?","[Oh, oh, oh, I remember now - it's the lipstick. He's reminding me that I haven't dealt with my excuse from earlier. I scared myself! What was I thinking, jumping to conclusions about kissing?!]","Qin Xian's face started heating up, and he felt somewhat helpless. It seemed that since his confession, Ji Fei had become as jumpy as a frightened bird.","The eavesdropping Qin family members all sighed in unison.","They knew it wouldn't be that easy to fulfill their wishes!","Ji Fei took out her small makeup mirror, wiped her lips a bit, considering it dealt with, and then returned to the wine tasting event with Qin Xian.","Their appearance immediately attracted everyone's attention.","Qin Xian's superior appearance and status had always been the focus of attention, and this time Ji Fei wasn't unknown either. That reality show had increased her fame; even without the wedding, these people recognized her at a glance.","Seeing her with Qin Xian, they suddenly understood - no wonder the female artist who had caused such a storm in the entertainment industry could be protected by the Qin family's third son; she was actually the second daughter-in-law of the Qin family.","No wonder... no wonder... Some of their networks had been affected by various incidents during that time, and no matter how they tried to suppress it, they couldn't. It turned out she was a genuine wealthy family's wife - who could compete with that?","And they had heard about the recent class reunion incident too. It was said the couple's relationship was unshakeable, and they had worked together to punish a homewrecker who tried to destroy their family.","Well, they had to accept it, though they'd heard this entertainment industry judge was quite mysterious - who knew if it was real mysticism or just a persona.","People are naturally gossip-loving and curious; if they were more familiar, they'd really want to ask about it.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian were already used to various kinds of stares. With their minds full of drama, they returned to where the Qin family members were seated.","Unexpectedly, the Luo couple was still there accompanying them, clearly showing great respect for the Qin family members.","But the Qin family really didn't need such enthusiastic hospitality - they wanted to privately discuss the hosts' gossip, and it was really frustrating having to hold it in.","Just as the two were about to sit down, they saw someone waving at them from seats not far away - it was Qin Xian's group of friends.","After they went over, they noticed Luo Zhou wasn't there.","Ji Fei immediately wanted to see where that scumbag Luo Zhou was. She was really curious about what would happen next, wondering if these two would run into each other at today's wine tasting event.","With one sweep of her eyes, she saw Luo Zhou walking towards them with his head down, with a young woman enthusiastically clinging to him, trying to hold his arm. However, a phone call suddenly came through, and after the woman answered it, she left.","Before Ji Fei could satisfy her curiosity about the gossip, Luo Zhou sat down, and Qi Li smiled and said, \"Why are you two brothers both arranging marriages with the same family? Isn't that Xuan Yi's cousin?\"","[An arranged marriage?!!! Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi's cousin?!]"]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210: If She Were Truly Superficial, It Would Be Better","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's surprised internal reaction was so strong that it made the Qin family members shudder.","The Luo couple finally noticed something unusual about the Qin family's frequent strange reactions and asked, \"Is there something wrong?\"","The Qin family members could no longer resist asking about the gossip.","\"We just saw a girl who seemed very close to your son Luo Zhou. Is she his girlfriend?\" Mrs. Qin inquired with a smile.","\"Oh, that's our eldest daughter-in-law's cousin. She quite likes Zhou, and we thought it would be nice if we could strengthen our family ties, so we're just letting the kids interact freely,\" Mrs. Luo explained.","While they were strict with their eldest son, they were more lenient with their second son, as long as he didn't bring home anyone questionable.","However, as soon as she finished speaking, she noticed the Qin family members' expressions had completely changed.","Mrs. Luo's heart skipped a beat as a bold guess crossed her mind, and she couldn't help but glance at the Qin family's youngest daughter, Qin Rong.","Seeing Qin Rong's shocked expression, she quickly added, \"But our Zhou hasn't shown any interest yet. By the way, does Rong have a boyfriend?\"","This shocked the Qin family members even more.","They were just there to observe the drama, not to have garbage thrown their way!","Qin Rong's face turned green when she realized what was happening.","Mrs. Qin hurriedly said, \"Our Rong is still young and plans to study abroad. Haha. We had heard that your Zhou had a girlfriend for quite a while, and we thought it might be her. Now that she's here, we thought perhaps wedding bells were in the air and wanted to ask when the marriage would be.\"","Mrs. Luo's face turned red with embarrassment. She hadn't meant to push for a connection with the Qin family, and since that wasn't their intention, she quickly changed the subject to avoid making her guests uncomfortable.","\"Oh, you've heard about that? Actually, we're not very clear about it either. Zhou said he would bring her home to meet us, but she didn't come today. Judging by Zhou's behavior, they must have broken up. He's not as stable as your Qin Xian in that regard,\" Mrs. Luo explained with a smile.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei had learned all the information and was rendered speechless.","More and more people at the gathering were becoming aware of Xuan Yi's past relationship with Luo Zhou.","So when Qi Li revealed the girl's identity, everyone was surprised, though not as much as Ji Fei and Qin Xian, who knew more about Xuan Yi's role in all this.","[Xuan Yi... really needs to see a psychiatrist. What is she doing? She's trying to set up her cousin with Luo Zhou? Ah, I get it - it's because she knows Luo Zhou hates girls like her cousin. If they get married, they won't be happy together, and this way she can keep controlling Luo Zhou's love without worrying about other women stealing his heart.]","Qin Xian was bewildered by Xuan Yi's thoughts. He just wanted to ask what grudge she had against her own cousin.","\"You and Xuan Yi are both okay with this?\" Luo Fei found it abnormal. \"What about your girlfriend?\"","\"Don't talk nonsense. That girl has a one-sided crush on me, it has nothing to do with me. My family won't force me into an arranged marriage, so stop bothering me about it.\" Luo Zhou stopped entertaining the guests, slammed his phone on the table, gave it a harsh look, then grabbed his drink and started drinking heavily.","\"I wanted to mention earlier that your mood seems unusually bad today,\" Jing Yan commented.","\"Could it be related to why your girlfriend didn't come today?\" Yu Yue asked gossip-hungry, having heard about Luo Zhou's plans to introduce his girlfriend to his family.","\"Heh.\" Luo Zhou sneered.","That single sound suggested others had wronged him terribly, making Ji Fei want to smack him on the head.","Qi Li, who got along best with Luo Zhou and knew the most gossip, teased, \"He's waiting for that woman to come confess and apologize to him because he discovered she knew his identity all along and was just putting on an act. Even after all this, you still won't break up with her? You're done for, Luo Zhou.\"","\"What?! Really? You were both acting?\" Bai Xiaoxi exclaimed in surprise.","Cen Ting looked at Luo Zhou wordlessly, refusing to comment.","Han Ziyu, who had been secretly glancing at Ji Fei, couldn't help but think sarcastically that everyone was acting – only her idol's relationship was real!","\"Maybe she's waiting for you to be honest?\" Luo Fei couldn't help suggesting.","Luo Zhou sneered, \"She asked me for money.\"","Everyone at the table's expression changed.","\"Could there be a misunderstanding?\" Although Jing Yan didn't want to comment on this relationship, something felt off.","\"She made up lies to get 500,000 yuan from me. If she didn't know my identity, how would she ask for money from someone who was supposedly penniless? She must have found out recently and gotten greedy, now trying different ways to get money from me. And I still...\" Luo Zhou put down his glass angrily, his eyes reddening.","Just then, they heard a contemptuous \"Heh.\"","The sound was distinctly unfriendly, and Luo Zhou looked up sharply – it was Ji Fei again.","\"What are you laughing at?\" Luo Zhou could tell Ji Fei wasn't mocking anything else but him specifically.","\"Fun fact: people sometimes laugh involuntarily when they're extremely exasperated,\" Ji Fei said with a face that showed she couldn't care less if she offended anyone. \"That's what just happened to me.\"","The whole table started watching the show – how did these two end up at odds again?","\"Are you saying you find me exasperating? She's the one who deceived me for money...\"","\"Aren't you also deceiving her for money? How come you're acting like the victim?\" Ji Fei shot back immediately.","Luo Zhou choked for a moment before quickly responding, \"I did it for the sake of having a more pure love between us, unlike her...\"","\"Deception is deception regardless of the reason. You're really good at putting filters on yourself. Heh, let me ask you something – you've been dating for two years, how much money has she scammed from you, and how much have you scammed from her?\" Ji Fei asked with a smile.","Luo Zhou choked again, \"She... she hasn't started yet...\"","Seeing his refusal to reflect on his actions, Ji Fei was thoroughly exasperated. \"I only know that if you've wronged her, if she really needs money right now and you're refusing to help despite having the means...\"","Ji Fei's cool gaze swept over him, suddenly making Luo Zhou break out in a cold sweat and feel anxious.","\"Then you're totally screwed.\" Ji Fei's tone was full of schadenfreude, as she really wanted to see little Tang dump him and see what face he would make then.","Luo Zhou's face darkened, and he immediately said, \"No, impossible. She just found out about my identity and started becoming materialistic...\"","\"What's wrong with being materialistic?\" Ji Fei suddenly asked.","\"What did you say?\" Luo Zhou asked incredulously.","Others also looked at Ji Fei in surprise, as this wasn't exactly a complimentary term.","\"It would be better if she were materialistic – it would prove she's smart and ambitious. Otherwise, I really don't understand what your girlfriend likes about you. Isn't your biggest advantage being born into a wealthy family and having money? If she doesn't love your biggest advantage, does she love your bad personality, your lack of gentleness, your mooching, your deceptiveness? Your girlfriend must be quite masochistic.\"","This speech made everyone at the table laugh.","Only Luo Zhou wasn't laughing, staring at Ji Fei in shock.","Ji Fei continued with a sincere expression, \"Oh, I might be biased. Maybe you have other admirable qualities beyond your wealth. Why don't you tell us what they are?\"","Everyone at the table was about to die laughing.","Come to think of it, he must have some good qualities, but when it came to his most obvious advantage... for Luo Zhou, who hadn't achieved any particularly impressive career accomplishments, it really was just 'being rich.'","So if someone fell in love with him for his most prominent quality, it seemed somewhat reasonable.","Probably suffering from a psychological and moral shock, Luo Zhou remained speechless.","\"Can't think of any? Let's look at it from another angle – if she's not materialistic, you're in trouble. After all, while your wealth might increase, your looks, age, physical strength, and energy will all decline. How do you plan to keep her love?\"","\"You... what kind of twisted logic is this? According to you, being materialistic is actually a good thing?\" Luo Zhou couldn't possibly accept this strange reasoning, especially since his deception with little Tang began because of a failed relationship with someone who was materialistic.","As Ji Fei was about to retort, she heard Qin Xian seriously say, \"Your brother wouldn't think Xuan Yi chose to marry him because she was materialistic, because he could afford it.\"","Suddenly, a single sentence silenced the entire table.","Everyone pondered the words for a moment, and they could see Luo Zhou's face turning pale.","It was absolutely devastating, cutting straight to the heart.","Indeed, when men want to show off their success to others, in most cases, how much money they make proves how capable they are. When their women spend their money, they only feel more accomplished, never thinking their women are materialistic or vain.","Only when they can't afford it do they become angry and embarrassed, thinking the other person is being materialistic.","If a capable man's beloved likes money, just give it to her. Why keep obsessing over questions like 'If I don't have money, will you stop loving me? Will you love someone richer?'","Why not try focusing on the question 'How can I keep making money and keep her loving me?'","Is it better to force others to compromise rather than making an effort yourself? This seemingly sincere questioning actually contains a certain cunning probe.","[Hahaha, Qin Xian is so right! How does he know exactly what to say? I absolutely love it.]","Qin Xian was startled, turning to see Ji Fei looking at him with stars in her eyes. His heart immediately started racing, and he coughed slightly, feeling pleased. As for his brother's predicament...","Actually, Luo Zhou was just unfortunate. He had been misled by Xuan Yi. None of the other men present, not even Qi Li, shared Luo Zhou's theory about materialism.","They were all wealthy, so they didn't care.","But Luo Zhou had personally experienced being abandoned because he wasn't as rich as his older brother, because Xuan Yi preferred his more powerful and influential brother. This made him sensitive and suspicious, leading to this twisted situation.","He wanted to find proof that there were people who would choose him even after meeting his older brother.","He did find such a person, but he ruined it with his behavior.","\"You all!\" Luo Zhou was furious, whether he had learned anything or not.","Just then, Luo Zhou's eyes suddenly widened as he looked into the distance.","Everyone followed his gaze, but only Ji Fei and Qin Xian showed any reaction.","[Strange, why did Tang come down? I thought she wasn't planning to come down based on how she looked earlier. Is a dramatic confrontation about to unfold?]"]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211: This Little Brat Says He Likes Xiao Tang, I Really Don't Believe It","paragraphs":["Tang wasn't alone; she was brought downstairs by that cousin.","Tang's complexion wasn't good, but she was forcibly pulled into a circle of young women by her cousin. Xuan Yi was there too, seemingly ready to introduce this makeup artist to the surrounding sisters.","Tang didn't look around; she just stood there uncomfortably, barely managing to respond.","[Damn, there's no limit to shamelessness. Xuan Yi, why are you putting on such an act? Aren't you afraid this will backfire? Are you really so determined to force a destined confrontation and completely cut off any possibility between them? How childish!]","Not just Ji Fei, but all the Qin Family members who could hear these thoughts were watching anxiously, waiting to see how the situation would develop.","[Tang didn't want to come down and see Luo Zhou, not just because she wanted to avoid causing trouble at someone else's important occasion, but because she was completely disgusted by the truth. Now she doesn't want to face Luo Zhou at all. So even though she knows Luo Zhou is here, even though she might have already been seen, she doesn't want to face him. But unfortunately, they won't leave her alone, forcing her to come down.]","\"Luo Zhou, who are you looking at? Xuan Yi or that little cousin?\" Qi Li asked curiously.","After all, they had expected Luo Zhou to argue with Ji Fei and Qin Xian, but he suddenly stopped as if he'd seen someone. Given Luo Zhou's temperament, this was very strange.","\"Oh? That makeup artist,\" Han Ziyu suddenly spoke up beside Qi Li.","Surprised, she momentarily forgot to maintain her innocent act. Normally, Qi Li would have warned her, as he truly disliked when the replacement for his first love acted too opinionated, just like the original.","However, Ji Fei became curious upon hearing this and looked at Han Ziyu. \"You know her too?\"","Hearing her idol speaking to her, Han Ziyu ignored her boss's warning, \"Yes, at the last class reunion at that hotel, I met her in the bathroom. She had some makeup products with your signature, so we chatted. She was working there as a makeup artist that day.\"","Han Ziyu spoke rapidly and energetically, quickly explaining everything.","Since Tang hadn't looked over, Luo Zhou didn't know how to react, but upon hearing Han Ziyu's words, he was stunned, asking in disbelief: \"She was there then?\" His brows immediately furrowed.","[Oh my, he's probably wondering if his identity was discovered that day.]","\"What a coincidence?\" Jing Yan frowned.","\"Is she a well-known makeup artist in the industry?\" asked Bai Xiaoxi, who had been abroad for a long time and wasn't familiar with the situation.","Cen Ting shook her head, \"Never heard of her.\"","Luo Fei turned to Ji Fei and asked: \"She has your signature? So she's your fan? You just said you know her too? So you do know her?\"","Like a true police officer, he was very perceptive.","Upon Luo Fei's comment, Luo Zhou immediately looked at Ji Fei, \"You know her too?\" He had become wary of Ji Fei, feeling that anything connected to her couldn't be good.","However, when Ji Fei glanced at him, that look made Luo Zhou's spine chill.","He felt that Ji Fei's gaze contained some very harsh criticism.","Yes, Ji Fei was indeed criticizing him, because she had just realized something.","[This bastard claims to love Tang, but I don't believe it anymore. Being a scumbag is in his bones; he has no conscience.]","\"Oh yes, I know her. During my previous variety show, Tang was part of my and Qin Zhao's makeup team for two months. What a coincidence indeed,\" Ji Fei said with a smile.","Qin Xian was startled, also realizing something, and looked at Luo Zhou in disbelief.","Luo Zhou appeared shocked and dazed.","[He has the nerve to be surprised, not even knowing that Tang worked with me for two months. Even if he doesn't care for gossip, our show was so popular, and we lived together – how could Tang not have mentioned it? She must have, but he probably didn't even register it in his mind. How little attention must he pay to his girlfriend! He clearly doesn't care about her career at all.]","Now, the Qin Family members who could hear these thoughts also realized.","Qin Zhao and Qin Rong were particularly speechless. Of course, the people on their team would know who they were working for, especially since the show was so popular. The fact that Luo Zhou didn't know was so absurd that everyone had momentarily forgotten about this detail.","Now that they thought about it, \"speechless\" wasn't enough to describe their feelings.","Seeing Luo Zhou still not realizing how despicable he was, Ji Fei became angry.","She spoke directly.","\"Tang is a good person, skilled, hardworking, and not afraid of difficulties. It's just that she has bad luck with money and men.\"","\"How so?\" Bai Xiaoxi immediately responded, proving that human nature is inherently curious about gossip.","Luo Zhou also looked over, his eyes probing and defensive, as if suspecting Tang had been speaking ill of him behind his back, unable to bear the fact that she had raised him, only enduring it because she knew his identity, but couldn't help complaining about it outside.","He was afraid to acknowledge the earlier mockery from Ji Fei and Qin Xian.","Ji Fei had already begun speaking in a gossipy tone, attracting everyone's attention at the table.","\"During our previous collaboration, she had to borrow money from her mentor because her boyfriend got into an accident with a luxury car owner. Her boyfriend's privileged attitude escalated the original conflict, causing her to end up with a debt of several tens of thousands. She had no savings, so she had to borrow money from her mentor for the emergency. After that, she worked day and night taking jobs to repay the debt, almost fainting from exhaustion at our show.\"","Upon hearing this, Luo Zhou was completely shocked, as if finally digging up this small incident from his distant memory.","With his privileged attitude, he had just let the conflict escalate, and although Tang paid the compensation afterward, he had assumed she had money, never bothering to calculate how much money he had spent from his family or how much Tang could actually afford with her salary.","\"What? Her boyfriend was so irresponsible?\" Bai Xiaoxi frowned.","Cen Ting: \"Only good at showing off and fighting, but not taking responsibility. Such men are the worst.\"","\"Making his girlfriend bear this expense?\" Yu Yue said with disgust.","\"This Tang must be blinded by love, not even breaking up after this?\" Jing Yan laughed.","With each comment, Luo Zhou's face darkened further, his lips trembling, scalp tingling, probably never imagining that what he considered a minor incident would receive such harsh judgment from others.","Luo Fei and Qi Li were stunned, somehow feeling this situation familiar.","Because after the conflict, when Luo Zhou was angry, he had complained to Qi Li and Luo Fei that the luxury car owner was just a nouveau riche.","Then they heard Ji Fei continue: \"Recently, her family ran into some trouble and needed to borrow money. She tried everywhere but couldn't get a loan, asked her boyfriend for help, and he ran away.\""]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212: Your plan really makes me mentally shrink","paragraphs":["This bizarre situation naturally sparked various expressions of disgust and amazement.","Ji Fei was telling the story with relish, and everyone else listened intently.","Luo Fei and Qi Li, however, were fidgeting uncomfortably as they looked at Luo Zhou. Hadn't Luo Zhou just mentioned something about borrowing money? Was this a coincidence?","At this point, Luo Zhou was already beginning to feel uncontrollably anxious. Not because he thought Ji Fei was deliberately mocking him, but because he wondered if the news about borrowing money had reached even someone as distantly connected as Ji Fei, then... could it be true?","\"I heard she got a big job today that solved her urgent financial problems. So that's what it was about,\" Ji Fei remarked thoughtfully, then looked at Luo Zhou. \"Oh, did your sister-in-law specifically seek her out? Perhaps she watched my show, liked my makeup, and approved of little Tang's skills? Well, I should thank her anyway.\"","Ji Fei wasn't about to stop at just targeting Luo Zhou; she wouldn't leave Xuan Yi out either.","Luo Zhou's face immediately turned several different colors, his expression rapidly changing.","Right, Xuan Yi had brought her here, and she was at the class reunion too? Was this all just a coincidence? His mind was in complete chaos, feeling that something wasn't quite right.","\"She even brought her down here, perhaps wanting to introduce her to more connections. Since her boyfriend is useless, she can only rely on herself to make money.\"","\"I'll go meet her too then,\" Bai Xiaoxi eagerly said. \"Help the poor girl stay busy so she can forget about that scumbag.\"","Cen Ting nodded along, seemingly also planning to make her acquaintance.","Luo Zhou's face was now covered in humiliation, his fists clenched tight.","Luo Fei finally couldn't contain his curiosity anymore. \"You know her?\"","Qi Li also felt something was off. \"Your expression changes are too dramatic. Don't tell me that this little Tang happens to be your girlfriend?\"","This comment instantly silenced everyone at the table.","They saw Luo Zhou's eyes change, but he didn't deny it. Gradually, everyone's eyes widened in shock.","The situation became extremely awkward, and those who had been criticizing the \"scumbag\" earlier now looked uncertainly toward Ji Fei.","Ji Fei quickly covered her mouth, almost laughing out loud. Then she put on a surprised expression.","\"It's you? No wonder people say little Tang's boyfriend is a freeloader. So you were pretending to be poor to test her, then letting her support you.\"","This statement was like a thunderbolt, making the situation even more intense. Originally, testing a friend would have been seen as a small game, and everyone at the table would have taken their friend's side.","But now that both parties knew each other, the feeling was completely different. Everyone's looks toward Luo Zhou were full of disapproval.","Luo Zhou's face had turned ashen, but he still didn't say a word, his eyes fixed on little Tang in the distance.","The atmosphere was too strange, and Jing Yan coughed, quickly trying to change the subject.","\"No way, what's Xuan Yi doing? Does she know little Tang too?\"","The attempt to change the subject failed.","The atmosphere at the table became even more awkward. After all, only Bai Xiaoxi hadn't yet figured out the previous relationship between Xuan Yi and Luo Zhou.","Yu Yue, knowing this information was crucial, no longer cared about brotherhood and directly shared it with Bai Xiaoxi.","Bai Xiaoxi was so shocked she almost cried out.","\"So, was little Tang really brought down here for introductions?\" Cen Ting calmly questioned. After all, they'd seen plenty of such situations in wealthy families.","They just hadn't expected their friend to be someone with such ulterior motives. But now everything seemed too coincidental not to be suspicious.","Before anyone could wonder further, a group of people was already walking toward them with little Tang.","What were they planning to do?","Everyone at the table watched in surprise.","In this tense atmosphere, someone spoke up.","\"Luo Zhou, are you sure little Tang knows who you are? If you've guessed wrong, when you meet, you'll be exposed!\"","Luo Zhou had been staring intently at little Tang, but she kept her head down, never meeting his gaze.","Originally, Luo Zhou had been speculating whether little Tang, knowing his identity, had come deliberately to seek reconciliation and create an opportunity for them to meet.","But that comment suddenly made Luo Zhou feel as if his heart had emptied, like falling from a hundred-meter cliff.","A sense of fear crept over him, but before he could react, little Tang looked up, and their eyes met for an instant.","Luo Zhou felt his throat tighten, not daring to move his gaze even slightly. But little Tang had already looked away.","Everyone else was watching the interaction between them, both nervous and excited, whispering among themselves.","\"Did she see him? No surprise? Looks like she knew beforehand.\"","\"I thought there would be a scene.\"","\"Are you hoping to see some drama?\"","While they were whispering, the group arrived.","Luo Zhou's gaze was almost burning as he looked at little Tang, and because she wouldn't look at him, he became increasingly agitated and even angry.","He wanted to ask little Tang about the truth behind the borrowed money.","But why wouldn't she look at him, why wouldn't she acknowledge him, and why did she come to his family's place?","Even after seeing him, she was ignoring him. Was she playing hard to get, or was this some kind of strategy?","Luo Zhou felt like he was going to explode with frustration. This agitation stemmed from a deep-seated unease in his heart, an unease he dared not face.","Ji Fei watched Xuan Yi standing at the front, completely unable to understand these twisted minds.","[So they came to make little Tang and Luo Zhou meet? But judging by little Tang's reaction, she probably won't acknowledge him.]","Just as she was thinking this, surprisingly, Xuan Yi's first words were directed at her.","\"Ji Fei, perfect timing. We heard this makeup artist Tang Jiang has worked for you before, so we came to ask about it.\"","Ji Fei: ?","Little Tang had now composed herself and managed a forced smile at Ji Fei, \"Teacher Ji, hello.\" There was still some uncertainty and awkwardness in her eyes, as this kind of name-dropping felt somewhat presumptuous.","[Why would Xuan Yi actively bring up to her sister group that little Tang was my makeup artist? And now that it's been mentioned and little Tang has confirmed it, why bring a whole group to verify with me? Does this mean they don't believe it? What's going on?]","Ji Fei immediately smiled and said, \"Little Tang, you're here too! I was wondering why Xuan Yi looked so dressed up today.\"","Everyone: Huh? Did they mishear something? Wasn't she talking about the makeup looking good?","Ji Fei's expression was so convincing that even Xuan Yi thought she had misheard.","This almost made the troubled Qin family members spray out their drinks.","While this drama was unfolding, Mr. and Mrs. Qin couldn't come over to watch, but the younger generation had no such restrictions and gathered around with their wine glasses to enjoy the show.","Xuan Yi ignored the threatening looks from Luo Zhou's direction and turned to her sister group, saying, \"I told you it was worth the price.\"","The sister group had various expressions on their faces.","\"I still think the fee is unreasonable. We may be rich, but we're not stupid. Mrs. Qin, how much did she charge you for makeup?\" the cousin suddenly asked.","With these words, little Tang's face changed instantly.","Ji Fei was also confused by this development and quickly consulted her system.","[OMG, my goodness, my brain has turned to mush, your plans are really making me mentally exhausted.]","The Qin family members: What? What? It's just asking about a price, how is that exhausting?","For one episode, even an assistant makeup artist would earn more than 10,000 yuan.","[So it turns out Xuan Yi had already told her cousin about little Tang's identity. The cousin is in love with Luo Zhou and couldn't possibly allow their relationship to continue. She's even more aggressive than Xuan Yi in wanting to force them to break up, so naturally, she wants to find ways to expose little Tang in public and damage her reputation, making her lose face completely. That's why they're putting on this show.]","[They used an exorbitant price of 200,000 yuan to take advantage of little Tang's desperate situation, forcing her to come here as a makeup artist, and now they want to use this high price against her. Because once I reveal the normal price, compared to what they're paying this time, everyone will think little Tang is price gouging, treating rich people like fools, and that she's someone who lacks professional ethics and only cares about money. With such a public problem, the Luo family would definitely not accept someone of such character.]","The Qin family members: No wonder they kept insisting on bringing little Tang down, this is actually a chain of schemes!","Qin Xian's mouth twitched. To be honest, if this level of scheming was used to help Brother Luo stabilize his business empire...","[Perhaps their main goal was to humiliate Little Tang in front of the Luo family, but if they succeeded, it would also make Little Tang infamous in the makeup artist community. Once word got out, even with excellent skills, Little Tang would never be able to serve wealthy female clients again, and it might even affect her work with female celebrities in the entertainment industry. This would completely destroy Little Tang's professional future. How vicious.]","The Qin family: Vicious, not just ordinary vicious, they're treating others as less than human. What did Little Tang do wrong? She's clearly the victim!","Qin Xian let out a cold laugh. He looked worriedly at Ji Fei, but saw his wife suddenly curl her lips into a smile.","[Don't blame me. If you try to use me to hurt others, I'll bite back.]","Qin Xian: My wife is so cute.","\"If you don't know, could you help ask around?\" The cousin was clearly impatient with Ji Fei's apparent daydreaming and wanted to resolve the issue quickly.","Little Tang's face had already turned quite pale. She had long understood what was happening, but she was helpless because the fee was real. At this moment, she should have sought help from Luo Zhou, but she didn't - she hadn't even thought of him.","Luo Zhou had been watching Little Tang the whole time. Though he didn't know the full picture, he sensed that Little Tang was in trouble. He thought she would seek his help - even just a glance asking for help would be enough for him to... actively give her a way out.","But Little Tang never once looked his way.","\"Oh, I remember now, it's 300,000 per show.\"","That single sentence silenced everyone.","Little Tang stared at Ji Fei in astonishment, only to see Ji Fei raise her eyebrows and smile at her.","The group of sisters were dazed - had they misunderstood?","\"Are rates really that high now?\"","\"So 200,000 here is normal then?\"","\"Maybe my makeup artist is charging too little?\"","Others at the table were completely unaware, not even understanding the significance of this conversation.","\"That's impossible!\" The cousin almost shouted, saying in disbelief: \"You must be mistaken, how could it be 300,000? It's clearly...\"","Xuan Yi immediately grabbed the cousin, stopping her from speaking out of turn, though she couldn't control her own face from turning ugly.","She looked at Ji Fei, never expecting to receive such an answer, making her uncertain now.","Their commotion had already drawn the attention of many nearby guests.","\"What's wrong? This rate is perfectly normal,\" Ji Fei said in surprise: \"Are you charging 200,000 for makeup today?\"","Ji Fei raised her voice, \"Little Tang, why did you lower your price? Did you give them a discount? Or is it because they're acquaintances so you gave them a better rate? Oh my, there's no need for that - they're wealthy and won't miss that amount. Giving them a discount would be insulting to them, wouldn't it? Look, you've made them so suspicious they had to come ask me about the standard rates.\"","Rich people dislike being cheated, but they hate being looked down upon even more.","These words immediately provoked a reaction from the Luo family.","What kind of talk was this? What did she mean? Did the Luo family need a discount from a makeup artist?","Who was she trying to insult?","Weren't they all wealthy families?","Which unworthy descendant had done this? How embarrassing!"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213: I'm Your Boyfriend, How Come I'm Not Qualified","paragraphs":["Xuan Yi came to her senses, feeling the skeptical gazes shooting at her from all directions, and almost couldn't maintain her facade.","Now she was certain that Ji Fei had deliberately said those embarrassing words just to antagonize her.","She felt somewhat wronged, wondering why Ji Fei always seemed to be against her. Given Qin Xian and his group's relationship, Ji Fei should have been closer to them, so why would she help outsiders to embarrass her?","[Huh? What's with that look in Xuan Yi's eyes, as if she's blaming me? Good heavens, how thick-skinned can she be? Does she actually expect me to help her bully others, and then blame me when I don't?]","Ji Fei felt goosebumps all over her body.","As the discussions grew louder, Luo Cheng naturally came over to handle the situation, smiling as he asked what had happened.","\"It's nothing, just introducing a makeup artist to the ladies,\" Xuan Yi forced a smile and said, \"Perhaps because Ji Fei is a celebrity, her rates are higher than ours. We were just discussing that.\"","Luo Cheng smiled at Tang and said, \"Miss Tang, thank you for your hard work today. Please feel free to sample any of the wines here. If you find any you like, let us know, and we'll send them to you.\"","Luo Cheng was being generous and polite, but Tang looked at him rather strangely.","Tang only felt a slight sense of sympathy, but considering Luo Cheng's status and power, she realized she was in no position to feel sorry for anyone.","\"That's very kind, thank you,\" Tang responded politely, taking the graceful exit Luo Cheng had offered and helping to restore the atmosphere to normal. She didn't want to create potential problems for herself by letting a couple of jerks ruin someone else's important event.","Tang didn't plan to stay any longer. Knowing these people's ill intentions, she certainly wouldn't make herself a target, so she decided to return to the makeup room and wait until the banquet was over.","However, Tang still gave Ji Fei a grateful look, silently thanking her with her eyes. Even though her boyfriend Luo Zhou was just two people away, she didn't even glance in that direction.","This complete disregard made Luo Zhou nearly lose his mind. After all, Tang used to revolve her whole world around him, with eyes only for him. How could she ignore him like this? His heart felt like it was being squeezed, making it hard to breathe.","Seeing Tang about to leave, Luo Zhou finally exploded, \"Where are you going? Come sit here.\"","At these words, everyone around looked over.","[Is it starting already? The mindless rage and domineering attitude is kicking in. I'm so embarrassed my toes are curling. Haven't you realized you didn't even specify who you're talking to?]","The Qin family members, who hadn't found anything wrong before, almost laughed out loud when they heard Ji Fei's mental commentary.","Those at the table naturally knew who Luo Zhou was addressing, but the group of ladies who had just arrived didn't, and they looked at each other in confusion.","Who was he talking to?","Tang might have tried to pretend she hadn't heard and continued walking, but then Luo Zhou shouted, \"Stop right there, Tang Jiang! Didn't you hear me tell you to come here?\"","[Here we go, here we go, he's calling her by name now. Looks like Luo Zhou really was planning to introduce his girlfriend to everyone before, so he doesn't care about making their relationship public right now. However, from Tang's behavior, it's clear she doesn't want others to know about her connection with Young Master Luo anymore, which is why she keeps trying to escape. Unfortunately, with such a lunatic, there's no getting away.]","Tang indeed had to reluctantly turn around, stiffly saying, \"Young Master Luo, I still have work to complete. If there's any work-related matter to discuss, we can talk about it privately later.\"","Though the excuse was rather forced, it could barely maintain appearances, preventing people from speculating further about their relationship.","However, Luo Zhou felt rejected and became furious with embarrassment, especially since his girlfriend wasn't giving him face in front of so many people - it felt like a slap to his face. What work was she talking about? Was her job just doing makeup for his family's women?","Luo Zhou felt deeply humiliated. It was one thing for Tang to work as a makeup artist elsewhere, but how could she do it right at his family's doorstep? She was his girlfriend, his future wife!","In Luo Zhou's original plan, once Tang passed his tests and married him, she would naturally become a wealthy wife. If she wanted to do anything in the future, it would be as a boss making investments, not providing services to others. Appearing in such a role in front of so many acquaintances now - wouldn't that become gossip fodder later?","\"What work? Stop embarrassing yourself and come here,\" Luo Zhou blurted out in the heat of the moment.","[Has he... finally lost it completely?]","Qin Xian also frowned, looking at Luo Zhou as if he were looking at an idiot.","Tang's expression froze instantly, and she looked at Luo Zhou with an utterly unfamiliar gaze, as if she didn't know him at all.","When Luo Zhou saw Tang's expression, he instantly regretted his words, but being a man who cared too much about face, he couldn't take back what he'd said. He could only maintain his rigid expression, habitually waiting for Tang to soften and go along with him.","After all, Tang loved him deeply and couldn't leave him. She was always willing to indulge him, even when he knew he was wrong, Tang would always tolerate it. So it should be fine.","\"Heh, embarrassing? What right does Young Master Luo have to say such things?\" Tang suddenly said in a low voice.","[Oh? Tang finally couldn't take it anymore? Well, if she had to endure even this, she'd really be nothing but a pushover.]","Luo Zhou was stunned, looking at Tang in shock.","Whether from panic or fear, Luo Zhou suddenly burst out, \"I'm your boyfriend, how do I not have the right!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the group of ladies who hadn't left yet gasped. They all widened their eyes, looking from Luo Zhou to Tang, and finally to the cousin. They had all heard about Xuan Yi trying to match her cousin with Luo Zhou, but they never expected Luo Zhou to have a girlfriend, let alone their hired makeup artist.","Oh my... what juicy drama!","Even those at the table hadn't expected their relationship to be revealed in such circumstances.","Tang froze, feeling uncomfortable under all the stares around her.","She had imagined that one day, she would be proudly introduced as his girlfriend in her boyfriend's social circle.","But when this moment actually came, Tang found it utterly absurd.","Tang gave a contemptuous smile and said, \"Since you're my boyfriend, you have even less right to say that, because I've been supporting you with this skill for two years. You're the last person who should talk about embarrassment.\"","[Damn, that's brave! Kudos to Tang.]","This single statement left everyone at the table and the surrounding group of ladies dumbfounded. The three Qin siblings who had come to watch the drama almost dropped their drinks.","Was this about to turn into a fight?","Since she hadn't spoken very loudly, people elsewhere hadn't heard anything.","But this was already enough to humiliate Luo Zhou.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian both expected Luo Zhou to explode in anger given his temperament, but surprisingly, he just stared at Tang blankly."]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214: This, I Don't Deserve, Return to You","paragraphs":["\"What's going on? Did I hear that wrong? She's supporting Young Master Luo?\"","\"Shouldn't it be Young Master Luo supporting her instead?\"","\"Are they really dating?\"","Due to Luo Zhou's lack of response, people gradually started gossiping.","[What's happening? Is he all bark and no bite?]","Qin Xian thought that this must be the first time in their relationship that Tang had treated him this way, so Luo Zhou was probably feeling shocked.","Tang coldly stared at Luo Zhou, who seemed unable to face her icy gaze and was at a loss for words.","At this moment, the Cousin Sister, who had been watching the situation angrily, suddenly moved. She approached Tang, getting uncomfortably close, \"Miss Tang, are you Brother Luo Zhou's girlfriend? Why didn't you tell us earlier!\"","[Such fake friendliness out of nowhere. Nothing good comes from unsolicited kindness. What is she up to?]","\"There's nothing to tell.\" Tang instinctively stepped aside as the other girl had invaded her personal space.","Luo Zhou suddenly snapped to attention, staring intently at Tang.","Tang didn't want to cause a scene or return the insult. As long as Luo Zhou didn't lose control, she preferred to discuss the breakup after leaving.","However, the Cousin Sister moved even closer, \"Such an important matter must be shared!\"","She put on a coquettish act and made as if to lean against Tang.","[Oh no, the champagne tower is right there.]","Near their seating area were two steps leading down, and at the edge was an eight-tier champagne tower. Tang was standing right at the edge, and because of the Cousin Sister's proximity, she was already at the step's edge. If someone were to push against her now, she would lose her balance and stumble down – the scenario was too terrible to imagine.","\"Watch out!\"","Ji Fei noticed the Cousin Sister's plan instantly, but sitting in the middle, she was too late to stop it and could only shout a warning.","Even Qin Xian, sitting on the outside, was too far from Tang to help.","They could only hope Tang had good balance, but she appeared to be wearing high heels.","The next second, they only saw a blur of movement, followed by the sound of shattering glasses and women screaming, disturbing many guests.","\"Cousin Sister!\" Xuan Yi called out in disbelief. She then glared viciously at Tang, who was unharmed.","Tang was also bewildered and turned to look at her savior.","[Damn, I thought it was some heroic rescue, but it's you, Qin Zhao! How did you appear so suddenly!]","Qin Zhao: How is this not heroic?","Thanks to Ji Fei's inner thoughts, the three siblings had been standing nearby watching the drama unfold. When they saw Tang about to be pushed over, they naturally reached out and pulled her back.","Unfortunately, the Cousin Sister, having lost her intended support, ended up being the unfortunate one.","\"Everyone stay back,\" Luo Cheng rushed over to handle the situation. Among the scattered glass and spilled wine, the Cousin Sister was crying miserably. Fortunately, she had fallen clear of the champagne tower – if she had fallen onto the broken glass, she would definitely have been injured. Now she was just soaked in wine.","But this was embarrassing enough.","\"Xuan Yi, quickly take your cousin to get cleaned up,\" Luo Cheng urged.","Xuan Yi had no choice but to escort her reckless cousin away.","\"What were you trying to do? Are you crazy?\" Xuan Yi berated in a low voice.","\"I... I heard you say we needed to find a way to make her lose face at this party, so the Luo family would force them to end their relationship?\"","\"Tch, that's why you shouldn't have interfered.\"","The Cousin Sister finally understood that Xuan Yi had already prepared a plan.","As they left, the group of girls naturally dispersed as well.","Just as Tang was thanking Qin Zhao, Luo Zhou appeared beside her, grabbing her wrist and pulling her away from Qin Zhao.","He had just learned that Tang and Qin Zhao had worked together for two months, and now Qin Zhao was playing hero – it was extremely irritating.","But when he grabbed Tang, she tried to break free.","After handling the situation, Luo Cheng saw his brother acting foolishly again and quickly approached: \"Zhou, why are you grabbing Miss Tang?\"","Luo Zhou glared at Tang angrily, then said to his brother: \"She's my girlfriend. Can't I take her to my table to meet my friends?\"","Even Luo Cheng was shocked, \"Girlfriend?\"","\"Yes.\" Luo Zhou seemed to want to bring Tang before his brother for recognition.","But Tang completely refused to cooperate.","Luo Cheng couldn't be bothered with young people's relationship drama and said directly: \"Then treat her properly, don't cause any more trouble. After the wine tasting is over, bring your girlfriend to meet Mom and Dad.\"","After speaking, Luo Cheng smiled apologetically at everyone and returned to his hosting duties.","Tang couldn't make a scene with Luo Zhou in public, so she was eventually dragged to their table.","The entire table fell silent, and while no one looked particularly gossipy, they all seemed to be waiting for drama to unfold. The three Qin siblings were at a nearby bar counter, listening intently.","Luo Zhou pulled Tang to sit down and was quiet for a moment, as if processing everything that had just happened.","But Tang was already impatient; being with the current Young Master Luo made her feel completely uncomfortable.","\"Can you let go of me? I'm still working...\"","Luo Zhou's temper immediately flared up, \"Are you deliberately trying to oppose me? Even if you're throwing a tantrum, there should be limits.\"","[He's beyond help...]","Qin Xian: No hope.","The Qin siblings: Completely beyond saving.","The Qin parents who could only hear thoughts: What? What's beyond saving?","Tang suddenly turned to face Luo Zhou directly: \"I signed a 200,000 yuan contract with your sister-in-law to do makeup for today's event. I don't have time to sit here drinking and chatting.\"","Luo Zhou finally wasn't stupid enough to ask if she was just after money.","\"Did you know about my identity before?\" Luo Zhou couldn't figure it out anymore. The situation seemed too complex to him, so he asked directly.","\"Yes, your dear sister-in-law hired me to work at your class reunion that day. I saw you there, Young Master Luo.\" Tang said with a cold smile.","Luo Zhou missed the sarcasm in the way she said 'sister-in-law' and asked in a daze: \"Then why didn't you confront me? Why weren't you angry with me, but instead... instead borrowed money from me?\"","Tang let out a derisive laugh: \"I didn't want to borrow money from you before we sorted out our relationship, but I couldn't borrow enough money from anywhere else, so I had to ask you. I thought that even if you were deceiving me, you still had feelings for me, and when I was really in trouble, you wouldn't maintain your deception but would choose to help me. But you didn't.\"","Luo Zhou's face paled. Remembering Tang's expression when he refused her, his heart felt constricted. But he hadn't done it on purpose; at the time, his investigation really hadn't turned up anything.","\"That must have been a misunderstanding. I can give it to you now, so you don't need to work anymore.\"","\"It's too late. I've already received payment and gathered enough money. I don't need your help anymore, and I don't need you either,\" Tang suddenly said.","Luo Zhou froze, \"What do you mean?\"","Tang: \"You asked why I didn't confront you. It's because I was waiting for you to be honest with me. That was your last chance.\"","The last chance, what she had planned to say on his birthday...","\"What do you mean by saying this?!\" Luo Zhou exploded, as if unable to face reality.","\"I had planned to say this privately, but since the person I was dating never really existed, it's like I wasn't even in a relationship. So, Young Master Luo, stop saying you're my boyfriend. You're not.\"","Tang's gaze remained unwavering as she looked at Luo Zhou, making him increasingly anxious.","\"What do you mean I never existed? I'm still me. Since I'm wealthy, shouldn't you...\"","\"You don't actually think that after you pretended to be poor and deceived me for two years, I'd be overjoyed to discover you're a super-rich heir, do you?\" Tang asked.","Tang's frankness finally made Luo Zhou's face change dramatically. He seemed to sense that something was about to derail from his expectations, so his voice almost trembled as he asked: \"Isn't having a better life good?\"","\"Young Master Luo, I may be lacking in love, but the love you gave was too fake for me to digest. I do want a better life, but not with you. So, I will leave your world, and please stop bothering me.\"","After speaking, Tang took out a bracelet from her bag and placed it on the table. \"This... I'm not worthy of it. I'm returning it to you.\"","When she saw the familiar bracelet, Cen Ting was the first to react. She was so surprised that she couldn't stop herself from blurting out, \"This is...\"","Standing beside her, Jing Yan quickly pulled at Cen Ting's arm, worried that her words might make the situation even worse. After all, he had seen all of Cen Ting's works before and naturally recognized this as the so-called \"gift.\"","At this point, even Jing Yan was speechless about Luo Zhou's behavior. If he had already treated someone like a mere gift, why was he now acting as if he couldn't bear to part ways?","Just as Tang was about to put down the bracelet and stand up.","Someone called out from the direction of the stairs.","\"Oh no! My cousin's necklace has been stolen! Where's that makeup artist? Don't let her leave!\""]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215: Still Treating Her as a Temper Tantrum","paragraphs":["Since there had been a commotion earlier, everyone present knew who the makeup artist was, and all eyes immediately focused in that direction.","The bridesmaids who had just left had already gone out to gossip, so some people knew that the makeup artist was Elder Luo's Second Son's girlfriend.","But now, suddenly there was a necklace theft incident, and it pointed to the makeup artist.","Instead of looking at Tang with suspicious eyes, everyone had expressions of anticipation for drama.","Who doesn't love watching drama unfold?","Elder Luo's Second Son's girlfriend stealing Elder Luo's Eldest Son's wife's necklace.","This was getting interesting.","Seeing the Cousin Sister who had changed clothes charging straight towards Tang, Xuan Yi quickly appeared behind her and said, \"Cousin, don't be rash, it might not be Miss Tang who took it.\"","This statement further confirmed certain suspicions.","By now, Luo Cheng's face was full of impatience. What was going on today? It was truly cursed, with so many problems arising. Even he was having trouble keeping his temper in check.","\"What's going on?\"","Xuan Yi came downstairs with a wronged expression and said to Luo Cheng, \"It was the birthday gift from Luo Zhou back then. You know the value of that necklace... I just showed it to Miss Tang for a moment, wanting her help to choose a necklace that would match the dress, but when I went back to help Cousin Sister change clothes, I discovered the necklace was missing.\"","Luo Cheng stepped forward and said in a low voice, \"She's Second Brother's girlfriend, how could she steal anything?\"","In Luo Cheng's view, his second brother's girlfriend wouldn't need to do such a thing.","\"But... she didn't seem to know earlier that Second Brother was from the Luo family, and she seems to be quite short on money lately. I wonder if she might have temporarily strayed from the right path,\" Xuan Yi said troubledly. \"It's all my fault, I should have stopped Cousin Sister and handled this privately.\"","Luo Cheng felt something was very strange. From the moment he learned that the makeup artist Xuan Yi found was Second Brother's girlfriend, things had felt odd. He wasn't sure whether Xuan Yi had known beforehand that she was Second Brother's girlfriend, but now wasn't the time to question it, as the situation had already exploded.","Tang froze when she heard those words, her face full of confusion and shock.","The people at her table, who had just consumed the breakup gossip, were also looking at each other in surprise.","Luo Zhou, who had been staring blankly at the bracelet, suddenly heard those words and saw Cousin Sister charging over aggressively. He immediately stood up, grabbed Tang's hand and said, \"It's okay, don't be afraid.\"","Tang came to her senses, merely glancing at Luo Zhou before pulling her wrist away.","\"I didn't do anything, what should I be afraid of?\"","Luo Zhou's heart ached, and he became even more flustered, like trying to grasp sand slipping through his fingers. He couldn't help but say, \"I was wrong to pretend to be poor and deceive you before, but now isn't the time for you to be angry with me. Let me handle this.\"","Tang almost laughed from anger. She suddenly looked at Luo Zhou, her eyes full of confusion.","\"What?\" Luo Zhou felt uncomfortable under her gaze.","Tang just shook her head, her lips curled in contempt. The words she had just poured from her heart had been completely dismissed by him as insignificant, treating her as if she was just throwing a tantrum.","Had she been blind these past two years? What exactly had she seen in him? Now that she had stripped away the filter she had placed on him, he was so despicable.","Tang couldn't bear to look at him anymore. As she glanced around, her eyes met Ji Fei's, who was urgently trying to signal her.","Unfortunately, she couldn't hear Ji Fei's thoughts and thus couldn't respond.","[Oh no, Tang, you should check the compartment of your bag! After Xuan Yi showed off to you earlier, she secretly hid the necklace in your bag when you turned around.]","The Qin Family was stunned as they listened. They had wondered how such a low-level accusation could be possible, but it turned out to be a trap that had been set up in advance, just waiting to catch the thief red-handed.","Qin Xian: No wonder Ji Fei had made those movements earlier, looking like she wanted to rush forward. She probably first thought about grabbing the bag to save Tang.","But with all these witnesses present, nothing could be done now.","Even Qin Xian couldn't help but frown at this situation.","But what puzzled Qin Xian more was why Xuan Yi would do this. Wasn't she afraid of losing control of the situation and having her own affairs exposed?","But thinking carefully, Xuan Yi indeed had nothing to fear. After all, her relationship with Luo Zhou had been underground, never publicly acknowledged. Even those who knew were just their own people, and their friends wouldn't come forward to testify against them. Luo Zhou himself wouldn't expose such matters either.","Even if Tang spoke up, there would be no evidence, as the necklace had been given openly as a birthday gift.","Xuan Yi's scheme probably had the same purpose as Cousin Sister's earlier plan.","But this meant destroying the wine tasting party that the Luo family had carefully prepared...","[Ah! I can't believe it, Xuan Yi actually planned to sacrifice this wine tasting party to completely sever any possibility between Tang and Luo Zhou. Unlike the previous small tricks like the makeup artist fees that would only cause dislike, if this wine tasting party is ruined, even with Luo Zhou's temperament, if he insists on being with Tang, he would definitely face absolute obstacles. It's really... leaving no room for alternatives.]","[I really can't help but ask again, if you're working so hard to prevent them from being together, why did you break up in the first place?]","Qin Xian frowned, his eyes full of disgust. He never knew Xuan Yi was such a contradictory person, willing to destroy everything Eldest Brother Luo had worked hard to prepare for her own selfish desires. It seems that even after knowing someone for many years, you still might not truly know their heart.","The Qin Family, hearing this, was amazed by Xuan Yi's malicious intentions. Earlier, the Luo Couple had been bragging about marrying a virtuous and excellent wife who helped her husband's career.","They had heard people comparing the wives of their two families before, saying that Qin Xian had married an evil daughter-in-law.","Just moments ago, the Luo Couple couldn't help but ask why Ji Fei wanted to become an artist, their words implying disapproval of a wealthy family's wife working as an artist.","If the truth comes out later, they'd really like to ask who really married the evil daughter-in-law.","So Ji Fei and Qin Xian needed to step up... they must expose this!","But before Ji Fei could think of a way, Cousin Sister had already rushed over, pointing directly at Tang and saying, \"Did you steal my cousin's necklace?\"","\"I didn't,\" Tang said firmly.","\"But in that makeup room, except for you, an outsider, everyone else was family. And with our wealth, none of us would covet that necklace, so you're the only suspect. Let me check your bag.\" Cousin Sister reached for the bag.","\"Stop!\" Luo Zhou directly intervened, pushing Cousin Sister away. \"She is my girlfriend, why would she need to steal a necklace?\"","[Well, he finally did something right. But has he forgotten that he just got dumped? Is he thinking this will prevent him from being dumped later?]","Naturally, as soon as Luo Zhou said this, their relationship was exposed, and the Luo Couple hurried over to ask about the situation.","Luo Zhou was truly protecting Tang, making Cousin Sister so jealous that her eyes turned red with anger. Xuan Yi walked over at this moment, patting her back, and though she said nothing, she gave her unspoken support.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian watched carefully, and sure enough, at some point, the necklace Xuan Yi was wearing was no longer the one she had deliberately shown off to Tang earlier.","[It's just unfortunate, it probably happened when we were planning to leave, so we didn't see it. Otherwise, we would have stopped this conspiracy earlier...]","Qin Xian suddenly paused, taking out his phone uncertainly."]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216: Flirting with Me at This Moment","paragraphs":["By this time, everyone was already in heated discussion. They had learned that the missing item was a birthday gift worth a million yuan that Luo Zhou had once given to his sister-in-law.","When the necklace was mentioned, both Tang and Luo Zhou's expressions turned quite unpleasant.","With Xuan Yi's support, Cousin Sister immediately said, \"If you're not guilty, why won't you let me look in your bag? I'm sure you're suspicious.\"","\"Don't you understand? I already said she's my girlfriend. If she wants something, can't I give it to her? Why would she need to steal a necklace?\" Luo Zhou insisted on defending her.","Tang also spoke up, \"Why is it that when you lose something, you immediately suspect me? Why should I have to prove my innocence just because of your accusations? That's not right.\"","In truth, Tang had already started to worry and doubt, especially since she had experienced firsthand how unfriendly Xuan Yi and Cousin Sister were towards her.","But just then, Cousin Sister suddenly pointed at the bracelet on the table and exclaimed, \"Ah, it's the same style as my cousin's necklace!\"","Without waiting for anyone's reaction, Cousin Sister picked up the bracelet and said, \"Indeed! Whose is this? It's yours, isn't it?\"","Tang looked at the bracelet with an uncomfortable expression. \"This is what I just returned to Young Master Luo.\"","\"So it was yours!\" Cousin Sister said excitedly.","\"I remember that necklace Luo Zhou gave me came with a matching bracelet. Is this it?\" Xuan Yi suddenly spoke up.","With this revelation, the scene immediately erupted into chaos.","Various voices merged into one message:","\"What? The authentic piece for his sister-in-law, and just a complementary gift for his girlfriend? Seems Young Master Luo doesn't think much of his own girlfriend. No wonder he kept it hidden.\" At this point, the onlookers hadn't yet imagined the more outrageous truth; they only assumed Luo Zhou looked down on his girlfriend and was just trying to appease her with trinkets.","Tang felt like she had been slapped in the face. Even when breaking up with Luo Zhou, she hadn't wanted to expose this matter and argue with him about it. It was humiliating for her, especially since she had once treasured that bracelet so dearly.","Luo Zhou froze completely. Though he hadn't felt he'd done anything wrong before, he now felt so guilty he wished he could turn back time. He was extremely anxious inside but didn't dare look at Tang, instead glaring fiercely at Xuan Yi and Cousin Sister.","\"Did you have a fight with Luo Zhou and want to use my necklace to confront him? You could have just said so,\" Xuan Yi said, playing the good person.","\"Theft is theft. She probably couldn't stand that Brother Luo Zhou didn't value her, so she stole the necklace for revenge,\" Cousin Sister immediately added.","After this explanation, it seemed that even if Tang was Luo Zhou's girlfriend, her theft became somewhat understandable.","\"Both of you, shut up!\" Luo Zhou suddenly lost his temper, but was immediately reprimanded by Mr. and Mrs. Luo.","\"Is that how you speak to your sister-in-law!\" Mr. Luo defended.","\"If your girlfriend really took it, just have her return it. We won't pursue the matter further,\" Mrs. Luo said, already showing clear dislike for Tang.","The couple knew their second son well. His current display of angry embarrassment surely meant he was guilty about something. They couldn't think of anything else that would make Luo Zhou feel guilty, so they naturally assumed Tang had stolen the item to create drama with him.","While couples' quarrels weren't unusual, this behavior was very improper and had ruined their wine tasting party.","Tang's eyes had turned red from all the accusations.","\"Mom, Dad, don't you believe...\"","But before Luo Zhou could finish speaking, Cousin Sister suddenly lunged forward, grabbed Tang's bag, and quickly turned it upside down, rummaging through its contents. Various items scattered out, and finally, a beautiful necklace fell out, with the same luster and material as the bracelet, instantly silencing everyone present.","Luo Zhou looked at the necklace in disbelief, then turned to Tang with a bewildered expression.","Tang stared at the necklace in shock. Although she had been mentally prepared, she still panicked for a moment. \"It wasn't me. Someone framed me.\" At this point, she suddenly looked up at Xuan Yi. \"It was you!\"","The surrounding crowd had already started discussing among themselves, but Tang's sudden accusation made everyone point fingers at her, as no one would believe that Xuan Yi would use her own necklace to frame her – it seemed too absurd.","Xuan Yi also responded pitifully, \"I don't blame you for stealing the necklace to confront Luo Zhou, but you can't accuse me just because you've been exposed.\"","Tang threw caution to the wind, \"It was you. You put it in my bag when I wasn't paying attention to frame me, because you...\"","The sudden turn of events had even left Ji Fei confused, but upon hearing this crucial point, she immediately became excited.","[Say it! Say it! Just break everything open and kill them all! No one should get away with this!]","However, Tang actually stopped. She looked at Luo Zhou and suddenly said, \"She framed me. Do you believe me?\"","[What are you doing asking a man to choose at a time like this? Didn't you already remove your love-colored glasses?]","Perhaps everyone thought Tang was just begging her boyfriend to believe her.","But Qin Xian didn't see it that way.","He believed Tang had clearly assessed the situation. She knew that if she revealed the shocking relationship between sister-in-law and brother-in-law, she would need evidence; otherwise, she would be viciously attacked. People would think she was making up stories about the necklace and bracelet connection just to escape guilt.","But how could she possibly have evidence unless Luo Zhou himself stepped forward to admit his relationship with his sister-in-law? Only then would Xuan Yi's motive for framing someone become plausible.","However, doing so would completely shatter the Luo family's harmony. Luo Zhou probably wouldn't do it.","Tang had long lost trust in Luo Zhou and didn't dare to gamble, especially since she couldn't prove her innocence in this matter anyway.","The crime scene was in the makeup room, which had no surveillance cameras, making it impossible to prove anything. Even if Tang insisted she was wronged and framed, while she might not be convicted, she would be condemned in everyone's eyes.","It was the simplest frame-up, yet the most impossible to overcome.","After recognizing all these realities, she desperately realized she could only pin her hopes on Luo Zhou. She was adaptable enough to directly ask for his help.","That's why she asked that question.","If Luo Zhou said he believed her, it would prove he had doubts about his sister-in-law's actions and could naturally help clear her name. But if Luo Zhou didn't believe her, there would be no point in saying anything more.","However, Qin Xian felt Tang would likely be disappointed.","He lowered his head expressionlessly and operated his phone for a moment.","Meanwhile, Luo Zhou was stunned by Tang's question. He looked at Xuan Yi, who had red-rimmed eyes and a face full of grievance, seeming to want to speak but holding back.","Luo Zhou truly didn't know the truth; he had only been hostile to Xuan Yi because he hated having his hidden matters exposed.","And now, with Tang directly accusing Xuan Yi of being the criminal, this... how could this be possible? Why would Xuan Yi do such a thing?","His once most deeply cherished love interest couldn't instantly transform into a villain in his mind, so he instinctively leaned towards believing Xuan Yi.","Of course, he absolutely believed Tang as well.","There must be some misunderstanding here, like maybe the item had fallen into the bag accidentally? Or perhaps... perhaps it was that Cousin Sister's doing deliberately.","Yes, that Cousin Sister had seemed very suspicious.","\"Was it you? You've been acting strange from the start. How could you find the necklace so accurately? Didn't you plant it there yourself? You went into the makeup room, it must have been you,\" Luo Zhou didn't answer Tang's question, instead choosing a third option.","This proved he believed both his sister-in-law and his girlfriend.","But his response not only caused Cousin Sister to create an uproar, but also made Tang let out a soft, cold laugh and say, \"Then let's call the police. I'm willing to prove my innocence to them.\"","The crowd erupted again, surprised that the matter had escalated so far. Was she truly innocent or just stubbornly refusing to admit guilt?","Luo Fei cleared his throat and was about to stand up, since he was a police officer and could handle this officially. He was quite curious about this matter as well.","However, Tang's suggestion was rejected as Mr. and Mrs. Luo stepped in, saying, \"What's the point of calling the police? We won't pursue this matter. The item has been found, let's drop it. Luo Zhou, have a good talk with your girlfriend.\"","Luo Zhou hesitated for a moment, feeling that bringing such a family matter to the police station was inappropriate. When he saw Luo Fei about to stand up beside him, he pressed down on his shoulder. Finally, he turned to Tang with extreme frustration and said, \"Let it go. I believe you anyway. Let's talk to my parents properly later, and they'll believe you too.\"","Tang could barely hold back her tears. \"So, will everyone here believe that I'm innocent? Can you guarantee that when this spreads, I'll be seen as the innocent one?\"","Luo Zhou's face darkened as if his facade had been stripped away. \"Isn't it enough that I believe you? I can guarantee you a worry-free life in the future. Besides, if you push this further, are you sure you can prove your innocence? Don't end up digging yourself into a hole.\"","Luo Zhou was indeed worried about how the situation might develop. What if Tang couldn't defend herself in the end and ended up with a criminal record? It would be better to just let it go.","[How laughable! Such pretty words, but it's just sacrificing the weakest one for the sake of harmony. After all, Tang is the one with the least status in your eyes. Indeed, Luo Zhou, you really look down on Tang - you're even worse than I thought. Damn it, isn't Luo Fei a police officer? Do something! The others... right, they're all Luo Zhou's friends, with various family connections and long-standing relationships. Friends are always more biased towards each other; you can't expect them to stab their friend in the back for a stranger.]","Upon hearing Luo Zhou's words, Tang couldn't stop her tears.","She knew that if this matter was simply brushed aside, her reputation would be ruined, but... but who could help her?","Could she expect a miracle to fall from the sky to help her?","She didn't know anyone here... Suddenly, images of Ji Fei helping numerous female artists on the entertainment industry stage flashed through her mind, along with the recent assistance.","But... but asking Teacher Ji for help would be useless too, after all, there was truly no solution to this situation.","Ji Fei felt dejected, as her identity meant she couldn't speak up about the uncle-sister-in-law issue without evidence.","She couldn't help glancing at Qin Xian a couple of times but felt she couldn't ask him to expose his own brother. Besides, exposing the truth wouldn't solve the problem anyway.","Qin Xian noticed Ji Fei's glances and turned to look at her. \"What's wrong?\"","Ji Fei pressed her lips together, feeling somewhat sullen.","Suddenly, Qin Xian smiled and reached out to grasp Ji Fei's delicate chin.","Ji Fei froze, looking at Qin Xian in disbelief.","[Flirting at a time like this?]","Qin Xian stiffened, but ultimately turned Ji Fei's head to one side with an indulgent yet helpless touch on her chin.","On that side was a large screen that had been playing various wine promotional videos.","Suddenly, the video changed.","A voice rang out.","\"I hope you don't blame him. He didn't mean to do this... there were... there were reasons for it.\"","In that instant, everyone turned to look at the big screen."]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217: Suddenly Mua'd a Big Kiss","paragraphs":["Actually, recording the video was an accident. When Qin Xian took out his phone, he was operating it with one hand. Just as he raised it, he heard Ji Fei praising him for mastering paparazzi skills, which made his hand shake and accidentally press the screen. Only after putting away his phone did he realize the video had been automatically saved.","Perhaps influenced by the family's gossip-loving atmosphere, he didn't immediately delete it, thinking he could share it in the family group chat if anyone wanted to see it.","Just now, he was also trying his luck to see if he could capture anything, and unexpectedly...","So after the situation became uncontrollable, Qin Xian sent the video to Qin Zhao, asking him to handle it discreetly. Officially, they couldn't directly intervene due to relationships and interests, but they could still work behind the scenes.","The large screen displayed footage secretly filmed from outside the door, showing the confrontation between the two people and their suggestive conversation.","Perhaps due to the shock, no one thought to stop the video immediately.","When Xuan Yi revealed the reason why Luo Zhou pretended to be poor to deceive Tang, Luo Zhou's whole body trembled. It was what he felt most guilty about, what he feared Tang would discover the most. Even in his self-righteousness, he understood that if Tang learned he had tested and deceived her entirely because of his ex-girlfriend, it would be almost...","Luo Zhou suddenly felt as if he'd fallen into an ice pit, seemingly understanding for the first time that Tang's talk of breaking up wasn't just a temper tantrum.","And in that story, there were some special elements that made Luo Cheng suddenly realize something, causing him to turn sharply toward Xuan Yi, who looked almost ready to burst.","When the video mentioned the necklace, watching Xuan Yi's affected expressions, even though the conversation didn't admit to anything, just looking at her expressions and movements, anyone slightly clever could guess what had happened.","\"Oh my god, is it what I think it is?\"","\"I think we're all thinking the same thing.\"","\"This is explosive.\"","\"The boss's wife and the second brother were actually classmates.\"","\"So the ex-girlfriend really refers to the boss's wife?\"","\"The boss's wife abandoned the second brother and chose to marry the boss for a better future.\"","\"This is too dramatic. The Luo family is quite open-minded, aren't they? Two brothers sharing the same woman? Don't they find it disgusting?\"","\"And look at how the boss's wife is trying to break up the second brother and his girlfriend, obviously still having feelings for him.\"","\"Maybe they've been secretly involved all along, behind the boss's back.\"","\"Are you saying the boss is being cuckolded?\"","\"Then what about the alleged theft incident...\"","\"It was purely out of jealousy, trying hard to frame someone.\"","\"Isn't this typical wanting to have it both ways? Never thought the Luo family's highly praised wife would be such a person.\"","Luo Cheng's face had completely darkened, his gaze coldly sweeping over Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi.","Luo Zhou just stared blankly at Tang, his face completely drained of color.","Tang was shocked watching the video, not knowing who had filmed it, feeling it was like a miracle.","Xuan Yi seemed to finally come to her senses, quickly shouting, \"Who filmed this? Turn it off, turn it off! Someone, turn it off quickly!\"","Everyone thought Xuan Yi was panicking about the unhealthy relationship between her and her brother-in-law being exposed.","But the next second, someone gasped.","\"It really was a frame-up.\"","Xuan Yi felt as if struck by lightning.","People then saw that after their conversation ended, when Tang turned away, Xuan Yi smoothly removed the necklace and slipped it into Tang's bag placed nearby.","The complete crime process had been captured, revealing her malicious intentions clearly.","Even though Xuan Yi opened her mouth, appearing ready to quibble, she had no way to explain.","Her entire world had completely collapsed.","She knew it was over.","Looking at the big screen with bloodshot eyes, she seemed completely unable to understand how things had turned out this way.","\"Xuan Yi?\" Mrs. Luo pulled at Xuan Yi in disbelief.","Mr. Luo was so angry his eyes were bulging.","Whether it was the suspicious relationship between sister-in-law and brother-in-law, or this public framing, both were huge scandals that would make the Luo family the laughingstock of high society!","Xuan Yi's family elders were also present. They actually knew about her previous relationship with Luo Zhou but thought he was just a wealthy playboy with no value in their eyes, so they had advised their daughter to break up. They never expected their usually cautious daughter would be exposed like this.","They quickly came forward saying, \"It's all a misunderstanding, surely it's a misunderstanding.\"","But such pale explanations seemed ridiculous against the looping video.","The Luo couple's faces had turned blue with anger, their minds unable to process how to handle the current situation. Seeing the faces of Xuan Yi's family elders made them even angrier. When the other party came forward trying to hold their hands in a show of closeness, they violently pushed them away.","As the video was about to complete its second loop, Xuan Yi still hadn't figured out what to do. Her face felt numb, and her blood seemed to be flowing backward. She had never experienced such embarrassment in her life.","Now she wished she could faint and pretend none of this had happened.","But her body wouldn't even listen to her commands.","She felt as if she had been stripped naked and paraded through the streets, repeatedly watched and mocked. The discussions were like countless needles piercing her body. Ironically, not long ago, she had been enjoying these same discussions hurting Tang.","But now, she had replaced Tang as the protagonist.","\"The more you watch, the more despicable it seems.\"","\"It was a frame-up from start to finish. It's amazing how convincingly she acted earlier.\"","\"Really, she's quite pretty, how can she have such a vicious mind?\"","\"She tried to frame an innocent makeup artist. If she had succeeded, that poor makeup artist would have been ruined.\"","\"If you ask me, the Luo family was blind to marry such a troublemaker.\"","\"She deceived the second brother's feelings and the boss's marriage.\"","\"The second brother is also stupid. He should have told his family about this. How could he let his ex-girlfriend marry his elder brother? Who knows what he was thinking, only focusing on his own hurt feelings and then pretending to be poor to deceive another girl.\"","\"He's not right in the head either.\"","\"I'd say the most innocent ones are the boss and that makeup artist. They had the worst luck, getting involved with these two.\"","Even the usually composed Luo Cheng could barely stand steady now.","His own wife and his brother...","As for Tang, who had already faced the truth, she felt completely relieved after the truth came to light, wanting to laugh at the group of people who had almost pushed her into hell moments ago.","Karma really is a beautiful thing.","At the classmates' table, everyone was stunned.","\"They!\" Bai Xiaoxi was the most shocked, as she hadn't known anything before.","\"I can't believe it was really Xuan Yi. How did she become like this?\" Cen Ting was also quite shocked.","The others didn't look too pleased, after all, they were watching their friend's downfall.","\"Looks like I won't need to make an appearance,\" Luo Fei swallowed hard, \"Just wonder about this video...\"","Luo Fei couldn't help but look toward Qin Xian and Ji Fei. There was actually no evidence indicating they were responsible.","But none of the people present would likely risk offending the Luo family just to help a small makeup artist prove her innocence, and the video was filmed at such a perfect moment.","One could say that such an absurd yet satisfying miracle, he had only seen from certain people before.","But Luo Fei only saw Qin Xian smiling slightly, while Ji Fei stared at the video in amazement.","But the next second, Ji Fei seemed to realize something, suddenly turning her head toward Qin Xian, who was about to say something.","Ji Fei's face lit up with joy, and she threw herself at Qin Xian, planting a big kiss on his cheek."]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218: She's a tough one","paragraphs":["[\"Qin Xian!!!! You're amazing!!!!\"]","Ji Fei's excited thoughts echoed in the ears of the Qin family.","However, they all missed Ji Fei's overly excited impulse.","Ji Fei was so happy that after the kiss, she immediately went to watch the commotion, not thinking about how much impact her action had on others.","Qin Xian was completely stunned, as if all the surrounding sounds had disappeared, and he could only hear his own frantic heartbeat.","The spot on his cheek, though touched by something soft, felt like a million indescribable sensations flashed through.","His eyes unconsciously brightened, then his whole being became flustered, his pupils trembling with uncertainty.","From his neck to his ears, then to his cheeks, visible redness spread, and finally, he only dared to steal shy glances at Ji Fei.","Sitting opposite, Luo Fei witnessed everything and was completely dumbfounded, even more so than when he had watched the video.","Was this really his respected brother, the head of Qin Corporation?","He looked more like some inexperienced young boy who had appeared out of nowhere!","It was just a kiss on the cheek, was such a reaction necessary? Really necessary?","If this wasn't the wrong time and place, he really wanted to tease him about it.","Naturally, such a small incident couldn't attract others' attention, as everyone was captivated by this explosive drama.","Xuan Yi was completely panicked, almost mechanically trying to defend herself.","\"No, it's not like that...\"","Suddenly, a scream rang out.","Everyone was startled and looked over, but to their surprise, the person screaming was the cousin who had been the most energetic earlier.","In everyone's eyes, the cousin must have been an accomplice in this defamation incident, deliberately helping her sister slander others, so why was she screaming?","Then people in the crowd started exclaiming.","It was those in the sister group.","\"Xuan Yi was trying to arrange a marriage between her cousin and Luo Zhou. But Luo Zhou clearly had...\"","\"My God, Xuan Yi was trying to harm her own cousin.\"","\"It's because she saw her cousin was naive and easy to manipulate. This way, even if something happened between her and Luo Zhou, the cousin probably wouldn't notice.\"","\"Look at how the cousin has just awakened as if from a dream, reacting with such shock. She clearly didn't know her cousin had a past with the man she likes.\"","\"Pushing aside Luo Zhou's true love interest and trying to get her cousin to take the position, her intentions are unimaginable.\"","After the sister group's discussions, everyone understood the key points of the drama.","No wonder the cousin looked like her world was falling apart.","Then came a loud slap, and no one was surprised. Everyone felt Xuan Yi deserved a slap today, they just didn't expect the first one to come from her own family.","Xuan Yi's cheek immediately swelled from her cousin's slap, and she looked at her cousin in shock and anger.","But her cousin glared at her like a fierce dog.","She was panicking inside and naturally didn't dare to argue with her cousin, so she could only force herself to say: \"It's fake, it's all fake, this video's angle is misleading, everyone has misunderstood, I have no relationship with Second Brother, we were just classmates in the past, the ex-girlfriend I mentioned... was someone else. That necklace, I actually... actually got it just to help my cousin...\"","After all, the video didn't actually confirm anything, so she could still deny it if she insisted.","Luo Zhou came to his senses and caught Xuan Yi's subtle hint, suddenly thinking, yes, as long as they deny it, Tang won't break up with him, right?","Like grabbing onto a lifeline, he was about to speak when he saw Tang turn to look at him, her eyes cold and piercing, as if mocking him for still trying to treat her like a fool.","Luo Zhou was instantly speechless.","The Luo family members also realized that although they were furious, they couldn't let this embarrassing situation continue to develop. They had to salvage what they could, at least maintain appearances. They couldn't care about private gossip now - isn't this how wealthy families operate? As long as they could maintain surface harmony.","So when the Xuan family members were helping Xuan Yi speak, they were also prepared to sacrifice their dignity and deny everything to the end.","But before they could perform their face-saving act.","They heard the cousin, frantically grabbing Xuan Yi's collar, shouting: \"So, the child you secretly aborted before marriage was Luo Zhou's, right? You had his child, that's why your health has been poor and you haven't been able to get pregnant, yet you still tried to match me with him, you're disgusting, you're disgusting!\"","At this moment, Xuan Yi seemed to leave her body, looking at her cousin in disbelief.","The faces of Xuan Yi's parents instantly turned pale - this was something only they as a couple knew about. They didn't understand how the cousin knew these things. Perhaps some things eventually can't stay hidden.","Luo's parents were also thunderstruck.","What? What did they just hear?","Before marriage, Xuan Yi had aborted a child? Luo Zhou's child?","Luo Zhou was also stunned, looking at Xuan Yi in disbelief, never imagining that when this woman heartlessly dumped him back then, she had been pregnant. But now his attention wasn't on the possible child, but on the fact that he felt the stain on him could never be washed clean.","He seemed to realize he might never be able to hold onto Tang again.","He could only look at Tang in panic, anxiously trying to explain something.","\"I didn't know, I was the victim, I was deceived, I just had a relationship and then got dumped, Tang, Tang, don't look at me like that!\"","The usually arrogant Luo Zhou was now so humble his eyes were red, tears about to fall.","At this moment, the one who could least stand firm was Luo Cheng. He almost stumbled, breathing rapidly, supported by his attending staff.","Married for three years without children, with the family pressing hard, Luo Cheng had gone for several medical checks. Never did he imagine...","Suddenly, Luo Cheng's expression changed several times, as if realizing something, his eyes bulging with rage.","Originally, knowing the two might have dated before didn't feel so nauseating.","But at this moment, not just Luo Cheng, even Luo's parents were thoroughly disgusted.","Other onlookers were also stunned.","Even though wealthy families often had oddities for the sake of benefits, someone this bold - playing with a wealthy family, deceiving two brothers - was unprecedented.","And now, such explosive information was revealed by family members. There was no need to maintain appearances anymore, it was completely impossible.","Xuan Yi was thoroughly finished.","[My goodness, I can't believe I overlooked such a huge scandal, it's terrifying, truly terrifying.]","This wasn't Ji Fei's fault - unless you specifically investigated this possibility or found strong connections while investigating other matters, the system wouldn't necessarily display it.","At this moment, Ji Fei simply absorbed all the details carefully.","[My God, Xuan Yi is really ruthless. When she was pregnant, she actually planned to make Luo Cheng take the fall - after all, they're brothers, whose child it was wouldn't matter. But Luo Cheng was too principled and wouldn't do anything before marriage, so when the timing didn't work out, she had to abort it. Ah ah ah ah ah, what have I witnessed? This is truly human nature at its worst! My worldview has been shocked!]","The Qin family hadn't expected such sinister scheming behind this scandal.","Even just watching this drama unfold was shocking, making them feel even more sympathy for Luo Cheng.","However, at this moment, Luo Cheng's expression seemed...","Everyone thought the Luo family, or at least Luo Cheng, would slap Xuan Yi, but Luo Cheng didn't. Instead, he coldly said to the Xuan family: \"Please take your daughter and leave. Later, I will... have a proper discussion with her.\"","These words were spoken through gritted teeth. It was restraint taken to the extreme; his good breeding had saved Xuan Yi's life.","Xuan Yi was rescued from her frenzied cousin by her parents, staring blankly at the man she once relied on, \"Husband... let me explain, actually, actually I...\"","\"Xuan Yi, that time before our marriage, when you suddenly became so passionate towards me, what were you trying to do? If you don't want me to say it now, then shut up and quietly go home.\" Seemingly at his limit of tolerance, Luo Cheng didn't want to hear another word from Xuan Yi."]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219: Please Repay the Money Within Three Days","paragraphs":["For a married woman, being asked by her husband to have her parents take her back home is an extremely humiliating matter.","Xuan Yi instinctively struggled against this fate, but upon hearing these words, she looked at Luo Cheng in terror, never expecting that her past scheming would be discovered.","Indeed, Luo Cheng was not as easily fooled as Luo Zhou.","Xuan Yi's face turned from white to a sickly green, looking worse than someone who had been dead for days. Besides her uncontrollably flowing tears, she couldn't utter a single word, and even struggled to breathe.","Finally, her eyes rolled back, and she fainted.","This fainting caused the scene to descend into chaos.","[\"Oh my goodness, is this real or fake fainting? It's real! Well, some people are truly amusing - they can't handle the consequences when their own evil deeds come back to haunt them, yet how could they be so comfortable harming others?\"]","The Qin family members shook their heads, thinking this was merely karma.","Xuan Yi's parents rushed forward to support their daughter, crying out in alarm. When they turned to seek help from their son-in-law, they saw Luo Cheng's completely indifferent expression and knew there was no hope left.","Luo Cheng's parents hadn't yet recovered from the shocking truth they'd just learned, and were too exhausted to try salvaging any noble dignity, let alone deal with this daughter-in-law who had brought them such shame.","Luo Zhou was even less capable of helping others, as he himself was already in a state of confused panic.","Xuan Yi's parents finally left the Luo residence in disgrace with their daughter.","All the onlookers knew that with this departure, divorce was inevitable.","The wine tasting party naturally couldn't continue. Luo Cheng maintained his composure and properly arranged for the guests to leave, giving each person a bottle of fine wine as an apology for the disturbance.","Although the Luo family had thoroughly lost face this time, everyone was still satisfied with Luo Cheng's handling of the situation. With such an heir, the Luo family wouldn't be too severely affected by becoming the subject of ridicule this time.","When the Qin family was about to leave, Luo Cheng presented them with wine and asked, \"May I ask why?\"","This made the Qin family members uncomfortable, because although others might not know, Luo Cheng must have noticed and could easily investigate that they were behind the video incident.","Just as Qin Xian was about to speak, Ji Fei said, \"It was me. I couldn't stand seeing Xuan Yi bullying people. I'm friends with Tang. Besides, someone had to be the first to do wrong for things to reach this point.\"","The Qin family naturally protected Ji Fei. If Luo Cheng were to make trouble, they wouldn't hesitate to cut off future relations - that's just how willful they were.","Qin Xian glanced sideways at Ji Fei, who stood in front of him as if to protect him, ready to take responsibility for anything. He couldn't help but curl his lips into a slight smile.","Luo Cheng's relationship with Qin Xian was mostly business-related socializing. Seeing this side of Qin Xian for the first time, and noticing the faint lip print on his cheek, Luo Cheng's eyes revealed a hint of envy. He thought he understood the answer now.","He had only asked out of genuine curiosity - it was unusual for noble families to be so inconsiderate as to expose such matters publicly. Typically, to avoid offending others, they would pretend not to see such things, and the interests of lesser individuals were usually sacrificed without hesitation.","But they had taken this 'unnecessary' step... They were truly... a very interesting family, and doing business with such people meant one could always rest assured.","Seeing Ji Fei's nervousness, Luo Cheng smiled and said, \"The Entertainment Industry Judge, truly impressive.\"","[\"Huh? Is he mocking me? Though his expression seems fine.\"]","Luo Cheng shook hands with Qin Xian and went to see off other guests.","As the family walked out, they saw Qin Xian's friends, with Luo Fei apparently discussing upcoming wedding plans while waiting to speak with Qin Xian.","Just then, they heard a loud slap from the nearby lawn.","Before everyone could look toward the sound, the Qin family heard Ji Fei's excited voice.","[\"Great, I thought I wouldn't get to see this scene of chasing after a wife turned funeral pyre. Oh wait, this has already been burned to ashes, hasn't it?\"]","In the earlier chaos, Tang had disappeared unnoticed.","Now, as she was about to leave, Luo Zhou had stopped her.","After the slap, Luo Zhou's face was turned aside. This proud young master, being slapped for the first time, was completely stunned. He turned to look at Tang in disbelief.","\"You hit me?\"","Tang shook her hand and said coldly, \"You deserved it.\"","Tang's attitude toward Luo Zhou seemed to have changed dramatically, which Luo Zhou couldn't handle. Was this still the same woman who used to be so careful and full of hope for his love?","Seeing Tang so unwilling to face him made Luo Zhou's anger surge - after all, he had always been the dominant one in their relationship. However, when he saw Tang turning to leave, he instantly panicked and began begging pathetically.","[\"Is this only realizing what you had after losing it? How despicable.\"]","Ji Fei commented sarcastically, and the Qin family members mentally cursed his despicable behavior. Others watching this version of Luo Zhou were also full of disgust, even someone like Qi Li couldn't bear to watch.","But Luo Zhou was apparently truly afraid of losing Tang, so even knowing he was being watched by acquaintances in such a humiliating scene, he couldn't care less.","He blocked Tang's path, \"Are you really breaking up with me?\"","Tang sneered, not even bothering to answer.","\"No, impossible, you love me so much, you must have seen it too, I love you, I wanted to marry you, those things before... I did wrong, I was just afraid of being deceived again after investing my feelings, I know... I know I was wrong.\"","\"But you can't blame everything on me. It was your love that spoiled me, made me reckless, made me think you would never leave no matter what I did. You can't just leave me after I've gotten used to it. Those two years of deception, can't I make it up to you for the rest of my life? Tang, I truly love you, please, give me one more chance, okay?\" As Luo Zhou spoke, he actually started crying.","[\"Hmm... the lines aren't good, too cliché, and now trying to blame the victim? You did bad things because the other person was too good? What kind of logic is that? But with all these tears... I hope Tang won't be swayed by him.\"]","Without Ji Fei's commentary, the Qin family members would have been sighing along with others at Luo Zhou's confession.","But hearing it this way, it just seemed ridiculous.","However, how would Tang react to these words? After all, it was obvious that Luo Zhou did have feelings for her.","But Tang was lost in thought, thinking about something unknown.","Luo Zhou thought he had a chance and immediately said, \"As for that person... that's all in the past, at most I was just being stubborn. I haven't had any feelings for her for a long time, she's my sister-in-law, how could I possibly have any lingering attachment to her? Everything was just her one-sided delusion.\"","[\"Hey hey hey, you scumbag, your words are quite manipulative, aren't they? Being stubborn means you still cared, right? You might not have done anything substantial, but there was plenty of emotional entanglement. I haven't forgotten the eye contact at the class reunion.\"]","\"Can we start over? If you're willing, I can convince my family to get engaged to you right away, I...\" Luo Zhou reached out to grab Tang's hand as he spoke.","But Tang directly avoided him, and when she raised her eyes, there was only coldness in them.","\"I'll send you the bill later.\"","Luo Zhou was stunned, \"What?\"","The onlookers were also frozen, not immediately understanding what was happening.","\"For the two years I supported you, the money I spent on you, the transfers I made - I'll calculate everything item by item and send you the bill. Please pay within three days.\""]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220: This Moment, Xiao Tang, You Are My Sister","paragraphs":["The words struck like a thunderbolt from the sky.","In over two years, except for that one time borrowing money, Tang had never asked Luo Zhou for money.","This time, Luo Zhou was completely stunned.","[Well done! That's exactly what should be done!]","While others were still processing the scene, Ji Fei was already celebrating internally with metaphorical fireworks. After all, Tang had previously appeared to be hopelessly love-struck in Ji Fei's eyes, but unexpectedly, she had awakened and suddenly learned to protect her own interests.","\"You... you're asking me for money?\" Luo Zhou asked in disbelief.","[Hey, hey, watch your words! She's not asking for money, she's demanding you pay her back!]","\"Why shouldn't I ask you for money? Isn't that what you swindled from me in the first place? Both morally and legally, I have the right to reclaim it. I don't want to take advantage of you or covet your money, but don't think you can take advantage of me either. I won't ask for a penny more, I just want what's rightfully mine,\" Tang said calmly.","[Ah, why not ask for more? Emotional damage compensation and such - make him pay! You deserve it!]","Ji Fei was so excited she almost jumped up. Qin Xian amusingly patted her back, silently helping her calm down. Ji Fei didn't even notice anything unusual, as if she had unconsciously grown accustomed to Qin Xian's touch.","Qin Xian could understand Tang's approach. Not asking for additional compensation, only requesting what was rightfully hers - it was her way of showing final respect to her investment in that false relationship.","Tang's words naturally made Luo Zhou's face darken. After all, Xuan Yi had distorted his view of love, making him believe that a poor girl willing to spend money on him must truly love him. He had enjoyed this, and now Tang's demand to reclaim everything from before felt like she was completely withdrawing her previous love, negating their relationship.","\"That money is insignificant. I can give you more. All my wealth will be shared with you. If we just go back to how things were, you won't need to work hard as a makeup artist. Just be my wife at home, and I'll cherish you, love you, support you, I...\"","\"Luo Zhou, even after the deception is exposed, you still look down on me from your high horse,\" Tang suddenly realized with insight. \"I just remembered, during those two years when I was working hard as a makeup artist's assistant, I always complained to you about not having good clients. If you had just... if you had just once secretly used your status and resources to arrange a client for me, I wouldn't have had to work so hard to support you. You had so many people around you who knew you were deceiving me - would it have been so difficult to help put on an act? Would it have been so hard to make things a little easier for me? You wanted to test me... but you only enjoyed my dedication, remaining cold and detached like an observer from start to finish. You never once thought about using your position to help even a little bit... Heh, Luo Zhou, you're lying. You never loved me, not even a bit.\"","Tang's revelation came abruptly, as if it were just a small detail.","Yet somehow, it struck a deeply melancholic chord with everyone.","Indeed, Tang had been nothing but a joke for the past two years.","Pretending to be poor to test someone was wrong, but if during this time, Luo Zhou had used his influence to arrange some small strokes of luck to help Tang when she faced difficulties, it would have proven that he loved her and cared for her, just struggling with some awkward insecurity after being hurt before.","Surely, given Tang's love-struck nature, if she had learned the truth under such circumstances, and if Luo Zhou had sincerely apologized, she would have forgiven him.","But Luo Zhou had done nothing, allowing hardships to crush Tang, even becoming one of those hardships himself - was that really love?","Wasn't it just his own twisted psychology, a pathological way of venting?","Put this way, no one could find excuses for the so-called 'pretending to be poor to test true love' anymore.","Luo Zhou seemed to realize this too, his face gradually losing color as he trembled, staring at Tang.","Tang smiled contemptuously and said, \"So what you just said about cherishing, loving, and supporting me, about not letting me work as a makeup artist and just being your wife - that's nothing but the generosity of someone in power. I don't need your handouts. Those bills aren't insignificant... they mean a lot to me. I just hope that after this, we can be completely done with each other, never meet again, and you'll stop bothering me.\"","As if having his deepest thoughts - ones he hadn't even recognized himself - laid bare, Luo Zhou's gaze became vacant.","[My... goodness, after being cured of love-blindness, did she turn straight into clear-headed mode? At this moment, Tang, you're my sister!]","\"Miss Tang, rest assured, if my foolish brother cannot repay your money, I will take responsibility for repaying it,\" Luo Cheng's voice suddenly rang out.","Everyone turned to see that Luo Cheng had finished seeing off other guests and walked over.","He nodded apologetically to Tang, \"I'm sorry that both my brother and my wife have caused you trouble and harm. Our Luo family will provide compensation for this as well.\"","Tang was startled and was about to say something, but Luo Cheng interrupted, \"Miss Tang, don't worry about it. You want to make a clean break with Luo Zhou, right? Then it's better to settle both grudges and debts completely. Our Luo family never owes anyone, and I won't let him bother you anymore after this, you can rest assured.\"","At this point, Tang didn't know what to say.","\"Brother...\" Luo Zhou suddenly came to his senses, seemingly still unwilling to give up and not wanting his brother to interfere. However, Luo Cheng had already reached him and directly slapped him, causing Luo Zhou to fall onto the grass.","[Ah, that's balanced now, I'm satisfied.]","The Qin family members almost laughed out loud in this serious situation.","Yes, this slap was something Luo Zhou truly couldn't escape.","Luo Zhou was stunned for a moment, feeling utterly wronged, \"Brother, I really didn't do anything with sister-in-law! I didn't know about the things she concealed in the past, I didn't...\"","He wanted to say he hadn't done anything to make his brother a cuckold.","But Luo Cheng almost gritted his teeth as he said, \"Why didn't you tell me! Why didn't you say anything... from the beginning!\"","Luo Zhou froze. He... he didn't know why. It was just that when Xuan Yi had so decisively chosen his brother back then, he wanted to see if she could really separate body and heart, if she could truly be happy with his brother.","He just wanted to see Xuan Yi regret her choice, so... so he hadn't said anything.","He seemed to suddenly realize how much harm his silence had caused his brother and their family.","He could only hang his head timidly, saying sorry.","But he still couldn't help lifting his eyes to look at Tang, clearly not ready to give up so easily.","Luo Cheng seemed to just want to vent and teach his foolish brother a lesson.","At this point, it wasn't appropriate for others to stay and watch anymore.","Ji Fei warmly offered to accompany Tang home.","In the car, Qin Rong, who was closest to Tang, couldn't help saying, \"Sister Tang, you should have demanded more compensation from Luo Zhou just now. How could you let that scumbag off so easily? He needs to be taught a lesson.\"","\"That's right! The money you spent supporting him could have earned interest in the bank. It was all wasted on him,\" Ji Fei chimed in with criticism.","Tang was still quite reserved with their family, \"President Luo said he would...\"","\"That's compensation for their framing you and damaging your reputation, it's different from what that scumbag should pay,\" Ji Fei said.","Seeing how they were defending her, Tang couldn't help but smile, \"As for the interest, I'll just consider it as having enjoyed a high-quality handsome guy for free. I got the better deal.\"","Only after speaking did she realize the elders were present, and she became extremely embarrassed. It was just nervousness that made her blurt that out.","Actually, she just didn't want to admit she had wasted so much love, so she could only say it this way.","But Ji Fei patted her shoulder and said, \"Not bad, that's a great mindset. You were attracted to such a worthless person just for his looks, right?\"","Tang was embarrassed - well, that was true. Luo Zhou's face was undeniably handsome.","But when everyone remembered how both of Luo Zhou's cheeks were swollen when they left, they couldn't help but laugh.","\"I just hope everything can end here,\" Tang said, probably thinking of Luo Zhou's shameless, persistent calls as they left, suggesting endless harassment to come.","\"It will end,\" Ji Fei said.","Tang took it as mere consolation, not knowing Ji Fei was speaking the truth.","[It has to end, because Big Brother Luo is about to start cleaning up the trash. Neither Luo Zhou nor Xuan Yi can escape. Hey hey, let's see...]","The Qin family members also became curious about how Luo Cheng would handle this.","At the Luo family home, Luo Cheng didn't fight with Luo Zhou again, but Mr. Luo directly took a rod and started beating.","Finally, after the father had beaten enough and the mother had cried enough,","Luo Cheng announced the arrangements and disciplinary measures for Xuan Yi and Luo Zhou."]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221: Strange... What's on Qin Xian's Cheek","paragraphs":["The Xuan Family was in an uproar. The cousin's family, being daughter-doting parents, demanded an explanation from their brother and sister-in-law because Xuan Yi had taken advantage of their daughter, treating her like a fool.","Xuan Yi's parents were so angry they could barely contain themselves.","\"If it weren't for your stupid daughter, things wouldn't have gotten this bad.\"","\"Sister-in-law, how ridiculous! If it weren't for your shameless daughter who dated my brother and then married my other brother, even got pregnant, and played everyone for fools - she wouldn't have been thrown out by her husband's family.\"","Xuan Yi's parents were furious, and if other relatives hadn't held them back, both sides would have come to blows.","Just then, the Xuan Family's phone rang. It was Luo Cheng's assistant calling.","Xuan Yi's father's face stiffened. Before he could speak, the assistant said: \"On behalf of Mr. Luo Cheng, I'm officially notifying Miss Xuan Yi that divorce proceedings will take place tomorrow. She will leave with nothing. If she fails to appear tomorrow or continues to cause trouble for any reason, we will collect evidence and seek compensation. Please consider this carefully.\"","The call ended abruptly.","Xuan Yi's father nearly lost his balance. Just as he was about to discuss what to do with his daughter, his private phone started ringing continuously with calls from the family company.","\"Chairman Xuan, something terrible has happened! Luo Corporation suddenly called to cancel their contract. The XX project also sent word they're stopping cooperation. Even suppliers have received hints that the Luo Family won't work with anyone who does business with us. They've all indicated they won't continue cooperation next season... What's going on? Are they trying to crush our company?\"","At this news, Xuan Yi's father seemed to hear the Xuan Family Tower crumbling and finally collapsed.","The Xuan Family members all heard the news. No one expected Luo Cheng to be so ruthless and act so quickly. They forcibly broke down the door and dragged out the secretly distraught Xuan Yi, forcing her to beg for forgiveness.","But Xuan Yi couldn't reach Luo Cheng at all. When she tried contacting the Luo Family couple, she was warned and scolded. In the end, she could only argue and rave with relatives, causing ambulances and police cars to frequently visit the Xuan Family Villa.","Meanwhile, after dealing with Xuan Yi's matter...","Looking at Luo Zhou, who had been beaten unconscious by their father, Luo Cheng coldly told his parents: \"Arrange for someone to send him abroad tonight. He'll live there from now on and isn't allowed to return without good reason.\"","Although the Luo Family parents felt sorry for their eldest son, they also felt sympathy for their second son. Sending him abroad felt like exile.","\"This...\"","\"Do Mom and Dad want people to remember our Luo Family's scandal every time they see my brother in public?\"","They had no response to that.","\"To prevent him from causing trouble, his assets will be directly controlled. Just give him basic living expenses monthly, and I hope you two won't provide extra assistance.\"","\"Isn't this too harsh? Zhou has never experienced hardship.\"","\"Is living without luxury considered hardship? Don't worry, it won't be that bad. Didn't he think money tainted his love? Wasn't he able to rely on women to support him? I'm giving him a chance to find true love.\"","Luo Cheng truly thought his brother was incredibly foolish. Didn't he realize that every attractive quality he used to charm women was built on money?","\"Mom, Dad, the future losses his foolishness could bring to our Luo Family are immeasurable. He deserves this punishment.\"","Indeed, if Luo Zhou had spoken up initially, they would never have allowed Luo Cheng to marry Xuan Yi, and there wouldn't be such a scandal now.","Seeing his parents weren't opposing, Luo Cheng let out a sigh, not taking things to the extreme, \"But don't worry, if one day he can achieve something on his own merit and make people forget his foolish actions, I'll let him return.\"","The parents knew they couldn't change Luo Cheng's decision and could only watch helplessly as the still unconscious Luo Zhou was arranged to be sent abroad that night.","When Luo Zhou woke up, forget about pursuing Tang - he couldn't even return to the country. He could only rage impotently, regretting his past actions.","Of course, at this point, Tang hadn't realized she would never have to see that hypocrite again, and would only receive repayment and compensation in the future.","The Qin Family learned about Luo Cheng's efficient handling of the situation through Ji Fei's thoughts.","While it was satisfying, they also looked worriedly at Qin Xian.","Although Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi were of poor character, one was Qin Xian's brother-figure and the other a long-time friend. To see them end up like this...","Qin Xian did furrow his brows, finally letting out a light sigh, his gaze clear.","It was karma after all, a fitting end.","[Strange... what's that on Qin Xian's cheek?]","Suddenly Ji Fei's thoughts rang out. She had actually been worried about whether Qin Xian would feel conflicted about the video exposure after learning about Luo Cheng's arrangements for those two.","When she secretly looked over, as the car's light flashed, she noticed something unusual on Qin Xian's fair cheek.","Others couldn't help but shift their gaze due to Ji Fei's thoughts.","Qin Zhao, being the closest, couldn't help but ask: \"Second Brother, is that... a lipstick mark on your face?\"","The question came out before he could think it through, not considering how impossible it would be for his brother to have a lipstick mark, unless...","[Oh no, was it from when I kissed him earlier? I was so happy about the video situation that I accidentally... Oh my god, this is so embarrassing! Qin Zhao, your eyesight is too good! And your mouth too!!!]","Although Ji Fei's thoughts were already gritting teeth.","But everyone's attention had completely fallen on the lipstick mark, all eyes fixed on Qin Xian's cheek, even outsider Tang was stunned.","Qin Family: Oh my god!!! They kissed!!!! And in public too, how did we miss it!!!!","Tang: I seem to remember... I think I caught a glimpse of Teacher Ji happily hugging and kissing Mr. Qin, why...","Tang fell into contemplation.","Qin Xian responded vaguely to Qin Zhao's question, but his heart was full, and he couldn't help stealing glances at Ji Fei, who was pretending nothing happened and looking down at her phone.","The Qin Family members were internally screaming for a while but obviously couldn't say anything outwardly.","However, Qin Zhao thoughtfully took out a wet wipe from the car and offered it.","After all, a big CEO couldn't go around with a lipstick mark on his face. Just thinking about his second brother unconsciously wearing this lipstick mark at the Luo Family's place where many people might have seen it made him feel embarrassed for his brother.","But his brother just gave him a cool glance, showing no intention of taking it.","Then his phone started vibrating frantically.","Qin's Father: \"Are you stupid?\"","Qin's Mom: \"It's no wonder you're single.\"","Qin Yan: \"Is this a lipstick mark that should be wiped away?\"","Qin Rong: \"This is Second Brother and Sister-in-law's love progress bar!\"","Qin Zhao: ...","\"Why don't you just let Second Brother get it tattooed on his face!\""]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222: Join the Gossip Group","paragraphs":["While they were having an intense discussion on one side, Qin Xian couldn't help but look at Ji Fei, his mind in turmoil.","Seeing her avoidant behavior, he initially thought she was shy, embarrassed, or perhaps regretful after processing what happened. However, shortly after, he heard her wistful inner thoughts.","[Oh my, come to think of it, my subconscious isn't working properly! In my excitement, why did I just hug and kiss his cheek? Why didn't I take the chance to turn his face and kiss him properly on the lips! In that situation, even if I did it, I wouldn't have to take responsibility. Ah, why am I so bad! It's terrible to think this way, but it's really such a shame! Qin Xian's lips look so kissable! Hehe... I guess I'm still not brave enough!]","Qin Xian's reaction was delayed by a beat, but then his face quickly grew hot.","In the dimly lit car, it was hard to tell just how red his skin had become.","But one could see Qin Xian lowering his eyelids, his eyelashes trembling constantly, his red lips caught between pressing together and parting, moving helplessly, looking increasingly luscious as if waiting to be tasted.","Qin Xian: ...If you want to kiss me, you can do it anytime... no need to take responsibility... it's not bad... not wrong.","The Qin family members: Ahhhhh, Fei Fei, just go for it boldly! It's okay! We won't stand up for him or demand justice. Do whatever you want! As long as you dare to do it!!!!","The Qin family members were practically smoking up their phones with their furious typing, showing just how excited they were. Suddenly, they felt a gaze sweep over them.","Looking up, they realized it was from Qin Xian.","He seemed displeased about something.","The Qin family members: ...We understand now, we're so stupid! Why did we ride in the same car as Qin Xian and Ji Fei just to watch the drama unfold? We're such obvious third wheels now, such huge light bulbs! Would it help if we asked the driver to stop now and let all the unnecessary people leave so you two can continue your moment?","The unnecessary person Tang: Why does it feel like there's such an intense atmosphere even though the car is so quiet?","Of course, leaving wasn't possible because the moment had already passed, and Ji Fei's quick mind had already moved on to other matters.","Ji Fei had seemingly been in contact with someone else earlier, and now she turned to Tang with a smile, saying, \"Tang, I've already spoken with Sister Pei. Our studio needs a long-term makeup artist. If you're interested, you can contact Sister Pei to sign a cooperation contract.\"","Tang, who had seemed completely drained earlier, immediately brightened up. While Luo Cheng might offer generous compensation, Tang was more excited about advancing her career.","Tang kept expressing her gratitude repeatedly.","Soon after Tang reached her destination and got out of the car, watching the vehicle leave, she suddenly had a strong feeling that the video must have been arranged by Teacher Ji and her people.","The cheek kiss incident had her mind wandering, and remembering Teacher Ji's title as the Entertainment Industry Judge, she suddenly felt this was very much her style.","Tang wasn't the only one thinking this way; many others who had left the Luo family that day were speculating about it too.","That night, the explosive gossip from the Luo family spread throughout upper-class circles, and many couldn't help but let their imaginations run wild.","There were many high-society parties.","Not every one of them would produce such shocking news.","After all, the last time something this explosive happened was during the Qin family's recognition banquet with the incident involving the Chu family twins.","While this was the Luo family's party, the Qin family was also present, and considering the storms that the Qin family's young madam had stirred up in the entertainment circle... hmm, wasn't it too coincidental?","After all, the video that really caused this scandal to break still hasn't revealed who was behind it. This was very suspicious.","Of course, these were just vague speculations for now.","But when the upper-class gossip spread to the internet, although it wasn't as dramatic as celebrity news and couldn't make it to the trending topics, it still sparked a small wave of excitement among gossip enthusiasts.","After all, such wine-tasting events would also invite some journalists, and while they might not dare to report too many inside details, the promotional photos from the wine tasting still gave netizens clues to piece together.","And among the gossip-loving netizens, a large portion were actually fans of Fei.","\"Strange, why do I seem to see our Sister Fei's figure?\"","\"Was Sister Fei there too?\"","\"Sister Fei seems to come from or have connections with an upper-class family.\"","\"Not sure, but I know wherever there's gossip, there's Sister Fei!\"","\"Hahaha, is the Entertainment Industry Judge going to judge the gossip in the upper class now? Is she evolving into the Upper-class Gossip Queen?!\"","Obviously, some netizens had made early predictions, though these were just occasional comments at this point.","The next day, while Ji Fei was browsing the internet, she couldn't understand why her name had appeared.","However, there was no news about Tang, which was fortunate as it meant her life wouldn't be disturbed.","Sister Pei had also contacted Ji Fei, saying Tang had come to sign the contract.","In the afternoon, while the whole family was accompanying Little Qin Xi to her competition, Ji Fei's inner thoughts revealed new information.","[Pfft, because of Luo Cheng's warning, Xuan Yi finally backed down. She went to file for divorce with her head wrapped in bandages, crying and begging Luo Cheng to soften his heart, but Luo Cheng didn't even look at her. Sigh, Sister Xuan, if you knew this would happen, why did you do it in the first place? If you had just lived your life peacefully, you wouldn't have had so many secrets exposed.]","The Qin family members also reflected on what a battle yesterday had been.","Naturally, Qin Xian, who had gone to work, also received news of the complete rupture between the Luo and Xuan families.","Their university friends' group chat was also in an uproar, though Luo Zhou didn't respond at all, and Xuan Yi directly left the group chat. Suddenly, as if remembering something, Qin Xian said something to the group and then added Ji Fei to it.","Everyone's opinion of Ji Fei had improved, so their attitude towards her was quite warm.","Ji Fei was very intrigued and privately messaged Qin Xian: \"Why did you suddenly add me to your group?\"","Qin Xian replied: \"There's a lot of gossip here.\" Although he never participated or liked to watch, he knew these people loved to chat about such things when they got together.","Ji Fei had thought Qin Xian would say something else, like how she was his wife and needed to build connections with his friends, but seeing this answer, she couldn't help but smile, feeling happy inside.","She then eagerly went to lurk and observe the gossip.","Everyone had clearly been discussing Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi's situation for a long time, but now, not wanting to continue sighing and lamenting, they started talking about Luo Fei's marriage.","Qi Li: \"Luo Fei, I'm really curious, how did your family agree to let you marry her?\"","\"It must be because of the child,\" Jing Yan said.","Luo Fei didn't deny it, \"Actually, my father had already given in earlier, but my mother wouldn't budge. This time it was indeed because Shi Shi is pregnant that my mother finally agreed. This is good though, being able to marry the woman I love with my family's blessing, that's happiness enough.\"","\"If we had known, you should have had a child earlier, then your parents wouldn't have opposed you for so long,\" Yu Yue said.","Luo Fei: \"I didn't even listen to them about my career choice, why should I listen to them about who I marry? Actually, it was Shi Shi who wouldn't agree. You know how cautiously she lives, she probably wanted both my parents' approval, otherwise she wouldn't dare to say yes. Even when she was pregnant, she was anxious several times and even considered terminating the pregnancy. Sigh, it's my fault for not giving her enough security.\"","Hearing Luo Fei's self-reflection, everyone either teased or praised him, all believing they would be a very happy couple.","Ji Fei had previously learned about their love story through Luo Fei's perspective; it was a true redemption story.","They were high school classmates - he was a righteous male student leader, and she was a timid girl who had lost both parents and suffered from bullying.","Luo Fei often played the hero, even getting into fights for her, sometimes serious enough to end up in the hospital.","When gossiping with Qin Xian earlier, she heard that Luo Fei's childhood dream was to become an air force pilot.","The Luo family actually had half their background in the military, so Luo Fei was expected to either go into business or join the military. However, because of a fighting incident in high school, he was severely injured, left with scars, and could no longer become an air force pilot.","His character had its own pride and dignity. Since he couldn't become an Air Force pilot, he didn't want to join any other military branch, fearing it would only remind him of his loss. His personality also wasn't suited for the business world, so he chose to become a police officer. Eventually, he grew to love this profession, and the regret of not becoming a pilot gradually faded away.","It was also because of that serious incident that the two of them, as if having weathered countless hardships together, came to understand each other's hearts, and officially began dating.","Even though they attended different universities and spent more time apart than together, they maintained their relationship until now, when their long-distance romance finally reached its perfect conclusion.","Through the group chat's various conversations, Ji Fei learned that the other person was called Fan Shi. Because she sympathized with this girl who had experienced bullying, Ji Fei instinctively felt that prying into her privacy would be like reopening old wounds, so she never thought about looking into Fan Shi's personal affairs.","Meanwhile, in Luo Fei and Fan Shi's apartment, Fan Shi graciously brought over some fruit. Luo Fei immediately put down his phone, stood up, and carefully helped her sit down, saying, \"I told you, let me handle these things.\" As he spoke, he gently caressed Fan Shi's slightly protruding belly.","Fan Shi's expression carried a delicate vulnerability that inspired tenderness.","\"Are you chatting with your friends? About the wine tasting event the other day?\"","Luo Fei replied, \"You were sleeping earlier so I didn't tell you, but actually...\"","Luo Fei told Fan Shi about what happened to Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi. Thinking of Fan Shi's pregnancy, he couldn't help but say, \"Xuan Yi was really cruel, how could she bear to abort the baby... well, not exactly... I heard others analyzing that Xuan Yi probably wanted to make Brother Luo the fall guy, to acknowledge the child. How could a woman be so... sigh.\"","Just as Luo Fei finished sighing, he noticed Fan Shi's face had turned deathly pale. He immediately asked anxiously, \"What's wrong, Shi Shi?\"","\"Nothing... just feeling a bit unwell again.\"","Luo Fei naturally dropped the topic and immediately started fussing over her, not noticing Fan Shi's hesitation to speak.","In the following days, due to Fan Shi's poor health, Luo Fei had to handle the wedding preparations alone. Because he was so busy, he completely failed to notice Fan Shi's various strange behaviors.","Until the wedding day...","\"Oh? Isn't that little Wu Xingqing? She's also attending Luo Fei's wedding? Does their family have connections with the Luo family?\" Mrs. Qin was surprised to see a familiar face."]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223: I Don't Like Plastic Surgery Faces, Qin Xian's Face is Still the Best","paragraphs":["The Qin Family and Luo Family had a good relationship, so the entire family attended the wedding together. The four women walked arm in arm in pairs, while the four men stood behind them. As the family's most attractive members, they naturally drew most people's attention as soon as they stepped out of their car.","Moreover, the Qin Corporation had recently completed a major project with impressive results, making others both envious and admiring.","People had also heard that the third son of the Qin Family might be going abroad for development and leaving the entertainment industry. They felt this could be a significant move by the Qin Corporation. Perhaps the brothers were joining forces to share Qin Xian's burden and create their own legacy while gaining more influence within the Qin Corporation. After all, the internal dynamics of the Qin family clan were quite complex.","So many people wanted to gather information early to plan their future arrangements.","Acquaintances came forward to exchange greetings. After the Qin Family dealt with wave after wave of people, they were walking into the Luo Family Manor when they spotted an unexpected person in the crowd.","Qin Rong curiously asked Qin's Mom, \"Who's that?\"","Qin's Mom, remembering that the younger generation hadn't met Wu Xingqing, explained, \"That's the daughter abandoned by that fool Peng Li.\"","Since Wu Xingqing occasionally visited her grandparents, and the Peng Family had a good relationship with Qin's Mom's family, they had met once or twice.","However, Qin's Mom remembered that neither the Wu Family nor the Peng Family had any connection with the Luo Family, so she found it strange to see Wu Xingqing here.","Ji Fei also followed Qin's Mom's gaze.","[Wow, she's beautiful.]","The Qin Family members all looked at Wu Xingqing, agreeing that she was indeed pretty, and fortunately didn't look like her mother - that would have been quite unsettling.","Wu Xingqing was a typical cool beauty with a naturally cold face and indifferent expression. Her demeanor showed that she was someone who held herself to very high standards.","When Wu Xingqing turned her head and saw Qin's Father and Qin's Mom, she clearly remembered them and, being polite, took the initiative to greet them.","As she walked over, everyone noticed she was arm in arm with a man.","However, this man's overall style didn't quite match hers. He was dressed casually with a somewhat playboy-ish handsomeness, though he carried an air of nobility.","When he came over with her, his eyes scanned everyone in an appraising way. Perhaps it was just his habit of looking at people, but it somehow made others feel uncomfortable.","\"Uncle, Auntie, it's been a long time. How are you?\" Wu Xingqing bowed slightly in greeting.","\"Xingqing, you're here for Luo Fei's wedding too?\" Qin's Mom smiled.","\"I came with my boyfriend. I didn't expect to meet you here,\" Wu Xingqing had recently returned from abroad, and since the Wu Family's business focus had gradually shifted overseas with fewer connections to domestic elite families, she wasn't clear about the relationship network here.","She was attending the wedding because of her boyfriend, who presumably knew someone from the Luo Family.","\"You've really grown up. Last time I saw you, your grandmother was saying you were single,\" Qin's Mom said with a smile.","Even a cool girl like Wu Xingqing couldn't help but feel shy at such topics.","\"Hello Uncle and Auntie, I'm Tang Yu, Xingqing's boyfriend. I finally won her heart three months ago,\" Tang Yu greeted with a smile.","Qin's Mom politely introduced the rest of her family in return.","[This man feels... like he's handsome, but also like he's not.]","Ji Fei felt something off about Tang Yu.","After they finished exchanging greetings and parted ways, Qin Zhao finally spoke up: \"That Tang Yu clearly has a surgically enhanced face. Who knows what he originally looked like.\"","\"Really?\" Qin Rong immediately asked curiously.","\"Didn't you notice how unnatural his expressions were? That level of stiffness - who knows how many times he's gone under the knife,\" Qin Zhao said.","\"It is unnatural,\" agreed Qin Yan.","Ji Fei had a sudden realization, \"No wonder something felt odd. So men will also go under the knife for beauty.\"","[Indeed, I don't like surgically enhanced faces. Qin Xian's face is much better - it's pleasant to look at.]","Qin Xian, who had just been thinking that Tang Yu's name sounded familiar, suddenly lost control of his thoughts and the corners of his mouth at this compliment.","He couldn't help but move closer to Ji Fei, like a big puppy, until their arms were almost touching.","Ji Fei was startled by the contact and instinctively thought Qin Xian was suggesting she should take his arm, as they were married and it was proper etiquette to walk arm in arm at formal occasions.","So Ji Fei took his arm proactively, causing Qin Xian to freeze, not expecting this development. His expression immediately became unnatural.","The Qin Family watched from behind.","They caught Qin Xian's tensed-up appearance perfectly.","Come on, it's not like they hadn't linked arms before... how immature~","If others saw this... how embarrassing","The Qin Family was already quite calm about such small developments - unless it was something like hugging or kissing, they would just glance over it.","Inside the manor, there were even more guests.","This time, not only did Qin's Father and Qin's Mom's generation have friends there, but Qin Yan, Qin Rong, and Qin Zhao also had their own friends, so everyone dispersed after entering.","Since there wasn't much gossip to catch up on, the Qin Family hadn't been particularly eager to arrive early this time.","By the time they arrived, Qin Xian's friends were already there.","When Qin Xian brought Ji Fei to his group, they saw Luo Fei was there too, rarely dressed in formal attire with his hair meticulously combed, his handsomeness reaching new heights, apparently discussing the upcoming bride pickup ceremony.","Fan Shi didn't have many relatives left, so their apartment served as the bride's home, with colleagues and classmates accompanying her as they waited for the groom's party to arrive.","\"Perfect timing, Qin Xian, Ji Fei, want to come with us?\" Luo Fei asked excitedly with a face full of joy, \"Help me get past the door games.\"","Everyone else laughed and agreed to join, even Cen Ting, who usually didn't seem to like such events, stood up.","Previously, Qin Xian wouldn't have joined in such lively activities, but this time he wanted to go to learn from the experience. However, he still turned to look at Ji Fei first, asking for her opinion.","Ji Fei of course wanted to join in the fun, so she readily agreed.","So they went along to pick up the bride.","In the car on the way there, Bai Xiaoxi suddenly asked curiously, \"Qi Li, you didn't bring anyone today?\"","[Right, where's Han Ziyu?]","\"Hmph, that immature girl is throwing a tantrum,\" Qi Li was displeased, \"Just because I watched that person's overseas performance video in front of her, and a few days later she said she wanted to break it off. It's just a little trick to play hard to get.\"","[Pfft, are you sure? Isn't it because Han Ziyu's contract expired, she made enough money, and didn't renew? She left quite happily - you can't imagine the joy of quitting a job you don't like.]","Ji Fei looked at Qi Li's arrogant and self-important expression, barely holding back her laughter. She was really curious about how he would react when he realized Han Ziyu wasn't coming back."]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224: Rich Families with Many Illegitimate Children","paragraphs":["However, the incident with Qi Li was just a brief interlude. Soon, they arrived at the apartment. After a series of door-crashing games, Ji Fei finally made it to the bridal chamber with the crowd.","There were too many people standing in front, making it impossible for Ji Fei to see the games being played in the inner circle.","Just as she was standing on her tiptoes, she suddenly felt herself being lifted up and held.","The familiar position felt completely different from last time. This time, Qin Xian exuded a sense of satisfaction, his body naturally holding her closer, more intimately.","And... more nervously.","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment, her heart skipping several beats. Despite the unsafe height, she felt strangely secure.","However, while other children were being lifted to see the excitement, she was the only adult being held up, which made her feel somewhat embarrassed. She wanted Qin Xian to put her down.","But when she looked down, she noticed Qin Xian seemed shy, his ears burning bright red, almost dripping with blood.","Ji Fei, perhaps in a moment of mischief, reached out with her hand that was draped over Qin Xian's neck and pinched his crimson earlobe.","Qin Xian reacted like a startled cat, suddenly looking up at Ji Fei.","Ji Fei felt guilty, let go, and pretended nothing had happened.","[I wasn't teasing him, I was just curious if his red ears were warm. But... being so red, was he embarrassed? Haha, who knew even a domineering CEO could be this cute? Is this what they call gap moe? So adorable!]","Qin Xian silently turned back, lowering his gaze, his whole body radiating heat...","\"Hey, isn't that Ji Fei?\"","\"Yes, it is! The big star.\"","\"And that man holding her is... so handsome, even more than Qin Chao... How can there be such a stylish man? And his strength is impressive, holding her so steadily!\"","Qin Xian paused, hesitantly waiting for Ji Fei's reaction. Actually... he wanted everyone to know they were married, but he knew Ji Fei still wanted to work as an entertainer, so perhaps she didn't want others to know about her marriage.","[That's my husband, you're not seeing things wrong. He's just that handsome and strong... hehe, having such a husband really makes me proud.]","Qin Xian's heart lightened, and he couldn't help but feel happy.","Yes, he could make Ji Fei proud!","Obviously, those gossiping people also understood that since they came with Luo Fei, they must be important people, so they didn't dare to take photos. After some discussion, they changed the topic.","\"Fan Shi is really lucky. Who would have thought that girl who had such a terrible time in high school would end up marrying into a wealthy family?\"","\"I think Luo Fei started feeling sorry for her back then, and pity turned into love. Men always like women who trigger their protective instincts.\"","\"Although I don't like Fan Shi's overly weak personality that never fights back, she really did have it rough in the past. Being bullied by school bullies for so long, coming to school with injuries almost every day. At least now she's finally found happiness.\"","\"Actually, it's been quite a while since those past events. I thought Fan Shi's personality would have changed somewhat when we saw her again, especially after being pampered by Luo Fei for so many years. But she seems almost the same as in high school, timid and fearful.\"","\"More than that, it's her wedding day, but since the morning makeup session, she's had this gloomy, sad expression. Only someone with Luo Fei's sunny disposition could face her every day without being affected by her negative energy.\"","\"I guess the shadows from school days really do follow you forever.\"","\"Not necessarily, pregnancy hormones could also be affecting her.\"","These two were probably Fan Shi's high school classmates, which explained why they couldn't stop gossiping about the past.","As Ji Fei listened, she observed Fan Shi and indeed noticed something odd about her expression, even though Luo Fei was down on one knee, declaring his love.","Usually, brides either laugh joyously or cry tears of happiness.","But Fan Shi was different - her eyes were flickering, distracted, and her smile seemed very forced.","It was strange.","Before Ji Fei could think more about it, everyone started cheering. The wedding games were over, and since there were no family members from the bride's side, many ceremonies were skipped, and they went straight to taking the bride to the Luo family home.","At the Luo residence, Luo Fei wouldn't let Fan Shi walk, carrying her in his arms as they entered.","He clearly cherished his wife deeply.","Along the way, they naturally received many guests' blessings.","\"Congratulations!\"","\"Thank you, thank you.\"","\"Congratulations...\"","Suddenly, two figures appeared in the crowd.","Luo Fei heard the congratulations and said thanks, but his gaze paused briefly, somewhat surprised to see these two unfamiliar guests.","At that moment, he noticed Fan Shi suddenly starting to tremble uncontrollably in his arms.","\"What's wrong?\" Luo Fei asked worriedly.","Fan Shi shook her head, burying her face in Luo Fei's chest, seemingly not wanting him to see her expression.","Thinking Fan Shi was feeling unwell, Luo Fei quickened his pace, wanting to get her to the bridal chamber to rest as soon as possible.","He didn't notice that Fan Shi was secretly watching the two retreating figures through the gap in his arms, her eyes gradually becoming misty.","\"Heh heh.\"","Wu Xingqing suddenly heard her boyfriend snickering and couldn't help but look at him curiously.","Tang Yu caught himself and quickly hugged Wu Xingqing, saying, \"I'm so envious, I want to marry you soon too.\"","Wu Xingqing immediately felt uncomfortable and said, \"We can only discuss marriage after dating for more than two years.\"","A flash of impatience crossed Tang Yu's face as he mentally cursed her old-fashioned prudishness.","Just then, Tang Yu suddenly saw someone waving at him - it was Luo's Father's assistant.","Tang Yu's eyes flickered, and after making an excuse to Wu Xingqing, he left alone.","Seeing him, the assistant frowned slightly, \"The boss wants to see you, follow me.\"","Tang Yu smiled and followed the assistant toward the Luo family's huge backyard garden.","After winding around for a while, hearing some dog barking, they finally found Luo's Father, wearing the father-of-the-groom boutonnière, in a secluded corner.","Before Tang Yu could speak, Luo's Father frowned and scolded, \"What are you doing here? Who told you to come?\"","\"Dad, even if big brother doesn't know about my existence, he's still my brother. For such an important event as his wedding, I wanted to witness it,\" Tang Yu said earnestly.","Luo's Father was taken aback, \"You're really not here to cause trouble? Your mother should have explained the situation to you. I can't publicly acknowledge your identity now, you can't cause me problems at an occasion like this.\"","\"How could I? Dad, I even brought my girlfriend today, wanting you to see her - the Wu family's eldest daughter, Wu Xingqing.\"","\"What! You're dating her? How did their family agree? You really...\" Luo's Father was very surprised.","Tang Yu said, \"Her father doesn't interfere with her decisions, regardless of background or status. As long as I win her over... although... given my current situation, even if we marry in the future, I might have to take her family name, so...\"","Luo's Father couldn't help but frown, seemingly weighing something in his mind.","\"I understand. Go back to your girlfriend for now, we'll discuss this later.\"","Tang Yu put his hands in his pockets, unable to suppress his smile as he turned to leave.","Passing by a man-high hedge, he heard dog barking again, though it seemed to stop abruptly, which was strange.","Tang Yu didn't notice, but behind the hedge were two people and three dogs.","Ji Fei had heard that Luo Fei had adopted several retired police dogs, and being bored while waiting for the bride to change, Qin Xian suggested taking her to see them. He knew she would like it, and sure enough, Ji Fei was delighted to go play with the dogs.","The butler had led them there and left, and while they were playing, they unexpectedly overheard the secret conversation.","Qin Xian's expression was displeased.","Ji Fei's mouth fell open as she held a dog's head with one hand, covering its mouth.","[Oh my goodness, what a scandal! Rich families really do have illegitimate children! I heard from Qin's Mom before that the Luo couple had a harmonious relationship, a rare case of true love in an arranged marriage, but who knew there was such a big secret! Men, really, hmph!]","[Luo Fei doesn't know about this yet. Now that we've heard this, should we tell on them? We probably shouldn't say anything on such a joyous occasion. Wu Xingqing's boyfriend, that Tang Yu, judging from his voice-over, is clearly using Wu Xingqing as a bargaining chip to force Luo's Father to acknowledge him as a legitimate heir. How despicable. I barely know Wu Xingqing, but should I find a chance to warn her?]","While thinking about this, a conversation between Luo's Father and his assistant drifted over.","\"Have someone keep an eye on that boy. Don't let him cause any trouble.\"","\"Boss, don't you trust the young master?\"","\"I sent him and his mother abroad back then because of his fight with Luo Fei. It left someone disfigured and created such deep hatred. With his temperament, I doubt he'll easily let go of that old grudge. Today is an important day for our family; we can't have any embarrassing incidents.\"","[What? They fought? Weren't they strangers? Someone was disfigured? What's going on? Let me look into this.]","Qin Xian was stunned. A fight? Disfigurement? Tang Yu?","All the clues came together.","Qin Xian's eyes flickered with sudden realization as he remembered - that school bully from high school.","[What? What? WHAT?????!!!]"]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225: One is willing to hit, the other is willing to be hit, what are you meddling in","paragraphs":["The Qin Family members, scattered in various places, had all stopped socializing.","What did they just hear?","Though distant and somewhat unclear, but... what did they just hear?!!!","The boyfriend of Wu Xingqing they just met turned out to be Luo's Father's illegitimate son!!!","Qin's Father and Qin's Mom happened to be facing Luo's Mother.","Luo's Mother was smiling and chatting with Qin's Mom, appearing completely oblivious, which was truly pitiful. After all, in their wealthy social circles, both Qin's Father and Luo's Father were known as good men who didn't fool around outside their marriages.","But now it turns out there's an illegitimate son almost the same age as Luo Fei - it was absolutely shocking.","Qin Yan and Qin Rong happened to see Luo Fei coming down the stairs after settling the bride, his face beaming with joy and without a care in the world.","Meanwhile, Qin Zhao was outside and saw Tang Yu walking back leisurely.","No wonder his face looked strange - was it because Luo Fei had beaten him up, forcing him to get plastic surgery?","But Luo Fei didn't know he was his father's illegitimate son, so why would he beat him?","Besides, given Luo Fei's personality, even if he knew this was his half-brother, he wouldn't resort to violence carelessly. After all, the fault of having an illegitimate child never lies with the child themselves - Luo Fei was quite benevolent in this regard.","Then came Ji Fei's sharp exclamation, clearly audible even from a distance.","This made the Qin Family's hearts skip a beat.","What happened?","What could make Ji Fei cry out like that? Was there an even bigger scandal besides the illegitimate son?","[Impossible, this is absolutely impossible!]","Qin Family: What? What's impossible?!","[Luo Fei's wife Fan Shi's child is actually Tang Yu's!]","Qin Family: Huh?","Wait what?","What did you say?","Whose wife, whose child?","How can three names make the relationships so confusing?","Nearby, Qin Xian was also stunned, unable to stop looking at Ji Fei.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei was so shocked by this huge revelation that she fell into complete astonishment, not noticing Qin Xian's reaction beside her.","[But Tang Yu used to bully Fan Shi in high school, and Luo Fei was Fan Shi's savior! How could Fan Shi possibly...]","Qin Family: Forced? Threatened? Poor girl, what a nightmarish experience?","Qin Xian: That's not right. Given Luo Fei and Tang Yu's positions, how could Fan Shi be abused to this extent? After all, if Fan Shi just told Luo Fei, he could have completely suppressed Tang Yu.","[Blackmail! There must be some leverage in Tang Yu's hands that made Fan Shi...]","Ji Fei had always thought Fan Shi was like a terrified, pitiful girl, so she couldn't understand why Fan Shi would carry Tang Yu's child. For a moment, Ji Fei wondered if there was hidden information she was missing.","But after Ji Fei looked into it carefully.","[No force, no blackmail, no... uh...]","Ji Fei fell silent.","The Qin Family was left hanging, desperate to know more.","What happened?","Your silence is deafening!","Soon after, they heard Ji Fei's mental exclamation.","[Oh Luo Fei, you're truly the universe's biggest sucker!!!]","The Qin Family's hearts started racing.","[It was consensual between them, why did you even get involved?]","The Qin Family was dumbfounded, certain suspicions making their worldview unstable.","Could it be... could it be that Fan Shi was actually willing and happy about the school bully's abuse?","Isn't this some kind of psychological disorder?","[Not long after starting school, Fan Shi accidentally spilled water on Tang Yu and became his target. Because Fan Shi wore poor clothes, was quiet, and had no parents watching over her, it encouraged the school bully's aggression, and the bullying quickly escalated to physical violence.]","[At first, Fan Shi would report it to teachers, but although Tang Yu got scolded, he only retaliated more viciously. Other students, fearing Tang Yu, chose to isolate Fan Shi and stay uninvolved. This continued until Luo Fei, a year ahead, happened to catch Tang Yu and his female gang beating Fan Shi. Luo Fei's sense of justice naturally made him step in to save her, take her to the school nurse, ask about what happened, and deal with the principal - showing complete dedication to helping her. Tang Yu was also called to bring his parents.]","The Qin Family listened in confusion - wasn't this a logical hero-saves-damsel story?","Even if Fan Shi didn't necessarily fall for Luo Fei who saved her from disaster, she couldn't possibly fall for her bully, right?","[At this point, Fan Shi was both afraid of and resentful towards Tang Yu, and grateful for being saved. But that day after the school handled the incident, Fan Shi accidentally encountered Tang Yu talking with Luo's Father on campus. She didn't know it was Luo's Father then, only that it was Tang Yu's father. Luo's Father berated Tang Yu and slapped him, warning: \"Remember your status as an illegitimate child. If you cause any more trouble, I'll send you away!\" When Tang Yu tried to call him dad, he was harshly rebuked not to.]","The Qin Family listened in confusion - so what? What did this have to do with Fan Shi liking Tang Yu?","[After Luo's Father left, Tang Yu started crying in the rain. Fan Shi somehow felt that Tang Yu looked as helpless as a child in that scene. Some inexplicable feeling made her go forward with an umbrella to shelter him. When Tang Yu saw it was her, he initially wanted to tell her to get lost and hit her, but Fan Shi just stayed silent, looking at him with pity. Finally, Tang Yu broke down and hugged Fan Shi, crying for quite a while. To vent his emotions, he lost control and forcefully kissed Fan Shi. Though Fan Shi resisted at first, she gradually became like a tamed animal and stopped resisting. That's how Fan Shi developed feelings for Tang Yu.]","Qin Family: ...This is hard to judge?","Is this some kind of painful youth campus literature?","Since things had gone this far, why not... just have a normal school romance? Why drag Luo Fei into it?","[Although they had shared such an intimate moment, Tang Yu felt ashamed afterward and wanted to completely forget that day ever happened. After all, he looked down on Fan Shi to begin with, and Fan Shi's personality wasn't the type to actively pursue relationship outcomes. So on the surface, their relationship showed no changes.]","[Tang Yu was rebellious by nature, and at that time still wanted to secretly compete with Luo Fei for their father's approval. Since Luo Fei wanted to protect Fan Shi, he deliberately escalated his revenge.]","[But Luo Fei had his own matters to deal with then, and thought the previous lesson was enough to stop Tang Yu from causing more trouble. Plus, Fan Shi didn't want Tang Yu to actually get expelled and was willing to accept all his violent behavior, so she kept enduring it silently without letting Luo Fei find out.]","[Unexpectedly, when Tang Yu realized Luo Fei wasn't watching over Fan Shi anymore, he lost interest in her and started dating girls who liked Luo Fei instead. Fan Shi gradually began feeling lost and anxious, unconsciously starting to reveal her hidden injuries to Luo Fei and acting mentally unstable in front of him. Naturally, Luo Fei quickly discovered something was wrong.]"]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226: This Melon Really Shatters the Three Views","paragraphs":["The Qin Family: What? What... what is this?","Previously, they only thought Fan Shi was pitiful and pathetic for having such a twisted love for someone who bullied her.","But now, after hearing this, they were all stunned.","[Fan Shi thought Luo Fei would warn Tang Yu, but unexpectedly, every time Luo Fei caught him, he wanted to report it to the school, hoping to get this toxic presence expelled. Fan Shi naturally didn't want this, and she always prevented Luo Fei from reporting it. When asked why, she remained silent, just shaking her head with tears in her eyes, appearing very distressed. Anyone who saw Fan Shi like this would feel sorry for her.]","[Luo Fei assumed Fan Shi was traumatized and afraid of retaliation. Although Luo Fei promised to protect her, Fan Shi kept begging him not to report it. Luo Fei never imagined that Fan Shi was actually pleading on behalf of the person she loved. Afraid of triggering Fan Shi further, Luo Fei temporarily went along with her wishes and began protecting her more closely. During this process, his pity gradually turned into love.]","[This naturally caught Tang Yu's attention, and he noticed Fan Shi's strange attitude toward him. No matter how much he bullied her, her eyes never showed hatred. Although there was struggle, resistance, and attempts to escape, it seemed more like playing hard to get. With just a little force, she would immediately submit. Many times, she wouldn't even report him.]","[After Tang Yu clearly learned that Luo Fei liked Fan Shi, he developed sinister intentions. He locked Fan Shi in a warehouse, intending to do something to her. Fan Shi resisted particularly violently this time, so Tang Yu simply tied her up. He listened to Fan Shi cry and even tried to film her. Before he could do anything, Luo Fei broke down the door. Seeing Fan Shi's condition, Luo Fei was heartbroken and lost control. It was during this incident that Tang Yu's face was disfigured, and Luo Fei... was also injured and scarred.]","Hearing this, the Qin Family sighed deeply.","Qin Xian's face turned completely dark. He remembered when young Luo Fei talked about his dreams, how his eyes sparkled. Actually, Qin Xian was quite envious because he was slow in emotional matters and his emotions weren't like normal people's, so he never knew what it meant to have dreams. But seeing how Luo Fei looked when talking about his dreams, he seemed to understand a bit.","And because of these two people, Tang Yu and Fan Shi.","Luo Fei's dreams could never be realized.","Ji Fei's inner thoughts continued intensely, after all, this revelation was truly mind-shattering.","[The incident became too big. Everyone thought Fan Shi would testify against Tang Yu, but she refused to file a case. Naturally, whether it was Luo Fei or others, they understood this as a girl not wanting more people to know about such matters, preferring to endure in silence, so they didn't think anything was wrong. However, Tang Yu was still expelled, and Luo's Father was furious, secretly arranging for him to go abroad for facial treatment and then study there.]","[During that time, Fan Shi constantly visited Luo Fei in the hospital and learned that he could no longer pursue his dream of joining the air force due to his injuries. Years of preparation were wasted. She cried every day, deeply saddened, making even Luo's Mother feel unable to blame her. Luo Fei was even more heartbroken and told her it was okay, trying to comfort her instead. Perhaps even she didn't know who her tears were really for - was it guilt towards Luo Fei, or because she could no longer see the person in her heart?]","[Perhaps to make up for her guilt, or perhaps moved by Luo Fei's kindness, even though her view of love was strange, she knew who could give her true happiness, so she agreed to date Luo Fei.]","The Qin Family: Distressingly scratching their heads, what kind of situation is this! Did Luo Fei dig up someone's ancestral grave? Isn't Fan Shi's behavior definitely repaying kindness with betrayal?","Not to mention, she later got pregnant with his child?","How did they end up getting involved again? Does Fan Shi have any morals at all?","Everyone truly understood the meaning of \"appearances can be deceiving.\"","Ji Fei's revelations continued.","[The psychological trauma gradually healed under Luo Fei's care. Although they attended different schools, the couple spent their college years sweetly and warmly. During this time, Fan Shi met Luo's Father and discovered the true relationship between Tang Yu and Luo Fei. Wanting to escape from everything, she almost broke up with Luo Fei, but was eventually coaxed back by him.]","The Qin Family: ...Why coax her back? Ah, this is so frustrating!","[Because Fan Shi couldn't bear to leave such a good man, she thought she would completely forget her past inappropriate love. But when Tang Yu appeared again, everything changed.]","[Tang Yu sought out Fan Shi naturally to take everything away from Luo Fei. While Fan Shi initially wanted to avoid contact and run away, she was once again subdued by that familiar forceful dominance. After some struggle, on their first day meeting, she was taken to a hotel where they ended up having relations. It was then that Tang Yu discovered Fan Shi was still a virgin, making him even more pleased... I'm disgusted.]","The Qin Family: We're feeling sick too!","[Afterwards, although Fan Shi was heartbroken and crying, she wanted to be with Tang Yu and break up with Luo Fei. However, Tang Yu continued to be violent towards her and refused to take responsibility. Finally, Fan Shi left heartbroken but didn't break up with Luo Fei.]","[Not long after, Tang Yu confronted Fan Shi again. Fan Shi painfully refused, but as soon as Tang Yu said \"I actually love you,\" she went with him again. This pattern of betraying Luo Fei continued until she became pregnant. Fan Shi asked Tang Yu to make a choice, but Tang Yu was overjoyed and insisted that Fan Shi keep the child and marry Luo Fei. Because this way, even if he, as an illegitimate child, couldn't get anything from the Luo family, his child could... How calculating, were you a calculator in your past life?]","The Qin Family was also speechless, but they still had some hope in Fan Shi's humanity, thinking she probably wouldn't agree.","But thinking about today's marriage, they realized how naive their thinking was.","[Fan Shi initially felt she couldn't do this, that it would be wrong to Luo Fei. After all, she still had enough sense to know that Luo Fei was the benefactor who changed her life, and she had already wronged him greatly. But Tang Yu wouldn't take her away or take responsibility, and she was afraid she couldn't raise the child independently, so she ultimately chose to wrong Luo Fei. She secretly vowed to live well with the child and Luo Fei, and never get entangled with Tang Yu again.]","The Qin Family: ...That's really unnecessary!","Qin Xian recalled Fan Shi's several absences from their activities - was it really because of poor health?","[Laughable, when people become despicable, they have no principles, and their words are as worthless as farts. She continued to hold hope for Tang Yu, even being at his beck and call, always hoping he would take her away, only to be disappointed time and again. She even learned that Tang Yu actually had a girlfriend. Tang Yu didn't hide it from her, telling her that her status, background, and position didn't qualify her to marry him, and she should just be content raising his son. This almost broke her, and facing the happy Luo Fei, she began to feel guilty. She even considered not keeping the child, but ultimately ended up where she is today.]","The Qin Family finished digesting this whole revelation and felt sick to their stomachs.","[...Although both wanted someone to be a convenient father, at least Xuan Yi was straightforwardly bad. Fan Shi, you really are...]","Ji Fei couldn't even find words to describe it. Somehow, in this revelation, Fan Shi seemed more infuriating than Tang Yu.","Ji Fei nervously looked at Qin Xian beside her, seeing his extremely dark expression, thinking it was because of hearing about the illegitimate child, Ji Fei became anxious.","[Luo Fei is a good person and Qin Xian's good friend. Encountering something like this, we can't not help. This marriage definitely can't happen - it's too insulting. But how to stop it? They've been together for years and have a child, and I don't have evidence, can't directly reveal the information in the system... what should we do?]","Just then, Qin Xian suddenly took out his phone and made a call.","\"Within one hour! Help me investigate someone. I want to know all their movements and trajectories for the past six months,\" Qin Xian said coldly. \"Especially any surveillance videos of them meeting anyone alone - get them all.\"","Ji Fei heard this and suddenly had a revelation.","[Damn, this could work! Qin Xian probably doesn't trust this illegitimate child and is worried he might return with intentions against Luo Fei, but this kind of investigation will definitely lead to Fan Shi. Once there's surveillance evidence, the truth will come out!]"]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227: Raising Someone Else's Child, and Taking Care of the Wife","paragraphs":["Actually, Luo Fei and Fan Shi's marriage hadn't been legally registered yet. Perhaps Fan Shi had other expectations, so she kept delaying it and chose to have the wedding ceremony first.","Therefore, stopping this wedding became even more significant.","Ji Fei curiously asked Qin Xian if they should tell Luo Fei about the conversation between the father and son they had just overheard.","Qin Xian said to wait for evidence.","Ji Fei hoped that Qin Xian could uncover something problematic about Fan Shi. If it was just about an illegitimate child, it wouldn't be appropriate to bring it up on someone's wedding day - such matters would typically be discussed after the wedding. Even if mentioned earlier, it wouldn't interfere with the wedding.","Qin Xian thought the same way. Simply revealing the existence of an illegitimate child to Luo Fei would only disgust him.","Moreover, given that Luo Fei and Fan Shi had been in a relationship for years, Qin Xian's words alone wouldn't be enough to shake their relationship. They needed concrete evidence.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian returned to the hall, where they spotted Tang Yu and Wu Xingqing among the crowd. They were greeting Luo's Father and Luo's Mother as ordinary juniors would.","Luo's Mother didn't recognize them at all but maintained proper etiquette.","Luo's Father, however, took a good look at Wu Xingqing, appearing quite pleased.","[This scene is truly sickening from any angle - it's clearly two men deceiving two innocent women.]","The scattered members of the Qin family had gathered together by now, unable to resist discussing the shocking revelations they'd just learned. Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, they couldn't help but look with contempt at Luo's Father and Tang Yu.","[Look at these two scoundrels exchanging knowing glances, treating everyone else like fools. It's really infuriating.]","The Qin family members noticed too - the father and son's eyes met with meaningful looks, full of calculation, which was indeed aggravating.","[I heard that compared to Luo's Mother, Luo's Father was more accepting of Luo Fei marrying Fan Shi. Initially, it seemed strange, as family patriarchs usually prefer marriages of convenience. Now it makes sense - he had a backup plan all along. If Luo Fei insists on remaining a police officer instead of inheriting the family business, Luo's Father naturally wouldn't want to leave his power to his nephews, preferring his own son instead, so Luo Fei marrying Fan Shi wasn't a big issue.]","[He originally planned to use emotional manipulation on his wife's family when his health declined, to legitimize his illegitimate son. Now that Tang Yu has found a good girlfriend, he's already calculating that if Tang Yu can get engaged to Wu Xingqing, he'll arrange for Tang Yu to be officially recognized as his son earlier.]","In fact, the Luo family's current success was largely due to the military connections of Luo's Mother's family.","Now, Luo's Father wanting to leave these achievements to his child with his mistress was truly disgusting.","Not to mention, Tang Yu had devised a \"two-pronged\" malicious scheme.","Qin's Mom wanted to tell Luo's Mother, but was stopped by family members, as such family scandals are awkward for outsiders to reveal.","Unless it came from someone like Qin Xian, who had a brotherly relationship with Luo Fei.","Tang Yu left with Wu Xingqing after greeting everyone, going elsewhere to socialize.","Qin's Mom, being soft-hearted, couldn't help but worry about Wu Xingqing, but they weren't close enough to meddle in her relationship affairs.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian crossed the living room, their eyes involuntarily following Wu Xingqing.","[Such a beauty, what a shame about her poor judgment.]","[When they met at university abroad, Tang Yu aggressively pursued Wu Xingqing. Due to family circumstances, the Wu family deeply spoiled Wu Xingqing, never caring about social status matches, only wanting her happiness, so they didn't mind Tang Yu's background.]","[It's really tragic. Tang Yu is Wu Xingqing's first love. Given her personality, she probably wouldn't break up with Tang Yu just for being an illegitimate child - unless she found out about his relationship with Fan Shi.]","Qin Xian wasn't distracted by Wu Xingqing's situation at this moment, only giving Tang Yu a cold glance.","Soon, they found Luo Fei among his friends.","Everyone was still chatting cheerfully, and when they saw Qin Xian and Ji Fei approach, they asked if they had been secretly dating.","Ji Fei glanced at Qin Xian, whose expression remained impassive, so others couldn't notice anything unusual.","Ji Fei admired Qin Xian's composure, but she herself could hardly contain herself, knowing so many shocking secrets and desperately wanting to reveal them.","Ji Fei couldn't help but cleverly steer the conversation toward the bride.","\"How's Fan Shi? She didn't look well earlier.\"","A flash of confusion crossed Luo Fei's face. \"Probably just nervous, didn't sleep well last night. Pregnancy is quite taxing.\"","[The person involved really is blind to what others can clearly see. When it comes to Fan Shi, Luo Fei's police instincts are completely useless.]","\"How many months pregnant is she?\" Ji Fei asked curiously.","\"Almost four months now,\" Luo Fei said with a smile. \"This child must be a boy, he's very active, always making his mother uncomfortable. Just wait until he's born, I'll teach him a lesson, haha.\"","[...Oh, Luo Fei, I have no words.]","\"Four months? Weren't you away on a business trip for half a year?\" Qin Xian suddenly asked.","[Oh?! Qin Xian, you've found the blind spot!]","But Qin Xian's words brought silence to the area.","This speaking style was very unlike Qin Xian, as he usually wouldn't care about such matters, let alone say something that sounded so inappropriate.","Everyone else looked at Qin Xian in surprise.","Was he implying something?","Suggesting his good friend was being cuckolded?","If Qi Li had said this, Luo Fei would probably have him in a chokehold, but Qin Xian's expression was so detached, and he rarely gossiped about personal matters, that Luo Fei assumed he was just asking out of simple curiosity.","Luo Fei didn't think much of it and said sweetly, \"It was while I was away on business, Fan Shi came to visit me... We didn't expect it, but it happened, what a surprise, ahem.\"","Luo Fei awkwardly but happily recalled that day when Fan Shi suddenly appeared at his door. It was a surprise he had never experienced before - Fan Shi hugging him wearily, crying and saying she missed him. Luo Fei's heart had melted completely.","Everyone around them started teasing.","Qin Xian's expression remained neutral, but Ji Fei's thoughts were racing.","[You really had no idea - she traveled all that way to get you to register the child! And what's even more outrageous is that you've never even been intimate with Fan Shi - you've been supporting someone else's girlfriend all along!]","The Qin family members eavesdropping nearby almost spat out their drinks.","What?","What what?","Even Qin Xian was stunned for a moment.","[Luo Fei is such a fool. After years of dating and living together, they've never been intimate because Fan Shi instinctively rejected him. Luo Fei assumed it was because of psychological trauma from the warehouse incident, so he's always been very understanding, waiting for her to overcome her mental block. At first, Fan Shi didn't understand her own resistance either, until Tang Yu appeared... After being with Tang Yu, she developed a notion of staying faithful for love, making it even more impossible to be with Luo Fei. When they needed to register the child, she had to get Luo Fei drunk and pretend they had been intimate.]","The Qin family members were dumbfounded. Could things really be like this?","[I'm really starting to think Luo Fei is love-blind too. He actually believed he got so lucky on his first try - he didn't even question whether he had any memory of that night.]","[Now that Fan Shi has a child to rely on, she can more righteously reject poor foolish Luo Fei. If they really get married, he'll end up raising someone else's child and supporting someone else's wife.]","At this moment, the poor fool was still being sweetly teased by his friends.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian's phone started vibrating with a constant stream of incoming messages."]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228: Is this going to directly punch someone","paragraphs":["The news came quickly, partly because Qin Xian's subordinates were indeed capable, and partly because Tang Yu hadn't contacted many people since returning to the country. He had been practically idle, doing nothing except appeasing his girlfriend and her family, and going to hotels with Fan Shi.","Such secrets of checking into hotels with another woman behind his girlfriend's back naturally caught the investigators' attention first. After all, when the boss ordered an investigation, it was presumably to find dirt, so they immediately sent over all hotel records and surveillance videos.","Hearing about something is quite different from seeing your own brother being played like this with your own eyes.","Qin Xian couldn't help but let out a heavy sigh.","Seeing Qin Xian looking at his phone, Ji Fei couldn't resist moving closer.","Although the videos weren't playing, the thumbnails made it clear enough who was in them.","Ji Fei's heart leaped with joy.","[Perfect, everything's going smoothly. Qin Xian is so smart, he must have figured it out.]","Qin Xian put away his phone and directly addressed Luo Fei: \"Luo Fei, I need to speak with you privately.\"","Luo Fei was startled, and seeing Qin Xian's unusually serious expression, though puzzled, he still stood up.","Others looked at them curiously, asking what secret they couldn't share.","[A direct attack? I hope Luo Fei can handle it. Although we shouldn't take pleasure in others' misfortune, I'm really curious about Luo Fei's reaction. If only we could watch it in person.]","Even Ji Fei, thick-skinned as she was, felt embarrassed to follow them at such a moment.","Qin Xian, who was about to leave, paused, then took Ji Fei's hand.","Ji Fei was surprised.","\"Come with us,\" Qin Xian said.","Ji Fei immediately followed enthusiastically.","The other members of the Qin family watched silently, all tense for a moment. But they soon became exasperated because once the involved parties entered the room, they could no longer hear Ji Fei's inner thoughts.","Meanwhile, Luo Fei slightly furrowed his brows, and seeing Qin Xian's serious expression and Ji Fei's awkward demeanor, he had an inexplicable sense of foreboding.","\"What do you want to tell me?\" Luo Fei asked.","Without any hesitation, Qin Xian straightforwardly related what he had heard in the garden.","Luo Fei's expression went blank, staring at Qin Xian and Ji Fei in disbelief.","\"An illegitimate child? Tang Yu? That school bully who tormented Fan Shi in high school? He's my half-brother? And he came today!\"","It was the first time Ji Fei had heard Luo Fei's voice so unstable; the shock must have been severe.","Unfortunately, this was just the beginning.","Luo Fei's face turned extremely ugly. Judging by the veins on his forehead, he was trying hard to suppress his emotions. He completely believed Qin Xian's words without any doubt.","His father's twenty-plus years of betrayal to his mother hit him hard at once. He wasn't concerned about his own hurt, but worried about what kind of impact this news would have on his mother if she ever found out.","Luo Fei closed his eyes briefly. \"Qin Xian, Ji Fei, thank you for telling me the truth, but I hope you can keep this secret for now. I'll find a way to handle it later.\"","Luo Fei was speaking exhaustedly when Qin Xian suddenly said, \"This isn't the main point of what I wanted to tell you.\"","Luo Fei was stunned, looking at Qin Xian in disbelief. The illegitimate child wasn't the main point?! Could there be something even worse?","Ji Fei couldn't help saying, \"You should prepare yourself mentally.\"","Luo Fei became anxious.","Qin Xian took out his phone and operated it for a while, and Luo Fei's phone vibrated as several videos were transferred over.","Qin Xian explained, \"I was originally concerned about him having some scheme, so I had people do a simple investigation. I didn't expect to discover something more important, otherwise I wouldn't have chosen this moment to tell you about the illegitimate child matter.\"","Actually, Luo Fei had also found it strange that the illegitimate child matter could have been discussed at any time, why not wait until after the happy occasion?","When he confusedly opened his phone and saw the video thumbnails, his pupils suddenly contracted.","He immediately played the videos.","One after another.","Blood began to suffuse Luo Fei's eyes, his entire face turned ashen, and even his muscular body started trembling uncontrollably. His phone made cracking sounds in his palm.","When he looked up again, his face was full of murderous intent.","\"He actually...\"","Ji Fei was startled, feeling something indescribably off about Luo Fei's reaction.","\"Why didn't she say anything? Why... the child...\" Luo Fei was so shocked he could barely string words together.","Qin Xian slightly furrowed his brows, thinking Luo Fei was too angry to think clearly, so he spoke directly, \"If we really check the baby's months, we should be able to find out exactly how many months along she is. Perhaps it's a month different from what you know, and you can also think about whether you really had relations during that time?\"","Luo Fei swayed, he wasn't stupid and naturally recalled those abnormalities. So the child wasn't his, but rather Fan Shi was pregnant with his half-brother's child and had come to him for salvation.","Qin Xian took the opportunity to present the information he had gotten from Ji Fei's thoughts as his own analysis. \"I think he must have known about Fan Shi's pregnancy. Perhaps he just wanted to compete with you for the family inheritance - if not for himself, then for his child in the future.\"","No man could endure such an insult; Luo Fei's eyes were about to pop out of their sockets.","Ji Fei carefully watched Luo Fei for a while before couldn't help asking, \"Should we arrange to stop the wedding?\"","Luo Fei seemed to suddenly come to his senses and rushed out violently.","From his demeanor, he had completely lost his rationality and seemed ready to kill someone.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian couldn't react in time before Luo Fei disappeared.","[I thought Luo Fei would consider his reputation and handle it quietly, but he's going to beat someone up? Are the scumbag and shameless woman going to be exposed?]","Ji Fei immediately got excited and quickly pulled Qin Xian to go watch the drama unfold.","Just as they came out, they heard a commotion.","From a distance, they could see that on the lawn, Luo Fei had already knocked Tang Yu to the ground with one punch.","One of Tang Yu's teeth was knocked out, his mouth was bloody, and he was completely dazed.","Before he could react, Luo Fei had already grabbed Tang Yu's collar and was throwing punch after punch, almost smashing him.","The ferocity caused everyone around to cry out in alarm.","Luo's Father was shocked and called for people to stop him.","However, Wu Xingqing was the first to react and rush over, so Luo Fei only managed to land three punches before being blocked - no matter how out of control he was, he wouldn't hit a woman.","\"Get out of the way!\"","\"Mr. Luo, what are you doing? We came to attend your wedding, what right do you have to hit people!\" Wu Xingqing was so angry her eyes were red, but facing Luo Fei, she didn't back down at all, protecting her boyfriend.","\"This has nothing to do with you, move aside!\" Luo Fei roared.","\"You... are you still a police officer? How can you be so violent and unreasonable!\" Wu Xingqing refused to budge.","Others had come forward by this time to pull Luo Fei back.","Luo's Mother supported the panting Luo Fei, \"Luo Fei, what on earth are you doing?\"","Luo's Father anxiously glanced at Tang Yu, and seeing that although he was injured, he hadn't passed out, he immediately felt relieved, then turned to glare angrily at Luo Fei.","\"What are you doing at your wedding, hitting guests?!\"","Luo Fei looked at his father, his expression becoming even worse. \"Guest? You call him a guest?!\" He pointed angrily at Tang Yu, about to say something when someone called him from the second-floor balcony.","Luo Fei turned to see Fan Shi with a pale face, tears in her eyes.","From that distance, Luo Fei actually couldn't tell who Fan Shi was looking at.","But it made him swallow whatever he was about to say, only coldly looking at his father, whose expression was clearly unnatural, and said: \"Dad, is this your invited guest? He's not welcome!\"","\"Luo Fei?!\" Luo's Mother was shocked, wondering when her son had become like this.","Luo Fei gritted his teeth and said to his mother: \"Mom, you probably forgot, he's the school bully who fought with me in high school, he used to bully Fan Shi!\"","Ji Fei and Qin Xian, who had followed, suddenly froze.","They exchanged glances, feeling something wasn't right.","[Either handle it secretly, or since it's come to blows, shouldn't he expose those two's shenanigans? Is it to save face, not wanting people to know he's been made a cuckold? But if he conceals it like this, how can he cancel the wedding?]","Qin Xian slightly furrowed his brows, also unable to figure out Luo Fei's approach.","The Qin family members who were watching the fight also found it strange. Was he planning to keep Fan Shi's matter hidden to save face?","[Oh my! He can think that way? Luo Fei... you're not even slightly wronged in being such a huge fool!]"]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229: His Sincere Heart Encountered Only Heartless Wolves","paragraphs":["The Qin family didn't understand why Ji Fei had such a sigh, but from her thoughts, it seemed Ji Fei was laughing with exasperation.","Meanwhile, due to Luo Fei's revelation, everyone around gasped and looked at Tang Yu with strange expressions.","\"Is it true? Is he that school bully?\"","\"But he doesn't look like him.\"","Some high school classmates were present, naturally recalling the Tang Yu from back then.","Luo's father let out a breath of relief; he had thought Luo Fei had discovered something else, but it turned out he just recognized Tang Yu as the person who fought with him in high school.","\"What nonsense are you talking about!\" Wu Xingqing exclaimed in shock. How could her boyfriend be someone of such low character? \"You must have the wrong person.\"","\"Miss Wu, your boyfriend is called Tang Yu, right? And he had plastic surgery, correct?\"","Wu Xingqing froze. Tang Yu indeed had plastic surgery, and she had seen his previous photos, but he had told her it was due to a car accident.","\"That was because I beat up his face when he was bullying other students. He was then expelled from school and went abroad for plastic surgery,\" Luo Fei said coldly, glaring at Tang Yu. \"How dare you... how dare you show your face in front of us again!\"","Luo Fei had never hated someone so much. His fist remained clenched, as if ready to throw another punch at any moment.","At this point, Qin Xian's other friends had arrived.","\"Is he the bully from back then? How dare he show up here?\" Yu Yue couldn't help saying.","\"Even if he is, why hit him at this time? Luo Fei is a police officer, this impulsiveness is so unlike him,\" Jing Yan said.","\"Is he afraid that his presence might frighten Fan Shi?\" Bai Xiaoxi wondered confusedly.","\"He could have dealt with this secretly if that was the case,\" Qi Li said with frustration.","Cen Ting remained silent, also feeling that Luo Fei had been too impulsive.","By now, Qin Xian understood what felt off about the situation.","Given Luo Fei's personality, if he had discovered Fan Shi and Tang Yu's affair, his first reaction should have been to question Fan Shi about what was going on, with beating up Tang Yu being the second step.","But Luo Fei's immediate reaction was wanting to kill Tang Yu, just like their last fight in high school when Luo Fei discovered Tang Yu had imprisoned Fan Shi with ill intentions, which resulted in him beating Tang Yu until his face was unrecognizable.","Having figured this out, Qin Xian felt utterly speechless.","The Qin family members gathered around Qin Xian and Ji Fei, unable to contain their curiosity, and couldn't help asking Qin Xian.","\"Second brother, what's really going on with Brother Luo?\" Qin Zhao couldn't help asking.","Ji Fei had already started her commentary mode, as the situation was too ridiculous not to comment on.","[What's going on? You could say that these poor souls all have kind hearts and never assume the worst in others.]","[Well, we can't think of it that way. It's more that Fan Shi's usual impression is too deceptive. In high school, she appeared to be completely the victim, never showing any interest in Tang Yu. The surveillance videos we showed him later also misled him.]","Qin family: Surveillance? What kind?","Qin Xian remembered that in those videos, it always showed Tang Yu forcefully pulling, while Fan Shi kept her head down unwillingly, even showing struggle occasionally.","To any normal person, it would appear that Fan Shi was being blackmailed by Tang Yu, which explained why she went to the hotel rooms.","[If I couldn't see the whole truth, I might have believed Fan Shi was the victim too. After all, Fan Shi wasn't playing hard to get - she genuinely felt it was wrong, she didn't want to cheat while being Luo Fei's girlfriend. She just could never reject her true love, struggling internally yet unable to resist. So on camera, her behavior made it look like she was completely under threat. Even police analyzing her behavior and expressions would conclude the same, when in reality there was no blackmail at all.]","The Qin family finally understood.","Qin Xian silently sighed.","[As a police officer, he's seen too many women in similar situations who choose to endure silently. Combined with Fan Shi's usual behavior - nervous, distracted, completely like an innocent victim - when he watched the surveillance videos earlier, he kept muttering: 'Why didn't she tell me?' meaning why didn't Fan Shi tell him about being coerced and hurt.]","Qin family: This makes terrible sense! After all, Fan Shi's personality is indeed weak, the type that's easiest to manipulate, so all these assumptions seem logical.","Qin Xian guessed that Luo Fei must think Tang Yu had some sort of leverage, like videos or photos, which made Fan Shi comply.","[About the child, that night he only remembers Fan Shi hugging him, but the memory is vague, so he's not sure if his body responded, thus assuming it did. Now he realizes Fan Shi set him up, and he never actually touched her. But regarding Fan Shi keeping the child and deceiving him, he never questioned her motives.]","Qin family: He doesn't even question that?","Qin Xian: Because Fan Shi once wanted to abort the child?","[Because Fan Shi has always lacked security, wanting a safe harbor. Someone who wants children wouldn't give up their child easily, and such a person considering abortion is seen by Luo Fei as evidence of her struggle and pain. Although he wonders why Fan Shi didn't tell him, he can't bring himself to hate her for the betrayal.]","Qin family: So he came straight to beat up Tang Yu - this really is a huge misunderstanding.","Should the wedding continue? Can this anger really be suppressed?","Is Luo Fei really willing to be such a fool?","But thinking from another perspective, if your true love suffered such abuse, would you reject them, abandon them, or resent them? This would probably be a question mark in many people's minds.","But for those who know the truth, it's really unbearable!!!!","Qin Xian already saw this as a likely development, especially since Luo Fei had given his reason for the assault.","Not about the illegitimate child, not about coercing Fan Shi, just that ridiculous old grudge.","[Luo Fei is truly pitiful. He doesn't dare let his mother know about the illegitimate child because of her poor health, fearing the shock would harm her. He also mistakenly believes his love is a victim, so he dares not expose being cheated on and almost becoming a stepfather. He's worried that with Fan Shi's personality, she couldn't survive the shock. Moreover, this occasion involves the face of two families, so he can only swallow his grievances and vent by hitting Tang Yu, at most losing some face himself.]","The Qin family felt frustrated listening to this.","[If Fan Shi's situation was really as Luo Fei imagined, this couple would truly deserve sympathy, and Luo Fei would be a real man, suppressing his anger to protect his girlfriend in such circumstances. Unfortunately, his pure heart encountered nothing but wolves in sheep's clothing.]"]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230: So, No Solution.","paragraphs":["Qin Xian's brows were tightly furrowed, his mood already extremely foul.","The Qin family members thought: they couldn't laugh at a kind person for being foolish; they could only curse at those disgusting people for being ugly.","Meanwhile, due to Tang Yu's identity being exposed, Wu Xingqing was completely stunned.","She had very high moral standards and couldn't accept that her boyfriend had once been a school bully.","\"Tang Yu, is what he said true?\" Wu Xingqing looked at Tang Yu in shock.","Tang Yu, supported by Wu Xingqing, was both disheveled and angry from the beating, but his mind was still in a daze.","Although he had boldly come to attend the wedding, he had no intention of exposing himself in front of Luo Fei. He had merely come to watch and mock Luo Fei's clown-like wedding.","His face looked completely different from before, so even though his name was the same, he thought Luo Fei wouldn't guess who he was.","Damn it, how did Luo Fei find out?","Could Fan Shi, that worthless woman, have betrayed him? Impossible, she was too stupid for that.","Tang Yu didn't dare make any rash moves. Faced with Wu Xingqing's questioning, he knew he couldn't lie about this anymore. He could only stand up with a bitter expression and say, \"Yes, what he said is true. Back then, I was young and immature. I just wanted to do things to get my family's attention, not really wanting to be a bad person.\"","After speaking, he bowed to Luo Fei and said, \"Coming to this wedding, I just wanted to witness whether the person I wronged in the past is happy now. If possible, I wanted to formally apologize to you all. It was all my fault back then, but I've completely reformed now. This face of mine, which had to be reconstructed after you beat me, is punishment enough. I hope you can forgive my past mistakes.\"","When Wu Xingqing heard Tang Yu say this, although she was still greatly shocked, she didn't immediately despise him.","After all, Wu Xingqing didn't know how bad Tang Yu had been as a school bully.","The surrounding guests who didn't know the truth saw Tang Yu's sincere performance and couldn't help but discuss among themselves.","\"He came specially; he must be sincere.\"","\"It's admirable to know one's mistakes and correct them.\"","\"Who hasn't made mistakes when they were young? Boys always fight and cause trouble during puberty.\"","\"A reformed prodigal son is worth more than gold.\"","But just then, Luo Fei, already enraged, charged forward again, swinging his fist to hit Tang Yu.","Nobody expected that even though someone had come to apologize sincerely, Luo Fei would become even more angry, and they immediately began to look unfavorably upon Luo Fei's behavior.","Others couldn't hold Luo Fei back as he threw a punch at Tang Yu. This punch was even more forceful than before, as if he wanted to beat him to death.","[Hmph, if Luo Fei didn't know everything, he might have been fooled by you, but now telling such disgusting lies in front of Luo Fei, you deserve to be beaten to death.]","Tang Yu was so frightened by Luo Fei's murderous aura that he trembled, his legs giving way as he collapsed, which actually helped him dodge the incoming punch.","As Luo Fei tried to pursue him, Fan Shi's voice appeared again.","\"Luo Fei, stop hitting him.\" Her trembling voice came through, filled with tears.","Luo Fei suddenly stopped, turned his head, and saw Fan Shi had come downstairs, standing at the main entrance.","Her updo had come undone, and she was wearing a simple red robe, as she hadn't had time to change into the next wedding dress style, hence her current attire.","At this moment, Fan Shi was holding onto the door frame as if she couldn't stand steady, trembling so much that it seemed a slight breeze could knock her over.","Usually, if Ji Fei saw a girl in such a state, she would feel sympathy, but right now, she only felt goosebumps all over her body.","It wasn't because she thought Fan Shi was acting; it was precisely because everything she was displaying was genuine that made people extremely uncomfortable.","[Earlier she wasn't feeling well, but now she runs down here concerned about protecting her lover? Hah, I guessed wrong. Indeed, it's hard to guess what's going through a crazy woman's mind. She actually thought that since everything was exposed, Tang Yu was willing to take her away, that's why they were fighting. She ran down here planning to properly apologize to Luo Fei and then leave.]","The Qin family members who heard this looked at Fan Shi with eyes that might as well have been looking at garbage.","At this point, Luo's Mother rushed over to support Fan Shi, as she saw that Fan Shi's complexion was very poor. Although she had previously disliked Fan Shi due to her wealthy family mindset, since there was a child involved, Luo's Mother had fulfilled her duty as a mother-in-law. She stepped forward to explain and asked Fan Shi to go back and rest, telling her not to worry about what was happening here.","However, after hearing this, Fan Shi's expression changed, probably because things weren't going as she had imagined. At this moment, she could only stare blankly at the scene, unable to express her true feelings.","[Damn, Fan Shi still puts Tang Yu's choice as her first priority, with Luo Fei forever being just a backup. Meanwhile, Luo Fei thinks Fan Shi is afraid of Tang Yu revealing her secrets, so she's too scared to offend him and forces herself to come out and stop him. Fine, you're good at making assumptions. I'll say no more.]","The Qin family members also felt helpless listening to this.","Earlier, they could tell Luo Fei the truth about the illegitimate child and the affair based on the evidence Qin Xian had gathered and the conversations he had overheard. Luo Fei was willing to believe that.","But now, regarding whether Fan Shi was willing or forced, unless she admitted to her own despicable behavior, there was no way to change Luo Fei's perspective, which was the most troublesome part.","Even if Qin Xian suddenly went to tell Luo Fei that his pitiful girlfriend was just despicably in love with how Tang Yu treated her, and he shouldn't sympathize with her at all.","They probably wouldn't even remain friends after that.","It wasn't that Luo Fei was blinded by love or valued romance over friendship, but after so many years of friendship, almost as long as their brotherly relationship, how could Luo Fei think that way about his lover just because of one statement from Qin Xian without any evidence?","So, there was no solution.","They had been too presumptuous from the start. Now they could only wait and see how things would unfold.","Luo Fei didn't strike again, but instead crouched down and glared viciously at the pale-faced Tang Yu.","\"I'm warning you, you'd better not do anything unnecessary, or I won't let you off. Get the hell out of here!\"","Before Tang Yu could respond, Luo Fei had already stood up and turned to look at Luo's Father.","Although Luo's Father was somewhat angry, he felt uneasy when faced with his son's gaze.","\"Dad, tell your guest to get out of here! Don't let anything happen that shouldn't happen.\" Luo Fei warned with implied meaning.","This immediately made Luo's Father's expression slip out of control, as Luo Fei's behavior was too unusual, clearly indicating he knew something.","It seemed Tang Yu's identity had been exposed, no wonder his son suddenly became so violent.","Although Luo's Father knew it would be exposed sooner or later, being forced to expose it caught him off guard. Fortunately, judging from his son's reaction, he didn't plan to reveal everything immediately. There was still room for preparation, as he also didn't want things to get too ugly – he had his reputation to consider.","Luo's Father coughed and could only say to Luo Fei, \"It's a joyous day, whatever issues there are, we can discuss them later.\"","This was as good as confirmation.","Luo Fei gritted his teeth, suppressing all his anger as he turned to leave.","Tang Yu was stunned for a moment, then met his father's gaze, suddenly understanding that the truth about him being an illegitimate child had been exposed.","This made Tang Yu breathe a sigh of relief; he had almost suspected that Fan Shi had revealed their relationship.","Hmph, as long as she hadn't said anything, he still had the upper hand, and Luo Fei would still be the clown, raising another man's woman and child.","Tang Yu stood up, still feeling dizzy with the taste of blood in his mouth. He turned and met Wu Xingqing's scrutinizing gaze.","\"Xingqing, I...\"","Just as Wu Xingqing was about to frown, they heard Luo's Father say awkwardly, \"My son was impulsive, I apologize to both of you. Why don't you follow the butler to the rest area and treat those injuries?\"","Actually, Luo's Father wasn't concerned about Tang Yu; he wanted Tang Yu to leave directly to avoid provoking Luo Fei further. But seeing Wu Xingqing's reaction, he had to show some courtesy to prevent this illegitimate son from losing such a good girlfriend.","As long as he showed friendliness, it would downplay the conflict between Luo Fei and Tang Yu, preventing Wu Xingqing from thinking too seriously about the situation.","In the end, Wu Xingqing still helped Tang Yu go treat his injuries.","Faced with Wu Xingqing's coldness and her desire to go for a walk alone, Tang Yu gradually became furious, getting angrier the more he thought about it.","He felt it was all Luo Fei's fault for ruining his plan and making him lose face in front of so many guests. Those dark histories should never have come to light.","After the wound was treated, he thought viciously that he must find another opportunity for revenge.","Just then, his phone vibrated. When he took it out and looked at it, his eyes immediately filled with mockery and contempt.","Meanwhile, since Qin Xian and Ji Fei knew the truth, they followed Luo Fei to find Fan Shi. Luo Fei didn't stop them but asked them to guard the door and prevent others from approaching. He needed to have an honest conversation with Fan Shi, as these matters absolutely could not be known by others.","Qin Xian and Ji Fei could only hold back their words, though they were quite curious. Once Luo Fei laid everything out in the open, would Fan Shi still have any conscience? Would she continue to conceal and deceive?","If Fan Shi admitted everything herself, then all would be resolved smoothly.","If she still wanted to pretend to be the victim, then they would have to find another way to expose everything.","At this time, the troubled Wu Xingqing had intended to go out and inquire about Tang Yu's past, but she found a phone on the grass where they had just been. She seemed to recall that Luo Fei had dropped it earlier during the fight. She wouldn't look through other people's phones, so she tried to return it. Unable to find Luo Fei, she instead saw Luo's Mother."]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231: Big Sis, Can You Show Some Decency, Please","paragraphs":["In the bedroom.","Fan Shi sat on the bed, looking completely devastated.","After Luo Fei entered, he asked everyone else to leave, then stood to the side, staring at Fan Shi in shock.","His fists were still clenched, his anger so intense it felt like it could burn through his blood. After all, no man could tolerate learning that his girlfriend had experienced something like this.","\"Fan Shi, we're about to get married. Is there anything you need to tell me?\" Luo Fei's voice was hoarse.","Fan Shi froze, not answering, instead lowering her head in silence, her whole being emanating the aura of a delicate flower swaying in the storm.","Seeing Fan Shi like this, Luo Fei naturally felt both pity and pain.","[No way, no way, Luo Fei has made it so obvious, yet she's still pretending to be deaf and mute. Oh my, with my impatient personality - just say something, are you mute? Why is it that when she's clearly the one who made a mistake, she has to put on this act of 'I'm hurt so I won't speak'? No wonder Luo Fei got fooled.]","Qin Xian stood beside Ji Fei, seeing her cheeks puffed up in anger, he couldn't help but pat her head to calm her down.","The Qin family members eavesdropping downstairs were also quite speechless at this point, wondering if this was intentional or not.","Inside the room, Fan Shi remained silent, as if silence could help her escape everything.","Though Luo Fei was kind-hearted, he couldn't let this matter pass so ambiguously.","Luo Fei closed his eyes painfully, \"Fan Shi, I've been protecting you since high school. I've protected you for so many years, why don't you trust me? That beast forced himself on you so many times, why didn't you say anything? Why didn't you ask me for help? Why did you suffer in silence? If you had just told me, I would have definitely found a way to solve everything.\"","Fan Shi, who had been holding onto a glimmer of hope, saw it all crumble at this moment. As if she were the one who had suffered an enormous injury, she suddenly covered her mouth with her hand, tears streaming down her face, looking at Luo Fei in panic and helplessness.","\"I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I didn't mean to, I really didn't mean to...\"","Seeing her like this, Luo Fei's heart twisted even more painfully. Usually, he would have already been comforting her.","But this time, Luo Fei gritted his teeth and said: \"Fan Shi, we're about to get married, and you wouldn't tell me. If he continues to threaten you afterward, were you planning to wear the title of my wife while making me a cuckold?\"","Fan Shi's face turned deathly pale in an instant, as if Luo Fei's words had deeply humiliated her.","Luo Fei couldn't bear to look at her expression, but there were things he had to say, because if today's revelation hadn't happened, this would likely have been the inevitable development. He knew Fan Shi was a pitiful victim, a weak person unable to resist, pitiable and tragic, and foolish to the point of helplessness.","But he just couldn't get over it - why didn't she ask him for help? She should have said something the first time it happened.","Did she think he would despise her because of it? Was she afraid of losing him? That's why she kept sinking deeper - Luo Fei could only comfort himself with these thoughts.","\"I'm not, how could I possibly...\" Fan Shi sobbed in protest, saying that since she had agreed to marry Luo Fei, how could she do anything to wrong him?","But Luo Fei said: \"Then weren't you planning to make me accept that beast's child?\"","At this moment, Fan Shi's face truly became bloodless. Her lips trembled as if she wanted to say something, but nothing came out. She just kept crying, as if she had suffered the greatest injustice in the world.","Seeing her not deny it, Luo Fei's expression suddenly collapsed, as if all his spirit had been drained away. He had always thought himself quite capable, but at this moment, he truly felt like a complete failure.","He could try to understand Fan Shi's difficulties, but he wasn't a fool either.","\"We'll handle this matter by going to the police. That beast must go to jail and pay for what he's done,\" Luo Fei said gravely.","But Fan Shi suddenly looked up, \"No!\"","Luo Fei was stunned, finally feeling something strange rising in his heart. \"Don't worry, no matter what leverage he has over you, I'll handle it all, I won't let you...\"","\"Please, no, no, can't we just pretend nothing happened? Please, otherwise, otherwise I really can't go on living.\" Fan Shi suddenly crawled off the bed, almost kneeling before Luo Fei, causing his expression to change dramatically.","[You're really getting into the act now? How did you so naturally turn yourself into the victim? If you just said one word now - that it was consensual - Luo Fei's suggestion about going to the police would definitely be invalid. By acting like this, like you're between life and death, aren't you just leading Luo Fei to think you're afraid of retaliation?]","[So now you're threatening suicide to prevent Luo Fei from going to the police? Not revealing your true feelings because you're afraid your worth in Luo Fei's heart would diminish and you couldn't persuade him? So you're pretending to love Luo Fei while preventing him from hurting Tang Yu - you really... truly love Tang Yu, don't you?]","Qin Xian listened, his breathing pattern changing, feeling that all of Luo Fei's years of care for Fan Shi had been thrown into the gutter.","Although the Qin family members could only hear Ji Fei's commentary, they could guess the general situation, and couldn't help but wonder how someone could act so innocent and pitiful while doing such cruel and disgusting things.","In Luo Fei's view, Fan Shi simply couldn't bear the pressure of possibly being exposed and threatened at any time - in other words, she had been frightened out of her wits by Tang Yu, developing a conditioned reflex to just avoid everything. Even though he promised to ensure everything would be okay, Fan Shi still didn't trust him.","Luo Fei took a deep breath, \"Fine, we won't go to the police.\"","As a police officer, naturally his first thought when encountering such a situation was to bring the perpetrator to justice. If that wasn't possible, he could use other means to make Tang Yu pay the appropriate price - even if he was his half-brother, he absolutely wouldn't let this beast off.","You could say that Luo Fei still thought he was taking revenge for himself and Fan Shi together, so his hatred was very obvious.","But as long as they didn't go to the police, everything was negotiable for Fan Shi.","But the next moment, Fan Shi froze, because Luo Fei asked her how she planned to handle the child.","Fan Shi had already developed feelings for this child, and reflexively protected her belly.","Seeing this, Luo Fei's eyes darkened.","Fan Shi looked at Luo Fei with tear-filled eyes, saying pitifully: \"You hate me and despise me now, you don't want me anymore, so, you're not going to marry me? And you don't want this child either, right?\"","If Qin Xian hadn't been holding Ji Fei back, she would have rushed in.","[Sister, have some shame, please. The child is innocent, but why should Luo Fei accept this child? Are you out of your mind?]","Looking at Fan Shi in such a pitiful state, Luo Fei found it difficult to breathe. He took a deep breath and said: \"Fan Shi, I don't hate you. You're the victim, I won't blame you, and I won't abandon you, but this child - I can't accept it.\"","After saying this, Luo Fei actually felt somewhat guilty, thinking that perhaps he didn't love Fan Shi as much as he had imagined.","Isn't this how it always plays out in TV dramas? Even if the child isn't yours, because you love your wife, you can accept everything, and might even come to love this child in the future.","But Luo Fei discovered he couldn't accept it. That illegitimate child with his wife - he hated even thinking about it. He knew he could never love this child, so naturally there was no need to bring this child into their home to suffer."]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232: Catching Infidelity with Luo Fei","paragraphs":["\"Luo Fei...\" Fan Shi was crying with tears streaming down her face, begging Luo Fei in hopes that he would soften his heart. \"You know I've always wanted to have a family, to have children, I...\"","\"We can have more children in the future, why do you insist on keeping this one?\" Luo Fei asked again in confusion. \"Isn't this just proof of humiliation? When you see the child in the future, won't you be reminded of the harm done to you?\"","Fan Shi's sobs seemed to be choked back, and she was stunned.","Luo Fei tiredly pinched the bridge of his nose and sighed: \"The wedding will proceed as planned today, but afterward you have two choices. First, don't keep this child, and we'll start fresh. Second, if you absolutely insist on keeping this child, then we won't need to get the marriage certificate, and I'll announce our divorce to the public when the time comes, taking all responsibility.\"","The wedding still needed to happen - if they didn't get married today, Fan Shi would face public criticism. She had already suffered such a blow, and he couldn't bear to let her endure more rumors and gossip.","Fan Shi stared at Luo Fei in shock, her eyes losing focus, as if she had suddenly lost her greatest support and most reliable backing, instantly becoming as rootless as duckweed, beginning to feel anxious and unsettled.","She reached out, trying to grab Luo Fei.","But Luo Fei didn't give Fan Shi a chance to speak, \"Fan Shi, this is the most I can do.\"","Fan Shi's hand froze, and she cried even more miserably.","Hearing this, Ji Fei and Qin Xian finally breathed sighs of relief.","[It seems Luo Fei is a good person, but not one without principles. He doesn't blame the so-called victim, but he absolutely won't let the perpetrator step all over him and make him bear all the consequences. But... brother, you shouldn't even give her the first choice. You're a real man, but she's truly unworthy! And is this wedding really necessary?]","Luo Fei's own emotions were in turmoil, so naturally he couldn't calmly comfort Fan Shi.","Luo Fei said: \"The ceremony will begin in an hour. Think it through carefully.\"","Facing someone he had protected for years, Luo Fei had done everything he could.","After leaving the room, Ji Fei and Qin Xian finally saw Luo Fei's expression clearly - he looked as if he had been through death itself.","Seeing Luo Fei somewhat unsteady on his feet, Qin Xian stepped forward to support him, but Luo Fei immediately waved him off, saying, \"I'm fine, I'm fine.\"","The sound of crying continued to flow from behind them. Luo Fei frowned, \"Let's go.\"","Ji Fei and Qin Xian accompanied Luo Fei to the downstairs lounge to rest for a while.","\"I'm going to deal with Tang Yu,\" Luo Fei said directly to Qin Xian. \"I'll make him pay for what he's done.\"","But Qin Xian didn't respond, instead asking straightforwardly: \"You're still going through with the wedding?\"","Ji Fei secretly gave her husband a thumbs up - brave man.","But there was no choice - since Fan Shi's conscience had gone bad and she refused to admit it, they couldn't just watch Luo Fei continue to be deceived. Although they believed in respecting others' fates, when it came to their good friend, they couldn't rest easy without intervening.","But if they stepped in and the other party ignored their good intentions, then they would truly respect others' fates.","Luo Fei was indeed taken aback, frowning as he said: \"I feel wronged about this matter, but Fan Shi is also pitiful. She didn't betray me intentionally - I can't just abandon her.\"","Luo Fei took it as his brothers being indignant on his behalf.","\"Is that so? Not intentional?\" Qin Xian said coldly.","\"What do you mean by that?\" Luo Fei was startled.","Qin Xian said directly: \"I don't think she's as passive and innocent as she appears. Perhaps she was willing.\"","\"Aren't you just purely victim-blaming?\" Luo Fei immediately became agitated.","Ji Fei quickly said: \"Are you so certain she was forced?\"","Just as Luo Fei was about to nod, Qin Xian said: \"In the surveillance videos sent to you, if there was even one from their first betrayal, think about what that means.\"","Luo Fei froze, his whole body stiffening as he clearly understood, his lips trembling as he said: \"But... you don't know if the first time was in the collected videos.\"","Qin Xian shrugged, saying: \"So, anything is possible. I hope you think it through carefully. A wedding is important - don't waste it on someone unworthy. In any case, we don't believe her.\"","After saying this, Qin Xian didn't add anything more, turning to leave with Ji Fei.","Ji Fei was still confused about what she had heard.","After following him out, she couldn't help asking: \"What did you mean by what you just said?\"","Qin Xian explained: \"In those videos, Fan Shi mostly showed mild resistance and struggling. If she were truly a victim, she would have had the chance to save herself or call for help the first time, but she didn't. That leaves only two possibilities: first, the video of her initially being forced to leave evidence isn't among them, or second... she was willing from the beginning.\"","Ji Fei suddenly understood - Qin Xian had essentially planted a seed of doubt in Luo Fei's mind.","\"But is this enough?\" Ji Fei asked.","Qin Xian shook his head: \"I'm not sure either, we can only wait and see.\"","The two returned to Qin Xian's friends' area, where they were immediately pulled into various conversations.","At this time, Wu Xingqing, having found nothing in her investigation, was preparing to leave when she passed through the lounge and happened to see Luo Fei.","Wu Xingqing thought for a moment and walked over, finding Luo Fei apparently deep in troubled thought.","\"Mr. Luo.\"","Luo Fei suddenly looked up, his eyes full of confusion. Seeing it was her, he composed himself and frowned, \"Hasn't he left yet?\"","Wu Xingqing pressed her lips together, \"He's treating his wounds, he'll leave soon. I have some things I want to clarify.\"","Luo Fei thought for a moment, then suddenly said: \"You want to know about his past?\"","Wu Xingqing nodded.","Without hesitation, Luo Fei told her everything about Tang Yu's high school years. When Wu Xingqing heard the true reason why Tang Yu's face had been beaten and disfigured, she turned pale.","\"Is everything you said true?\"","Seeing Wu Xingqing's awful expression, her reddened eyes stubbornly refusing to let tears fall, Luo Fei couldn't help but feel sympathy.","\"Miss Wu can investigate if you don't believe me. Besides, his pursuit of you has ulterior motives. There are some things I can't say, but I suggest Miss Wu be more careful when choosing a man. The one you're with now is just a beast in human skin.\"","\"Luo Fei!\" Suddenly, a voice called out.","Luo Fei turned to see his father approaching. Their lounge was empty, but the passages on both sides were open - if someone spoke loudly or listened carefully, they could hear their conversation, and Luo's Father had heard as he approached.","Luo Fei gave his father a cold smile. If Tang Yu dared to do such things, how could he let him keep Wu Xingqing as his backing?","Luo's Father anxiously tried to say something, but Wu Xingqing, unable to bear it anymore, turned and quickly left to confront Tang Yu.","Walking so fast, she almost bumped into someone as she left the lounge without noticing.","Luo's Father couldn't very well chase after Wu Xingqing, so he could only look angrily at Luo Fei, \"Luo Fei, what are you doing, you...\"","\"Dad, did I say anything wrong just now? Or do you also want your illegitimate son to marry the Wu family's daughter, to legitimately take my place, and then give him the confidence to claim his heritage?\" Luo Fei understood the machinations of wealthy families well, he just hadn't bothered to speak of it.","\"Shut up, what are you saying!\" Luo's Father knew this day would come sooner or later, and could only force himself to say: \"What happened with Tang Yu was a mistake I made when I was young, but he is still your brother, you...\"","Luo Fei laughed, really wanting to reveal how this brother had backstabbed him and done such disgusting things. His father probably couldn't handle such a scandal either.","\"Dad, you don't need to explain these things to me. Wait to explain them to Mom.\"","\"What? Your mother's health is poor, she can't take such a shock. This matter needs careful consideration.\"","Careful consideration - meaning he would definitely acknowledge Tang Yu, it was just a matter of time.","Luo Fei sneered, \"Oh, so you know that? Then why didn't you think about Mom's poor health when you were doing such shameful things?\"","\"For men of our status, who hasn't...\"","\"Just because others are dirty, you have to be dirty too? If others eat shit, you have to eat it too?\"","Luo's Father nearly fainted at Luo Fei's sudden vulgarity, but it also showed just how angry Luo Fei truly was.","\"Alright, alright, I won't argue with you. The wedding is about to begin, so mind your appearance and don't cause any more trouble that would embarrass the Luo Family,\" Luo's Father said before turning away.","Luo Fei froze at the mention of the wedding...","Luo's Father stormed off, failing to notice the trembling figure hidden around the corner.","It was Luo's Mother, who had heard everything. In her hands, she held Luo Fei's phone, its screen still lit up, displaying paused surveillance footage.","She had originally come to question her son about Fan Shi and Tang Yu, only to discover that Tang Yu was her husband's illegitimate son. She nearly fainted at the revelation.","However, thinking about the injustice her son had suffered, her maternal instincts kicked in, and anger surged through her. She managed to stay standing through sheer determination.","Unlike Luo Fei, she wasn't quick to assume Fan Shi was the victim. She had never liked Fan Shi's weepy, petty nature to begin with. Moreover, even if Fan Shi was indeed a victim, she would never allow a woman who had been involved with an illegitimate son to marry her own son. Not even if there was a child involved – especially when the child's paternity was uncertain.","She knew her son's nature all too well – he was too responsible, willing to endure wrongdoing silently. But she wouldn't stand for it!","Clutching the phone, Luo's Mother turned to leave. She had to find Fan Shi!","Meanwhile, Wu Xingqing had searched everywhere but couldn't find Tang Yu. Unfamiliar with someone else's estate, she could only continue her search.","Luo's Mother's search also proved fruitless – the makeup artists told her the bride had stepped out for some air and would return shortly.","Impatient to wait, Luo's Mother headed straight for the surveillance room.","At this time, Ji Fei was pretending to engage in casual conversation while secretly following the drama unfolding between several people.","[This is insane! Fan Shi secretly went to see Tang Yu and told him that Luo Fei knows everything. She wanted Tang Yu to take her away because she didn't want to abort his child. But after hearing this, Tang Yu still told Fan Shi to go ahead with the wedding and stay with Luo Fei, saying they could give up the child. Not only that, but bitter about being beaten up earlier, Tang Yu actually planned to cuckold Luo Fei right here... wait... what... what are they doing!]","The Qin family members, who had been secretly following the drama, became excited at this point. Could it be that thing? That shameless act? Right here and now?","[Wow! This is our chance to catch them in the act! Take Luo Fei there, and everything will be exposed!]","Before Ji Fei could react, Qin Xian stood up and said, \"I just remembered something important I need to discuss. Come on, let's find Luo Fei.\""]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233: Surveillance Video Exposed","paragraphs":["When Qin Xian said he was going to look for Luo Fei, Ji Fei didn't even need to find an excuse and excitedly followed along.","[Perfect timing! Though it's probably better not to watch what happens next, might give me sore eyes.]","Qin Xian frowned in disgust. He had interacted with Fan Shi a few times before, but it just proved you can never truly know someone.","The Qin family members overheard the plan to catch the cheaters and excitedly began observing in secret. Since they didn't know the exact location, they could only wait to follow once the two found Luo Fei.","By now, the wedding ceremony had entered its warm-up phase, with a hired emcee holding a microphone to engage the crowd.","Although it wasn't time for the newlyweds to appear yet, Luo's Father and Luo's Mother were supposed to be present occasionally to interact with the emcee.","Luo's Father was in the center of the crowd, but Luo's Mother was nowhere to be seen.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian went to the lounge to look for Luo Fei but didn't find him.","[Where is he? Oh, he's in the back garden cooling off. He's starting to have doubts, isn't he? He's finally noticing something's wrong with her? But even so, he hasn't cancelled the wedding. Is he afraid of wrongly accusing Fan Shi? Women who play the victim really put a debuff on men's rationality!]","Qin Xian didn't think too much about it and instead of going to the garden, he directly took out his phone to make a call.","The phone rang somewhere nearby.","They both turned to look and saw Luo's Mother in a daze, holding a phone and walking towards the hall through a nearby corridor.","[Huh? Why does Luo's Mother have Luo Fei's phone? Oh, Wu Xingqing found it and gave it to her. Wait, didn't Luo's Mother just come from the direction of that bathroom where those two were having their affair?]","The distant Qin family members wondered: Which bathroom? There are bathrooms in all directions - north, south, east, and west. Which one?","[Oh my, Luo's Mother saw the surveillance video on the phone, went to find Fan Shi, and when she couldn't find her, she checked the surveillance footage and discovered Fan Shi and Tang Yu going into the same bathroom one after another. This... this is so explosive! Haha, those two have nowhere to run now, well, except straight to their doom. Do we still need to find Luo Fei? I'd rather watch the drama unfold with Luo's Mother.]","Qin Xian: We must find Luo Fei, and quickly. He remembered that Luo Fei's mother had poor health and couldn't handle shock well.","Qin Xian suddenly said to Ji Fei: \"Auntie is probably looking for Luo Fei to return his phone. Fei Fei, go tell auntie that I'll find Luo Fei and bring him back here, ask her to wait for him here.\"","If anything happened to Luo's Mother, Ji Fei would be there to notice immediately.","This request suited Ji Fei perfectly, and she nodded right away.","So they split up, and without Ji Fei by his side, Qin Xian went straight to the back garden and found Luo Fei without hesitation.","Luo Fei looked troubled when he saw Qin Xian. \"Is there more news?\"","He was truly afraid things were as Qin Xian had said; he felt he couldn't handle it.","Qin Xian ignored Luo Fei's troubled expression and said directly: \"Auntie seems to have your phone and is anxiously looking for you.\"","Luo Fei was startled, suddenly realizing his phone was missing. He became panicked, worried that his mother had discovered something, and quickly headed back with Qin Xian.","At this time, Qin Xian could hear Ji Fei's continuous stream of thoughts.","[Oh? Is Luo's Mother eavesdropping at the door?]","[Her face has turned pale. Seems like she heard something unspeakable. Is she so angry she can barely stand?]","Qin Xian frowned, worried about Luo's Mother's condition.","[Good thing she's holding up. Huh? She's not kicking down the door? Not going in to catch them in the act? Could it be... she doesn't want to cause a scandal at today's wedding, so she's swallowing her anger? Damn, she's walking away? Really going to endure it? Then... should we still bring Luo Fei to catch them?]","Hearing this, Qin Xian paused. Perhaps Luo's Mother wanted to maintain the family's reputation at the wedding, but Luo Fei still needed to know the truth. If he didn't see it with his own eyes, he might be deceived forever.","Just then, Luo Fei suddenly stopped. \"Mom?\"","Qin Xian and Luo Fei had entered the hall, planning to take the quickest path to meet up with Ji Fei, when they saw Luo's Mother suddenly appear in the hall, making a round near the wedding staff.","Luo Fei was about to rush over to find his mother, but after pushing through the crowd, he found she had gone again.","Meanwhile, Qin Xian heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","[What is she doing? Why did she come back? She didn't even bring her son to catch them. Wait! Is that a microphone in her hand? Holy... she's using a key to secretly open the bathroom door. Oh god, she secretly left the microphone there. Ah ah ah, could it be...]","Just as Luo Fei was about to chase after his mother, Qin Xian grabbed him.","\"What's wrong?\" Luo Fei looked anxious. He was truly worried his mother would be shocked by those things, and knowing his mother's personality, she would likely try to stop the wedding regardless of whether Fan Shi was a victim or not.","Although he now had some... some uncertainties, he couldn't abandon her in such a situation just because of a slight doubt in his heart.","Just then, the big screen set up for the wedding suddenly changed. The original wedding photos were replaced by eight surveillance videos.","The footage showed different dates in the hotel corridors, with Fan Shi and Tang Yu struggling and heading towards rooms together.","The previously lively hall gradually grew quiet as people began to notice something unusual.","Luo's Father, who had been facing away from the big screen and interacting with the emcee with a microphone, noticed the strange atmosphere and turned around confused. When he saw the footage clearly, the microphone fell from his hand with a piercing sound.","Soon, people spotted Luo Fei, and countless eyes turned to him in shock, sympathy, and disbelief.","\"Isn't that his wife?\"","\"Isn't that the guy he just hit?\"","\"Are they going to hotel rooms together?\"","\"How is this possible? In high school, Tang Yu was always bullying Fan Shi.\"","\"Maybe Fan Shi is being coerced? She doesn't look very willing.\"","\"Even if she's unwilling, it doesn't change the fact that she's cheating on Luo Fei.\"","\"Wait, didn't they say it was a shotgun wedding? Then whose child is...\"","\"Better not say it, better not say it. This is too awkward.\"","\"Who did this? Was it Tang Yu? Is he trying to humiliate Luo Fei?\"","\"No, didn't Tang Yu come to the wedding with his girlfriend?\"","At this mention, people finally noticed the other protagonist. She had been looking for Tang Yu, and unable to find him, was about to ask the butler for help when she entered the hall and saw the shocking surveillance footage.","She had just learned that her boyfriend used to be a bully, and now seeing these videos, she really didn't know what to think.","Wu Xingqing slowly walked to the equally shocked Luo Fei's side. \"This... what? Is this... is this Tang Yu forcing Fan Shi?\"","Wu Xingqing still preferred to believe the girl was innocent."]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234: Running into These Two Lunatics","paragraphs":["Luo Fei's lips trembled, unable to answer Wu Xingqing, because he realized one thing - this was his mother's doing.","His mother had found out.","But this wasn't his mother's usual style. Even if she was angry and believed Fan Shi was in the wrong, she wouldn't ruin the wedding in this way. After all, doing so would completely humiliate him as well.","Before Luo Fei could deal with the big screen, his father was heard saying in an almost hysterical tone: \"This is someone's prank. Turn it off, turn it off immediately. This is all fake.\"","Although Luo Fei knew his father was acting this way out of consideration for the family, it still sent a chill through his heart - seeing this scene, his father's first reaction wasn't concern for him.","Even though his son had been so humiliated by his illegitimate son...","Luo Fei took a deep breath, reflexively cooperating with his father to prevent the scandal from spreading.","But Qin Xian held him back.","\"Prepare yourself mentally.\"","Luo Fei looked at Qin Xian in bewilderment.","What Luo Fei couldn't understand, Qin Xian had figured out - making such an ugly scene wasn't just for momentary satisfaction; Luo's mother was trying to protect her son as much as possible.","Amidst Luo Fei's confused gaze and his father's roaring, an eerie sound came through the speakers.","Though not loud, in the relatively quiet venue, everyone understood its meaning within seconds.","Many people quickly covered the ears of minors, looking horrified at the Luo father and son.","Many adults were also blushing - how was this any different from accidentally watching adult content without headphones?","Come on, what decent family would play such... restricted... 'radio drama' at a wedding?","Showing evidence of cheating was one thing, but what was this? Surely there wouldn't be a video next?","Was this normal? Was this reasonable? Weren't they afraid of completely disgracing the Luo family?","Wait, they seemed to be finishing, that sound... quick, everyone cover your ears!!!!","They really came here to attend a wedding!","They didn't expect this extra experience!","This scandal would spread everywhere tomorrow, but they wouldn't feel proud about witnessing it firsthand - rather, they'd feel embarrassed!","Due to the shock, no one thought to cut off the speakers.","Luo Fei's face had turned as black as the bottom of a pot, with all his blood rushing to his head. He was so shocked he couldn't react, only staring blankly at Qin Xian, wondering if perhaps Qin Xian had sent some other video that he hadn't seen and his mother had released it too.","Even without experience with Fan Shi, he could tell from those intermittent sounds that it was Fan Shi's voice.","Beside him, Wu Xingqing hadn't yet processed what was happening, but she instinctively blushed. Thankfully, it ended quickly. Just as she was about to breathe a sigh of relief.","Suddenly, Tang Yu's voice was heard.","\"You slut, tell me, who's better, me or Luo Fei, hm?\"","Then came sobbing sounds.","Many people momentarily thought it was forced, and even Luo Fei felt a glimmer of hope.","\"Are you going to answer?!\"","\"Wuwuwu, you know very well, I love only you, I never let him touch me, I only have you.\"","[Ahhhhh, although it was so embarrassing earlier that my toes curled, now I can only say well done! If it weren't for this line, Luo Fei probably wouldn't have given up so easily!]","Qin Xian turned to look and saw Luo Fei sway slightly, his expression completely empty. His heart must be thoroughly dead now.","Among the other forced spectators, especially the high school classmates from back then, they were truly stunned.","What was going on? Fan Shi and Tang Yu? Fan Shi liked Tang Yu?","\"That's more like it...\"","\"Wuwuwu... why are you doing this? You already have Miss Wu, why are you treating me like this...\"","\"Heh, what? Are you jealous? Who told you to not have her background? Though for doing these things, I still prefer doing them with you. That boring woman is rigid and dogmatic, insisting on dating long enough before letting me touch her, forcing me to be celibate. If it weren't for her worth helping my career, I wouldn't bother coaxing her.\"","[Hahaha, wow, how can you guys talk like this? Is heaven taking pity on Wu Xingqing, letting her see the truth too? Just don't know if she's still at the scene?]","Qin Xian looked at Wu Xingqing beside him, whose face was completely drained of color. Seems she saw the truth quite clearly.","Among the spectators, many were friends of the Wu family. Upon hearing this, they were even more shocked. They wondered what kind of person would dare to play with the Wu family's daughter like this?","Luo's father gradually came to his senses, his face now a kaleidoscope of colors. He knew this illegitimate son was now ruined.","He couldn't let people know that an illegitimate son had stolen his brother's wife and schemed against someone else's daughter.","But in the next moment, Luo's father could barely stand.","\"...I know, I understand you. As an illegitimate child, you've suffered a lot, so you want to prove yourself, want to compete with Luo Fei for father's approval. I feel for you, but you...\"","[Sister, right now you two are the ones making Luo Fei taste all the bitterness of life! You're being too hypocritical. But fortunately, you said it out loud, hahaha continue continue, hahahahahaha...]","Except for Ji Fei's wild laughter and the Qin family's incredulous exclamations.","The surroundings were filled with gasps of shock.","What was going on!","An illegitimate child?!","This scandal wasn't just explosive, it was earth-shattering! Even TV dramas wouldn't dare to write this!","Brothers from the same father but different mothers, and one having an affair with his future sister-in-law!","Hey? Why does this... plot feel familiar?","Wait! Wasn't Luo's father supposed to be a good man? How could he have such a grown illegitimate son, and even let him attend his son's wedding? Has he gone mad?","Did Luo's mother know?","\"Shut up! Who told you to mention this? Do you look down on me too!\"","\"I don't, I love you. That rainy day in sophomore year, when you first kissed me, I hopelessly fell in love with you. I know you bullied me because you felt empty inside, I understand.\"","\"I knew it. After that, I clearly stopped bullying you, but you suddenly acted like a cheap person seeking Luo Fei's protection, showing off in front of me. So it was to attract my attention! What's funny is that Luo Fei repeatedly confronted me for you and ended up getting injured, never able to join the air force again. I heard that was his dream. You ruined it because of you, hahaha, you're really my treasure, helping me destroy his dream and the bright future his mother's family gave him. You've done me a huge favor!\"","\"No, I didn't want this, don't say that. Luo Fei is a good person, a benefactor, I'm the one who wronged him, wuwuwu.\"","[Tsk tsk tsk, why cry now? These are truly crocodile tears. Wonder if Luo Fei hearing these words regrets meddling in others' business.]","Qin Xian looked at Luo Fei beside him.","Luo Fei's expression was indescribable. Perhaps he never imagined that Fan Shi had been... He had saved her purely out of a sense of justice, but now he's told: the person you protected never wanted your protection, she loved the person who bullied and harassed her, everything you did was just unnecessary interference.","How ironic.","Luo Fei even broke into a grotesque smile.","Whether they knew the truth from back then or not, hearing this, no one had the heart to mock Luo Fei anymore.","How unfortunate to encounter these two psychos."]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235: Indeed, the Villain Dies from Talking Too Much","paragraphs":["Luo Fei's dream was also the pain of Luo's Mother's family. Many relatives who came from the maternal side stood up in anger when they heard this.","Who would have thought that saving someone would create such enmity?","There weren't many people brave enough to stand up against bullying during the school term, and those who truly needed saving might still be trembling in darkness. Yet these two scoundrels had turned everything into a joke.","They had transformed a praiseworthy act of justice into a clownish display.","It was truly like the farmer and the snake fable.","Meanwhile, Tang Yu and Fan Shi's self-destructive behavior continued.","\"What? Still thinking about him?\"","\"No, Tang Yu, please take me away. I'm begging you. Deep down, you must want a family, want to be a good father. Can you really bear to abandon this child?\"","\"Enough! I'll say it one more time - later, you'll quietly go marry him and agree to get rid of this child. Let him keep believing you were forced into it. Don't show any signs that might give us away!\"","[While others have a post-coital cigarette, these two are full of hot air afterward. Well, at least they've settled the paternity question of the child in her belly, haha!]","When the crowd heard this, they were shocked. So it was true! The shotgun wedding wasn't for Luo Fei's child - it was for an illegitimate one!","How could the Luo family play such games? One brother plants the seed, the other marries the woman? Such brotherly cooperation? Old Luo must be so proud of his parenting!","No previous family had come this close to such \"success.\"","With one family after another behaving like this, perhaps they should all go home and investigate their own situations - it sent chills down their spines.","Some people focused on Luo Fei's actions.","Did this mean Luo Fei already knew the child wasn't his, and believing his wife had been forced, he was still willing to tolerate everything and accept this woman as long as she terminated the pregnancy?","Should they call him an exceptionally good man or a living Buddha? Sadly, all his tolerance had been wasted on a dog.","It must be said, why did such a foolishly good man end up with such a worthless woman? Some young ladies were even moved - while his foolishness toward other women deserved criticism, they would surely love him well if he were foolish for them.","The crowd's emotions were complex, but the sharper ones immediately grasped the key point and their expressions changed dramatically.","Qin Xian could tell from Luo Fei's expression that he had finally noticed it.","Luo Fei had thought he'd already hit rock bottom in despair, but he discovered there was an even deeper abyss.","Because that conversation revealed this wasn't some previous affair's recording - it was happening right now.","Fan Shi and Tang Yu were having their affair during the wedding ceremony. The shock nearly stopped Luo Fei's breathing, making his blood run cold.","For a moment, he wondered how much Fan Shi must hate him to do something like this.","Or perhaps he had never truly understood just how low Fan Shi's character could sink.","Luo's Father had just recovered from the shock of the illegitimate child revelation when he realized the current situation. He nearly collapsed backward, and if not for the steward's support, he might have fallen badly.","\"Go... go find them...\" Luo's Father said through gritted teeth to the steward.","Since the steward didn't know where they were, he first helped Luo's Father sit down, then went to check the security monitors.","As other gossip-hungry guests were informed of this explosive revelation's significance, they were greatly shocked and began searching around, wondering where this despicable couple was hiding their affair, their eyes gleaming with curiosity.","Having already witnessed such scandal, everyone had pushed past their shame threshold and just wanted to catch them in the act!","After all, catching cheaters in the act was all about participation.","Meanwhile, Tang Yu and Fan Shi remained oblivious because the elegant estate played soothing music even in the bathrooms. Their conversation was broadcast in the main hall due to the excellent microphone pickup, but in their distant bathroom, they only heard muffled sounds which they assumed were from the wedding officiant. They had no idea their affair had been exposed.","Fan Shi began crying again at Tang Yu's words.","\"How can you be so cruel? Even if you don't want me, how can you not want our child?\"","\"What's the rush? There will be more children later. Heh, if Luo Fei is afraid of raising someone else's child, I'll make sure he does. He's always busy with police work, right? We'll have plenty of opportunities. I'll keep making him a cuckold. I'll make sure every future child of his is actually mine. Even if that old man doesn't give me the Luo Corporation, my children will inherit it!\"","[Is it that villains can't help bragging when they think of a brilliant plan? Indeed, the villain dies by talking too much. Now they're really done for. Even if Tang Yu later discovers the truth and starts crying, playing victim, and trying moral manipulation, probably no moral crusaders will dare speak up for him.]","That was definitely not going to happen.","Qin Xian had noticed the Luo family relatives nearby, their faces extremely dark. Even if they cared about bloodlines, even if they were concerned about Luo's Father, just based on Tang Yu's actions and today's words, even if he later cried and claimed to have reformed, the family would never accept him again.","It wasn't about being fair - if they accepted someone who could maliciously harm his brother like this into the Luo family business, probably none of the present families would work with them again.","After all, who would dare cooperate, even on small business deals, with someone who would let such a vicious person who betrays his own brother represent them? If they got stabbed in the back, they'd have no recourse.","Hearing Tang Yu's plan, Luo Fei witnessed human evil once again. Unlike Luo Zhou, who had almost been tricked into raising someone else's child, Luo Zhou had been completely deceived by the woman and would have stopped everything had he known.","But his half-brother had planned it all.","If he had remained ignorant and stayed with Fan Shi, just thinking about the consequences made him feel like coughing blood.","Nearby, Wu Xingqing almost stumbled - this disgusting man had been her boyfriend whom she had feelings for. Just thinking about how she had dated him for several months made her stomach churn with nausea.","Others were clicking their tongues in amazement.","Damn, this illegitimate son was vicious enough.","He wanted to take advantage of everything.","One would think Luo Fei had desecrated his ancestors' graves or something.","Well, they shared the same ancestors - there couldn't be anything more disrespectful to their ancestors than this.","This could make the Luo family become the biggest joke in upper-class circles.","\"You... so that was your plan. No, I can't agree. If you won't take me this time, then I'll be a good wife to Luo Fei. I will never betray him again.\"","Fan Shi's struggling words came through.","The crowd didn't know how to judge this. It seemed to show some morality, but not much; some conscience, but just a tiny bit. But it felt more like she was using this to threaten Tang Yu.","[Well, well, what does she mean by being a good wife to Luo Fei and not betraying him? How noble of her. Should Luo Fei be moved to tears of gratitude for her compromise?]","Qin Xian glanced at Luo Fei - good, his fists were already clenched."]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236: Caught in the Act","paragraphs":["Everyone was suspicious, and Tang Yu immediately exposed everything.","\"Heh, Fan Shi, you always say this, but in the end, you keep craving me. You slept with me when you were his girlfriend, you slept with me after accepting his proposal, and even now, when you're about to take vows with him, with all these relatives and friends waiting outside to witness your marriage, you still came to see me.\"","\"No, no, I said I didn't want to, you forced me...\" she sobbed.","\"Stop deceiving yourself. You used to use that as an excuse, but what about now? Luo Fei knows everything. If you were truly unwilling, one scream would have brought him to save you. Weren't you still cooperating with me? You're just naturally debased, you can't live without me, you can't leave me, so you better be obedient, understand?\"","\"No, no, it's not like that...\"","Though she seemed to be refusing, nobody believed this repeat offender anymore.","Finally, probably annoyed by her crying, a slap could be heard through the speaker.","\"Shut up,\" Tang Yu commanded.","Fan Shi fell silent.","Hearing this, everyone couldn't help but wonder if such people really existed in this world. Still so in love after being hit? Rejecting such a good man? Some kind of masochist?","Then came the sound of a door opening, someone seemed to have come out.","Everyone had been listening so intently, with shocking revelations coming one after another, there wasn't even time to process and discuss, let alone catch them in the act.","Coming back to their senses, they felt that since the host hadn't moved, they shouldn't overstep their bounds. They might as well just watch the drama unfold.","However, everyone was more curious about whether that woman would really have the nerve to come and hold the wedding ceremony with Luo Fei.","Luo Fei's face darkened. At this point, how could he let Tang Yu leave? Just as he was about to go find him, Qin Xian mentioned the location.","Without thinking about how Qin Xian knew the location, Luo Fei shot out like an arrow.","Surprisingly, Wu Xingqing was right behind Luo Fei.","Luo's Father, coming to his senses, stumbled after them.","Qin Xian and his family were the quickest to react among the guests.","After all, their drama-watching skills were well-trained. They knew to grab the best spectator seats. Judging by the excited expressions of the Qin family, they were clearly enjoying the show.","Relatives and friends close to Luo Fei immediately swarmed forward.","Other guests, realizing what was happening, all left the hall, some cleverly going around the outside, converging from all directions to watch the excitement.","Everyone was filled with anticipation.","However, just as they approached the rest area connected to the bathroom, the whole group stopped.","Because Tang Yu had already arrived at the rest area and was about to sit down to call Wu Xingqing.","When Wu Xingqing, who had already spotted him, suddenly felt rage rising from within, completely losing her usually cold and aloof demeanor.","Although she had been insulted, she didn't want to lose her dignity over a scumbag. She wanted to break up gracefully, without becoming a laughingstock. But that resentment from being played with in her first love made her lose control when she saw him, rushing forward like a madwoman to confront him.","However, having never been so hysterical before, she was completely unpracticed, and stumbled in her high heels. If she had fallen so awkwardly, it would have been humiliation upon humiliation.","But in the next second, a strong arm caught her around the waist.","Thanks to Luo Fei's police-trained reflexes, otherwise with both of them charging forward like that, no one could have saved her.","This moment seemed to bring back some of Wu Xingqing's lost rationality.","Tang Yu, hearing the commotion, turned around to see Luo Fei catching Wu Xingqing, the two standing extremely close, not noticing the others at first.","Tang Yu immediately stood up, questioning suspiciously: \"Qingqing, why are you with Luo Fei?!\"","The others who had caught up heard this and fell into an odd silence. Though it should have been a normal question from Tang Yu, why did it sound so ridiculous?","Wu Xingqing stood dazed, raising her reddened eyes, stubbornly holding back tears while glaring at him fiercely.","Tang Yu immediately became anxious, stepping forward to say, \"Luo Fei, what nonsense have you been telling Qingqing?\"","[Oh, he's worried Luo Fei told Wu Xingqing about what happened back then, which would ruin his chances with her. No wonder he's panicking.]","Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, Qin Xian couldn't help but look around, finally spotting Ji Fei excitedly watching from the shadows of the plants and corridor near the bathroom.","Qin Xian left Luo Fei's situation alone and slowly moved to his wife's side.","Ji Fei saw him approach and giggled, whispering, \"Did you hear that?\"","Qin Xian nodded.","Ji Fei became even more delighted, pointing at the bathroom, \"The other one hasn't come out yet. I wonder what expression she'll have when she comes out and discovers everything. It must be spectacular, hehe.\"","Qin Xian's lips curled into a slight smile.","Facing Tang Yu's questioning, Luo Fei's anger had almost burned his throat hoarse. But he smiled strangely and said, \"I didn't say anything, but you said quite a lot.\"","\"Huh?\" Tang Yu didn't immediately understand. Then he suddenly noticed - were there many people standing in the corridor behind them?","Why were so many people gathered here?","And why were their gazes so strange?","Everyone was staring at him with intense eyes, even more dramatically than when his bullying was exposed before.","Scanning around, he saw that many people were looking at him with murderous intent.","Before he could react, a figure flashed before him, and a hard slap landed on his face.","When Tang Yu looked up in disbelief at Wu Xingqing who had slapped him, she delivered another backhand slap.","\"We're done,\" Wu Xingqing announced word by word, her expression gradually emptying, then looking at Tang Yu as if he were trash, indicating to everyone that this person was now beneath her notice, she no longer cared.","Ji Fei felt it was a pity though - while this protected her dignity and saved face, two slaps weren't enough.","\"That beautiful sister's youth is worth more than just two slaps,\" Ji Fei mumbled.","\"Don't worry, there's still Luo Fei,\" Qin Xian said.","Being publicly slapped and dumped, Tang Yu's anger surged, and he almost revealed his true nature by wanting to hit Wu Xingqing, but he forcefully suppressed it. He raised his hand to grab Wu Xingqing's arm, \"Qingqing, don't make such decisions just based on Luo Fei's one-sided words, I...\"","But before he could touch Wu Xingqing, Luo Fei raised his foot and violently kicked Tang Yu, sending him almost airborne.","When he crashed to the ground with a bang, he could barely breathe, ending up coughing severely.","[Ouch, that's going to cause internal bleeding.]","This was even harder than the previous fight. Tang Yu was stunned by the pain but sensed something was wrong.","Just then, a cry of surprise rang out.","Everyone turned to look and saw Fan Shi finally emerging from the bathroom in a bathrobe. She had clearly tidied herself up, but upon coming out and seeing another violent scene in the distant rest area, she instinctively cried out. Concerned and flustered, she hadn't noticed anything unusual and still reflexively tried to stop Luo Fei.","\"Luo Fei.\"","Still with that pitiful, crying appearance.","For the first time, Luo Fei felt disgusted by this pitiful act.","\"What are you doing here?\" Luo Fei suddenly asked.","Fan Shi only then realized her presence was inappropriate, but could only hurriedly explain, \"The upstairs bathroom seemed to have some problems, so I came down to use this one. Is it time already? I'll go change clothes now.\"","Luo Fei let out a meaningful laugh, looking straight at Fan Shi, \"You still want to marry me?\"","Fan Shi froze, feeling guilty under Luo Fei's gaze. After some confusion, as if hurt by Luo Fei's words, she started being quiet again, head lowered, helplessly calling Luo Fei's name.","Luo Fei closed his eyes briefly, seeming unable to continue speaking.","Finally, a voice spoke up.","\"Should our Luo Fei thank you? Despite having someone else in your heart, you're still willing to marry him? Fan Shi, I really want to ask you, what grudge do you have against Luo Fei to treat him like this? Even if he shouldn't have saved you in high school, even if saving you was wrong and against your wishes, and you want revenge, haven't these years of playing with his emotions been enough? Do you still want to ruin my son's entire life?\"","Everyone looked toward the voice, which came from Luo's Mother standing on the stairs near Ji Fei and the others.","\"Honey, all this...\" Luo's Father suddenly realized.","Luo's Mother never spared another glance at Luo's Father.","She simply walked down and approached Fan Shi, who was trembling and stunned, and delivered a sharp slap across her face.","Fan Shi, fragile and weak, collapsed to the ground, holding her stricken cheek.","\"Mom...\"","\"Don't call me mom, you disgusting whore.\"","With that, Luo's Mother pushed open the bathroom door, grabbed the hidden microphone, and in front of Fan Shi's increasingly pale face and Tang Yu's rigid body, she forcefully tapped the microphone.","The harsh feedback sound echoed from the main hall in the distance, audible even from where they stood.","At that moment, both Fan Shi and Tang Yu understood everything.","In an instant, they both felt as if they were plunging into an abyss, their bodies trembling uncontrollably."]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237: I Never Want to See You Two Again, You Dog Couple","paragraphs":["What did they just do and say in the bathroom?","When was the microphone placed there?","What did the people outside hear?","Why were these people looking at them with such expressions?","Tang Yu and Fan Shi were almost synchronized in their actions at this moment, both shocked and bewildered as they looked around, their blood running cold.","\"How interesting. They were so bold while doing it, but now they look terrified after being discovered. So they do know what they did was shameful,\" Ji Fei couldn't help but mock.","Qin Xian said coldly, \"They won't learn until they face the consequences.\"","At this moment, the surrounding discussions felt like countless arrows piercing through the unprepared couple's hearts.","\"From what we heard earlier, Luo Fei was her choice. Regardless of what decision she makes later, anyone with morals, ethics, and conscience wouldn't do something so shameful to Luo Fei at a time like this.\"","\"My God, she actually wanted to marry Luo Fei while she just got off another man. How can there be such a shameless woman?\"","\"Don't forget, she's pregnant. She's so unable to control herself, aren't they worried about harming the baby?\"","\"She might as well not be called Fan Shi anymore, just call her what she is - desperate.\"","\"Some people just naturally don't deserve sympathy. No matter how pitiful and helpless they appear, they don't deserve to be saved because they're deliberately degrading themselves. They deserve whatever beating they get.\"","\"Being around such people only infects you with negative energy and brings misfortune. They're completely worthless.\"","\"This is the first time I've seen such a disgusting girl. I'll never trust these innocent-looking types again.\"","\"Well, birds of a feather flock together. That illegitimate son is just as vicious.\"","\"Indeed, he just got beaten up, and then turns around to do something like this at someone's wedding. That's some serious revenge.\"","\"Petty and vindictive - these are the kind of people to stay away from.\"","\"Honestly, we've seen plenty of family feuds in wealthy families, but using such unconscionable methods is a first. This Tang Yu really opened our eyes.\"","\"Exactly, what did Luo Fei ever do wrong to this illegitimate son? He schemes like this when it's actually him and his mother who wronged Luo Fei and his family.\"","\"An illegitimate child always thinks everything should be his, how would he ever think he did anything wrong?\"","...","Shame, humiliation, mortification - they had no face left.","Perhaps even worse than being stripped naked and paraded through the streets.","All dignity was lost.","\"Shut up, all of you!\" Tang Yu exploded in rage, \"You old hag, you set me up, you...\"","Tang Yu started cursing at Luo's Mother, as all his beautiful fantasies had been exposed, how could he maintain any rationality?","He was practically deranged.","His high school classmates watching this felt Tang Yu was no different from the school bully he'd been back then - nothing but rage and impulse, no brain at all. To still act tough at a time like this showed how foolish and ignorant he was. They were truly curious about how damaged Fan Shi's mind must be to prefer this clown over Luo Fei.","They could only say her taste was peculiar and incomprehensible.","Just as Tang Yu opened his mouth, Luo Fei's slap sent him tumbling head over heels.","Luo Fei's slap was naturally much stronger than a woman's - with one hit, Tang Yu's face was twisted and several teeth flew out.","Before he could react, another slap landed.","This time, his jaw was dislocated. Tang Yu wanted to roar in anger but could no longer speak properly, only drool.","This time, he was finally scared and desperately looked to Luo's Father for help.","But Luo's Father was already at a loss for how to salvage this scandal. He was exhausted and regretted not being able to control his lower half back then, why did he want to have affairs outside his marriage?","What kind of trouble had he brought upon himself?","Now his reputation in their social circle was completely ruined.","Fan Shi was frightened watching Luo Fei beat Tang Yu. She remained sitting on the ground, but this time there was no gentle and protective Luo Fei to care for her and worry about her catching cold due to her weak constitution.","She trembled all over, unable to believe what was happening before her eyes, especially the blatant looks from everyone around that made her dizzy and her vision blur.","She dared not recall what sounds she had made or what words she had said earlier. She couldn't bear to think about it.","She looked at Luo Fei tremblingly, weakly seeking support, and sobbed with tears in her eyes: \"Luo Fei, I... I didn't... I...\"","Regret spread through her body. She had previously thought that since she was going to marry Luo Fei, she definitely wouldn't betray him again. She had only contacted Tang Yu because of the baby, but after just a few words, she couldn't resist meeting him.","She really hadn't intended to do such things in this setting, yet she still fell so low without any principles or bottom line.","But this wasn't what she had intended. She felt so wronged - why would her mother-in-law do this to her? She could never show her face in public again.","\"Luo Fei, wuu wuu...\"","The same approach again, and Luo Fei walked toward her just like before.","Fan Shi's heart suddenly filled with hope - after all, Luo Fei was always her hero.","Others gasped - could Luo Fei still be so blind?","\"No way, no way, no way.\" Ji Fei was shocked.","Qin Xian calmly said: \"Don't worry, now that he sees everything clearly, he won't be fooled anymore.\"","Fan Shi was moved as she watched Luo Fei crouch down in front of her, her tears flowing even harder from feeling wronged.","But before she could speak, Luo Fei lifted her hand and directly removed the engagement ring.","Fan Shi froze, looking at Luo Fei in disbelief, still pitifully saying, \"You don't want me anymore?\"","Luo Fei actually laughed from anger, \"Fan Shi, do you really think I'm an idiot? Don't be too greedy. You should be grateful that I generally don't hit women.\"","In an instant, a chill came over her. Facing his cold gaze, Fan Shi felt the Luo Fei before her was completely unfamiliar.","How could Luo Fei, who had cherished her for so many years, suddenly treat her this way? She couldn't accept it.","But she didn't know that when someone is thoroughly disgusted by her, all feelings can vanish in an instant, even making them question if the person they had protected was really this disgusting woman before them.","\"Fan Shi, I declare our engagement cancelled. From now on, we have no connection. You can be with whoever you want to be with. Leave my house today, and tomorrow, move out of that apartment. Disappear from my sight - I never want to see you two dogs again in my life.\"","After speaking, Luo Fei stood up.","Fan Shi was dazed for a moment before completely breaking down. She immediately grabbed Luo Fei's pant leg in panic, practically kneeling as she begged: \"Luo Fei, aren't you my hero who saves me? How can you not want me? I had just made up my mind that after this time, I would abort the baby and live properly with you, never contact him again. We were just one step away. Isn't this the choice you wanted me to make?\""]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238: Today is Actually Not a Good Day for Marriage, but a Good Day for Divorce","paragraphs":["Hurried footsteps approached, and Luo Fei was pushed aside.","Several women of different ages rushed forward and, quick as lightning, began slapping Fan Shi's face repeatedly from both sides.","\"You shameless little tramp, how dare you say such things!\"","\"With your rotten character and inherent wickedness, you have the nerve to make such promises? If you can stay faithful, I'll eat my hat!\"","\"What's this? Weren't you madly in love with that illegitimate child just now? And now you're clinging to my nephew? Have you finally figured out where your happiness lies? You're quite the calculating one.\"","\"Why are you so obsessed with my Luo Fei? Are you some kind of leech?\"","\"Where does your confidence come from? What makes you think Luo Fei would accept someone as filthy as you? My Luo Fei is so outstanding, so many girls like him. If it weren't for his emotional nature, who would even look at someone like you!\"","\"Good heavens, you're not worthy! Are you out of your mind?\"","\"Being Luo Fei's girlfriend was already more than you deserved - your ancestors must have accumulated good karma, but you've squandered it all with your misdeeds!\"","They were all female relatives from Luo's Mother's side. Since Luo's Mother wasn't well and Luo Fei wouldn't hit women, it fell to them to act.","They were careful with their actions, mindful of her pregnancy. They aimed only for her face, with just enough force to humiliate without causing brain damage.","Each slap was accompanied by an insult, like a symphony.","Fan Shi couldn't keep up with the assault, only able to cry pathetically and beg them to stop.","Watching this satisfying scene, all the onlookers felt an inexplicable sense of satisfaction. After all, this woman had been so wishy-washy and full of twisted logic - she desperately needed this beating.","Ji Fei instinctively shrank back at the sound of the resounding slaps.","Qin Xian naturally wrapped his arms around Ji Fei, protecting her in his embrace. He heard his sweetheart murmur: \"You know how she falls in love with people who hit her... do you think the aunties and sisters might be making her too happy? Maybe she doesn't like Luo Fei because he never hit her?\"","Qin Xian couldn't help but laugh out loud.","Ji Fei felt the vibrations from the chest against her back, and suddenly realized she was being held by Qin Xian.","When she became aware of this, she first felt her face grow hot involuntarily.","Then, feeling mischievous, she pretended to be unaware and backed up a little more.","[I'm not taking advantage; I just want to feel his abs and chest. I'm only trying to avoid the spittle from those slaps flying over here.]","Qin Xian froze for a moment, his face also beginning to heat up, but finally seized the opportunity and gradually tightened his embrace, intoxicated by the soft, fragrant body in his arms.","He just wondered if Ji Fei could feel his quickening heartbeat.","The scene was so captivating that the Qin family missed another chance to witness their own romance, assuming Ji Fei was just making sarcastic comments. Their eyes were fixed on the slapping show.","After about twenty slaps, Fan Shi's face was so swollen she could only drool, and that's when they finally stopped.","But she still looked at Luo Fei through her tears.","Luo Fei frowned, thinking about how his previous image had really made Fan Shi take him for a fool. He wanted to punch himself for being so stupid.","\"Your tendency to fall in love with people who abuse you is your own business, and I have no right to criticize it. But keep your special fetishes to yourselves - why drag me into your love games? This goes beyond mere heartlessness. Fan Shi, I'll write off our past time together as wasted.\"","Fan Shi's swollen lips trembled as she finally turned to look at Tang Yu, then cried until she fainted.","Even then, no one felt sorry for her.","Luo Fei immediately arranged for an ambulance to be called and had servants pack up Fan Shi's personal belongings to give to Tang Yu.","When Tang Yu tried to leave, he was restrained by Luo Fei's police colleagues and military cousins.","When the ambulance arrived, Fan Shi was loaded in, and Tang Yu was forced to go with her.","The nurse tremblingly asked what had happened.","\"This is the father of the child she's carrying,\" someone said.","Tang Yu struggled desperately, glaring at Luo Fei with blazing eyes that seemed to say, \"Just you wait!\"","Luo Fei dismissed him with contempt. In the distance, Wu Xingqing watched Tang Yu's disgraceful behavior with a broken heart, endlessly regretting her poor choice until Qin's Mother came forward with the Qin family to comfort her.","Finally, at Luo's Father's frustrated direction, the butler went along. Since Fan Shi and Luo Fei truly had no relationship anymore, there was no reason for him to go.","But the child in Fan Shi's womb was still of Luo family blood, so they couldn't completely ignore the situation.","After the troublemakers were gone, Luo's Mother came to Luo Fei's side.","\"Son, don't blame me for exposing everything this way and making you lose face. I was afraid you'd soften your heart and let this despicable woman continue to deceive you, so I had to cut off that possibility. Besides, if we didn't take this opportunity to make it public and told you privately later, people would speculate when you divorced, thinking our family had mistreated a pregnant vulnerable woman. I couldn't let people wrongly assume you abandoned your wife and child - losing face doesn't matter as long as we can expose their true nature and prove your innocence! This way you can still find a good girl in the future.\"","Luo Fei smiled bitterly, \"Thank you, Mom, for letting me know the truth. And that's just how it is - I was stupid, and I deserve to lose face.\"","\"Also, if we hadn't made this public, others wouldn't know what evil deeds that illegitimate child committed. The Luo family would have concealed everything to save face, and after time passed, that illegitimate child might have acted like nothing happened and been accepted back into the Luo family, claiming his heritage. I absolutely cannot let someone who schemed against you gain any advantage.\"","Luo Fei saw his mother's exhausted face still so thoughtfully considering his interests, and felt immense pain for her.","\"Mom, I'm sorry I was useless. I know you're suffering more than I am right now. Don't hold back - whatever you want to do, I'm on your side.\"","Luo Fei understood his mother well.","Others couldn't hear what Luo's Mother said, they only saw Luo Fei nod in agreement.","Luo's Father awkwardly tried to approach the mother and son to discuss arrangements for the guests' departure. After all, with the wedding cancelled, the guests would naturally need to leave.","But then they saw Luo's Mother turn to address all the guests: \"Since we have so many people here, I'll take this opportunity to announce something.\"","As she spoke, Luo's Mother, with bloodshot eyes, turned a cold gaze toward Luo's Father.","As husband and wife naturally understand each other, Luo's Father immediately panicked and tried to step forward, but was blocked by his own son.","\"You!\" Luo's Father exploded in anger.","Luo Fei just lowered his eyes in silence.","\"Luo Qiang, I, Mei Wen, formally announce today that I want a divorce from you. Tomorrow, my lawyer will contact you, and regarding the money you've spent over these years supporting your mistress and illegitimate child behind my back, I will account for everything. I will reclaim all marital assets that should be recovered,\" Luo's Mother declared directly. \"Also, this villa is under my name - please leave immediately!\"","Luo's Father's face finally turned ashen.","The guests, still absorbed in the previous explosive revelations, were stunned.","What was this? Was today not auspicious for marriage but for divorce instead? One after another... All they could say was that attending today's event was incredibly worth it - it was all juicy drama!","*Hiccup*"]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239: Don't Do Wrong Things on Weekdays, What Are You Afraid of the Rich and Powerful","paragraphs":["When Luo's Mother announced her divorce declaration, both the Luo Family and Mei Family erupted in chaos.","The Mei Family members, known for their passionate temperament, immediately stood up to support their own when they heard Luo's Mother's declaration and saw that Luo Fei didn't object.","The Luo Family, however, was thrown into panic. In the business world, their business acumen wasn't particularly outstanding. In fact, it was mainly their connection to the military through the Mei Family that had given them the networking resources to carve out their own path. Without that foundation, the Luo Family's original standing wouldn't have been enough to enter their current social circle.","Moreover, they didn't have a genius successor like Qin Xian who could turn the tide.","Therefore, they absolutely couldn't afford to sever ties with the Mei Family.","They all rushed forward to mediate, spouting the same old clichéd persuasions.","After all, in many people's eyes, having a mistress and an illegitimate child wasn't anything extraordinary. Some even considered Luo's Father to be one of the better ones - he had always treated Luo's Mother well, only kept one mistress, and had just one illegitimate child. His private life was relatively clean by their standards.","To be honest, among the families present, three out of five men weren't faithful to their marriages.","In these wealthy circles, those who remained truly faithful to their marriages were the minority.","Of course, they had never seen a scandal as huge as the one involving Luo's Father's illegitimate child. It was understandable that Luo's Mother would demand a divorce in her anger.","So the Luo Family members started pushing Luo's Father forward to apologize, willing to face the humiliation in front of guests to win back Luo's Mother's heart.","But Luo's Mother had already made up her mind. She completely ignored them and even called upon the family's military connections and her son's police colleagues to drive them away.","Finally, the Luo Family members, unable to bear the humiliation any longer, had to leave.","Luo's Father and the butler were also driven out, while his phone kept ringing incessantly.","Through Ji Fei's insight, the Qin Family all knew that the caller was the mistress from abroad.","Tang Yu had gone to complain to the mistress, who still had emotional control over Luo's Father, though now... Luo's Father looked like he wanted to smash his phone every time it rang.","Seeing Luo's Father's pathetic state, the guests wanted to laugh but didn't dare to.","After the unwanted guests left, the hosts began systematically arranging for the remaining guests to depart.","Luo's Mother and Luo Fei apologized to everyone one by one.","As people left, they eagerly discussed the day's dramatic events.","It was certain that the wealthy circles would be shaken again, though Ji Fei probably hadn't expected to be dragged into it again.","\"It was so close - Luo Fei and that Miss Wu were almost schemed to death. Thank heavens the affair was discovered before the wedding.\"","\"I heard Luo Fei discovered the surveillance video first, and Luo's Mother became suspicious and started investigating, leading to catching them in the act.\"","\"Wasn't Luo Fei completely unsuspicious before? Why would he investigate Fan Shi?\"","\"Someone must have shown him the evidence, since he seemed normal during the early wedding preparations.\"","\"Come to think of it, I saw Mr. Qin and Mrs. Qin accompanying Luo Fei for quite a while...\"","\"You mean Qin Xian and that...\"","\"Yes, that one...\"","\"Why is it her again?! She was also there during the Luo Family incident, and seemed quite close to the people involved.\"","\"It must be a coincidence, they're all Qin Xian's brothers, of course they'd be there.\"","\"No, no, no, the Entertainment Judge is quite mystical.\"","\"So does this mean wherever she attends an event, there's bound to be some wealthy family drama?\"","\"Are you suggesting Mrs. Qin is some kind of walking drama magnet? Wherever she goes, drama follows?\"","\"Well... I'm just curious about which event she'll attend next. I have to say, witnessing these dramas in person is incredibly thrilling.\"","\"She can attend anyone's events, just not my family's. I'm scared.\"","\"If you haven't done anything wrong, why fear the wealthy family drama queen? Unless your family...\"","\"Oh, stop it...\"","Ji Fei, who was about to leave, suddenly felt eyes on her back, as if many people were staring at her. It made her uncomfortable.","At this moment, Qin Xian's friends couldn't help but marvel.","Qi Li frowned and said, \"Ji Fei, be honest, do you have some kind of mystical power?\"","He was beginning to suspect that his troubles with Han Ziyu were connected to Ji Fei, especially since Han Ziyu was Ji Fei's fan.","Of course, it wasn't that he cared about Han Ziyu - he was just annoyed by her playing hard to get. She was just a substitute; she should just cooperate obediently. Even if she wasn't content, he couldn't give her what she wanted. Wasn't it enough that he allowed her to stay by his side?","Ji Fei had no time to investigate the twists and turns in Qi Li's mind, otherwise she would have definitely criticized him harshly.","\"This time it was Qin Xian who investigated the problem, it had nothing to do with me,\" Ji Fei immediately deflected.","Qin Xian nodded in agreement.","\"Wasn't it because you wanted to see the dog that the illegitimate child issue was discovered?\" Bai Xiaoxi laughed heartily.","Everyone certainly hadn't thought as deeply as Qi Li had; they simply felt that Ji Fei had a knack for being present during dramatic events, so they were just joking around.","Although they shouldn't have been so cheerful about their good friend Luo Fei's situation, strictly speaking, this was actually good for him. Plus, after what happened with Luo Zhou and Xuan Yi, they had become somewhat numb to such drama and were happy to watch it unfold.","\"Are you two going to break up a couple every time you attend an event? Are you marriage breakers?\" Yu Yue immediately turned to Cen Ting and said, \"Cen Ting, you better be careful, your engagement party is coming up soon.\"","Cen Ting shrugged indifferently. \"If a relationship can be broken up, it means there were problems to begin with. This kind of scrutiny is good - emergency risk prevention. But I think we probably won't have any issues, since it's already a loveless arranged marriage. That person already plays around outside anyway, we're just cooperating.\"","This was the first time they heard Cen Ting talk about his own marriage.","Ji Fei had seen some information about it before - it was indeed purely a business arrangement marriage where both parties did their own thing, though Cen Ting didn't play around while the other person was quite active in that regard. There was absolutely no emotion involved, so there was no talk of hurt feelings.","However, every time Ji Fei heard Cen Ting speak, she habitually stole glances at Jing Yan's reaction.","No one could resist their gossiping nature, especially when they knew someone in their circle had a secret crush on another person that others didn't know about.","Sure enough, Jing Yan gave Cen Ting a controlled glance, his eyes complex with emotion, before returning to his natural smile and retorting to Yu Yue, \"What about your father's wedding?\"","Yu Yue immediately made a wish to Ji Fei: \"You must come, and hopefully you can disrupt my father's wedding.\"","Bai Xiaoxi gave Yu Yue a light smack.","Yu Yue said innocently, \"You wouldn't want your future mother-in-law to be the same age as you, would you?\"","It was just that Yu Yue's father changed wives too frequently, so frequently that people had become numb to it, making Yu Yue wonder if his old man was using these constant weddings as a way to collect gift money.","Each time he changed wives, it would cause a huge storm and disrupt the family peace. That's why they had been staying abroad. Several times when they wanted to return home to get married, they encountered drama from his father's romantic entanglements and had to cancel their plans. The only silver lining was that his father couldn't produce any illegitimate children - probably due to physical inability.","After all the joking and laughing, Luo Fei came over. In front of his good friends, he didn't hide his exhaustion anymore."]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240: Tang Yu is still not giving up and wants to get Wu Xingqing","paragraphs":["\"Let's drink with you,\" Jing Yan said directly.","Others agreed, all wanting to help Luo Fei take his mind off things.","\"I'm fine. I need to help my mother handle things during this time,\" Luo Fei said. He was clearly putting up a strong front despite the shock he'd experienced, but being the tough man he was, he could handle it.","He came specifically to thank Qin Xian and Ji Fei.","If it weren't for them, who knows what would have become of his life.","\"It's because of you...\"","Suddenly, Wu Xingqing's voice came from behind. The Qin family had brought Wu Xingqing along, intending to call Qin Xian and Ji Fei home.","As elders who knew Wu Xingqing, they naturally didn't want her to walk alone and wanted to escort her home.","Wu Xingqing still looked unwell, but having just heard Luo Fei's words and thinking of her own fate, she bowed to thank Qin Xian and Ji Fei.","When she raised her head, her eyes met Luo Fei's.","They both quickly looked away after making eye contact.","Both felt oddly guilty towards each other, yet also felt they were victims who shouldn't feel guilty, having done nothing wrong to each other. Their feelings were complicated, and as fellow victims of the same deceitful couple, they simply didn't want to see each other again.","However, the others were probably being nosy, seeing these two standing face to face, both recently deceived in love, they strangely connected them in their minds, feeling... they might be a good match. If not for the awkward circumstances, they might have even tried to play matchmaker.","Though this thought was fleeting - attractive man and beautiful woman, perfect height difference - it's easy to let imagination run wild.","Once they calmed down, they realized that unless by accident, these two would never be possible.","After a few words, the Qin family left with Wu Xingqing.","In the car, since it wasn't appropriate to discuss the scumbag situation, they talked about Wu Xingqing's circumstances instead.","Her mother was in prison, her father was abroad handling business, and Wu Xingqing was living between the Wu family home and her grandparents' house.","News spread quickly here. Wu Xingqing had wanted to go home alone to collect her thoughts, but after receiving many calls, her family worried and sent her to her grandparents' house instead.","Fortunately, compared to the Luo family drama, Wu Xingqing was merely a side note, so she was rarely mentioned when the news spread. The focus was mainly on the bizarre love triangle between Luo Fei, Tang Yu, and Fan Shi, as well as the divorce battle between Luo's Father and Luo's Mother.","Of course, Ji Fei's reputation as the \"Drama Queen of High Society\" gradually spread among fan circles, with online memes suggesting that after cleaning up the entertainment industry, she had started cleaning up high society circles, determined to bring positive energy and correct values to all social circles.","Some even started tagging her, listing dramatic family situations, asking her to investigate whether they were genuinely dramatic or just putting on shows to scam netizens.","It could be said that Ji Fei had become their connection to high society.","This led Sister Pei to call and ask Ji Fei what was going on, wondering if she was trying to create a new public image.","Ji Fei was both speechless and innocent.","The day after the incident, the Luo family drama remained trending, even showing signs of hitting the short video platform's hot search. After all, the overall development was more dramatic than a soap opera, and netizens loved it.","However, by the third day, all online discussion had died down, given Luo's Mother's family's special status and Luo Fei being a police officer, naturally controlling the situation strictly.","On the fourth day, Luo's Father and Luo's Mother successfully divorced, with Luo's Father being the party at fault, leaving him practically penniless.","The Luo family also resented Luo's Father for not handling the situation well, causing them huge losses, and refused to deal with him anymore, ultimately leading to his hospitalization due to anger.","[\"Luo's Mother is formidable! She froze all of the mistress's overseas properties, forcing her to return to the country to seek help from Luo's Father and Tang Yu.\"]","The Qin family sat in the living room, pretending to discuss gossip while listening to Ji Fei's updates.","Very good, swift and decisive.","[\"Tang Yu doesn't care about his hospitalized father or Fan Shi, staying in a hotel, throwing tantrums daily and... getting dental work done.\"]","The eavesdroppers almost burst out laughing.","[\"Fan Shi, depressed and melancholic, had some pregnancy complications and was hospitalized for a few days. Unable to contact Tang Yu, she returned to the apartment she shared with Luo Fei, only to find she couldn't even enter the complex because Luo Fei had sold the apartment and her resident information had been deleted, with only her personal belongings left at the security office. Fan Shi fainted from crying again and was taken to the hospital.\"]","The Qin family thought: She really faints too easily, and how shameless of her to try returning there!","[\"Fan Shi went to Luo Fei's workplace only to learn he was on leave, so she could only go to the mansion villa, which was also empty.\"]","The Qin family: Looks like Luo Fei and his mother completely saw through Fan Shi's true nature - if you can't fight them, at least you can avoid them.","[\"Then she unexpectedly met Tang Yu's mother outside, who had also come to argue and try to get more inheritance for her son.\"]","The Qin family: ...Even if invisible, birds of a feather really do flock together. Tang Yu's two most important women had the same idea.","[\"Fan Shi immediately latched onto her when she saw her, wanting to find Tang Yu... no... she's still trying to keep both options open.\"]","The Qin family's expressions froze.","[\"Then they got into a fight because Tang Yu's mother felt Fan Shi wasn't worthy of her son or carrying his child, calling her a shameless woman clinging to her son. If it weren't for her, her son wouldn't be in trouble, and they wouldn't have ended up in this situation. She called Fan Shi a jinx and beat her severely... What? The baby is gone?!\"]","The Qin family was shocked. Though they had imagined various scenarios of their meeting, Fan Shi was carrying her son's child - her grandchild!","However, from another perspective, being born to such parents would be the greatest misfortune, with none of them having proper values. Perhaps not being born was heaven's mercy for this innocent child.","The next day, the Qin family heard the follow-up from Ji Fei.","[\"Tang Yu finally appeared after finishing his dental work. Facing Fan Shi, who was devastated about losing the baby, Tang Yu was completely indifferent and warned her not to bother him anymore, saying she had no value left and they were over. Fan Shi finally realized the truth.\"]","The Qin family: He's worse than an animal, not even caring about his own child.","[\"Oh my god! Fan Shi is trying to commit suicide by jumping off the building!\"] Ji Fei was suddenly startled.","The Qin family also froze in shock.","[\"Wait, it's... it's a ploy to force Luo Fei to appear? She deliberately left Luo Fei's police station contact information with the nurses, saying she was Luo Fei's ex-girlfriend. My goodness, this is incredible.\"]","The Qin family was speechless at this point, eager to know the outcome.","The next moment, they saw Ji Fei trembling, seemingly trying to hold back laughter, until she couldn't even sit straight and had to lean on Qin Xian's shoulder, laughing so hard she could barely breathe.","[\"The hospital was prepared for such people, so all doors to the roof were locked. She couldn't get up there at all. Without an audience for her performance, she naturally couldn't act it out. Because of the contact information she unnecessarily left, the nurses noticed her heading to the roof and immediately called security. In the end, not only could she not fake her suicide, but the hospital suspected she had mental issues and sent her for psychiatric evaluation. Of course, Luo Fei wasn't called - it was Fan Shi's distant relative who came to handle the situation. Hahaha, I'm dying of laughter!\"]","The Qin family quickly found things to do elsewhere - after all, except for Qin Xian, who could resist laughing at such a story? They had to find somewhere else to laugh properly.","Another day passed.","Everyone thought the drama was mostly over.","Then suddenly Ji Fei sat up straight with a serious expression.","[\"What's going on? Tang Yu hasn't given up and still wants Wu Xingqing. He didn't care about Fan Shi losing the baby because he actually wanted to marry into a wealthy family and didn't want an illegitimate child interfering with his life.\"]","The Qin family became tense, and Qin's Mom naturally wanted to find a way to warn Wu Xingqing. But it was too late.","[\"Damn, Tang Yu had previously installed a tracking device on Wu Xingqing's phone, and tonight when she went to a bar alone for drinks, he seized the opportunity and drugged her! He's taken her to a hotel room!!!\"]","At this point, the Qin family panicked, and Qin's Mom immediately stood up to take action.","Qin Xian immediately took out his phone, intending to contact Luo Fei. Having the police handle it would be the quickest solution.","[Luo Fei went there too???!!!]","Everyone paused, secretly glancing at Ji Fei with surprise and suspicion.","What was going on?!"]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241: Wow, a true gentleman","paragraphs":["Wu Xingqing never imagined her judgment could be so poor - what kind of scum had she been dating?","Due to her mother's nature and experiencing an emotionally abusive childhood, along with the hypocritical and toxic relationship with her parents, Wu Xingqing appeared cold and distant on the surface. Deep down, however, she deeply admired true love, yet remained extremely cautious due to her defensive nature.","Her preference for doing everything by the book made her appear as a boring, rigid, and dogmatic woman in Tang Yu's eyes.","When Tang Yu initially pursued Wu Xingqing, he put in tremendous effort - acting as a gentle, caring, and attentive man who was completely devoted to her and perfect in every detail. Any woman would have fallen into such a love trap.","One should be especially careful when everything feels perfectly comfortable and compatible with someone, as that person might be operating at a much higher level of manipulation, merely playing along in an elaborate act.","Unfortunately, Wu Xingqing lacked such experience in love and was thoroughly deceived.","She thought that would be the end of it. With few friends in the country and feeling suffocated by her family's excessive concern, she could only drink alone to drown her sorrows. Despite usually having a high alcohol tolerance, today just one drink made her feel dizzy.","When Tang Yu appeared and tried to take her away, she finally realized the danger and attempted to call for help, but her cries were drowned out by the noisy crowd. Her body had no strength to resist as he covered her mouth and took her to a hotel room.","When Tang Yu threw her onto the bed, Wu Xingqing glared at him through tear-filled eyes as her body began to feel strange.","\"What are you doing? Get out!\"","Tang Yu's expression turned maniacal as he sneered, removing his clothes while saying, \"I played your little love game for so long, while you acted like some chaste virgin. Tonight, I'll make you beg me to take you!\"","Wu Xingqing's face turned ashen, yet she couldn't control the flush spreading across her skin as her body's condition worsened.","She could no longer hold back her tears.","\"Tang Yu, you beast! If you dare do this to me, I'll never let you get away with it!\"","\"Heh, never let me get away with it?\" As Tang Yu spoke, he walked to the side. Wu Xingqing's gaze followed his movement, and her face suddenly went pale as she saw a camera on the cabinet, its red light blinking.","Wu Xingqing's whole body trembled as she finally burst into angry curses.","\"Save your breath, you'll need your energy later. Haha, Wu Xingqing, be smart about this. After tonight, we'll get married, and this video will just be some married couple's private fun. Otherwise, it'll show how the noble Miss Wu shamelessly threw herself at me. Let's see if your Wu family can handle that shame, and if you dare let the whole world watch your performance!\"","With these demonic whispers, Wu Xingqing bit down so hard her mouth filled with the taste of blood, but her body gradually slipped from her control due to the drugs.","She watched in near despair as Tang Yu crawled onto the bed towards her like a venomous snake.","Though she wanted nothing more than to kill him, her body couldn't resist the heat, wanting to tear everything away and embrace Tang Yu - thoughts that made her wish she were dead.","Just as her dignity and sanity were about to crumble under Tang Yu's hand on her collar, there was a click from the door.","As Tang Yu turned to look, Wu Xingqing, still lying on the bed, saw a tall figure rush in like a gust of wind.","With a loud thud, Tang Yu was punched off the bed. He looked up in shock and anger at the newcomer.","\"Luo Fei! It's you, how could you possibly...\"","Before Tang Yu could finish, Luo Fei struck again, even harder this time. After several punches, Tang Yu lay unconscious on the floor, his face covered in blood.","Actually, Luo Fei had been having people watch Tang Yu during this time. After all, this half-brother of his was malicious and constantly scheming, so he couldn't rest easy without monitoring him, worried that Tang Yu might plot something against him and his mother behind their backs. He thought if he could catch some evidence, it would be safer to deport him, since Tang Yu still held foreign citizenship.","He hadn't expected to receive information about Tang Yu buying illegal drugs, but knowing he must be planning to harm someone, they kept watching, allowing them to arrive in time to save the victim.","\"Beast!\" Luo Fei spat out the curse before turning to check on Wu Xingqing.","However, as he turned, Wu Xingqing suddenly threw herself at him, grabbing him tightly and pressing her lips against his, shocking Luo Fei to his core.","By now Wu Xingqing's clothes were disheveled, her rationality gone as she clung to him desperately, kissing Luo Fei while trying to remove his clothes.","Luo Fei immediately pushed Wu Xingqing away, \"Wu Xingqing, calm down!\"","But at this moment, Wu Xingqing possessed surprising strength, managing to push Luo Fei down onto the bed.","\"Help me, please help me...\"","\"Wu Xingqing, look carefully at who I am.\"","\"I know, you're Luo Fei, you're a good person, so you must be able to help me.\"","Wu Xingqing's hands were already roaming over Luo Fei's body. Having never experienced such intimate contact before, Luo Fei's face turned bright red.","Wu Xingqing's beautiful figure, snow-white skin, gentle fragrance mixed with the intoxicating smell of alcohol, all pressed against Luo Fei's solid frame - even he, like an inexperienced youth, couldn't help but respond.","\"Wu Xingqing! Do you want to give yourself to just anyone? Wake up!\"","Wu Xingqing froze, then looked at Luo Fei through her tears.","Luo Fei thought she had come to her senses and tried to push her away, his face red, but she caught his neck again and kissed him.","\"I only wanted a sincere love, why did I have to encounter something like this? Never mind, it doesn't matter anymore. They treated us this way, so let's get revenge together. This isn't you taking advantage of me, it's you being heroic. Don't worry, I won't hold you responsible.\"","As if resigned to giving up completely, Wu Xingqing truly didn't want to fight the drug's effects anymore.","Luo Fei stared at the determination in her eyes, stunned by her words, but the next moment when Wu Xingqing tried to pull at his clothes, he knocked her unconscious.","After hastily helping her arrange her clothes, he immediately called for an ambulance and the police, sending those who needed to go to the hospital to the hospital, and those who needed to go to the police station to the police station.","[Wow, what a true gentleman! I thought following the usual plot development, things would have gone differently!]","Hearing Ji Fei's report, the Qin family's emotions had been on a rollercoaster, but finally breathed a sigh of relief when they heard that Luo Fei hadn't done anything.","If something had happened under those circumstances, it would have been disrespectful to the woman. Fortunately, Qin Xian's friend had impeccable character.","Qin Xian wasn't surprised at all - even if the drug had been given to Luo Fei, he wouldn't have allowed such a situation to occur.","[I wonder if these two people, after such an awkward encounter, might spark something between them.]","Ji Fei couldn't help but gossip a bit."]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242: Sudden Pool Party","paragraphs":["Two hours later, Wu Xingqing woke up and immediately saw Luo Fei watching over her. As her memories gradually returned, she felt so embarrassed that she pulled the blanket up to cover her face.","She couldn't believe that in her impulsive state, she had made such requests to Luo Fei, and even forcefully kissed him several times. She couldn't entirely blame it on the drugs, since she still had some consciousness at the time. If it had been Tang Yu, she would have rather died than agree, but because it was Luo Fei, she had allowed herself to give in.","\"Wu Xingqing, are you alright?\" Luo Fei's awkward voice came from outside the blanket.","Wu Xingqing played ostrich under the covers for quite a while before finally mumbling, \"I'm sorry.\"","If she had pulled down the blanket, she would have seen Luo Fei's equally flushed face. \"Ahem, this wasn't your fault, you don't need to apologize. It was all because Tang Yu drugged you.\"","\"Thank you for saving me,\" Wu Xingqing said, hastily pulling down the blanket, trying to act as if nothing had happened.","However, when their eyes met, they both remembered what had just happened, especially with the wound on Luo Fei's lip where Wu Xingqing had bitten him.","In an instant, one ducked back under the covers while the other turned away, frantically fumbling with various documents to place them on the bedside table.","\"Ahem, regarding Tang Yu's crimes, I have evidence of him purchasing the drugs, and I can be a witness to this incident. However, to fully convict him, we'll need the video footage from this camera as evidence. So the decision is yours. It's just a matter of the severity of the charges. If you want to destroy the video, I completely understand.\"","After all, it was a female victim's dignity at stake, and her wishes had to be respected.","Wu Xingqing emerged from under the covers again, her face pale and her gaze heavy, \"I want to press charges against him. I'm willing to provide any evidence necessary. I want him to receive the punishment he deserves.\"","As she spoke, Wu Xingqing couldn't help but hug herself, trembling all over.","Luo Fei frowned and stepped forward to pat her shoulder, \"Don't be afraid, I'll be with you through this.\"","The two victims would work together to bring this beast to justice.","\"Thank...\" Wu Xingqing looked up, but their eyes met again, and both timidly looked away.","After that, the Wu family rushed over upon hearing the news and worked with Luo Fei to handle the case.","A few days later, news came that Tang Yu had been sentenced and would be deported after serving his time. He might face additional charges abroad, but prison time was certain.","A week later, the turmoil in the Luo family gradually settled down.","With no further news from Luo Fei and Wu Xingqing's side, Ji Fei lost interest in following the drama.","At this time, Ji Fei was carrying some desserts made by Qin's Mom to the Qin Corporation for Qin Xian.","Of course, she wasn't concerned about the gossip she'd heard from Qin's Mom and Qin Yan about a beautiful business partner aggressively pursuing Qin Xian, nor was she there to assert any authority as the legitimate wife. She was just a tiny bit curious and wanted to see what the fuss was about.","Sure enough, as soon as she arrived at the company, the receptionists looked at her differently, their exchanged glances full of gossip. However, they were respectful towards Ji Fei, without their previous disdain.","When she reached outside Qin Xian's office, passing by the president's office, the assistants saw her and looked awkward, their eyes constantly darting towards the office inside, speaking volumes without words.","Ji Fei thought: Oh, so the homewrecker is inside? Talk about perfect timing.","Ji Fei, being proper, asked the executive assistant to announce her.","The assistant was surprised, \"The President has instructed that Madam can enter freely at any time, under any circumstances.\"","Ji Fei blinked, her face warming slightly. As she approached the office door and was about to knock, she heard voices from inside.","\"I've delegated the task of entertaining your team to the director. I have dinner with my wife every evening and can't attend social functions. If you feel this shows disrespect to your team, we can cancel the cooperation.\"","\"President Qin, someone as clever as you surely understands my meaning. In your position, there's no need to be so rigid.\" It was a woman's voice, with a seductive undertone.","\"Haven't you noticed what's in this office since you entered?\"","\"Just for show.\"","Ji Fei was confused by what she was hearing.","[What are they talking about?]","There was a pause inside, but the woman couldn't help continuing, \"President Qin, I truly admire you, and I'm not asking for any official status, I just want...\"","\"Then let me be direct: no woman in this world compares to my wife. I only want my wife, and I'm not interested in other women, so don't waste your effort.\"","[Oh my, what's he saying? Hehe... Seems like I've completely bewitched this guy.]","Inside the office, the usually ice-cold Qin Xian suddenly broke into a smile, a hint of blush crossing his face, stunning the woman before him.","Qin Xian ignored her now, after all, it was rare for his wife to visit, making today special.","Qin Xian stood up and walked past the woman towards the door.","\"By the way, regarding your project, I'll notify your company to assign a different person in charge. Qin Corporation can cooperate with you, but only if you're not involved in the project.\"","The woman's face changed dramatically. Failed seduction was one thing, but such rejection was unexpected. What kind of man was he!","Little did she know that Qin Xian was extremely careful about everything concerning Ji Fei. Since Ji Fei had witnessed this, he naturally had to make a clean break, lest his wife harbor even the slightest doubt.","As Ji Fei was marveling at this CEO's behavior, the door suddenly opened, and she, who had been leaning against it eavesdropping, lost her balance and fell forward.","She could have steadied herself, but someone was too eager and embraced her directly, making it look like Ji Fei had deliberately fallen into Qin Xian's arms.","A gentle laugh echoed.","\"What brings you here?\"","The low voice vibrating through his chest made Ji Fei's heart skip a beat.","\"Mom asked me to bring you some desserts,\" Ji Fei said.","Qin Xian released Ji Fei and led her into the office.","Ji Fei noticed the woman – quite a sexy beauty – but didn't greet her.","The woman had already investigated Ji Fei's identity and knew what she looked like, but seeing her in person, she was stunned to find that Ji Fei was even more beautiful than in photos. The previously confident beauty was struck by Ji Fei's casual beauty.","Combined with Qin Xian's ruthless dismissal, she could only leave in defeat.","By now, Ji Fei had lost interest in the woman because she was shocked by this office she hadn't visited in a while.","Many places that used to display famous paintings now showcased her celebrity photoshoots, making it look more like a talent manager's office.","She finally understood what they had been talking about earlier.","In this presidential office full of her posters, she felt too embarrassed to look anywhere.","[When other staff members come in and see all this... ah, I can't even imagine.]","Qin Xian knew what Ji Fei was looking at but tried to act casual, taking the desserts and leading her to the sofa, though his ears were red.","This wasn't just for show – Qin Xian simply wanted to see Ji Fei whenever he looked up. After all, the Qin Corporation's artist department and Ji Fei's own studio were full of his wife's posters, so why shouldn't his office have them too?","If possible, he'd want Ji Fei to accompany him to work, but... Ji Fei wouldn't agree to that, so this was the next best thing.","It also made Ji Fei's status clear to everyone.","Unable to read Qin Xian's thoughts, Ji Fei pretended to ignore the posters to avoid embarrassing herself by asking about them.","\"Try Mom's cooking,\" Ji Fei said.","Qin Xian opened the box, looked at the golden-brown desserts inside, and fell silent.","\"You remember that our mom is a kitchen disaster, right?\"","Ji Fei chuckled, \"Don't worry, others have already tested it for poison. It's rare for her to succeed, that's why I brought it.\"","[Dad and Qin Xi were fine, otherwise I wouldn't risk giving it to Qin Xian. Having the CEO rushed to the hospital for food poisoning would be quite the joke.]","Qin Xian contentedly started eating, pleased that his wife cared about him.","Though it didn't taste good, they couldn't waste Qin's Mom's effort, so they finished it together and took a photo to report back to her.","Meanwhile, Qin's Mom had already learned through Qin's Father's sources that the homewrecker had been completely driven away, putting her mind at ease.","After eating, Ji Fei didn't think about leaving, and Qin Xian naturally wouldn't ask her to, as he was happy to have Ji Fei keep him company for a while longer. So it turned into Ji Fei playing with her phone while Qin Xian worked.","Shortly after, Qin Xian's phone rang.","Seeing it was Qi Li, he put it on speaker.","\"Hey Qin, are you free tonight? I'm planning a pool party, you and Ji Fei should come together. Location is at XX Club.\"","Qin Xian was taken aback. He usually didn't participate in such activities, so Qi Li and others never invited him. Why was today so strange?","\"Are you coming or not? Everyone else is coming. Well, whatever, it's fine if you don't come, as long as Ji Fei comes,\" Qi Li said impatiently.","Qin Xian frowned slightly, feeling that Qi Li had an ulterior motive. Although he wanted to refuse, it was rare to have a chance to be with Ji Fei today, and it could have been a private date, but now...","\"I'll ask Ji Fei.\"","Qin Xian still respected Ji Fei's opinion, so he turned to look at her.","Ji Fei blinked, realizing she hadn't attended anything like this since she came here.","[A pool party, everyone in swimsuits? That means handsome guys and beautiful girls, what a visual feast!]","Qin Xian's eyebrow twitched when he heard that excited tone.","Sure enough, he saw Ji Fei's lips curve into a smile, and at this moment, Qin Xian really wanted to refuse.","[Qin Xian in a swimsuit... hehe, I want to see that. Maybe I can even get a chance to feel those eight-pack abs in the pool! A gorgeous man all wet...]","Qin Xian's face started heating up, while the person on the phone was still urging them.","\"Do... do you want to go?\" Qin Xian's gaze wavered.","\"Yes!\" Ji Fei immediately replied.","Qin Xian coughed and responded to Qi Li.","After the call ended, Ji Fei dragged Qin Xian to the mall to buy swimsuits.","Meanwhile, Qi Li was still urgently notifying others, hastily organizing something of party scale. Because his behavior was so strange, everyone in the friend group found Qi Li's actions odd, but Qi Li was too busy to care.","Someone tagged Qin Xian and Ji Fei, wondering if they were really going.","Seeing everyone's curiosity about why Qi Li suddenly called for a party, Ji Fei decided to investigate.","One look was enough to make her speechless.","[Unbelievable! Just because Han Ziyu keeps ignoring him, he thinks she's playing hard to get too much, so he's planning to give her a chance. He found out Han Ziyu would be covering a shift for a friend at this club today, so he immediately arranged this party to casually appear in front of Han Ziyu, holding other women, making her sad and upset, then give her another chance to come back to him... what a drama queen.]","[The reason he wants me there is because he knows Han Ziyu will definitely come greet me when she sees me. Using me as a tool, huh?]","Hearing these thoughts, Qin Xian also understood, but felt somewhat exasperated. Would Qi Li only wake up after being humiliated?","[But it's going to be interesting to watch.] Ji Fei smiled excitedly.","She casually picked up a swimsuit.","Suddenly Qin Xian coughed, \"You want to choose this one?\"","The swimsuit in Ji Fei's hand was practically a bikini. She blinked, having not looked carefully before, and turned to ask, \"Do you have any recommendations?\"","She had never attended such gatherings, so naturally didn't know what level of coverage was appropriate.","But then she saw Qin Xian's eyes turn toward what looked like elementary school-style swimsuits...","\"Hey, Qin Xian, your taste is terrible. Don't tell me you're planning to recommend that style to your wife.\"","Suddenly, a woman's voice came from the doorway.","They turned to look and saw an elegantly dressed woman standing at the entrance with a smile."]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243: It's been years since the breakup, isn't it a bit much","paragraphs":["The woman's slender fingers hooked onto her sunglasses. She was dressed sensually, with sun-kissed skin that looked both healthy and powerful. Her willow-shaped eyebrows were slightly raised, and her dominant red lips were both bright and bold.","However, what surprised Ji Fei wasn't this style that stood out from the surroundings, but rather her facial features.","She looked, she looked exactly like Han Ziyu.","[Could it be Guo Yalan?]","Qin Xian spoke up at the right moment: \"Guo Yalan, you're back in the country.\"","Guo Yalan stepped forward with a smile: \"Yes, I just got back. I didn't expect you to be the first person I'd see. Aren't you someone who never goes shopping?\"","Although Guo Yalan was speaking to Qin Xian, her gaze was curiously examining Ji Fei, without any malice, just pure intrigue.","Ji Fei smiled at Guo Yalan, \"Hello. I'm Ji Fei.\"","\"I know, I know, you're Qin Xian's precious wife. The news has spread all over our circles abroad. They've made you sound almost mythical,\" Guo Yalan said with a gossipy expression, raising her eyebrows: \"I'm really curious how you managed to win over this emotionless robot.\"","After all, this was something that Yu Zhi couldn't achieve despite all her scheming. Before returning home, she had seen Yu Zhi's embarrassing retreat, which had nearly made her laugh to death.","Previously, everyone thought they were the model campus couple, but Guo Yalan felt they were just a fake couple - one clueless and the other pretending.","What disgusted her more was that even after they were married, Yu Zhi still came back to cause trouble. It was truly despicable.","Of course, now she was most interested in Ji Fei. Being able to win over a peculiar person like Qin Xian was quite impressive.","Guo Yalan spoke directly but graciously, so she didn't come across as unlikeable.","But Ji Fei still couldn't help but defend him, \"Qin Xian is not a robot at all.\"","Qin Xian was startled.","A memory suddenly flashed through his mind.","\"Young Master Qin feels like an emotionless machine...\"","\"You're all wrong, Second Brother Qin isn't like that at all. Second Brother Qin has lots and lots of feelings, so many feelings, you just can't see them!\"","Qin Xian's eyes flickered, and he couldn't help but look at Ji Fei. The tenderness in his gaze was so intense that even Guo Yalan felt affected by it and couldn't help but shiver.","She had thought the rumors were exaggerated, but reality was even more dramatic - he was practically heart and eyes full of nothing but his wife.","Guo Yalan almost burst out laughing, as Qin Xian's transformation was truly incredible and unbelievable.","\"Alright, alright, he's indeed not a robot anymore, he's turned human, but his eye for choosing swimwear is truly terrible,\" Guo Yalan pointed at the swimsuit Qin Xian had been looking at earlier.","It was comparable to a short-sleeved top with shorts, with the top having draping parts covering the chest, and the shorts having a skirt layer outside.","How to put it... For elementary school students, it would be cute and princess-like, but for adults, apart from showing arms and legs, even the covered parts wouldn't show off Ji Fei's excellent model figure at all.","\"If it's for your private pool, it's completely unnecessary and too heavy. If it's for going out, letting your wife wear something like this would make people laugh their heads off and mock her taste. Do you want her to be treated like a joke?\" Guo Yalan said mercilessly.","Qin Xian immediately became embarrassed. After all, he had never participated in such purely recreational gatherings before, and at events with pools, he had ignored others wearing sexy swimsuits like they were air, so he really didn't know the situation.","\"Sorry, I wasn't aware before,\" Qin Xian said uncomfortably, his little private wish vanishing.","Ji Fei didn't dare speak up, as she actually thought that piece wasn't bad.","\"Let me help you choose, I have better taste than him,\" Guo Yalan said familiarly, casually asking, \"What's the occasion?\"","Ji Fei suddenly perked up. Her gossip radar activated.","Qin Xian wasn't evasive, \"A pool party, arranged by Qi Li.\"","Ji Fei immediately got excited watching Guo Yalan's expression.","But Guo Yalan just smiled and said, \"So everyone will be there? Perfect, I was planning to meet everyone after coming back anyway. I'll go tonight too, give everyone a surprise. Would it be convenient for you two to take me along?\"","[This is too convenient! What a dramatic moment - just when someone's obsessing over a substitute, the real person suddenly appears, hahaha!]","The corner of Qin Xian's mouth twitched slightly.","Seeing Qin Xian's strange expression, Guo Yalan asked puzzled, \"What's wrong? Am I not welcome? Don't tell me Qi Li is still holding a grudge, it's been so many years since we broke up, surely not.\"","[By the looks of it, Qi Li's plan of openly maintaining a substitute to provoke Guo Yalan has completely failed. Because she hadn't been paying any attention while abroad! Even though Qi Li had been openly posting on social media, it was useless. When they meet later, when Qi Li realizes all his careful planning has been for nothing, what expression will he have? My goodness, I can't imagine how dramatic it will be, hehehe.]","Influenced by Ji Fei, Qin Xian almost smiled, but thinking that Qi Li was still his friend after all, it wouldn't be right to act this way, so he coughed and said, \"I'm not sure about that, but since you don't mind, let's go together.\"","Guo Yalan shrugged, with an expression that said 'what would I have to mind about?'","Since they were going together, Guo Yalan also needed to choose a swimsuit, and naturally continued helping Ji Fei choose as well.","As a fashion designer, she certainly had good taste. Although seeing Ji Fei's excellent body proportions made her want to choose the sexiest options, she could feel the burning gaze from behind, and instinctively felt that doing so might not be wise.","After all, she was a married woman, and her husband was right there, so it wouldn't be good to go too far. Therefore, she chose swimsuits that were moderate but had strong design elements.","As for her own choice, it was bold and sexy - the kind that made Ji Fei almost drool.","In the end, Qin Xian paid for everything, and Guo Yalan treated them to a meal, after which they arrived at the appointed club right on time.","The three were guided to change clothes.","Guo Yalan was very meticulous, needing to apply various products before getting in the water, so she told Ji Fei not to wait for her. Ji Fei also wanted to go ahead to see where Han Ziyu was, so she went out first.","As soon as she went out, she saw Qin Xian.","Qin Xian's swim shorts were the modest type, so there wasn't much to note, but most regrettably, he was still wearing an elegant shirt, and although it was open, it still covered most of his eight-pack abs.","At this moment, Qin Xian was standing by a marble pillar not far away, tall and graceful, looking down while waiting. Many passing women kept looking at him, stopping in their tracks, their eyes full of amazement and infatuation. Quite a few men also kept looking back at him.","After all, his superior looks were truly eye-catching, and his figure was tall and straight, with broad shoulders and a narrow waist.","Finally, someone couldn't resist trying to approach him, but Qin Xian unexpectedly looked up.","He was almost completely insensitive to others' gazes, with only one exception.","When he saw Ji Fei in the distance, his eyes froze, then his cheeks gradually turned red, and his gaze began to dart around, as if not knowing where to land.","Ji Fei walked over, and Qin Xian was about to meet her halfway, but was stopped by a woman."]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244: Another Victim","paragraphs":["A girl approached, \"Handsome, can I get your contact info?\"","Qin Xian ignored her and walked past.","Another girl tried, \"Hey handsome, are you here for the party too? Let's hang out.\"","Qin Xian frowned and walked around her again.","A third girl called out, \"Handsome, you look so familiar. Haven't we met before?\"","Growing impatient, Qin Xian continued avoiding them.","\"He's so hard to approach.\"","\"What a snob!\"","\"He won't even look at us. Could he be into men?\"","The girls who dared to approach such a handsome man were naturally confident beauties themselves. Since Qin Xian rarely attended such events, these non-elite socialites didn't recognize him.","The rejected beauties grumbled amongst themselves, then noticed another girl approaching him. She looked somewhat familiar, but since Ji Fei usually didn't wear makeup, and there was quite a difference between her made-up and natural look, those who didn't follow entertainment news couldn't immediately recognize her.","They just saw another beautiful woman.","The onlookers unanimously believed the fourth victim was approaching, certain she would face rejection too.","Their expectant expressions were all too obvious.","Ji Fei couldn't help but feel playful.","When Qin Xian came near, before he could speak, Ji Fei said directly: \"Handsome, are you alone tonight? Want to keep me company?\"","Qin Xian paused, hearing the playfulness in Ji Fei's voice.","\"Sure,\" he replied.","The crowd: ?","Ji Fei proudly linked her arm through Qin Xian's, holding back her laughter as she led him toward the pool party in the club's backyard. Countless envious gazes followed them.","Finding it so amusing, Ji Fei didn't notice Qin Xian's stiff posture.","Given she was in swimwear, Qin Xian could feel the soft, supple touch against his arm, making his muscles tense and his whole body uncomfortable.","Arriving at the lively pool party, accompanied by numerous furtive glances, they headed toward Qin Xian's friends.","Ji Fei's gaze curiously swept across the venue, taking in the colorfully dressed guests and the dozen or so staff in black and white uniforms, all young men and women, though she didn't spot Han Ziyu.","Their friends had arrived early. Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi were enjoying themselves in the pool, while Cen Ting, Jing Yan, and Luo Fei sat in the poolside lounge area. They all greeted the newcomers.","\"Ji Fei really has a way with him. He never comes to these places when we invite him,\" Jing Yan said with a smile.","Luo Fei turned to look, saying with a faint smile, \"Indeed, this is quite unusual.\"","Cen Ting just raised his eyebrows and smiled at them.","Qin Xian typically let their teasing slide without response.","Ji Fei asked curiously, \"Where's Qi Li?\"","\"Said he went to pick up his new girlfriend,\" Bai Xiaoxi answered, sitting on a pool float.","Yu Yue, pushing Bai Xiaoxi around, added, \"Qi Li's changed again. We thought the last one might be different.\"","\"Apparently, Qi Li's previous girlfriend caught him watching Guo Yalan's international fashion design competition video and broke up with him,\" Jing Yan explained with a smile. \"Even though she knew she was a replacement, I guess there's a limit to what someone can take.\"","\"What Qi Li's doing isn't right,\" Cen Ting commented.","\"Those who play with others' feelings always end up unlucky,\" Luo Fei said knowingly.","Ji Fei couldn't help but retort, \"Are you all so sure Han Ziyu actually likes Qi Li?\"","Everyone looked at Ji Fei in surprise, either brainwashed by Qi Li or fooled by Han Ziyu's superb acting, unanimously believing this was a case of the replacement falling for the main lead.","[Seriously, have you all watched too many TV dramas?]","Jing Yan spoke up, \"Actually, I think he does have feelings for that replacement. He's just being stubborn. Maybe in his heart, she's already more than just a replacement.\"","Just then, Qi Li walked over with a sexy beauty on his arm.","\"Talking about me behind my back?\" Qi Li said arrogantly.","[They're saying you're stubborn, but you'll be singing a different tune soon enough.]","Ji Fei thought sarcastically as Qin Xian guided her to sit down.","As they sat, he mentioned, \"We ran into a friend while buying swimwear, they'll be joining us.\"","Qi Li seemed indifferent, not even bothering to respond, as this seemed trivial to him. He was now wholly focused on waiting for a certain disobedient girl to appear.","Since he didn't ask, Qin Xian felt no obligation to elaborate.","The others were curious to ask, but were interrupted by Qi Li introducing his new companion.","Ji Fei was the only one who didn't recognize the beauty; when the others saw her, their expressions were somewhat strange.","The new girlfriend, Lily, came from a notable background. Though she smiled at them, she had an intimidating air about her.","After Ji Fei and Qin Xian sat down, Qin Xian quietly filled Ji Fei in: Lily was one of Qi Li's former pursuers. Her personality was similar to Guo Yalan's, and because of his experience with Guo Yalan, Qi Li had strongly resisted Lily, rejecting her several times. Until now.","[Tsk tsk, Qi Li, you deserve what's coming. Hurting one woman's feelings to win back another, and repeatedly using this tactic - is this the only way you know how to win love? No wonder you always lose. Karma's coming for being so heartless. Let's see how you handle this!]","Qi Li sat down with Lily, called over a server to order drinks, and then put on a show of intimacy with her, holding her waist and chatting playfully.","The display was so eye-searing that others couldn't bear to watch.","Jing Yan, always well-informed, had heard about Luo Fei and Wu Xingqing's situation, and asked curiously, \"I heard you played the hero and saved her. Could it be...\"","His gossipy tone made Luo Fei rub his temples, \"Stop gossiping. It's nothing. After she dealt with Tang Yu's matter, she returned to her previous country with her father.\"","\"No possibility? You two seemed quite compatible,\" Cen Ting rarely joined in on gossip.","\"Are you worried I'll end up a bachelor? Don't worry, it won't come to that,\" Luo Fei smiled. The two barely knew each other, it was just an unexpected encounter. Like a strange yet embarrassing dream, that contact had indeed left a unique impression of Wu Xingqing in Luo Fei's heart, and they had exchanged contact information, but it wasn't like they could start dating just from that.","At least after Fan Shi, his heart probably needed to wither for a while. He didn't want to consider others for now, preferring to focus on keeping his mother's spirits up.","If there was a chance to meet again in the future, perhaps something could develop, but they each had their own worlds, and there might not even be another opportunity to meet.","Since Ji Fei's gossip system could clearly see there had been no progress between them afterward, she didn't participate in this topic.","At this moment, several servers carrying cocktails walked over.","\"Ji...\"","An excited voice called out briefly.","Ji Fei's gaze happened to sweep over, immediately meeting Han Ziyu's delighted eyes.","Since they approached from Ji Fei's side, Han Ziyu hadn't noticed Qi Li at the other end.","\"Oh, what a coincidence! You're working here?\" Ji Fei smiled.","Han Ziyu instantly blushed, extremely excited, \"Hello, Teacher Ji! I'm filling in here tonight. What luck that I get to see you again!\"","The others naturally noticed Han Ziyu too, their expressions varying.","Such a coincidence? They didn't believe it. Had the young girl followed them here? Was Qi Li right about her playing hard to get? But was it necessary to still pretend not to see Qi Li? Would there be a dramatic confrontation with Lily later?","They couldn't help but look forward to it.","Meanwhile, Qi Li held Lily close, his gaze fixed on this scene, waiting in vain for Han Ziyu to notice him from the corner of her eye.","Seeing Han Ziyu and Ji Fei about to start chatting,","Qi Li opened and closed his mouth several times before finally breaking.","Han Ziyu heard a loud cough, seemingly trying to draw attention. Turning her head, she saw an exasperating face.","\"Haven't your service staff been properly trained? Who gave you permission to chat with customers when you should be serving?\" After speaking, he put on a cold expression while looking at Han Ziyu, deliberately holding Lily closer.","He laughed inwardly: Let's see how long you can keep up this act.","At that moment, Guo Yalan had already walked through the inner hall. Many people recognized her, their faces showing shock, as news of their breakup had spread far and wide at the time."]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245: What kind of divine idol am I a fan of","paragraphs":["By the pool, everyone familiar with Qi Li could tell he was deliberately trying to cause trouble.","Qi Li stared intently at Han Ziyu, expecting that in the next moment, when she saw him embracing another woman, she would become sad and upset. Then she would reflect and realize she shouldn't oppose him this way, as he was someone who responded better to gentleness than force.","As long as Han Ziyu was willing to yield, he would still give her a chance to return to his side. If she behaved well, he would even be willing to indulge her affections, perhaps even giving her the status of girlfriend.","During this time, Han Ziyu had seemingly vanished from his world, giving him a sense of déjà vu of his nightmares.","So teaching her a lesson was necessary.","However, the scene he anticipated didn't unfold. Han Ziyu looked over, first startled, then slightly frowning, with what seemed like a twitch at the corner of her mouth.","But as a service staff member who had upset a customer, she naturally had to bow and apologize.","\"I'm sorry, sir, for disturbing you.\"","Yet this professional response was interpreted by some as her being wronged, struggling, and desperately trying to maintain her pitiful dignity.","Qi Li lifted his chin, feeling both angry and secretly pleased.","However, Lily in his arms began to look displeased, also staring intently at Han Ziyu's face.","\"Call your supervisor. Such an unprofessional server should be fired.\"","Han Ziyu was completely bewildered, instantly cursing her bad luck. She couldn't let her friend lose their job, and was anxiously trying to think of a solution.","As Luo Fei couldn't stand seeing a young girl being bullied and was about to step in, Ji Fei suddenly spoke up: \"Oh my, I was just happily chatting with my fan, and now you're criticizing and wanting to fire people? Are you trying to embarrass me? So you don't actually welcome us here, then why invite us?\"","Ji Fei rarely showed anger, appearing to stand up for her fan.","Qi Li and Lily were completely surprised that Ji Fei would confront them over a mere server, so they were momentarily stunned.","After all, they were supposed to be in the same social circle. Unless they were already sworn enemies, who would risk creating tension between them for the sake of an insignificant person? Was Ji Fei really mentally unstable?","Han Ziyu was quite surprised too, since they were supposed to be friends.","At this moment, Han Ziyu's supervisor arrived, looking terrified, clearly unwilling to offend these young masters and misses, and likely ready to sacrifice Han Ziyu as a scapegoat.","[Although without my interaction with Han Ziyu, that idiot Qi Li would still play his twisted game of cruel love due to her refusal to submit, but making an ordinary working person lose their job is really disgusting. I need to think of something.]","Ji Fei was still thinking when, before the supervisor could bow and apologize, Qin Xian suddenly pointed at Han Ziyu and said: \"This server's service is excellent. I want her to exclusively serve my wife and me during tonight's event. Can that be arranged?\"","Qin Xian's tone was cool, phrased as a question but clearly brooking no refusal.","The supervisor naturally knew Qin Xian's status and immediately changed his attitude, bowing and scraping, assuring it would absolutely be no problem, then quickly instructing Han Ziyu to take good care of these two distinguished guests.","Ji Fei was delighted at this development.","[Wow, Qin Xian understands me perfectly, how handsome!]","Qin Xian's lips curved slightly.","His intervention left the onlookers stunned.","They thought they were watching drama between Qi Li, Lily, and Han Ziyu, but then Qin Xian and Ji Fei suddenly stepped in.","Lily, being of slightly lower social status, didn't dare to provoke them and chose to stay quiet.","Qi Li looked at the two with some irritation, but since they had spoken first, he truly didn't dare to go against Qin Xian.","Han Ziyu was now looking at Ji Fei and Qin Xian with starry eyes, full of gratitude.","Who could understand? When I'm being bullied, my idol stands up for me, and my idol's husband also defends me - what kind of amazing idol did I end up following?!!!","Thus, Han Ziyu was left to serve exclusively at their side.","Qi Li glared viciously at Han Ziyu, who didn't spare him a single glance, though he naturally assumed she was just pretending not to care about him.","\"What's the meaning of this?\" Qi Li asked displeasedly.","\"Just taking care of my little fan,\" Ji Fei replied with a smile.","\"Mrs. Qin, I think you've been deceived,\" Lily said. \"Everyone here knows who she is. Her sudden appearance here, how could it be such a coincidence? She must have come deliberately to find Young Master Qi. You should be careful about being used by this social climber. She's probably just pretending to be your fan to get you to help her put on a show in front of Young Master Qi, trying to get back to his side.\"","But they saw Han Ziyu wearing an expression as if she'd been struck by lightning.","Lily, who was about to expose Han Ziyu's true nature: ?","Shouldn't she be showing shame and embarrassment, or at least appear panicked at being exposed?","Han Ziyu felt very frustrated and wanted to curse back, but she truly didn't dare offend these neurotic young masters and misses, being just an ordinary person. However, she was also worried Ji Fei would misunderstand her and wanted to explain herself.","But then she saw Ji Fei trying to suppress a smile as she asked: \"So you're saying she found out Qi Li would be here, deliberately arranged to infiltrate beforehand, just to make an appearance in front of him?\"","Lily nodded as if it was obvious.","Others had similar thoughts, so their expressions were about the same.","[Oh my god, why does Qi Li have the same expression? Has he become so narcissistic that he's forgotten this was all secretly arranged by him? Wait, he actually thinks that even though he arranged it, Han Ziyu, as a server here, must have known in advance that he was hosting the party, and if she didn't want to see him, why would she show up? So she must miss him inside and sought a chance to appear before him... um... isn't it possible that she's just covering one shift for a day and doesn't need to know the clients' identities at all?!]","Ji Fei could barely contain her laughter as she delivered the killing blow: \"But weren't we only urgently notified about tonight's party at noon?\"","That single sentence gradually silenced the scene.","Ignoring Qi Li's frozen expression, Ji Fei turned to Han Ziyu and asked: \"When did you start work today?\"","\"Eight in the morning,\" Han Ziyu quickly replied, catching on.","Ji Fei shrugged, looking at Lily with sincere expression, \"It seems Miss Lily misunderstood. Her being here really is just a coincidence!\"","Everyone: It's more than just a coincidence - based on the timing, it's possible that Qi Li discovered Han Ziyu working here and deliberately arranged the party.","But they wouldn't think Qi Li was trying to save face; instead, they assumed this substitute must have upset Qi Li, so he came to deliberately torment her. This aligned with his earlier harassment.","Lily, though refuted, still refused to believe that Han Ziyu actually didn't want to approach Qi Li. Suddenly, her eyes lit up with an idea.","She sneered, \"Mrs. Qin, I was just trying to be helpful. Her conveniently appearing in front of you earlier already proves my point. Why don't we just ask this girl directly - does she want to return to Young Master Qi's side or not?\""]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246: This resolute tone seems as if it's about to dedicate oneself to the motherland at the next moment.","paragraphs":["[\"Oh, what a direct attack! This is quite an unusual strategy - she's completely treating Han Ziyu as a scheming white lotus, forcing her to take a stance and leaving her no way out!\"]","This was exactly what Lily was thinking.","She was convinced that Han Ziyu had feelings for Qi Li. After all, how could such a lowly girl who had been by Young Master Qi's side for so long, willingly acting as someone's stand-in, not have feelings for Qi Li?","With her question out there.","If Han Ziyu denied wanting to return for the sake of her pride and image, it would deepen the conflict between them, meaning a win for Lily. If Han Ziyu admitted wanting to return, it would prove that everything earlier was just an act, revealing her deep scheming nature, which would offend many people - and Qi Li wouldn't like such a calculating girl.","So this seemingly random and even troublemaking question was actually the most effective way to deal with a scheming woman.","[\"However... this only works if Han Ziyu actually likes Qi Li and truly wants to return to his side.\"]","Ji Fei silently commented.","When everyone heard this question, their gossip enthusiasm immediately surged.","After all, this stand-in was the woman who had stayed by Qi Li's side the longest, and they also felt that Qi Li still cared about Han Ziyu.","Initially, Qi Li was angry at Lily's thoughtless words, as he wanted to slowly force Han Ziyu to recognize her true feelings and submit, rather than directly pressuring her to answer.","If she stubbornly said she didn't want to return out of spite, wouldn't that make things more complicated?","But thinking about it, he felt a bit excited - perhaps Han Ziyu would finally succumb to her love for him, willing to abandon all dignity and risk offending everyone by admitting she wanted to return to his side. This would greatly satisfy his vanity.","Qi Li had already started fantasizing about how he would respond if Han Ziyu answered that way. He would definitely agree, but wouldn't show her any kindness - he couldn't let her become proud and needed to keep her in check...","Qi Li's lips curled into a smile as he thought about this. He couldn't help but add, showing off, \"Lily, what nonsense are you saying? It's not so easy to return to my side whenever one wants.\" He finished with a raised eyebrow toward Han Ziyu.","Meanwhile, Lily felt that Qi Li didn't care about this stand-in that much after all.","At this moment, Han Ziyu felt extremely frustrated.","What was all this about? Why would such a question even come up?","If she had known this brain-dead former boss would be here, she would have stayed far away - it was such bad luck.","Indeed, this former boss had always liked to make his own assumptions, thinking she liked him. She had told him several times it wasn't true, but this former boss seemed unable to understand human language, completely refusing to believe it and living in his own world. It was truly hard-earned money and difficult work - she couldn't exactly curse at him and accuse him of having delusions. Fortunately, she had already resigned and couldn't be bothered whether he believed it or not.","With such a chance encounter now, her former boss might really think she was the one who couldn't let go. She felt more wronged than Dou E. Were all rich people this self-centered?","But her idol and her idol's husband were both so nice.","Han Ziyu had an internal rant.","Then she solemnly answered: \"No, I don't!\"","Everyone was stunned.","Many people had bet that Han Ziyu would answer that she didn't want to return.","But could someone explain to them why the answer was so forceful and resounding?","The firm tone was as if she was about to pledge allegiance to her country - solemn and dignified.","Shouldn't she have hesitated, struggled to speak, with her entire demeanor and expression screaming 'I'm lying' before saying she didn't want to?","Not just the onlookers were surprised.","Even Qi Li seemed as if his pride had been wounded by Han Ziyu's firmness.","Only Ji Fei finally couldn't hold back and burst out laughing.","Qi Li's face instantly turned red. After recovering, he immediately stood up and scolded, \"Han Ziyu, even spite should have its limits.\"","Han Ziyu was about to roll her eyes. \"Young Master Qi, I swear, I really have no intention of pursuing you, much less returning to your side. Both you and this lady by your side can rest assured!\"","If it weren't for the confidential nature of the paid companionship agreement, she would have thrown it in their faces - they had a fair transaction, how did they imagine she would be clingy?","However, Qi Li seemed unable to sense her disgust and directly stepped forward to grab Han Ziyu's hand.","\"Shut up! Come with me!\" he said, trying to pull her away, apparently attempting to play the domineering CEO role.","Han Ziyu's harsh words had hurt him, and he admitted that he cared about this woman. Since she was being stubborn about saving face, he was willing to take a step back and give her a way out.","But he couldn't lose face, so they needed to talk privately behind closed doors.","However, after trying to pull her for a while, he found he couldn't move her at all.","Han Ziyu had almost half-squatted, lowering her center of gravity and firmly resisting, looking as if she would rather die than go with him.","She appeared as if the person pulling her wasn't her former boss but a human trafficker trying to kidnap her.","Han Ziyu often did physical work and was quite strong. Qi Li hadn't expected his cool and domineering action to stall, and the two ended up in a deadlock.","The surrounding crowd watched this almost comical scene with wide eyes, not knowing how to react.","Lily, who had almost fallen from her chair earlier when Qi Li suddenly let go, now watched as the man who had just started getting closer to her went to pull that stand-in. She became so angry that she also stood up and went to intervene, \"Young Master Qi, I'm your date tonight.\"","\"Get out of the way!\" Qi Li was already irritated and sweating from being unable to move Han Ziyu, and now being blocked made him even more furious.","His attitude naturally caused Lily's anger to escalate. She directly tried to separate their arms.","The three-way struggle created an even more incredible scene.","This spectacular display had everyone watching with great interest, so much so that they almost missed the grand entrance of the VIP.","Lily turned her attack directly on Han Ziyu, \"I get it now, you cheap woman, you're trying to win Young Master Qi back by playing hard to get. Let me tell you, don't think this will work. You're nothing but a stand-in, do you really think Young Master Qi would like you? Stop daydreaming!\"","Although everyone knew about the stand-in situation, bringing it up so blatantly made Qi Li momentarily lose focus.","In that moment of distraction, his grip loosened, and Lily successfully separated them forcefully.","She also pushed Han Ziyu hard.","Their position was already close to the swimming pool.","With that push, Han Ziyu instantly lost her balance and staggered backward several steps.","Noticing she was just one step away from falling into the pool, Ji Fei immediately shouted, \"Watch out!\"","But Han Ziyu had already lost her balance completely.","Luo Fei, being the most agile, immediately jumped up to grab her. Although falling into the pool wasn't dangerous, she was wearing a uniform, and getting it wet would definitely be troublesome.","But before Luo Fei could reach her.","Suddenly, a figure appeared in everyone's view.","Tan skin, flowing body lines, sexy swimsuit, bright red lips, large wavy braids swinging with her movement.","She caught Han Ziyu around the waist, stopping her fall.","Due to the momentum, Han Ziyu practically crashed into the other's sexy embrace. She was completely dazed.","\"Little beauty, are you alright?\" A bright, clear voice rang out.","That scene was straight out of a TV drama's hero-saves-damsel moment.","Except everyone's expressions seemed frozen, as this wasn't a scene most people could easily process.","[\"Uh? The real deal heroically saves the stand-in? This... what kind of development is this? It's kind of funny, I can barely hold back my laughter...\"]"]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247: His Brain Circuit is the Narcissistic Path","paragraphs":["At this moment, the atmosphere at the scene was bizarrely comical, even those playing in the swimming pool stopped to stare at what was happening.","After all, this was Qi Li's party, and everyone knew him well enough to remember his only experience of being dumped.","Just moments ago, they were watching a love triangle drama unfold. They weren't sure if the wealthy patron would successfully leave with the look-alike, or if the admirer would successfully prevent the look-alike from being taken away.","But in an instant, the plot twist nearly gave everyone whiplash.","Rising above the two female characters, the true leading lady in the wealthy patron's heart had appeared.","Up to this point, things still made some sense.","But why was it the original person who came to help when the look-alike was in trouble?!!!","How could anyone even begin to comment on this?","Han Ziyu was also stunned. Having been hired to imitate Guo Yalan, she had naturally seen video footage of her, so she recognized the real deal immediately.","She wasn't sure if her heart was racing from the previous tension or if it was nervousness from meeting the original person that made her heartbeat irregular.","Either way, Han Ziyu didn't know how to react and could only stare blankly at Guo Yalan.","The real person was even more beautiful than in the videos - was she always this stunning?","Although others said they looked alike, Han Ziyu felt that Guo Yalan's excellence wasn't in her features but in the confidence and free-spirited aura that radiated from within.","That kind of charm made her the type of beautiful big sister that other women would admire without jealousy.","No wonder her former boss was so obsessed that he needed to find a look-alike, though Han Ziyu was absolutely certain that Qi Li wasn't worthy of Guo Yalan.","Guo Yalan was also looking at Han Ziyu, whom she was holding. The little girl was quite slim, barely weighing anything, with a small face...","Holy cow! How could she look so much like me?","Guo Yalan suddenly recalled hearing something about a \"look-alike\" when she arrived, and seeing Qi Li harassing the girl, she quickly understood the situation.","Although the feeling was a bit strange, Guo Yalan didn't think too deeply about it. She figured everyone had their own preferences and assumed Qi Li just had a type. Lily must have been jealous when she mentioned the \"look-alike\" thing.","After all, who in their right mind would actually hire a look-alike?","Guo Yalan smiled naturally and helped Han Ziyu up.","Han Ziyu nervously thanked her, \"Thank you.\"","Guo Yalan found herself liking Han Ziyu more and more, feeling quite intrigued.","Just as she was about to speak, Lily exclaimed in shock: \"Guo Yalan? Why are you here!\"","Guo Yalan finally turned to look at them, her gaze sweeping over everyone with amusement before addressing Lily: \"Ta-da! Surprised? Unexpected? I just got back to the country today.\"","Lily was completely caught off guard, her eyes darting nervously toward Qi Li.","By now, everyone's attention was focused on the interaction between Qi Li and Guo Yalan.","Qi Li had been staring at Guo Yalan in a daze, as if unable to process what was happening.","Ji Fei was now enthusiastically watching the drama unfold while sipping her drink. [Oh, he's been frozen since just now. Haven't seen the real person in many years - is he too overwhelmed with joy? Now this is the proper reaction to having your ex-girlfriend, your white moonlight, return from abroad. Unlike last time...]","Qin Xian: Who wasn't proper?","[Oh my, his expression is changing. Why so guilty? Is it because of the look-alike on one side and the new girl on the other? Too embarrassed to face the original?]","Qin Xian looked at Qi Li, who indeed showed a moment of panic, his eyes quickly darting between Han Ziyu and Lily.","[Weren't you just playing the forceful love interest role? Even specially arranged this party for Han Ziyu, how did your heart change so quickly? Tsk tsk tsk...]","Qin Xian was also at a loss for words.","Seeing no one responding to her, Guo Yalan looked around and complained, \"What's this supposed to mean? Aren't you all happy to see me back?\"","With that, everyone naturally couldn't just keep watching the drama and immediately gave her a warm welcome.","Guo Yalan had always been part of Qin Xian's social circle, and although she'd been abroad for many years, everyone except Qi Li and Qin Xian had maintained some contact with her. Especially Cen Ting.","The two women had contrasting personalities - one fiery and one cool - one designing clothes and the other designing jewelry, so they were particularly close.","\"I thought you wouldn't be back until my engagement party,\" Cen Ting said with a smile.","\"I just couldn't wait anymore,\" Guo Yalan said, raising her eyebrows and smirking towards Qin Xian and Ji Fei's direction.","After all, throughout the past year abroad, she'd been hearing one piece of juicy gossip after another from back home, and the drama was so exciting it had sparked her enthusiasm to return.","At her words, Qi Li finally snapped out of his daze. His whole body tensed, his eyes flickering as he looked at Guo Yalan, and his lips curled into a sudden cold smile: \"Couldn't wait? Weren't you quite carefree when you left?\"","He finally couldn't hold back! He knew Guo Yalan still cared about him - she must have come back to fight other women for him.","Qin Xian was frowning at this exchange, feeling like they were talking about different things, when he felt Ji Fei squeezing his arm hard.","Looking over, he saw Ji Fei's face had turned red from holding back.","[Ah ah ah, his thought process is pure narcissism, what a misunderstanding, completely missing the point... Hahahahaha]","Others also felt something was off, especially since Guo Yalan had clearly been looking towards Ji Fei and Qin Xian.","Guo Yalan paused, turning to seriously look at her ex-boyfriend for the first time.","Looks like this guy is still quite bitter about being dumped back then, speaking in such a sarcastic tone.","Guo Yalan shrugged, \"There are good things about being back home too, I wanted to join in on the excitement.\"","If I had known there would be so much drama here at home, I wouldn't have stayed abroad for so long.","The others found this exchange even stranger, since there had been one piece of gossip after another recently that had greatly affected them. Given Guo Yalan's personality, it seemed she was referring to all the recent drama.","Qi Li gave another proud smile - was she declaring war against her love rival? So she only realized his worth when she got jealous?","But he wouldn't come running just because Guo Yalan called.","\"How thoughtful of you to track down this place,\" Qi Li said mockingly with an air of indifference.","[Hahahahaha, no, Qi Li, please stop, I beg you to stop imagining things, you're making yourself look pitiful, I can't even bear to listen anymore.]","Qin Xian felt the grip on his arm tighten even more, and he looked at Qi Li wearily.","However, having known each other for so many years, Qin Xian felt he had to say something, so he directly asked, \"By the way, why did you arrive so late?\"","This question was directed at Guo Yalan, which caught everyone by surprise.","\"I was held up by something,\" Guo Yalan said with a smile.","Luo Fei realized something and asked, \"So when you said you were bringing someone, you meant Guo Yalan?\"","Qin Xian nodded.","Qi Li immediately looked over, suddenly uncertain, \"How did you end up coming together?\"","\"We ran into each other while shopping for clothes. When she heard about the party and that everyone would be here, she decided to come join the gathering,\" Ji Fei explained with a smile.","Qi Li's expression became rather complex. So she hadn't desperately searched for information about him and tracked him down immediately after returning?","But she must have heard he was hosting a party and rushed over.","She wanted to see him as soon as she got back?"]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248: Please Stop Your Divergent Thinking","paragraphs":["\"Why didn't you tell me?\" Qi Li was dissatisfied. He wasn't happy with how their reunion had played out, especially since Guo Yalan had just helped Han Ziyu.","Hmm... they should have been confrontational rather than this strange situation.","If he had known Guo Yalan would come, he would have made better use of the situation...","At this thought, Qi Li suddenly felt uncomfortable and involuntarily glanced at Han Ziyu, who was standing quietly to the side with her head lowered. He felt uneasy.","Indeed, despite Han Ziyu's earlier harsh words, she must still be thinking about him; otherwise, she wouldn't have become so quiet and self-conscious after seeing Guo Yalan, the real deal.","She probably understands that with Guo Yalan's return, she has no chance of getting back together with him.","If she had known this would happen, why did she play hard to get back then? Playing cat and mouse isn't a game everyone has the right to play. Even if she cries now, he won't soften his heart toward her.","Seeing Qi Li constantly stealing glances at Han Ziyu, Ji Fei became suspicious and checked the situation. What she discovered almost made her laugh herself unconscious.","[She's just feeling awkward and trying to be invisible, plus she's on duty as a waitress. Now that the issue is resolved, she's naturally standing by to provide service. What do you expect her to do, jump out and make a scene? Han Ziyu, you should lift your head and let him see if there are actually any glistening tears on your face, otherwise you'll be the subject of rumors. This is even scarier than yellow gossip! Hahaha!]","Qin Xian mechanically patted Ji Fei's back and responded to Qi Li's earlier question with increasing exhaustion: \"I did mention it, you just didn't ask.\"","Qi Li wanted to say something more, but Ji Fei interrupted him.","Ji Fei felt that if she didn't speak up, she would die laughing.","\"Are you alright, Xiaoyu?\"","Han Ziyu lifted her head, showing no sign of melancholy, just nervousness as she replied, \"I'm fine.\"","Ji Fei then said, \"Could you please bring a drink for Sister Yalan?\"","Guo Yalan looked over with a smile and naturally ordered a drink, treating Han Ziyu normally.","Han Ziyu immediately responded with a sweet smile and turned to prepare the drink.","As the drama seemed to be over, the party atmosphere gradually returned to normal.","This harmonious scene and the normal emotions between Han Ziyu and Guo Yalan left Qi Li confused. This wasn't how it was supposed to be, was it?","[Hehe, surprised? Neither of them actually cares about you. Please stop your divergent thinking.]","Meanwhile, Guo Yalan completely ignored Qi Li and instead went straight to Ji Fei's side, smilingly pulling out her phone to show a photo of a handsome man.","\"Since you're in the entertainment industry, do you know him?\" Guo Yalan asked excitedly, her eyes practically sparkling with stars.","Ji Fei was taken aback, not understanding why Guo Yalan suddenly brought this up.","But the sensitive Qi Li immediately turned to look with blazing eyes.","\"Um, he looks familiar, I probably do. Why?\" Ji Fei said.","Others gathered around to look.","Cen Ting's lips twitched upon seeing the photo, as the handsome man was exactly Guo Yalan's type.","\"This is what delayed me earlier! I ran into him as soon as I came out, and since he was my type, I went to chat him up, but his manager stopped me. It's a shame I don't know much about domestic celebrities. If you know him, it would be great if you could help set us up.\" Guo Yalan finished with a predatory look.","Guo Yalan wasn't speaking quietly, so everyone around could hear.","The atmosphere suddenly became awkward again.","This was a development Ji Fei hadn't expected at all. She secretly glanced around and noticed she wasn't the only one stealing looks.","Everyone seemed to hear the sound of a heart breaking.","[K.O.!]","Ji Fei thought Qi Li must surely understand now.","Sure enough, Qi Li's expression changed, his eyes seeming to burn as he stared at Guo Yalan's profile. He completely ignored Lily's attempts to pull him back to his seat.","Just then, Han Ziyu arrived with Guo Yalan's drink.","Guo Yalan was about to thank her but stopped, then looked confused and helpless as she tapped the glass with her long nail.","She said to Han Ziyu, who was about to step aside, \"Little beauty, could you bring me a different drink?\"","Han Ziyu, who was already nervous about serving Guo Yalan, immediately asked, \"Ma'am, is... is there something wrong with the drink?\"","Ji Fei was also confused, as Guo Yalan had seemed friendly toward Han Ziyu earlier. Was she now dissatisfied with the drink Han Ziyu had brought?","Before Guo Yalan could respond, Qi Li suddenly rushed over, put his arm around Han Ziyu's shoulders, and coldly said to Guo Yalan with an I-knew-it expression, \"What's the meaning of this? Are you targeting her? Guo Yalan, don't you know she's my girlfriend?\"","At these words, the onlookers internally roared with excitement - here we go again! More drama!","[Has his brain short-circuited again? Wait, damn, he thinks Guo Yalan was deliberately trying to make him jealous with that other guy's photo, so now he's trying to use Han Ziyu to put on a show. Good grief, can someone please stop his wild imagination! And if you need an accomplice, shouldn't you be using Lily right now? Oh, you think Guo Yalan is giving Han Ziyu a hard time, so using Han Ziyu would be most effective. Damn, I don't know whether to call you clever or stupid - you've got it all wrong, brother!]","Others were tense because of the sudden atmosphere, assuming Guo Yalan had finally snapped and was going after her replacement.","And Qi Li was trying to spite Guo Yalan by using the substitute.","It seemed only the substitute would get hurt in this scenario.","Qin Xian, hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, felt embarrassed for his friend.","Sure enough, Guo Yalan was dumbfounded after hearing this.","Guo Yalan, not one to back down, immediately responded with exasperation: \"Qi Li, has your brain stopped working? First, I'm not targeting anyone. Second, isn't Lily your girlfriend now? I just saw you two arm in arm. How could it be this little beauty? You two were clearly ganging up on her earlier.\"","Han Ziyu, coming to her senses, quickly stepped away from Qi Li's arm. Like someone avoiding a virus, she immediately moved three steps away, indicating they had no relationship.","Cen Ting glanced over and helped explain for her friend: \"This type of cocktail is served with lemon in our country, but not abroad. She forgot to mention it when ordering, and she's allergic to lemon.\"","Han Ziyu, who had been in shock, now paused with a momentary change in her expression. She was about to say something but properly remained silent instead.","Guo Yalan said playfully, \"Please bring me another one without lemon, and don't waste this one - I think you'll like it. It's my treat.\"","\"Alright, I'll get you a new one right away, but I can't drink while I'm working. I'll save it for after my shift. Thank you, Miss Guo.\"","\"Don't call me Miss Guo, call me Sister Yalan,\" Guo Yalan said warmly.","Even Cen Ting could tell that Guo Yalan seemed to genuinely like Han Ziyu.","People whispered among themselves - so there was no drama after all? Who had spread false rumors?","As the two women chatted warmly, Qi Li, who had been ready for confrontation moments ago, now stood like a backdrop, thoroughly ignored."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249: He is learning from his mistakes, one after another","paragraphs":["Qi Li knew about Guo Yalan's allergy to lemon. Although it was a memory from long ago, how could he possibly forget? He just hadn't paid attention to the drink situation since his mind was elsewhere.","This misunderstanding made him feel somewhat embarrassed and annoyed.","However, Guo Yalan had always been like this with her temperament, so even when being snapped at or scolded, Qi Li didn't think she didn't care about him.","After all, Guo Yalan had deliberately mentioned wanting to meet other handsome men right in front of him, her ex-boyfriend.","Wasn't she just putting on a show to make him jealous?","What Qi Li didn't know was that Guo Yalan had always been like this abroad. In China, Qi Li was her only ex-boyfriend, and after their breakup, she went overseas, so he never had the chance to experience this side of her.","In Guo Yalan's view, a breakup meant making a clean break. If they had to remain in the same social circle and still be considerate of each other, it would be too troublesome.","That's why Guo Yalan's carefree attitude was well-known abroad.","Sometimes at a single gathering, she could harmoniously coexist with more than ten ex-boyfriends present.","Meanwhile, Qi Li was either indulging in wishful thinking or instinctively avoiding rational thought out of fear of losing face...","Even though Guo Yalan had returned, she still wouldn't bow her head properly. She truly maintained that difficult temperament of hers. What he hated most was Guo Yalan's temper - if they were to marry in the future, she would definitely need to change it.","Naturally, Qi Li's temper wasn't good either. Otherwise, when Guo Yalan left the country and broke up with him, he wouldn't have resorted to threats and curses instead of trying to keep her or following her.","So facing the current situation, Qi Li characteristically chose to meet force with force, to see who was tougher and who would bow first.","He imperiously commanded Han Ziyu, who was about to go change the drinks: \"Let someone else handle that. Come over here.\"","Everyone's attention immediately shifted. Lily, standing beside Qi Li, looked even more displeased. She didn't blame Qi Li but glared viciously at Han Ziyu, as if ready to bite her if she dared to come over.","Ji Fei hadn't expected Qi Li's dramatic move either.","[He's not only refusing to find a way out of this situation but continuing to make a spectacle of himself? Why does he seem to have automatically blocked out how Han Ziyu just avoided him like the plague and how his lies were exposed? Is this a required skill for privileged young masters, living in their own world?]","[He still wants Han Ziyu to play along? He really never learns from his mistakes. Does he still confidently believe that Han Ziyu harbors feelings for him, so he'd rather have her help than Lily? He should look at Lily beside him, who's nearly red-eyed with jealousy - she would definitely complete his performance perfectly.]","Qi Li's stubbornness made Ji Fei want to arrange things reasonably for him.","Qin Xian also hadn't expected his friend to be so self-destructive. He couldn't be bothered to stop his self-sabotaging behavior anymore.","When Han Ziyu heard her former boss's commanding tone, she wanted to roll her eyes dramatically. Did this guy really think he was some ridiculous overbearing CEO from a romance novel?","But as she couldn't offend the party's host, Han Ziyu tried to maintain a professional tone: \"Sir, I need to be ready for Professor Ji's instructions at all times. If you need service, I can call a colleague for you.\"","Qi Li's pupils constricted in disbelief. He hadn't expected Han Ziyu to refuse to cooperate with him again and again. His irritation grew - it was one thing for the real target to be defiant, but what right did a substitute have?","Did she understand that he had planned to use her to provoke Guo Yalan earlier and was now angry about it?","Qi Li wouldn't indulge her. His tone became severe, \"Han Ziyu, my patience is limited. Remember your place, come here!\"","Han Ziyu was now wearing a forced smile. \"Sir, my only role here is as a current server. Please don't make our work difficult.\"","She felt incredibly unlucky - who could have known her former boss would be so unreasonable? She had already resigned, yet he still wanted to order her around?","What position was she in? Others might not know, but how could Qi Li not know? Now that the contract had ended, what position was he talking about? If he had come to her a day earlier to sign a contract for a performance, as long as the price was right, she wouldn't have minded adding some benefits for the welfare home children.","But now he wanted her to work for free? Even capitalists weren't this absurd.","Qi Li hadn't expected that even with his stern tone, Han Ziyu still wouldn't cooperate. She was really getting out of hand. He started trembling with anger, his face turning slightly blue.","If he couldn't control Guo Yalan, could he not even control Han Ziyu?","[Hah, Han Ziyu used to act docile and submissive, but she wasn't actually like that. Qi Li must have fooled himself.]","However, it wasn't Qi Li who exploded - it was Lily who could no longer contain herself.","She hated both Han Ziyu and Guo Yalan. Today was supposed to be the party Qi Li held for her, so why did these two hussies have to appear and steal her spotlight and Qi Li's attention?","Lily didn't dare confront Guo Yalan, but who did Han Ziyu think she was?","If Han Ziyu hadn't refused Qi Li, Lily would definitely have exploded, but Han Ziyu's refusal made Lily feel even more humiliated. It was as if this little tramp was playing hard to get with something Lily couldn't have - who was she trying to insult?","If she couldn't compete with Guo Yalan, could she really not even compete with Han Ziyu?","It must be said that Lily and Qi Li were truly alike in their thinking. Even though it wasn't anything good, Lily couldn't bear being not even a supporting character in this drama.","Before anyone could react, Lily stepped forward and snatched the glass from Han Ziyu's tray, splashing the drink all over her.","The liquid drenched Han Ziyu from head to toe, instantly making her look disheveled.","Seeing that similar face in such a sorry state gave Lily a double dose of satisfaction, making her feel extremely pleased.","Qi Li, standing nearby, hadn't expected Lily to suddenly act like this. He instinctively moved forward as if to step in, but stopped himself a moment later, then coldly smirked. This is what Han Ziyu got for not knowing better - he had really spoiled her too much. Playing attitude with him in this kind of setting, a little lesson would help her calm down and remember who she should rely on!","\"You!\" Han Ziyu almost lost her temper.","\"When Young Master Qi gives you face, you should know your place. Stop pretending - look at yourself in the mirror. What do you think you are? You're not even an ant to us. Don't think that because others are polite to you and Qi Li used to spoil you, you can be so presumptuous. You're nothing but a poor working girl. I can't stand pretentious people like you. If you dare to be so insolent again, I'll smash your mouth!\"","Han Ziyu had probably never encountered such an unreasonable rich young lady before, and her eyes immediately turned red.","When Han Ziyu was splashed, Ji Fei and Guo Yalan immediately stood up. Ji Fei grabbed a towel and handed it to Han Ziyu.","Guo Yalan pushed Lily away.","\"If you're in heat, keep it to yourself, why are you acting crazy!\" Guo Yalan scolded without mercy. \"Is Qi Li ignoring you making you this desperate?\""]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250: Have you finally realized that they are all in it together","paragraphs":["Lily had never been scolded so harshly before, and her eyes immediately reddened with emotion.","\"Guo Yalan, are you crazy? Can't you see what this little tramp is thinking?\"","Guo Yalan sneered, \"I can see what you're thinking though - you wanted to splash me, didn't you?\"","Lily's heart tightened under Guo Yalan's piercing gaze.","Indeed, Lily wanted nothing more than to splash Guo Yalan, but she didn't dare. So now she and Qi Li were of the same mind, using Han Ziyu as a scapegoat - after all, there was no cost to bullying Han Ziyu.","Seeing Lily's guilty conscience, Guo Yalan said directly, \"Apologize.\"","\"What?\" Lily was dumbfounded.","\"Apologize to the young lady. What, you don't understand simple words?\" Guo Yalan crossed her arms, presenting an intimidating stance.","Han Ziyu looked up at Guo Yalan in surprise, only able to see her solid back, yet feeling extremely safe.","Overwhelmed by the aggressive atmosphere and the stares from everyone around, Lily immediately turned to Qi Li with a pitiful expression, seeking help.","Qi Li truly couldn't understand why Guo Yalan was defending Han Ziyu again. Seeing Lily on the verge of tears, he frowned.","He said to Guo Yalan, \"Why are you still so temperamental? It's just a small matter.\"","As soon as Qi Li finished speaking, he saw Han Ziyu suddenly look up at him.","His heart skipped a beat, and he inexplicably couldn't meet her gaze. Had his words hurt her?","He couldn't be blamed though - after all, she hadn't been cooperative before.","Besides, what was her status compared to Lily's?","Standing beside Han Ziyu, Ji Fei could feel the resentment radiating from her, and was mentally cursing quite colorfully.","Honestly, regarding Qi Li's previous hiring of a stand-in, since he hadn't really taken advantage of Han Ziyu, Ji Fei had at most considered him a narcissistic fool who was full of himself and self-deceptive. But hearing his words now, Ji Fei felt that Qi Li's true nature was simply lacking.","[Even though Qi Li wouldn't have to worry about offending Lily, it's clear he still ranks people by their status. Even if he has developed feelings for Han Ziyu, deep down he still looks down on people without status or background, thinking it doesn't matter if they suffer because there's no cost. If he were to stand up for her, that would just be asking for trouble. It seems there's a huge gap in values between these friends. My Qin Xian is still the best.]","Qin Xian: My?","Qin Xian had been listening to Ji Fei's criticism and was also dissatisfied with Qi Li's behavior, but that sudden possessive remark caught him off guard. His brain short-circuited, stopped thinking, and he sweetly gazed at Ji Fei. In this tense atmosphere, he was probably the only one whose thoughts were completely out of sync.","While others were fighting, he was savoring love.","Hearing Qi Li's response, Guo Yalan couldn't help but laugh mockingly.","Guo Yalan shrugged, \"Good thing we broke up back then. I knew we weren't compatible.\"","This statement hit Qi Li's nerve hard, and his face truly darkened.","\"Guo Yalan, you...\"","\"Shut up, this has nothing to do with you,\" Guo Yalan cut him off.","Now it was Qi Li's turn to tremble with anger.","Glaring at Lily with displeasure, she said, \"When you do something wrong, you should apologize. What are you hiding for, making it seem like I'm bullying you?\"","\"Guo Yalan, don't push too far.\"","\"So it's okay for you to bully others but not okay for others to bully you?\" Guo Yalan sneered, \"Besides, I'm not bullying anyone - I'm upholding justice.\"","Lily finally couldn't hold back anymore and shouted, \"Guo Yalan, you're just an idiot! Are you pretending not to know or can you really not see? She's your stand-in! Do you know what a stand-in is? She's a fake trying to replace you! Why are you protecting this kind of cheap woman? You don't even know how she's been seducing Young Master Qi using a face similar to yours. Otherwise, how could a mere working girl stay by Young Master Qi's side for so long? You should be teaching her a harsh lesson!\"","Guo Yalan suddenly fell silent and turned to look at Han Ziyu.","Although it was common knowledge, having it stated so directly made it extremely awkward. Han Ziyu became nervous under Guo Yalan's gaze, and suddenly felt a strong emotion surge within her - she didn't want Guo Yalan to dislike her.","But what original would like their counterfeit version?","It would be considered merciful if she didn't slap her.","Han Ziyu didn't expect any kindness from Guo Yalan, let alone having her speak up for her.","But it was such a shame - they looked so similar, and Guo Yalan had been so friendly before. She was such a good person, and Han Ziyu felt a special kind of affection. Although it might have been presumptuous of her, she wished they could have met under different circumstances - perhaps they could have been good sisters.","Her feelings toward Guo Yalan marked the first time since losing both parents that Han Ziyu had such a strong desire for family.","And this was coming from someone who had always been independent and didn't even care for having a boyfriend.","\"That... no... I never wanted to replace you, much less seduce anyone, I just...\" Han Ziyu was so anxious she didn't know what to say.","[If it weren't for the confidentiality agreement, Han Ziyu would probably want to shout out that it was just an employment relationship. Unfortunately, I can't help explain either, since I'm supposed to know nothing about it. The most infuriating is Qi Li - he's the one who paid for this, yet he seems to have conveniently forgotten that part. It's absolutely maddening. I hope Guo Yalan doesn't misunderstand Han Ziyu.]","Guo Yalan paused, then smiled helplessly, \"Sister, whether that's true or not, I'd suggest you find someone else - this one's not worth it.\"","[Pfft, I'm really growing to like Guo Yalan's personality more and more. Qi Li truly doesn't deserve her.]","This statement stunned everyone around them.","This... why did it sound like she was disapproving of a friend's boyfriend and advising her to break up?","Shouldn't Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu be in an awkward, opposing relationship?","Actually, Guo Yalan had previously thought Qi Li just had a preference for this type of appearance, and the similarity was coincidental. But after seeing Lily and Qi Li's attitude toward Han Ziyu, she began to have doubts.","Now that Lily had completely torn away the veil of pretense, Guo Yalan fully understood Han Ziyu's position.","She just wasn't sure about Han Ziyu's feelings for Qi Li, and when uncertain, she always followed her instincts. Since she quite liked this young girl, she might as well protect her.","\"Ah... ah, oh, you're absolutely right,\" Han Ziyu was stunned, probably never having encountered this kind of situation before. \"But I swear, I have absolutely no relationship with him now!\"","Guo Yalan smiled with satisfaction.","The conversation between Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu completely trampled Qi Li's dignity - who could have imagined these two would team up to humiliate him?","\"Guo Yalan, Han Ziyu, you, you both...\"","[So you've finally realized they're on the same side? Pfft pfft pfft~]","Guo Yalan immediately shot Qi Li a warning glare, \"Why are you so chatty? This is between us women - can't you men just stay out of it? You're so annoying.\"","Then, Guo Yalan fixed her gaze on Lily, \"Your turn.\"","Lily finally realized she couldn't count on Qi Li and stepped back in fear."]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251: What kind of man is this who supports his wife without any limits","paragraphs":["Qi Li was once again left speechless by Guo Yalan, savoring the taste of being overpowered and unable to attend to Lily.","【Indeed, Guo Yalan is Qi Li's nemesis. No wonder he can't forget her; after all, men can't let go of women they can't conquer. It's not necessarily that he likes her so much, but the unattainable always disturbs the mind. As for this Lily, she brought this upon herself.】","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow and decided not to let Guo Yalan do all the work.","She directly said, \"Oh, and there's the matter from earlier that hasn't been settled yet. Lily, you wanted to push someone into the water without reason, shouldn't you apologize to her? We're all human; no one is superior to another. I believe Lily is well-bred and understands this basic courtesy. Apologize for both incidents.\"","Lily was caught off guard by yet another person jumping in and truly felt the sting of being bullied for the first time. She stared angrily at Han Ziyu, feeling both wronged and anger.","Although Guo Yalan and Ji Fei were not people she could afford to offend, she didn't believe they would go against her for a mere worker.","So, Lily stubbornly said, \"It's just a push; nothing happened. And the wine... it's just a spilled glass. What's the big deal? I'll just pay her some money.\"","In short, the words \"I'm sorry\" were something she would never say to this \"lowly\" person.","\"Name your price,\" Lily mocked.","Han Ziyu, feeling the support from Ji Fei and Guo Yalan, though still afraid of offending the powerful, wouldn't easily belittle their help.","\"I don't want money!\" Han Ziyu declared firmly.","\"You!\" Lily was furious. \"Don't push your luck!\"","\"She said she doesn't want it; just apologize!\" Guo Yalan demanded sternly.","The atmosphere had quieted around them.","Lily, being cornered, turned red with embarrassment and finally snapped, \"She's not worth it!\"","With that, she turned to leave, taking the approach of retreating when outmatched.","【How can someone who did wrong just walk away without any consequences?】","Qin Xian, hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, knew she wouldn't let Lily off the hook.","Ji Fei suddenly called out to Lily.","Lily instinctively turned around, only to see Ji Fei quickly grab her wine glass and splash it at Lily.","Lily screamed as the wine drenched her.","Everyone around was shocked; they hadn't seen Ji Fei as this aggressive before. Wait, hadn't they heard that the Mrs. Qin was a bit... unstable?","Some glanced at Qin Xian, expecting a reaction, but he remained calm, as if not surprised at all.","Guo Yalan, catching on, gave Ji Fei a thumbs up.","Qi Li, who was close to Lily, got some of the wine splashed on his face and was left bewildered.","After the scream, Lily couldn't hold it together and glared at Ji Fei, shouting, \"What are you doing?\"","\"It's just a spilled glass of wine; what's the big deal?\" Ji Fei parroted Lily's earlier words.","\"You're doing this for her?\" Lily was incredulous.","Ji Fei smiled. \"I said before, no one can bully my fan. Lily, you didn't take my words to heart at all.\"","Lily now stared at Ji Fei with pure hatred.","\"If you have any complaints, blame this... on him.\"","Ji Fei pointed at Qin Xian, using him as a shield to the fullest.","But to offend someone in their circle for a small fan, this kind of recklessness made others wonder if Qin Xian would back her up.","Qin Xian nodded seriously, \"Yes, blame it on me.\"","The others: Huh?","Ji Fei proudly lifted her chin. \"Hear that?\"","Now, Lily was truly devastated, pointing at Ji Fei, \"You... are you crazy? Why do you love meddling in other people's business so much!\"","Qin Xian's face instantly darkened. \"Who are you talking about?\"","Lily felt a chill down her spine but still complained, \"Mr. Qin, don't you think your wife is being unreasonable? She's deliberately bullying me!\"","Qin Xian: \"My wife isn't bullying you; she's just settling accounts for others. It's completely justified.\"","Lily was left speechless in disbelief.","The others around them felt like they wanted to complain but didn't know where to start.","This... this Mr. Qin was different from their memories and imaginations.","What kind of man blindly supports his wife without any limits?","But he had the confidence; whether it was Lily or the Qi Li behind her, Qin Xian wasn't afraid to offend them, so of course, he could indulge his wife's antics.","Before, they thought Qin Xian was excellent but too cold and unromantic with women; being with him would probably leave one feeling frozen.","But now... many women present couldn't help but feel a pang of envy!","Qin Xian's other friends were already used to this, though still not fully accustomed. They knew a rule: whenever Qin Xian seemed uncharacteristically \"not Qin Xian,\" it was always related to Ji Fei. Otherwise, he was the Qin Xian they knew.","With Qin Xian's statement, Lily, drenched in wine, finally broke down into sobs.","Qi Li, coming to his senses, felt a mix of emotions on his face. He couldn't leave Lily unattended, and now facing Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu, he felt the world was in chaos.","So, Qi Li dragged Lily away, intending to send her off.","Lily, crying at the door, complained and questioned Qi Li, hoping he would leave with her.","He couldn't leave, of course; Guo Yalan had just returned, and Han Ziyu was still here. He didn't know how to handle the situation yet.","Finally, he lost patience and said coldly, \"Are you leaving or not? If not, I'm going.\"","Lily was stunned by Qi Li. \"A Guo Yalan, a Han Ziyu... do you really have no place for me in your heart? Why did you pretend to accept me?\"","Qi Li's patience was exhausted. \"When did I ever accept you? Can you stop bothering me? Look at what you've done today; you embarrassed yourself and dragged me down.\"","Lily froze.","Qi Li didn't care about Lily and simply pulled his hand away, turning back to return.","Lily stared at Qi Li's retreating back, almost bursting with anger.","On the other side, with the annoying person gone, the atmosphere by the pool finally improved.","\"Thank you, thank you so much!\" Han Ziyu, full of gratitude, bowed to Guo Yalan and Ji Fei.","Guo Yalan clicked her tongue. \"You're welcome. You're just unlucky, but since we look so much alike, it's fate. From now on, you're my sister. If anyone dares to bully you, use my name. With our looks, we're not meant to be bullied.\"","Ji Fei was about to say something when she suddenly noticed Han Ziyu's neck was red, not from emotion, but with tiny spots."]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252: It Really Is Sisters with Different Fathers","paragraphs":["\"Weird, what happened to your neck?\" Ji Fei asked directly.","Guo Yalan looked over and the familiar scene made her pause for a moment.","Han Ziyu was already feeling itchy and said, \"I'm fine, just an allergy. I'll go take care of it.\"","With that, she left.","\"She's allergic? To alcohol?\" Guo Yalan wondered, \"Guess she's also prone to allergies.\"","Ji Fei also found it strange; she hadn't seen Han Ziyu drink before during their previous gatherings.","Instinctively, she used her system to check.","Guo Yalan went back to chat with the other friends, complaining about Qi Li using that young girl as a replacement, essentially putting her in an unjust position.","Everyone didn't know how to respond; Qi Li was indeed in the wrong, but Guo Yalan's reaction was also unexpected.","Since Ji Fei was standing still while checking, Qin Xian got up, pulled her back to sit down, and wiped the alcohol that had splashed onto her fingers.","[Holy crap! What a coincidence!]","Qin Xian, already accustomed to Ji Fei's thoughts, continued wiping without reacting.","[Both are allergic to lemons, and they look so similar? Could Guo Yalan have a long-lost sister? Is this really that cliche?]","Qin Xian:?!","Now Qin Xian couldn't stay calm either. The combination of elements couldn't be explained by coincidence alone.","But Qin Xian hadn't heard of any missing family members from the Guo family. Could it be a secret child? But Guo Yalan's parents were genuinely loving, and they doted on Guo Yalan.","As Qin Xian pondered, Ji Fei's strange thoughts grew stronger.","She remembered the initial revelation about the eldest sister and her son. Sometimes, unless the person already knew, deeper digging into the system was needed to uncover the truth.","So previously, when Ji Fei checked their information, it was only superficial and didn't reveal anything unusual.","This time, Ji Fei had the patience to look closely.","[Han Ziyu's information is straightforward. Her parents died in a car accident early on, and no relatives could be contacted, so she was sent to an orphanage. She grew up in the orphanage, and her memories of her parents are from early childhood. She looks like her mom, so she should be their biological child.]","[As for Guo Yalan, I can't believe it... Guo Yalan's current mother isn't her biological mom?]","Qin Xian immediately perked up, sensing some possibilities.","[So that's how it is. That's... too much. Guo Yalan saw her biological mom having an affair and running away with someone when she was very young. She clung to her mom, refusing to let her go, but her mom, in a panic, pushed her down the stairs.]","[Even though she was injured and couldn't get up, she still tried to grab her mom's hand, but her mom cried and said sorry, avoiding her. Guo Yalan watched helplessly as her mom ran off with the other man, leaving her not only physically hurt but also emotionally scarred.]","Seeing Ji Fei's righteous anger, Qin Xian couldn't help but look at the lively and carefree Guo Yalan. He hadn't noticed before.","[Guo Yalan's grandparents were furious and forced her dad to remarry. Initially, they didn't approve of the biological mom, but her dad fought for the marriage. After experiencing betrayal, her dad had no more fight left, only wanting his daughter to be okay.]","[Her dad was initially resistant to the new wife, as she was forced by his parents. But it turned out she genuinely cared for Guo Yalan, taking good care of her. Guo Yalan accepted her even before her dad did, treating her as her real mom.]","[But her dad still had a mental block, as he was always looking for Guo Yalan's biological mom, not to bring her back, but to get closure. One day, he told Guo Yalan that her mom had passed away a few years ago and asked if she wanted to visit the grave. Guo Yalan refused, insisting she only had one mom. The stepmom, loving Guo Yalan, never had children of her own, and their mother-daughter relationship was excellent. Guo Yalan had long forgotten her biological mother.]","Qin Xian suddenly understood. When Han Ziyu had an allergic reaction, Ji Fei thought of various possibilities, but Guo Yalan didn't. Maybe her subconscious was rejecting any connection to her biological mom, helping her ignore these clues.","But Guo Yalan, with her bold and straightforward personality, would she really not suspect anything?","Ji Fei's doubts grew stronger as she dug deeper.","Both having lost their biological moms, the coincidence was alarming.","[Although the names of the two moms are different, Han Ziyu's age... the time that woman ran away... Oh my god... it's highly possible! Could this world be full of such drama?]","Ji Fei was so absorbed in this revelation that she ignored those trying to talk to her.","\"Ji Fei? Ji Fei?\" Guo Yalan asked curiously.","Qin Xian said, \"She's thinking.\"","Guo Yalan laughed, \"She looks so cute when she's lost in thought. No wonder you like her.\"","Qin Xian: \"Whatever type she is, I like her.\"","\"Hahahaha.\" Guo Yalan laughed uncontrollably.","But someone was completely oblivious to the outside world, engrossed in the truth she had uncovered.","[Oh my god! They're really half-sisters!]","Qin Xian's eyes widened in disbelief as he looked at Guo Yalan.","Guo Yalan, carefree, suddenly asked, \"By the way, the girl just now, Han Ziyu, is she really Ji Fei's fan?\"","Qin Xian nodded.","\"How old is she this year?\" Guo Yalan asked casually, not looking at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian glanced at Guo Yalan and frowned slightly, \"It's said she just turned twenty.\"","Guo Yalan's eyelashes fluttered.","Ji Fei, having snapped back to reality, was eager to share this big revelation with Qin Xian.","When her vision focused, she saw Guo Yalan leaning over, startling her.","To be honest, she felt guilty.","If it were other types of lost siblings, Ji Fei would try various roundabout ways to help them reunite.","But in Guo Yalan's case, she didn't know whether she should say anything.","After all, Guo Yalan's mother had an affair and abandoned her, having a child with her lover.","Han Ziyu was innocent, and so was Guo Yalan.","Given this background, Ji Fei couldn't guarantee how Guo Yalan would react to Han Ziyu.","Guo Yalan seemed to snap back to reality and laughed, \"What are you thinking about?\"","Ji Fei stammered, \"I'm thinking if Qi Li will cause more trouble when he comes back.\"","Guo Yalan seemed to completely disregard Qi Li.","After chatting for a while, she pulled Cen Ting to jump into the pool, swimming impatiently and quickly getting out.","\"I want to drink. Where's that girl? Why isn't she back yet?\" Guo Yalan suddenly asked, \"Did she have a severe allergic reaction? I'll go check.\""]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253: Qi Li suddenly experienced a strong sense of turmoil","paragraphs":["As Guo Yalan got up and left, Ji Fei was left in a state of shock.","【Although Han Ziyu does seem to be to Guo Yalan's liking, it's quite strange for her to be so concerned about someone she's only just met.】","After watching Guo Yalan's retreating figure for a while, Qin Xian finally chimed in, \"Perhaps Guo Yalan suspects that Han Ziyu is her half-sister from a different father.\"","At these words, Ji Fei turned to Qin Xian with an almost panicked expression. After all, such a juicy secret was something Ji Fei hadn't shared with Qin Xian at all. How had he come up with this idea?","Seeing Ji Fei's expression, Qin Xian knew exactly what she was thinking. He decided to play his trump card, gesturing for Ji Fei to come closer with a conspiratorial wave of his hand, as if ready to share some gossip.","Ji Fei's eyes lit up at once. After all, Qin Xian was well-connected and could easily find out any piece of information he wanted. Maybe he already knew some of the gossip.","No longer needing to keep the big secret to herself, Ji Fei eagerly leaned in, whispering, \"Do you know something?\"","Just as the two were about to speak, Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yuezhenting arrived, and with more people around, the conversation inevitably shifted, interrupting Ji Fei and Qin Xian's private talk.","Desperate to share the gossip, Ji Fei pulled Qin Xian to a corner by the pool, where they could talk in private amidst the noise.","\"There's a rumor that Guo Yalan's current mother isn't her biological mother. Her real mother ran off with someone else. Judging by Han Ziyu's age, it seems quite plausible. I think Guo Yalan might be suspicious, which is why she's paying so much attention to Han Ziyu.\"","Ji Fei's face lit up with excitement. \"If... if they really are sisters, what do you think Guo Yalan's attitude towards Han Ziyu would be?\"","Qin Xian pondered for a moment before replying, \"All I know is that Guo Yalan is very protective of her own. Besides, Han Ziyu lost her parents at a young age.\"","The source of resentment is gone, and not everyone likes to transfer their hatred. At least Guo Yalan is a very principled person.","But even so, Qin Xian couldn't be too sure, as he didn't know most of the people around him very well.","Ji Fei was also quite worried and couldn't help but use her system to check on Han Ziyu's current situation.","What she found almost made her curse out loud.","【Is Qi Li sick or something? Why is he blocking her again?】","The water in the pool rippled as a water balloon floated by, which Qin Xian swatted away. It was then that he heard Ji Fei cursing in her mind.","Had his buddy Qi Li gone and done something stupid again?","Han Ziyu, who had just taken her medication and changed into a new uniform, was on her way back to work when she was blocked in an empty corridor.","Seeing Qi Li, Han Ziyu was filled with frustration. She had wanted to pretend not to see him and simply sidestep him, but as soon as she passed by, Qi Li pulled her into a clichéd and tacky hand-grabbing wall-slam.","\"Han Ziyu, you've got some nerve, ignoring me!\"","Han Ziyu struggled in vain and was utterly speechless. \"Qi Shao, the contract stipulates that after the term ends, there should be no more entanglement!\"","This rule was originally set by Qi Li to guard against Han Ziyu, but now Han Ziyu felt that it was Qi Li who should really abide by it.","Qi Li chuckled, pinching Han Ziyu's chin and sneering, \"You're quite the big shot today, aren't you? Always trying to make me uncomfortable. Do you really think I'll tolerate you for long?\"","Han Ziyu's mouth twitched. She was genuinely puzzled as to why someone as wonderful as Guo Yalan ever dated him.","Seeing Han Ziyu remain silent, Qi Li thought she had finally stopped putting on an act. He took a deep breath, but when he saw Han Ziyu's lowered eyes and caught a whiff of her scent, he was momentarily stunned.","This was the Han Ziyu he was familiar with—submissive and obedient.","In truth... he really missed having her around, always at his beck and call.","Qi Li gazed at Han Ziyu, his throat tightening. It had been so long since they last met. Surely this girl must miss him too, right? How many tears had she shed in secret?","If it weren't for Guo Yalan, they would still be like they used to be.","Qi Li's resolve suddenly wavered.","Why did it have to be Guo Yalan? Even after meeting again, while he still had feelings for Guo Yalan, their interactions were as infuriating as ever. Why was he putting himself through this torture when he could have someone who loved him wholeheartedly and compromised for him?","Maybe the person he should choose was Han Ziyu, not Guo Yalan.","Perhaps, in his heart, Han Ziyu had already become a completely different person from Guo Yalan.","\"Han Ziyu, I know what you're thinking. In fact... my heart is also in turmoil. Can you give me some time?\" Qi Li suddenly said.","Coming back to her senses, Han Ziyu was utterly dumbfounded to hear this. She felt a helplessness that no amount of language learning could describe.","\"Qi Shao, you don't need time, and you don't need to be confused. We have no relationship now, and I've never had any thoughts about you. I swear it with my life. Please step aside; I need to get back to work!\"","If Qi Li believed her so easily, he wouldn't have been able to deceive himself for so long.","\"Han Ziyu, I haven't kissed you yet, have I?\" With that, Qi Li leaned in, as if to prove something.","Han Ziyu's eyes widened in horror, and she shrank back, almost wishing she could burrow into the wall. Before she could even blurt out a \"What the hell,\" she heard a voice from not far away.","\"What's this? Acting out a forced kiss? Qi Li, you really are getting more and more 'judgemental' these days.\"","At the sound of Guo Yalan's voice, Qi Li reflexively let go of Han Ziyu, his heart racing with guilt.","Han Ziyu was pushed aside a few steps, and she couldn't help but turn back to Qi Li, giving him the double middle finger.","Of course, Qi Li was too busy nervously facing Guo Yalan to notice, but Guo Yalan found Han Ziyu's gesture amusing.","Guo Yalan's laughter left Han Ziyu feeling awkward and at a loss.","After all, she still couldn't tell if this ex-couple had any lingering feelings for each other.","\"Why are you here?\" Qi Li said, his confidence growing, \"What I do is none of your business, is it? You're not my anything anymore.\"","Ji Fei, who was watching the drama unfold through her system, was utterly speechless.","【At this point, he still hasn't forgotten his plan, using Han Ziyu to provoke Guo Yalan. He just said his heart was in turmoil, but I think he's just fickle.】","Qin Xian, listening to the live broadcast, found Qi Li's actions unsurprising. After all, it was a scheme he had been plotting for years. Even if he loved both, Guo Yalan was always his first choice.","【If either Guo Yalan or Han Ziyu had any feelings for Qi Li, this would probably be a classic case of the 'white moonlight, stand-in, and fiery funeral' trope. As it stands, only Qi Li is stubbornly sticking to this script, even trying to add his own drama.】","Faced with Qi Li's diva-like behavior, Guo Yalan had no patience or mood to humor him. She simply brushed him off, \"Right, right, right. Could you please leave? I need to talk to Han Ziyu about something.\""]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254: Is She Into...","paragraphs":["When Guo Yalan said that, Qi Li's expression suddenly changed, as if he was worried that Guo Yalan would make things difficult for Han Ziyu.","But then he thought about how Guo Yalan was doing this for him, and Qi Li couldn't help but feel a sense of pride.","\"Guo Yalan, I don't like you being so pushy,\" Qi Li said, lifting his chin. \"And why are you involving my people?\"","Guo Yalan remained expressionless and gave him the middle finger twice.","Qi Li's veins bulged, but he felt even more smug inside. Suddenly, he heard laughter behind him and quickly turned around in surprise, but Han Ziyu stopped laughing just as quickly.","Han Ziyu immediately stepped forward and said to Guo Yalan, \"We have a dedicated rest area here, please...\"","Before Qi Li could react, Guo Yalan had already walked away quickly with Han Ziyu.","\"Han Ziyu, are you crazy? You...\"","\"Please go back, Qi Shao, this party is your event,\" Han Ziyu said without looking back.","By the time Qi Li wanted to catch up and interfere, they had already boarded the elevator.","Qi Li was stunned.","What was going on? Shouldn't he be there at a time like this?","Han Ziyu was really stupid. What if Guo Yalan hit her? How would he protect her if he wasn't there?","Qi Li felt annoyed and angry, not wanting to care about Han Ziyu anymore. But he couldn't let it go either, feeling very conflicted, as he still wasn't clear about what he wanted.","Turning back to the party, he couldn't help but want to hint to Ji Fei, who had been protecting Han Ziyu. Maybe Guo Yalan would give Ji Fei face.","But as soon as he returned, Qi Li locked eyes with Ji Fei and Qin Xian in the pool.","Their looks at him were strangely eerie.","Qi Li walked straight up and said, \"Hey, Ji Fei. Your little fan was taken away by Guo Yalan for a private chat, probably to be bullied.\"","Ji Fei opened her mouth, and Qi Li thought she was hesitating whether to intervene or not. But Qin Xian heard Ji Fei's inner thoughts, filled with a thousand curses, unsure where to start.","\"Right, just now Sister Yalan said she and Ziyu hit it off and wanted to get along better.\"","\"Ah?\" Qi Li scoffed, \"You actually believe that?\"","\"Why wouldn't I? Didn't Sister Yalan just keep defending Ziyu? Have you lost your memory? How could you think Sister Yalan would make things difficult for Ziyu?\"","Qi Li was stunned, feeling his good intentions were being mocked. He wanted to say more, but saw Ji Fei give a fake smile, \"Oh no, oh no, you don't think they're fighting over you, do you? Hahaha, you're thinking too much.\"","Qi Li: ...","What does that mean? Aren't they fighting over him? What do you mean I'm thinking too much?","He wanted to refute, but recalling previous events, he suddenly lost his confidence. But Qi Shao never lost his bravado, at least not in words.","\"You don't understand, so don't talk nonsense.\"","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow and said, \"You can rest assured, I think she treats Ziyu better than you, right, honey? Don't you think so too?\"","Ji Fei pulled Qin Xian in to add credibility.","Qi Li indeed looked over unconfidently, and Qin Xian naturally nodded, as it was the truth.","Qi Li's expression cracked for a moment.","Suddenly, he blurted out, \"Could it be that she likes...\"","Qi Li immediately shut his mouth, looking somewhat panicked.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian: ...","Ji Fei: [Wait, the 'likes' Qi Li just blurted out doesn't seem to be the kind of 'likes' I think? Has he misunderstood something? Has his imagination gone that far?]","Qin Xian was also shocked, his mouth twitching, as he sensed that Qi Li meant exactly that, though he seemed to have snapped back to reality now.","[That's right, Guo Yalan once said she wasn't fixed on her orientation, that she might fall in love with a woman too, although she had never tried it, so Qi Li forgot about it. And today, Guo Yalan was clearly different with Han Ziyu. That's why Qi Li suddenly felt an unspeakable sense of crisis, though he doesn't seem to think so now. Well... such a big imagination.]","Qi Li stopped himself because he suddenly thought, how absurd could it be? Even if she liked women, she wouldn't like someone who looks so much like him, it would be too uncomfortable. He felt his mind was messed up by the strange harmony between the two.","Qi Li wanted to bother Ji Fei again.","But Ji Fei didn't want to be harassed anymore, so she pulled Qin Xian and swam to the middle of the pool.","She grabbed a giant inflatable ring, climbed on it, and Qin Xian stayed below with her.","Ji Fei continued to enjoy the drama.","She was curious how Guo Yalan would handle this situation.","After Guo Yalan was taken away by Han Ziyu from Qi Li, Han Ziyu breathed a sigh of relief and instinctively thanked her.","\"It seems I didn't do anything wrong. You didn't like him treating you that way,\" Guo Yalan said directly.","Han Ziyu immediately nodded, \"Of course, I didn't like it.\"","Guo Yalan smiled, \"Luckily, I was worried that because of Qi Li's stupidity, you'd have a grudge against me.\"","Han Ziyu instantly understood, it was about the stand-in matter.","Han Ziyu awkwardly scratched her head, \"Don't be disgusted with me. I really don't like him, I swear!\"","\"Now I completely believe it. Luckily, you don't like him, otherwise...\"","Han Ziyu immediately looked nervously at Guo Yalan. Sure enough, Guo Yalan still cared...","\"Otherwise, I really would have to send you to an ophthalmologist and then recommend you a hundred handsome men. I don't believe I can't change your taste in men.\"","\"Pfft!\" Han Ziyu really couldn't hold back and laughed out loud.","Actually, at this point, Guo Yalan's words were a bit too much for their current relationship.","But Guo Yalan said it naturally, and Han Ziyu didn't feel strange about it.","\"Then why did you agree to be a stand-in in the first place?\" Guo Yalan continued to ask, genuinely concerned.","Han Ziyu didn't know how to explain. After being harassed by Qi Li for so long, she might as well break the contract.","But once the contract was broken, what if she got sued? The money had already been used for the orphanage.","These young masters and gentlemen, she really couldn't afford to offend them. She wasn't the type to beg Ji Fei and Guo Yalan for help just because they treated her a little better.","So she had to choose to endure.","Just as she was about to speak, she heard Guo Yalan directly say, \"Could it be for the money?!\"","Han Ziyu was shocked, and her reaction immediately made Guo Yalan understand.","Guo Yalan's face darkened, but she still asked respectfully, \"Was it voluntary?\"","There was nothing to hide about this, so Han Ziyu nodded frankly, it was just a job after all.","In a sense, if Qi Li hadn't acted crazy later, it would have been a help to her in an emergency. So Han Ziyu's repeated tolerance wasn't entirely because of the contract, but also because she didn't want her former boss to lose face. After all, one should be grateful.","Guo Yalan actually cursed Qi Li a thousand times in her heart, but she understood that if it was for money, there must be a reason, so she couldn't blame Qi Li.","She had to swallow her anger.","\"So, Miss Guo doesn't like...\" Suddenly, Han Ziyu cautiously said.","\"What did you call me?\"","Seeing Guo Yalan's slightly narrowed eyes, Han Ziyu immediately became obedient, \"Sister Yalan.\"","When Guo Yalan heard the word \"Sister\" come out of Han Ziyu's mouth, she felt a shiver of pleasure.","Suddenly, her eyes flashed, and while talking, she reached out and casually took a strand of Han Ziyu's hair."]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255: Still Saying You Like Me, But Won't Even Let Me Hug","paragraphs":["\"This is good, you don't need to ask. I, your Auntie Guo, haven't had him in my heart for eight hundred years. I'm naturally fickle, falling in love with one person after another. It's not that I don't believe there are good people in this world, but I don't believe in everlasting love. Love is like a flower; it's best preserved at its most beautiful moment. I want to keep falling in love until I'm old and die; how can I stop for just one person?\" Guo Yalan said as she twisted her hair into her hand.","Han Ziyu was dumbfounded, hearing and seeing someone actually live out such a philosophy for the first time.","If love were all like what Qi Li had with Guo Yalan, then Han Ziyu would naturally disdain it, feeling it was even worse than Guo Yalan's approach. But...","\"I think Teacher Ji and her husband are doing just fine.\"","Guo Yalan chuckled and tapped Han Ziyu's nose, saying, \"I'm talking about normal people. Qin Xian, and that... Yu Yue, they're all freaks; they can't be included in normal patterns. Normal people's love is just like that; it's passionate at first, but after it wears off, it's just ugly. If there's a harmonious way to get along, it might last a bit longer.\"","Han Ziyu was a bit upset that Guo Yalan called her idol's husband a freak, but she understood it was just a playful jab from her friend and didn't get angry. She just didn't understand why they suddenly started talking about this.","Guo Yalan was getting a bit impatient now; before, the thought hadn't crossed her mind, so she didn't feel anything, but now that she had taken action, she couldn't stop.","\"Alright, enough of that. Have you recovered from your allergy?\"","\"Yeah, I'm fine now.\"","Guo Yalan suddenly asked, \"Allergic to lemons?\"","Han Ziyu's heart skipped a beat, \"Uh, yes, isn't that a coincidence?\"","Yes, very coincidental. If this were a TV drama, they'd probably be sisters. But Han Ziyu had heard from Qi Li that Guo Yalan's parents had a harmonious relationship and were a happy family of three. And she herself also had parents, who were very similar to her mother and also allergic to lemons. So this fantasy was basically impossible.","However, Han Ziyu optimistically thought that maybe there was some ancestral connection, which could be considered a kind of fate.","Guo Yalan's expression grew even more complicated, but she didn't say much. She added Han Ziyu's contact information and then asked, \"Do you still have work to do?\"","Han Ziyu nodded.","Guo Yalan sighed, \"If Qi Li bothers you again, ask Ji Fei for help. She's a good person and seems to like you a lot. Plus, Qi Li wouldn't dare to mess with Qin Xian.\"","Han Ziyu blinked, feeling a strange sense of being protected by Guo Yalan. \"Aren't you coming?\"","Guo Yalan smiled, \"I'll find you later. I have something to do right now.\"","Han Ziyu looked at Guo Yalan curiously but didn't pry.","After that, they went downstairs, and Guo Yalan called a car and left, immediately calling her connections back in the country to arrange the quickest paternity test.","Then she had someone investigate Han Ziyu's background and family. The people who knew Han Ziyu's situation were definitely related to Qi Li, since it was Qi Li who found Han Ziyu.","This roundabout way of doing things alerted someone close to Qi Li.","The person even joked that it seemed Guo Yalan still had feelings for him, not wanting to give him to someone else. Immediately, she was actively inquiring about the substitute, worried that she might pose a real threat.","But Qi Li, looking at Han Ziyu returning, had a moment of doubt.","After all, Han Ziyu's simple background didn't seem to warrant such thorough investigation. Was it really necessary to go to such lengths for a rival in love?","At least in his perception, Guo Yalan wasn't that kind of person.","Could it be that she really took a liking to her and wanted to investigate her?","Qi Li quickly shook his head to dispel this absurd thought.","But seeing Han Ziyu return with a heavy heart, as if really troubled, it must be that Guo Yalan had finally started to act.","Now it was Qi Li's turn to feel a bit annoyed, as he was starting to feel... a bit reluctant to part with Han Ziyu.","Who should he choose?","Qi Li couldn't help but get up and walk towards Han Ziyu.","Han Ziyu, catching a glimpse of him out of the corner of her eye, felt like she was facing a great enemy and immediately turned to leave. But she was called back.","When Han Ziyu turned around, her face was already stern.","Qi Li, however, thought she was upset, and said, \"Did she trouble you?\"","\"No.\"","\"Stubborn.\"","Han Ziyu: ...#¥@&*","\"If you're really upset, tell me. I... I'll talk to her. Where is she?\" Qi Li asked, puzzled, not seeing Guo Yalan return.","\"Sister Yalan had something to do and left. Also, Sister Yalan and I are fine, please don't make wild guesses about our relationship.\" If she could, Han Ziyu really wanted to grab his shoulders and shake him to wake him up.","Qi Li, however, didn't listen to the latter part of the sentence. Hearing that Guo Yalan had left, his face changed immediately, and he turned to leave.","【I see, on one hand, he can't let go of Han Ziyu, and on the other, when he hears that Guo Yalan has left, he regrets and wants to chase after her. Is he determined to set himself up for a female-centric tragedy? I really want to tell him that he thinks he's making a choice, but the two of them aren't even on the list!】","Qin Xian, although not fully understanding what a female-centric tragedy entails, really felt that Qi Li's behavior of going back and forth was indeed problematic.","Qi Li went to grab his phone and stepped outside to make a call.","However, Guo Yalan, anxiously waiting for the results, had no time to deal with him.","Qi Li felt that Guo Yalan must be really angry, probably having heard about his interactions with Han Ziyu, so she was even more concerned.","If that's the case, Qi Li felt he shouldn't have been distracted by Han Ziyu, as Guo Yalan was the one he had loved for years.","Qi Li found a place to think about life in a somewhat dejected manner.","【Looks like both Qi Li and Guo Yalan are waiting for a result. I wonder if I can finish this drama today.】","Ji Fei thought idly as she lay on her float.","Ji Fei, who had been lying comfortably on her float, was suddenly knocked off by a wave caused by someone diving nearby.","But Ji Fei didn't choke, as Qin Xian quickly caught her and led her to the edge.","Ji Fei was a bit dizzy but soon perked up.","Qin Xian was about to ask how Ji Fei was doing when he heard her thoughts.","【This feeling of being held, this chest, this back, this feeling of using the whole body to experience the muscular lines and hidden strength, amazing! Hehehe, I was so focused on the drama that I overlooked the main point of this trip.】","Qin Xian: ...","Although his muscles tensed a bit, his embrace tightened gradually.","It could be said that this was the first time they were so close.","There was almost no distance between them except for Ji Fei's swimsuit, and their body heat was exchanging in the water.","Before they knew it, they had reached the edge, and Ji Fei was happily enjoying the embrace of a handsome man. The strange sense of security and comfort made her feel so at ease that she didn't want to move.","Qin Xian naturally didn't want to let go either; the person in his arms filled the void in his heart, wishing time could stop at this moment.","The two of them held each other without caring about anyone else.","However, soon, Qin Xian's face suddenly changed, and he quickly pushed Ji Fei away.","Ji Fei, who was almost lulled to sleep, was woken up and couldn't help but complain, \"What's the matter? Can't I be held for a while?","【He even says he likes me, but he won't even let me hug him?】"]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256: Where does he get the nerve to make such a request","paragraphs":["Qin Xian was immediately flushed with embarrassment when asked, stammering out an excuse, \"I thought you were going to fall asleep and catch a cold.\"","He then whispered softly, \"I'll let you hold me when we get back.\"","Ji Fei was now fully awake and equally embarrassed, realizing she had unconsciously assumed she could hold him whenever she wanted.","She habitually avoided the topic, saying, \"It could indeed make you catch a cold, so let's go up.\"","Qin Xian didn't mind Ji Fei's response, as his current situation was not ideal.","Just holding his wife for a moment had made him feel uncomfortably hot. He was used to it, but the close proximity had caused him to lose control.","The unfamiliar sensation made him feel embarrassed, as if he had done something shameful, and he feared Ji Fei would notice, so he quickly distanced himself.","Fortunately, he had calmed down by now.","As Ji Fei ascended safely, Qin Xian arranged everything for her at the lounge chair without needing any help from the staff, ensuring she was comfortable.","Meanwhile, others were inquiring about Cen Ting, asking why Guo Yalan was missing.","Cen Ting couldn't get in touch with her either.","The conversation soon turned to the topic of 'love triangles.'","Han Ziyu, perhaps to avoid suspicion, had stayed with the servers until Qin Xian and Ji Fei arrived.","Now that they were back, she approached to serve them.","People's gazes on Han Ziyu inevitably increased. Though she noticed, she didn't say much and just focused on her duties.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian knew the truth but couldn't reveal that Guo Yalan was involved in something very important.","Although they were aware of the outcome.","At this moment, Qi Li returned.","His expression was solemn, and he went straight to Han Ziyu, wanting to pull her aside to talk.","\"Hey...\" Ji Fei couldn't help but speak up.","\"Private matter, don't interfere,\" Qi Li said sternly, which surprised Ji Fei, as it wasn't his usual impulsive tone.","Han Ziyu was also taken aback by Qi Li's seriousness. After a moment's hesitation, she said, \"Let's talk here.\"","She didn't want to be alone with Qi Li, so she suggested they talk nearby, just lowering their voices.","Qi Li didn't object this time.","Once they were at a distance where their whispers couldn't be overheard, Qi Li spoke solemnly, \"Han Ziyu, I've realized, I have feelings for you.\"","Han Ziyu... \"Ah?\"","No way, no way, did her former boss really fall for her? What did he see in her? Wasn't he only interested in her because she resembled Yalan?","Was it because he couldn't have Yalan and turned his attention to her? Was he thinking of hiring her as a replacement again? That wouldn't do, it wasn't a proper job to begin with, and she only took it as a temporary solution. She didn't need to earn her future money this way.","\"Qi Shao, if it's about the previous...\"","\"Not like before. I'll truly be with you, give you a response, and make you my woman.\"","Han Ziyu: ...Understood, so before he paid, now he plans to freeload? That's worse than before.","Ji Fei, who had been eavesdropping through the system, also caught the key point.","[Holy crap, is this for real? Did he suddenly have an epiphany and realize he likes the replacement? Is he planning to end up with the replacement? Is this really that clichéd?]","Qin Xian was also surprised. If he had to choose, he thought Qi Li would pick Guo Yalan.","Not just them, even Han Ziyu found it quite baffling.","Before she could sternly reject Qi Li's proposal, he added a twist.","\"However, I will still reconcile with Yalan, and maybe we'll get married. I hope you don't dwell on the title.\"","Han Ziyu's mouth opened, her eyes wide.","\"What? I don't understand?\"","Qi Li frowned, looking genuinely troubled. \"This is the best solution I've thought out after much consideration. But we have to keep it from Yalan; she has a bad temper and wouldn't accept our relationship. For your sake, I feel guilty towards Yalan, but as long as you're obedient... I'll give you money, share my love with you, and you can even have a child in the future. Except for the title, I won't mistreat you.\"","Han Ziyu's expression gradually turned blank. Thinking of how Guo Yalan had taken care of her, she couldn't help but ask, \"So you mean you'll marry Yalan and keep me as your mistress, all while hiding our relationship from her?\"","\"Don't put it so harshly; it's just the way it has to be.\" Qi Li felt this was the best arrangement.","Both women liked him, and he couldn't let go of either, so why make a choice when he could have both?","Although there were many oddballs around, most of the upper class lived like this. His father had several lovers, and his mother had her own confidant, yet their family remained harmonious. Han Ziyu, with no parents or background, was the most suitable to be kept outside.","Besides, Han Ziyu was usually obedient and never overstepped her bounds, clearly aware of the gap in their status, which made her feel insecure and want to leave his side. Today's unusual behavior, acting out of character, was probably due to her fear that once the real one returned, she, the replacement, would never have a chance to win his heart again.","Now he was giving Han Ziyu a sense of security; he would keep her, a promise he made.","Qi Li looked at Han Ziyu earnestly, finally letting his affection show. He was about to reach out to touch her face, fearing she might cry with joy.","But before he could, there was a loud slap.","The sound echoed through the party, instantly silencing everyone and drawing all eyes.","Ji Fei, who had been lying down, was so furious she sat up.","[Damn, why didn't she slap him! What kind of delusional scumbag is he dreaming up!]","Qin Xian also looked sternly at Qi Li, surprised by the worst possible outcome he had come up with.","Qi Li looked at his hand, which had been harshly slapped, now red.","But Qi Li didn't get angry. He just warned the onlookers with a glance, and they quickly looked away, pretending not to have been eavesdropping, though they indeed couldn't hear anymore.","\"I can understand your dissatisfaction, but this is the most I can offer.\"","Han Ziyu stared at Qi Li, her eyes almost red with anger.","[Hit him, beat him, I'll back you up, such a despicable jerk, won't wake up without a beating. How dare he make such a demand?]","Ji Fei was about to get up, even if she couldn't say anything, at least to pull Han Ziyu away, fearing she might get so angry she'd faint. But Qin Xian stopped her, gesturing towards the distance.","Guo Yalan was approaching rapidly, her face filled with excitement, clutching a roll of documents tightly in her hand.","Upon arrival, she saw Han Ziyu's red eyes, trembling with anger, and the annoying Qi Li.","Immediately assuming Qi Li was bullying Han Ziyu again, she rushed over, pulling Han Ziyu behind her.","\"Qi Li, what are you doing!\""]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257: You Probably Have Delusional Infatuation","paragraphs":["Guo Yalan's appearance also caused Qi Li's eyes to flash with a hint of panic, immediately clearing his throat, \"Nothing, just talking.\"","Qi Li was naturally nervous, as he didn't dare let Guo Yalan know about this.","\"Han Ziyu, think carefully and give me your answer,\" Qi Li hinted ambiguously.","Since no one around knew what they were talking about, Qi Li's remark at this moment left others in the dark.","He naturally assumed that Han Ziyu wouldn't disclose what had just happened, as it wasn't something worth boasting about.","Han Ziyu would surely keep it to herself and ponder over his proposal at home. Even if she felt hurt initially, as long as she was smart, she would understand that he was offering her love, a carefree future, children, and a home, just without a public title.","This was the best choice, and it also gave Han Ziyu an explanation.","Qi Li was full of confidence, thinking he had solved a big problem, and thus had no need to use Han Ziyu to provoke Guo Yalan anymore.","He could focus on reconciling with Guo Yalan.","Thinking of this, Qi Li looked at Guo Yalan, lowering his posture, ready to speak.","However, Guo Yalan didn't even glance at him, instead frowning at Han Ziyu, \"What's going on? What answer?\"","Guo Yalan's tone was questioning.","Those around them were suspicious if Guo Yalan suspected Han Ziyu of trying to steal Qi Li.","Only Ji Fei and Qin Xian knew that Guo Yalan had received the identification results, confirming that Han Ziyu was her half-sister.","【Wow, that protective stance, so Yalan really isn't blaming Han Ziyu, but rather excited about finding her sister? No wonder she's Yalan, admirable.】","Qin Xian's face also showed a hint of a smile, indeed magnanimous, truly admirable.","Han Ziyu didn't feel Guo Yalan's tone was off, she was still seething with anger.","Not only was she thoroughly disgusted by Qi Li's thoughts, but she also didn't expect Qi Li to scheme against Guo Yalan, a good woman, and even wanted to keep her as a secret lover, utterly nauseating. Previously, when she was used as a substitute, Han Ziyu felt disgusted but still thought Qi Li might be deeply in love with Guo Yalan, so he was acting out of character.","Now, it had come to this, making Han Ziyu feel even more nauseated, and any gratitude for the high-paying job was completely gone.","Han Ziyu didn't answer Guo Yalan's question, instead glaring sharply at Qi Li, \"You heard me, I don't need to think, I refuse.\"","Qi Li was momentarily stunned, \"What?\"","\"I said, I refuse your proposal!\" Han Ziyu shouted angrily.","Before Qi Li could show an impatient expression, Han Ziyu turned and pulled Guo Yalan, \"He wants to reconcile with you, marry you, and then have me as his secret lover, he wants to have his cake and eat it too.\"","Her loud accusation left the entire party in complete silence.","Everyone stared in shock, unable to believe that Qi Li had just been talking to Han Ziyu about such a thing.","And now it had been exposed in front of everyone?","Wait, how could Han Ziyu be so blunt about it... Could such a thing be openly discussed?","Oh, no, Han Ziyu's boldness proved that she had no intention of agreeing, right?","So all those times everyone thought Han Ziyu was pining for Qi Li and having a tantrum were fake?","Constantly brainwashed by Qi Li's created atmosphere and a few words, everyone's minds were buzzing with confusion, and they were also embarrassed by the unfolding events, their toes curling in discomfort.","Was this something they should be hearing?","Should they be avoiding this?","But... such a big scandal, how could they not enjoy it in the moment!","Everyone was eagerly awaiting the next development.","Ji Fei was so excited by Han Ziyu's outburst that she hugged Qin Xian tightly.","But on the surface, she still looked shocked, \"Ah? How could Qi Li be like this?\"","Qin Xian let Ji Fei hold him, while supporting her to prevent her from falling off the chair in her excitement.","Other friends also had mixed expressions, although they knew Qi Li was a rascal, they didn't expect him to make such a decision.","After all, Guo Yalan was also their friend. If Qi Li really fell for Han Ziyu, they wouldn't mind, but Qi Li couldn't have his cake and eat it too, humiliating Guo Yalan.","Guo Yalan stood frozen for a full thirty seconds after hearing this.","Then she mechanically looked at the stunned Qi Li.","This... this fool actually dared to think of taking both of them?!","How many guts did he have?","What a fool she was to have dated him, not only leaving a stain on herself but also bringing trouble to her sister.","Originally, Guo Yalan's feelings towards Han Ziyu were complex. She was happy to learn of this blood relation, but it was impossible not to feel hurt knowing Han Ziyu was born from that woman's betrayal of their father. Still, the excitement of finding a sister outweighed the discomfort.","Added to that, her failed relationship had brought such trouble to her sister, her guilt completely overshadowed any resentment.","Now, this shameless man dared to scheme against them, making her sister so angry, he was asking for it!","Guo Yalan glared angrily at Qi Li, and before he could react, she stepped forward and swung her arm.","Two resounding slaps echoed through the party, stunning everyone and knocking Qi Li to the ground.","Qi Li clutched his cheek, completely dumbfounded, unable to understand how things had turned out this way. Almost instinctively, he looked at Han Ziyu, \"Are you crazy? Who told you to say that! Do you still want to be with me?\"","【Holy crap! Guess his brain isn't clear yet.】","\"How dare you do it but not own up?\" Han Ziyu retorted even angrier, \"Be with you? Can you pour the water out of your head and look at your face? What makes you think I'd ever look at a man as messed up as you? Please stop fantasizing, stop being so self-absorbed, I never liked you, okay? I've said it so many times, can't you understand or just don't want to? If you keep harassing me, I'll call the police!\"","Han Ziyu's outburst stunned everyone again.","Before, no matter what Han Ziyu said, Qi Li always thought she was speaking in reverse, saying things out of anger. When asked by others, he would always act high and mighty, saying Han Ziyu was just throwing a tantrum with him.","Now, Han Ziyu had practically torn off his face.","\"You... you say that, don't regret it!\" Qi Li fumed.","\"Xiao Yu has made it so clear, and you still think she's just throwing a tantrum with you? I didn't know you were so delusional before. Tell me, how does Xiao Yu need to prove it for you to understand she doesn't like you? Or are you so self-absorbed that no matter what she proves, you'll still think she likes you and is doing everything to get your attention? Please, go see a doctor, you probably have a delusion of love!\" Guo Yalan also let loose, not sparing Qi Li any face."]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258: Aren't You... Liking Her","paragraphs":["The people around them were a bit disoriented as they listened to the two women sing in unison, working together to target Qi Li.","How to put it, they seemed not only physically similar but even their manner of scolding was so alike.","It was truly fascinating.","Qi Li, however, was genuinely triggered. After all, he wasn't sure if Guo Yalan still had feelings for him, but how could Han Ziyu, a young girl still in school, possibly not like him?","\"How could you not like me? You've been by my side for so long. If it wasn't for liking me, how could a woman easily agree to be someone else's stand-in!\" Qi Li was desperate, frantically trying to prove himself.","Others thought it made sense. Being a stand-in, if not for love, then for climbing the social ladder. Otherwise, who would be so self-deprecating?","If it was for climbing the social ladder, there was no reason to refuse being Qi Li's mistress now.","But then again, if it was love, how could things have gotten so ugly?","The crowd was truly confused.","Han Ziyu snorted coldly, \"Since you brought this up, it's not me breaking the contract. Don't you remember how we started? It was an employment contract. You hired me to play Sister Yalan for a month, fifty thousand yuan. I was just working for a salary. If it weren't for the orphanage being on the verge of collapse, I wouldn't have taken this job. It was a clear-cut employment relationship. Why would you think I should like you? Did I act too realistically, work too diligently? And our contract has expired, yet you continue to harass me. Isn't that going too far!\"","This revelation was like a thunderbolt.","Although they had previously thought Han Ziyu would benefit a lot from being with Qi Li, this clearly marked employment contract was a completely different story.","\"Isn't Qi Li too funny? He hired someone himself and forgot?\"","\"So it was a monthly salary. No wonder she left so decisively.\"","\"Now I can understand Han Ziyu's attitude today. It's like dealing with a former boss.\"","\"Qi Li just thought those two would fight over him. I can't help but laugh.\"","\"I always thought Qi Li was narcissistic, but I didn't expect it to be this bad.\"","\"So, out of the three, only Lily truly likes Qi Li?\"","\"Too bad, Qi Li picked and chose, but only Lily wanted to be chosen.\"","\"The previous drama was all a solo act, wasn't it? I can't help but laugh when I think about it.\"","The onlookers were thoroughly entertained.","Qi Li's friends felt utterly embarrassed. After all, Qi Li had shown off so much in front of them, making them think of Han Ziyu as: such a devoted stand-in who could never gain Qi Li's emotional response, how pitiful.","Who would have known it was all an act paid for by Qi Li?","They felt both angry and humiliated, unable to look at Qi Li without cringing. But thinking about how Qi Li had deluded himself, they couldn't help but laugh and feel annoyed.","Ji Fei, on the other hand, was ecstatic, jumping up and down.","【Finally, the truth is out! Ahhh, I've been holding it in, hahaha!】","Qin Xian quickly pulled Ji Fei into his arms as she bounced on the chair, but she was still laughing uncontrollably, her eyes curved and sparkling.","Qin Xian was momentarily lost in her gaze, though he knew those emotions weren't for him.","Qi Li's mind was still reeling from Han Ziyu's sudden confession.","In his mind, paying Han Ziyu was his way of preventing her from liking him. After all, that amount of money meant nothing to him. He never thought she would take the job because she desperately needed the money, willing to endure any work.","He had thought the money was just an excuse, a way to avoid emotional entanglement.","Little did he know, it was all his own self-delusion.","Even with his questionable judgment, he could now clearly see the genuine disgust in Han Ziyu's eyes.","Instantly, the humiliation and anger washed over him, but what angered him even more was that he had developed feelings for her.","Qi Li leaped up, wanting to rush to Han Ziyu to ask if she had ever felt anything for him. He couldn't accept the reality in front of him.","But Guo Yalan stood in his way.","\"Why... why are you doing this? I once treated her as your stand-in. Shouldn't you hate her?\" Qi Li was forced to face reality again as Guo Yalan showed no intention of opposing Han Ziyu.","She was against him!","\"Qi Li, get this straight. The only one doing disgusting things here is you. You want to have your cake and eat it too? You're such a scumbag. I'm officially declaring here that neither of us likes you, we both hate you. Stay away from us, or watch out for my slap, you scumbag!\"","Qi Li's eyes turned red with fury.","Suddenly, he saw Guo Yalan take Han Ziyu's hand and shield her, acting as if she were protecting her very soul. A lightning bolt struck his mind, and he exclaimed in horror and disbelief, \"You... you like her, don't you? That's why you two are teaming up against me!\"","The more Qi Li thought about it, the angrier he became, feeling like he had been double-crossed, his anger reaching its peak.","The previously chattering crowd fell into an eerie silence once again.","【Hahahahahaha, he really thinks that? His imagination is as big as ever.】","Ji Fei was laughing so hard she was rolling in Qin Xian's arms.","But Qin Xian was starting to worry. After all, there was the issue of them being related that needed to be addressed privately. And now...","The suppressed laughter from the crowd finally burst out, making Qi Li realize no one believed him. He immediately shouted in anger, \"You never minded liking women before, that's what you said yourself. And when have you ever felt such an instant connection with someone? You didn't like it when people imitated you before, let alone someone who looks so much like you. The way you're protecting her is just strange. Do you like her? Have you fallen for her!\"","His hastily pieced-together arguments made some people start to doubt.","After all, Guo Yalan's level of protection for someone was hard to explain by mere good looks or a sense of justice.","The crowd's eyes darted between Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu.","Guo Yalan had been accused of liking men before, but this was the first time she was accused of liking a woman. Did she ever say such things? She didn't remember, probably just casual talk.","\"You really need to get your head checked,\" Guo Yalan said, exasperated.","\"If you don't admit it, then why are you being so nice to her?!\" Qi Li raged, \"We've known each other for years, and we were once in a relationship...\"","Qi Li's point was that Guo Yalan, being the kind of person who should side with her own, should be biased! Why was she helping Han Ziyu against him? Even that abnormal Ji Fei hadn't stepped forward!","Unless their relationship was deeper than anyone imagined."]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259: Your mother is indeed me... my biological mother","paragraphs":["Guo Yalan's eyes were rolling so hard they almost reached the ceiling. She was about to mock, but seeing the uncertain looks from the people around her, she hesitated. Han Ziyu, whom she was holding onto, also seemed to stiffen for a moment.","Guo Yalan couldn't help but feel a mix of amusement and frustration. Did her sister actually worry that she might be interested in her?","Han Ziyu was genuinely shocked. After all, she didn't know Guo Yalan as well as Qi Li did, so she wasn't sure if what Qi Li said was true or not. But it was true that Guo Yalan was the only person who had been so kind to her from the very first meeting.","Looking back, although they clicked, Guo Yalan's proactive kindness was a bit baffling. Moreover, Han Ziyu herself felt a bit guilty. She had liked other boys before, and the feeling she had for Guo Yalan was different. But this was the first time she had felt such a strange and wonderful attraction to a woman she had just met. So, she was also a bit lost.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian knew the reason behind it, but they weren't sure if Guo Yalan would explain it.","【I've heard before that people with blood relations, if they don't know each other, might feel an unusually strong affinity upon first meeting. Of course, if this affinity isn't clearly understood, it could lead to misunderstandings.】","Ji Fei let her thoughts wander for a while, and by then, Guo Yalan had made up her mind. Although this wasn't part of her original plan.","She raised her hand and threw the documents she was holding straight at Qi Li's face.","\"Open your dog eyes and look clearly! What kind of nonsense is in your head? Compared to you, of course, I'd be more inclined to care for her!\"","After saying that, Guo Yalan ignored Qi Li's reaction and turned to Han Ziyu.","\"Xiao Yu, I'm sorry. I was planning to tell you privately, but this idiot messed everything up! Now that things have come to this, if I don't clarify it in public, others might be misled by this fool into thinking there's something strange between us. I don't care about my reputation, but I can't let this fool ruin yours. So, I'll announce it now: you are my half-sister, my biological mother's daughter.\"","Guo Yalan's words were like a thunderclap on a clear day.","Everyone began to wonder if they were all hallucinating. How could there be such a shocking revelation?","\"Qi Li found a stand-in for Guo Yalan, but it turns out to be her sister?\"","\"Half-sister? They share the same mother? Wait, my brain can't keep up.\"","\"Is Guo Yalan joking? She's always been one to say anything.\"","As they were talking, Qi Li suddenly shouted, \"How is that possible?!\"","At that moment, someone with sharp eyes noticed the content of the documents.","It's a professional verification. They really are related by blood.","\"I knew it! How could it be such a coincidence? They look so much alike.\"","\"Wow, this is... huge news.\"","Except for Ji Fei and Qin Xian, who didn't rush over, the other friends gathered around Qi Li.","\"It's true!\" Luo Fei exclaimed in astonishment.","\"Today's information overload is just too much.\" Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue were both shocked. Could there be such a coincidence in the world?","Jing Yan's mouth twitched. What kind of situation was this? Qi Li had previously planned to mess with both sisters.","Cen Ting was astonished and asked, \"Yalan, did your family have a lost child?\"","Han Ziyu suddenly spoke up, \"How is that possible?! I have parents, I...\"","The news was too shocking, and Han Ziyu couldn't easily accept it.","Guo Yalan held Han Ziyu's hand and said seriously, \"Your mother is indeed my... biological mother. My current mother is my stepmother. This information just hasn't been widely known in the country. The moment I saw you, I felt a strong connection, which I believe is the effect of blood ties. I took a strand of your hair for a verification out of suspicion, and there's no mistake. We are truly sisters.\"","Guo Yalan continued, a bit nervous, \"Don't you want me as your sister? Your parents are gone, and I'm your only relative now. I didn't know about your existence before, and I let you suffer in the orphanage for so many years. Don't worry, from now on, no one will ever let you suffer again.\"","Based on Guo Yalan's investigation of Han Ziyu, the two sisters had similar tragic lives.","When she was five, her mother left, and when Han Ziyu was four, her mother died. Neither of them had ever experienced complete maternal love. Truly a pair of unfortunate sisters.","But Guo Yalan had a great father and stepmother, living the life of a wealthy young lady, while Han Ziyu had grown up in a poor orphanage, lonely and struggling.","Imagining the hardships Han Ziyu had endured, and now, for money, willingly playing the role of a stand-in, Guo Yalan felt nothing but heartache.","Guo Yalan, who had always been bold and unrestrained, was now looking at Han Ziyu with the most tender and loving gaze, almost cautiously.","Han Ziyu, who couldn't handle it, realized that her fondness for Guo Yalan was indeed a blood-related bond.","Thinking about it this way, it didn't seem so hard to accept.","It was almost like a pie falling from the sky.","Han Ziyu was overwhelmed by a mix of emotions and felt a bit dazed.","\"You really don't want me as your sister?\" Guo Yalan even started to act pitiful.","Han Ziyu immediately shook her head, \"No, I want...\"","Then she felt both awkward and embarrassed.","\"Then call me sister,\" Guo Yalan's eyes sparkled, her lips slightly trembling, as if eagerly anticipating something wonderful.","Han Ziyu paused, and under Guo Yalan's expectant gaze, she finally called out, \"Sister.\"","In an instant, Guo Yalan's eyes welled up with tears.","Their friends, who had never seen Guo Yalan like this, were all stunned.","Seeing Guo Yalan's red eyes, Han Ziyu also felt her own eyes welling up, as if she could feel her sister's emotions and wanted to cry.","\"Sister!\" Guo Yalan also called out solemnly, then reached out and hugged Han Ziyu tightly.","It was truly a touching scene of sisterly love.","Most of the people, besides being shocked and amazed by the gossip, didn't really understand Guo Yalan's actions.","After all, could an ordinary person accept so easily a child their own mother had with someone else?","But Guo Yalan wasn't an ordinary person.","She knew that she would never get married or have children in this lifetime. Finding a blood relative, especially such a lovely and similar-looking sister, made it impossible not to like her.","Look, her sister was so good, obedient and well-behaved, so easily accepting her as a sister. She had really hit the jackpot.","Even Ji Fei was a bit touched and took the lead in applauding to celebrate.","The others looked at Ji Fei, then at Qin Xian, who was also clapping, and gradually joined in with the applause.","\"Congratulations on successfully recognizing your sister!\" Ji Fei said happily.","Guo Yalan immediately introduced her sister, saying, \"This is my sister, everyone, remember that!\" while affectionately stroking Han Ziyu's head.","Han Ziyu was still a bit dazed, feeling that everything had happened too quickly.","As they turned to face the disheartened Qi Li, Guo Yalan warned again, \"Remember, I was the one who dated you. My sister was only hired by you as an actress for a while. If you dare to spread rumors about my sister again, I'll break your legs!\""]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260: Qi Li dug his own grave","paragraphs":["Qi Li was still in a state of disbelief, his eyes darting frantically between the two people in front of him.","Just as he was about to say something, he heard someone call out, \"Qi Li, are you here?\"","Everyone turned to look and saw four burly men standing at the entrance of the swimming pool. Somehow, they looked vaguely familiar.","Qi Li's mind was still buzzing, and as he turned his head, he felt like he recognized them, yet also didn't. Impatiently, he snapped, \"What is it? Talk later!\"","\"He's here indeed! We're Lily's brothers, and we need to talk to you!\"","Without another word, the four men walked over.","[Lily's brothers? Wait... oh no, Qi Li is done for. So Lily has four brothers who are not exactly law-abiding but are fiercely protective of their sister. Hearing Lily's story, they learned that Qi Li had toyed with her feelings, so they rushed over to cause trouble. These guys are reckless, and once they get worked up, they don't care about the relationships between the big families. Normally, when Lily pursued Qi Li and he ignored her, it was fine, but this time, he used her and left her in a sorry state. How could her brothers not seek revenge? It seems Lily has finally seen through him. Hmm? Wait, just now, I was the one who poured the wine...]","Hearing this, Qin Xian immediately felt that the situation was getting out of hand. The men's eyes were filled with hostility.","Qin Xian first subtly shielded Ji Fei behind him and quickly called over a waiter. Although the men hadn't made a move yet, it was better to be safe than sorry, so he asked for security to be on alert.","But before the security arrived, the four burly men had already started to act.","The first punch came flying, and Qi Li was knocked over, toppling a nearby table of drinks.","The crowd screamed and scattered.","In such a situation, Luo Fei, Jing Yan, Yu Yue, and Qin Xian, being the four men among them, naturally couldn't stand by and do nothing. Even though Qi Li deserved it, they couldn't just watch him get beaten up.","However, despite their timely intervention, Qi Li was still left with a bruised and swollen face, his anger turning into humiliation, and he almost cried.","This night would be a scar he would never forget, both physically and emotionally.","The security arrived and restrained the men.","The four brothers continued to curse and yell, calling Qi Li a scumbag. In the end, the police were called, and both the Qi family and Lily's family showed up, turning the whole affair into a huge joke.","The swimming pool party naturally came to an end. But the gossip spirit didn't dissipate. It was estimated that after tonight, the elite circle would be buzzing with yet another scandal.","Everyone changed back into their clothes and waited at the entrance of the club for their rides.","Seeing Guo Yalan take Han Ziyu away alone, everyone was still in a daze.","\"They really are sisters,\" Jing Yan said.","\"Yalan seemed really happy,\" Cen Ting added. \"She even said she would bring her sister to my engagement party.\"","Bai Xiaoxi widened her eyes in curiosity and asked, \"Do you think... Qi Li will dare to come to the engagement party in a week?\"","\"I bet he won't,\" Yu Yue chuckled.","Luo Fei said, \"You could say that in the end, Qi Li dug his own grave.\"","As they were talking, they heard a louder discussion nearby.","\"There she is, the judge of the entertainment industry, the queen of elite scandals!\"","\"It's really uncanny. The last time she appeared was at the Luo family's wedding, and the wedding was canceled. This time, it was just a small party, yet it turned into such a big drama. It's terrifying.\"","\"No wonder her fans are so obsessed with her. She really has some kind of divine power!\"","\"I'm starting to get obsessed with her too. I want to follow her and eat all the juicy gossip. Today's twists and turns were more exciting than ever. I can talk about this for a year.\"","\"I wonder what event she'll attend next. I want to get in early to catch the gossip.\"","\"I don't know if there will be other events, but there's a wedding coming up soon. She'll definitely be there...\"","Qin Xian's friends looked at Ji Fei and Qin Xian as they descended the steps, and then at Cen Ting, who seemed stunned.","For a moment, they didn't know what to say.","\"What's wrong?\"","As the two approached, seeing everyone looking at them strangely, Ji Fei couldn't help but ask.","Bai Xiaoxi, being the most carefree, immediately asked excitedly, \"Feifei, did you use your magical powers to make all this happen today?\"","Ji Fei: ?","Yu Yue laughed and said, \"Be careful, though. What if Qi Li snaps out of it and comes after you? Hahaha.\"","Ji Fei realized they were joking.","But how to put it, she really hadn't stirred the pot this time. She had just known some information in advance and sat back to enjoy the show.","So Ji Fei put on a pitiful face and said, \"It really has nothing to do with me.\"","Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue both had teasing expressions, clearly not believing her and again emphasizing that she must attend Yu Yue's father's Nth wedding.","Luo Fei coughed, reminding them not to go too far. They were being carefree, but if Cen Ting took offense to this talk of mysticism, it wouldn't be good.","However, if it really was mysticism, Luo Fei would genuinely be grateful to Ji Fei.","Of course, he thought it was all just a coincidence. Ji Fei simply loved to eat melon (gossip) and enjoyed joining in on the fun whenever there was a commotion.","Qin Xian also caught on and looked at Cen Ting.","Cen Ting directly said, \"If it really has something to do with you, then Guo Yalan should give you a big red envelope. However, my engagement party is coming up soon, and I need to be prepared.\"","Everyone was a bit awkward, thinking Cen Ting was really bothered by it.","\"My fiancé has quite a few dark pasts, but I don't care, as long as it doesn't get out and affect the cooperation between our families. So, our justice crusader, try not to use your powers, okay?\"","Hearing the rising tone at the end, they realized Cen Ting was deliberately joking.","Or rather, all the previous scandals had a sense of justice prevailing, but in her case with her fiancé Jing Yu, there was no such thing as justice. Even if Ji Fei discovered something shady, it didn't need to be exposed.","Because she simply didn't care. She agreed to the arranged marriage to gain the family's promise to let her pursue her passion. Since she couldn't help with the family business, she had enjoyed the benefits of her family for so many years and naturally had to pay some price.","A superficial marriage in exchange for her dream to flourish was a fair trade in her eyes.","After all, she had no interest in romantic relationships.","Hearing Cen Ting joke so rarely, everyone laughed along.","Only Jing Yan's expression gradually grew more complicated.","As the vehicles arrived one by one to pick everyone up.","Finally, only Jing Yan, Ji Fei, and Qin Xian were left.","As their car arrived, Jing Yan suddenly stepped forward impulsively, looking at Ji Fei, hesitating to speak.","\"Something on your mind?\" Qin Xian asked.","Ji Fei looked over, and Jing Yan seemed to suddenly snap out of it, his eyes flickering with panic, his teeth clenched, but he didn't speak.","Ji Fei raised an eyebrow, her expression ambiguous as she said, \"Could it be that you're also worried about the upcoming engagement party, afraid I'll mess up your cousin Jing Yu and Cen Ting's happy future?\"","Jing Yan's expression was awkward, and his eyes also flashed with self-mockery, feeling absurd, like a desperate man suddenly turning to faith.","Just as he was about to deny it, he heard Ji Fei say sarcastically again, \"Or are you hoping I'll definitely be there to use my powers and ruin the engagement party?\""]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261: They're Going to Sleep Together Tonight","paragraphs":["Jing Yan's expression suddenly changed. \"What are you talking about? I was just looking for... Qin Xian to discuss some official business. Where did you get that idea? Don't you really think you have some kind of special ability, haha.\"","\"Hahaha.\" Ji Fei also awkwardly laughed along, making the scene somewhat comical.","Qin Xian's mouth twitched. He remembered that his friend also had some juicy gossip.","Who would have thought that Jing Yan had been secretly in love with Cen Ting, but Cen Ting was about to marry his cousin.","Jing Yan wasn't the type to lack courage, so Qin Xian couldn't understand why he had liked her for so long without ever trying to pursue her.","It wasn't surprising that Ji Fei teased him like this. Even Qin Xian began to suspect that Jing Yan, desperate, was turning to superstition to help him out.","But seeing how he was trying to steer the conversation back, it was clear that it was just a momentary lapse in judgment.","Ji Fei thought the same, so she didn't expose him. After all, there was no real conflict, just a little teasing of a man who lacked courage.","It was just a small interlude. Soon, Ji Fei and Qin Xian got into the car and left.","Throughout the drive, Ji Fei kept talking non-stop, as this piece of gossip was quite explosive. Qin Xian was a good listener, satisfying Ji Fei's need to vent.","\"By the way, I'll share this with everyone,\" Ji Fei said, taking out her phone and sending a message to the family group.","Various sensational headlines kept popping up, drawing the Qin family members out.","Actually, a couple of days earlier, the Qin family had lost two members.","Qin Zhao had finally finished his work in the entertainment industry and left the country with Gao Ge.","Qin Rong also left because the foreign art academy had started.","But the Qin family's gossip circle remained lively, though everyone felt a bit lonely not being able to eat gossip in person.","This time, even Qin Zhao, who was abroad, couldn't help but complain: \"Second Sister-in-law, you really have some kind of superstition in you, huh? How did you even manage to stumble upon this?\"","Qin Yan replied: \"Should be, otherwise, you might be accompanying someone else right now?\"","Qin Zhao: \"......I'm speechless.\"","\"Second Sister-in-law must be a justice angel who fell to earth, dedicated to resolving earthly injustices,\" Qin Rong immediately said. \"Sob, I want to go home and eat gossip in person.\"","\"Ah, even we who are at home don't get the chance to eat gossip. We're too old to be included in the young people's activities,\" Qin's Mom said.","Qin's Father added: +1","Ji Fei could only send a group hug emoji to everyone.","When they got home, the remaining family members were still discussing the matter in the living room.","It was clear that not only Ji Fei's side but also the outside world had already spread the news.","Sitting on the carpet, Qin Xi suddenly looked up from her tablet and said, \"Second Aunt, it's also popping up online, and many people are mentioning you.\"","Ji Fei couldn't help but laugh and cry. It seemed that human nature was to love gossip, even among children.","Ji Fei hadn't even looked at the online information yet when Sister Pei's phone call bombarded her.","Sister Pei's information source was indeed fast.","Ji Fei couldn't understand why, even though everyone was eating gossip together, they had to pin the blame on her.","Sister Pei teased her, saying that even though she wasn't in the entertainment circle, her legend remained. Her followers were growing, and they were all die-hard fans.","Ji Fei had become the first artist in the entertainment industry with such an easily-scandalized persona that had been continuously proven not to be a persona.","She was almost becoming the gossip god.","Of course, there were also some discordant voices, such as: Ji Fei was using information from her investigation in the wealthy family to dig up gossip in advance and then hype her persona.","However, Ji Fei didn't care about this at all and continued to enjoy surfing the web.","After taking a shower and changing into her pajamas, she lay on the bed, happily eating gossip.","Suddenly, there was a knock on the door.","Ji Fei knew it was Qin Xian coming to say goodnight.","Ji Fei immediately put down all the gossip, as if it had become a conditioned reflex, and rushed to the door.","As soon as the door opened, Qin Xian, also in his pajamas, stood at the door.","He, as always, lowered his eyes and gazed at her, his gentleness seemingly overflowing from his eyes.","Ji Fei met his gaze and gradually felt overwhelmed, her heartbeat feeling off.","Qin Xian, of course, was even more out of sync, his neck turning red to his face.","Then, he suddenly spoke, \"Aren't you going to give me a hug?\" Before Ji Fei could react, he even opened his arms.","Ji Fei was stunned for a moment, not knowing how to respond.","Qin Xian's breathing almost stopped, his tone a bit disappointed, \"Don't you want to hug me anymore?\"","Ji Fei suddenly remembered that at the swimming pool, Qin Xian had said to hug her when they got back.","Ji Fei took a deep breath and looked up. The robe's neckline was slightly open, revealing the beautiful muscle lines beneath, which looked very tempting.","【Compared to not wearing a shirt in the pool and wearing a short-sleeved shirt after getting out, the robe's style also has its own charm.】","Under Ji Fei's gaze, Qin Xian's body really couldn't relax.","Meanwhile, the Qin family members who were just about to sleep: Hmm? Did we just hear something?","Ji Fei finished appreciating and felt her desire rising.","【The bolder the heart, the bigger the harvest. Since he's offering himself, I might as well take advantage of this opportunity. Wait, maybe... I can be even bolder.】","Qin Xian, on the surface, remained calm.","Inside: Bolder? Does she want to kiss?","\"Then I want to sleep while hugging you.\"","Qin Xian's pupils dilated, and his body temperature began to rise. His voice almost burned out, \"Ah?\"","Ji Fei suddenly realized there was a double meaning and quickly said, \"Just hugging, purely sleeping.\"","She remembered the situation at the swimming pool.","【Being held in Qin Xian's arms, the sense of comfort and peace was incredibly soothing. I've never tried sleeping with someone else before. I really want to try it. I'm not lusting after someone's body, nor do I want to wake up to a handsome man starting the day beautifully, and certainly not to take advantage of the situation for an abdominal muscle buffet.】","【Anyway, since we're both trying to see if we can be together, sleeping in the same bed is definitely necessary. Let's just try it out. I won't do anything to him, so it's not like I'm ruining his pure love.】","Ji Fei kept justifying her desires.","Qin Xian could only watch Ji Fei nervously and helplessly.","He was willing to give her everything, but Ji Fei was both bold and cautious. It was as if without emotions, she could act recklessly, but with emotions, she had to cherish and respect them. It was really contradictory.","Qin Xian pursed his lips and took a step forward.","Ji Fei was lost in thought when she was forced to retreat into the room.","Qin Xian stepped in one by one, and finally, the door closed.","Meanwhile, the Qin family members who were pressing their ears against their bedroom doors were already excited, their eyes gleaming.","Listen carefully!","In the small group, Qin's Father, Qin's Mom, and Qin Yan were all roaring: They're going to sleep together tonight!!!!!!!!!","Qin Zhao: !!!!!!!","Qin Rong: !!!!!!!"]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262: Qin Xian is her pillow","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's room, with its large double bed.","Qin Xian lay on it, gradually relaxing his body, leaning against the pillow, his hands gently embracing Ji Fei.","Ji Fei, on the other hand, was comfortably resting on Qin Xian's abs, one hand hugging his firm waist, the other sliding across the phone screen.","The scent unique to Qin Xian surrounded Ji Fei, enveloping her with an indescribable sense of security, making her feel like a drifting reed finding stability.","Strangely, neither of them felt awkward or uncomfortable.","Instead, they gradually felt a warmth and a natural sense of harmony that seemed to suggest they were meant to be like this, to cuddle together, as if doing so could heal both body and soul.","Qin Xian truly felt an incredible sense of happiness in this state.","He often felt dazed, as if this short year and a half had been two lifetimes.","The changed Ji Fei had become the most vivid presence in his heart.","The one he could never let go of.","\"Qin Xian, you know...\" Ji Fei suddenly looked up.","Qin Xian had been watching Ji Fei all along, so as soon as she looked up, their eyes met.","But in that instant, Qin Xian was reminded of a scene.","It was as if a proportionally smaller, adorable girl had looked up from this same perspective, smiling sweetly, \"Qin Er Ge, from now on, you're my pillow. You can't move until I fall asleep.\"","In Qin's Father and Qin's Mom's room.","The two were lying peacefully when suddenly Qin's Mom burst out laughing.","Qin's Father chuckled, \"So happy? Even though they're sleeping together, Fei Fei doesn't seem to have that intention. And that newly awakened one is also quite timid, so it's not certain if anything will happen.\" He wasn't underestimating his own son, but Qin Xian had a history of not being able to perform even when drugged!","With his slow nature, it seemed unlikely he would take the initiative to consummate the marriage.","It might take some impulsive action from the daughter-in-law to make it happen.","Qin's Mom laughed, \"No, I was just remembering the incident at the vacation villa back then. Fei Fei always had to hug a pillow to sleep, but the pillow she brought got accidentally soiled, and her mom took it to clean. Even though it was just a short nap, Fei Fei couldn't sleep without it and insisted on hugging Er Ge as a pillow.\"","Qin's Father recalled and joined in the laughter, \"Oh, that time! Hahaha, the silly boy just stayed still, acting as Fei Fei's pillow. After she woke up, Qin Xian was so stiff from poor blood circulation that it took him a while to stand up. He was sweating all over, and it scared Fei Fei so much that she cried.\"","Qin's Mom continued, \"Fei Fei thought she had crushed him and cried out, 'Qin Er Ge, don't die, I don't want you as my pillow anymore.' But back then, even though Qin Xian didn't say anything and his face was expressionless, he just stood there in front of Fei Fei, not moving, not leaving, just watching her cry. I guess he was panicking inside but just couldn't express it.\"","Qin's Father added, \"Exactly. After the pillow was returned, Fei Fei naturally stopped using Qin Xian as a pillow. But Qin Xian would silently stand by her side whenever she was about to sleep, as if ready to be her pillow at any moment.\"","Qin's Mom couldn't stop laughing, \"Too bad Fei Fei was too scared to hurt him again and refused to use Qin Xian as a pillow anymore. No matter how much she was coaxed to hug her brother, she wouldn't. I bet that boy was quite disappointed inside. Who would have thought that after all these years, they'd circle back to this.\"","The couple couldn't stop laughing.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei looked curiously at Qin Xian, seeing him staring at her blankly. She waved her hand in front of his eyes.","Qin Xian snapped back to reality, wanting to ask something but unsure how to start.","\"Tired?\" Ji Fei asked, \"Or is it uncomfortable with me lying on you? You don't have to hold me all the time.\"","Qin Xian, almost without thinking, blurted out urgently, \"It's very comfortable. You can hold me forever.\"","Ji Fei: \"Huh?\"","Wouldn't that make his half of the body go numb?","Are muscles really that resilient?","Before Ji Fei could say anything more, Qin Xian tightened his embrace, making Ji Fei even more comfortable.","Once this embrace started, it would never stop!","\"What do you want me to see?\" Qin Xian asked.","Ji Fei came to her senses and showed Qin Xian her phone, gossiping.","\"This time, it's really blown up on the trending searches. More than the previous big events.\"","Qin Xian glanced at it; indeed, almost all of them were trending.","The Qi Family Young Master had hired a stand-in, narcissistic enough to think both women loved him, and wanted to play a double game, but little did he know they were actually real sisters.","Every piece of information released was explosive. The discussion among netizens was unprecedented.","Ji Fei had originally thought these trending searches would be taken down quickly.","But this time, they stayed up for a long time.","So Ji Fei was very curious.","\"Three-way game, each with their own goals, not so easy to take down,\" Qin Xian explained.","\"Three-way?\"","\"The Qi Family, Lily's Family, and the Guo Family.\"","\"The Qi Family certainly doesn't want to lose face, so the other two families want to make it bigger?\" Ji Fei exclaimed in surprise.","\"Each has its own focus, and when they clash, no one can back down. It will probably take time to negotiate privately before it's taken down,\" Qin Xian said.","Ji Fei thought for a moment, \"Actually, I'm more curious about what Mr. and Mrs. Guo think about Guo Yalan exposing Han Ziyu.\"","Since she didn't know the couple, she couldn't remotely enjoy the gossip.","She could only enjoy the gossip about Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu.","\"They dote on Guo Yalan, and the truth can't be hidden forever. They just don't want to be high-profile, probably not trying to hide it completely. Mrs. Guo is fine, but Mr. Guo...\"","[Indeed, after all, it's the child of his ex-wife's betrayal and the man who cuckolded him. Any man would find it hard to take. Guo Yalan is also putting her father in a difficult position. Actually, Guo Yalan being so decisive in exposing their identities must be under tremendous pressure. I wonder how they're doing now? I'll check later.]","Ji Fei thought as her hand unconsciously drew circles on Qin Xian's eight-pack abs.","Suddenly, the abs beneath her hand twitched. Ji Fei came to her senses but didn't stop, pretending to continue thinking. But her thoughts betrayed her.","[Ahhh, my hand is more perverted than I thought. It's already taking advantage. When did I even pull his collar down to his waist? Huh, the feel is so good. Enjoying the body of a top-tier beauty while eating gossip. This is the perfect life. I wonder which gossip lover can enjoy this as much as I do.]","Ji Fei felt like a total pervert, thinking she should stop, but Qin Xian's silent endurance and occasional involuntary tremors only fueled her perverse desires. She wanted to continue taking advantage of Qin Xian, without any responsibility.","Just as Ji Fei was enjoying herself, the one she was teasing finally reached his limit.","Suddenly, Ji Fei's wrist was grabbed and pulled, and the embrace tightened abruptly, their breaths instantly intertwining."]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263: Can't the daughter-in-law be bolder","paragraphs":["Ji Fei's eyes met Qin Xian's, and the depth of his dark gaze seemed to pull her in. The atmosphere grew suddenly intimate.","Ji Fei stared at the unrealistically handsome face in front of her, her heart pounding like a drum. Her gaze shifted downward to his slightly parted red lips, and Ji Fei instinctively swallowed.","【So close, too close, we're about to kiss!】","Qin Xian suddenly snapped out of it. He had almost given in to his impulse... No, Ji Fei hadn't agreed to be with him yet. How could he force a kiss on her against her will?","In Qin Xian's mind, Ji Fei held the power of choice. She could do anything to him, but he couldn't act like a scoundrel.","【What's he suddenly doing? Is his male instinct kicking in? Should I resist or not? If I lift my head now, I might accidentally kiss him.】","Qin Xian's Adam's apple rolled, and his tense breath escaped from his lips, unconsciously alluring.","But someone was too cowardly to act, only indulging in fantasies.","\"What... what's wrong? Are you ticklish? I didn't mean to.\"","Qin Xian lowered his eyes. Why couldn't his wife be bolder?! Ugh... okay, he wasn't either!","\"It's fine. It's late, we should rest.\" Qin Xian's voice was still hoarse, his body stimulated but still trying his best to restrain himself, afraid of scaring Ji Fei.","Seeing that he wasn't pursuing the matter, Ji Fei quickly lay down, \"Mm-hmm.\" But after lying down, she couldn't help but turn over and hug Qin Xian.","Strange, it felt so comfortable to hold him.","Since Qin Xian had agreed, it seemed like it was her right.","Qin Xian turned off the light, covered Ji Fei with a blanket, and the moonlight streaming through the window still allowed them to see each other's outlines.","Qin Xian looked at Ji Fei, who blinked.","\"Close your eyes.\"","Ji Fei wanted to say something, but Qin Xian suddenly leaned down and placed a gentle kiss on her forehead before saying, \"Goodnight.\"","Ji Fei felt a surge of emotion.","\"Goodnight.\"","They slept well that night, while the other three parties were sleepless, especially Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu.","Guo Yalan had already taken Han Ziyu back to her temporary hotel room. Excited and thrilled, the two sisters talked all night.","Having been separated for many years, they had a lot to catch up on.","Guo Yalan didn't hide anything and told Han Ziyu everything about the past.","\"Dad and she got together for love, but Grandpa and Grandma didn't accept someone from a mismatched background, so they eloped, got married, and she got pregnant with me. In the end, Grandpa and Grandma had no choice but to let them keep their marriage secret until Dad achieved certain business goals, allowing them to go public. To meet the family's expectations and ease the pressure on her, Dad worked so hard he barely had time to sleep. But she couldn't stand being lonely and missing Dad's company, so she cheated with her first love. After Dad found out, she found a way to run off with her lover. The scar on my waist is from when she fled and refused to take me with her, pushing me down the stairs. I broke my bones and got this scar from surgery.\"","Guo Yalan lifted her shirt to show Han Ziyu.","The scar was very noticeable, as Guo Yalan had deliberately kept it to remind herself never to forgive that woman.","Han Ziyu was emotionally overwhelmed by the heartless past, and seeing Guo Yalan's scar, tears immediately streamed down her face.","She couldn't imagine how painful it must have been for Guo Yalan to be abandoned by her own mother.","\"Don't you want to ask anything?\" Guo Yalan asked bitterly.","Han Ziyu looked at Guo Yalan in confusion.","Guo Yalan sighed, \"I'm saying all these bad things about that woman, and you don't even doubt me?\"","Han Ziyu lowered her eyes and remained silent for a while before speaking, \"Actually, I have some fragmented memories from childhood. Maybe... it's karma. They didn't live well afterward. Life was full of struggles, and I remember Mom always complaining about Dad. When she drank, she'd cry and say she regretted it, arguing all the time. Sometimes she'd take it out on me.\"","Guo Yalan immediately grew anxious, \"She hit you?\"","Han Ziyu hesitated, then rolled up her sleeve to reveal an old scar, which naturally hadn't been removed due to lack of money.","\"She once got drunk and cut me with a broken bottle piece. She said that if it weren't for my existence and Dad's deception, she could have gone back. Back then, I thought she meant going back to her single, youthful days. I didn't realize...\"","Guo Yalan exclaimed, \"Disgusting! Two daughters, and she couldn't even treat one properly. She's just a selfish, self-centered woman!\"","Han Ziyu trembled but didn't curse her mother like Guo Yalan, knowing the woman was already gone.","Guo Yalan couldn't help but hug Han Ziyu.","\"Sister, I'm sorry,\" Han Ziyu murmured.","Guo Yalan quickly replied, \"Nonsense! The one who should apologize is that woman, not you. We're both unlucky to have such a mother.\"","Han Ziyu smiled, \"At least she gave me a good sister.\"","She had thought she was all alone, but suddenly, fate had given her such an amazing, talented sister. It felt like a dream!","Guo Yalan smiled too, \"Right, the only good thing she did was leave me a good sister.\"","As they talked, the phone in Guo Yalan's hotel room rang, probably because her mobile couldn't reach her. Few people had this number.","Guo Yalan got up to answer, saying, \"It's probably my parents. They're probably just waking up over there, haha, and I bet they're already overwhelmed by the news from here.\"","Han Ziyu immediately grew nervous, her expression complex. From her perspective, she felt she didn't dare face Guo's Dad. She thought he might hate her existence.","Guo Yalan naturally picked up on Han Ziyu's tension and said, \"Don't worry, you're only related to me, not to them.\"","\"Exposing our relationship might not be good for the Guo family. It could hurt Uncle and Aunt,\" Han Ziyu said, having picked up some insights from Qi Li.","\"Haha, when I got the DNA report, I already told them. They said I could handle my own affairs,\" Guo Yalan replied.","After that, Guo Yalan picked up the phone and heard Guo's Dad's low-pressure voice, with Guo's Mom's gentle reassurances in the background.","Guo Yalan stuck out her tongue and honestly explained everything. \"What's the matter? Didn't you say I could make my own decisions?\"","\"That doesn't mean you can cause such a big commotion!\" Guo's Dad was exasperated. \"If you have the guts, clean up the mess yourself!\"","Guo Yalan made faces at Han Ziyu, who was worried, then coaxed her father.","Guo's Dad never mentioned Han Ziyu.","In fact, both Guo's Dad and Guo Yalan had been healed by Guo's Mom's presence, so they weren't upset. Guo's Dad just had no reason to care about the child that woman had outside. He didn't stop Guo Yalan from doing this, though.","It was Guo's Mom who called later, softly asking about Han Ziyu's tragic past. Guo Yalan told them everything, and Guo's Mom felt great sympathy for Han Ziyu and showed concern.","\"She's with me now, building sisterly bonds. Don't worry, I'll protect her. No one can bully my sister,\" Guo Yalan joked, then laughed, \"Mom, now that I have a sister, when are you going to give me a brother?\"","\"You're talking nonsense!\"","\"Where's the nonsense? I'm saying, now that I have a sister, you don't have to worry about me. Give me a brother soon.\" Guo Yalan laughed carefreely, making Han Ziyu feel that the family really didn't mind her sisterhood with Guo Yalan, and she gradually felt the warmth and began to smile.","If her sister really got a brother, even if it had nothing to do with her, she thought she would like him too."]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264: The Land of Tenderness, the Tomb of Heroes","paragraphs":["Ji Fei woke up in a warm embrace.","Her nose nuzzled against a firm chest, and the scent around her was pleasant.","Ji Fei felt her nose itch and rubbed it against the curve of the chest, only to feel the other person pull away slightly.","Drowsily opening her eyes, she was met with a view of a handsome man's chest, and when she looked up, the stunning beauty of his face jolted her awake.","She remembered her bold request from the night before and silently praised her own daring.","Although she didn’t often suffer from insomnia, her sleep quality varied.","She swore that in both her lifetimes, she had never slept this well.","Qin Xian was like a walking soothing incense.","“Good morning,” Qin Xian said softly, his voice carrying the unique laziness and hoarseness of the morning.","Their positions shifted, and Ji Fei moved out of Qin Xian’s embrace.","However, when Ji Fei saw Qin Xian’s slightly pale face, she couldn’t help but feel awkward.","“Not used to it? Didn’t sleep well?”","Qin Xian was taken aback, his expression a bit unnatural. “No, I slept very comfortably. Better than when I sleep alone.”","Ji Fei was suspicious. Could it be that Qin Xian usually has trouble sleeping?","This kind of complexion is considered good sleep?","Well, actually, Qin Xian didn’t sleep well. Luckily, Ji Fei couldn’t check his status with the system, or he wouldn’t be able to cover it up.","It wasn’t a matter of habit; it was just that Ji Fei was restless in her sleep, moving around a lot. She moved on her own, but she was also very clingy.","She hugged and clung to him in various ways.","At first, it was incredibly sweet, but soon it became a burden.","In fact, Ji Fei didn’t know that he had gotten up in the middle of the night.","He had never been so embarrassed to solve the problem alone.","When he went back to bed, Ji Fei clung to him again, and he barely had a chance to sleep well the entire night.","Just as he had finally calmed down his morning reaction, Ji Fei woke up, and he almost lost control again.","Of course, it wasn’t his wife’s fault; it was his lack of self-control!","“Ah!”","Suddenly, Ji Fei exclaimed.","“What’s wrong?” Qin Xian had already gotten out of bed and, hearing the sound, immediately became tense, thinking he might have accidentally left a mark on her neck. He had secretly checked and found nothing, as he hadn’t dared to apply much force, just a momentary loss of control.","“It’s half past nine!” Ji Fei exclaimed in surprise. “You’re late for work.”","Usually, when Ji Fei woke up, Qin Xian was already in the office. Their morning routines were completely different.","“It’s fine,” Qin Xian said.","Although he had already woken up, he had promised to let Ji Fei hold him until she woke up, so he didn’t wake her.","Ji Fei was stunned, sitting on the bed, staring at Qin Xian.","[Is this something Qin Xian would say? The workaholic isn’t hustling anymore? He’s fallen! Indeed, beauty misleads men. If he doesn’t work hard, then the money...]","Qin Xian: ...So money is more important, huh?","Qin Xian sighed, ignoring Ji Fei’s rambling thoughts, and tapped her forehead with his finger.","“Since you’re awake, let’s get up. We’ll have breakfast together, and don’t worry, I’ll go to work after that, no delays.”","Ji Fei chuckled awkwardly.","Qin Xian’s toiletries and clothes were in the opposite room, so he had to go back, but before leaving, he couldn’t help but ask, “Did you sleep well last night?”","Ji Fei was getting up to go wash, and upon hearing the question, she nodded. “I slept great.”","Qin Xian stood tall by the door, his long fingers resting on the doorknob, not daring to look at Ji Fei, and suggested, “Then... I’ll come be your pillow again tomorrow.”","Ji Fei paused, not immediately responding. She thought last night was just a little perk.","That said, the suggestion was quite tempting.","After some hesitation, Ji Fei finally said, “Okay, sure.”","The breath Qin Xian had been holding in his throat finally escaped.","Since Ji Fei seemed a bit hesitant, Qin Xian didn’t push his luck by asking to move his personal items in; just coming over every night to be her pillow was enough.","He believed Ji Fei would gradually accept him.","As they went downstairs together, they received the attention of the Qin family.","Even Qin Yan, who should have gone to work, stayed just to witness the miracle.","After all, their second son had slept in, and it was this late—truly a rare occurrence.","Could it be that something really happened last night, so he slept in?","But seeing Ji Fei naturally following behind, and hearing her thoughts about the gossip involving Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu, they knew nothing had happened.","Qin Xian’s parents and Qin Yan shot reproachful and disdainful glances at Qin Xian, making him stop in his tracks, utterly embarrassed.","The three of them sighed and vented in a private group chat.","Then, they happily joined Ji Fei and Qin Xian at the table for breakfast.","Although Ji Fei usually woke up late, whenever she ate, someone from the family would always join her, even if it was just for a cup of tea. They never let Ji Fei feel lonely.","They chatted about some gossip, and through Ji Fei’s thoughts, they learned about the developments.","Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu seemed to have resolved their issues. The two best friends had stayed up talking until now and were now sleeping together, still close as ever.","[It seems only Qi Li is suffering in this world. Lily’s family is throwing a tantrum, demanding Qi Li marry Lily, claiming he deceived her feelings. Anyway, Qi Li’s reputation is already ruined, so it’s better to marry into their family.]","Qin Family: Is that even possible? Would that girl even want Qi Li?","Qin Xian thought Qi Li wouldn’t agree.","[Qi’s family, however, is considering it. After last night’s confrontation, they realized Qi Li’s actions had offended the Guo family and made them a laughingstock in the circle. Qi Li probably won’t be able to marry well, so Lily might be a good match. After all, she’s a love-struck fool who would unconditionally help Qi Li.]","Qin Family: ...This is calculated. It’s hard to tell whether to feel sorry for Qi Li or not.","[Qi’s family originally planned to drag Qi Li to meet Lily to discuss the possibility of marriage, but... haha, he jumped out of the window halfway and left a note saying he’d rather die than marry a woman he doesn’t love, only to accidentally break his leg. The discussion ended there.]","Qin Family: Oh, that’s... a bit tragic. But also a bit funny, isn’t it?","Qin Xian felt a headache coming on. It seemed he would have to make time to visit this unfortunate fellow.","Sure enough, when he checked his phone, he had already received a message from Luo Fei, who had also heard about it and wanted to join Qin Xian to pay a visit.","Qin Xian asked if Ji Fei wanted to come along, but she declined, saying Qi Li had always liked to blame her for his bad luck, and if she went, he might blame his misfortune on her.","Qin Xian only made a quick stop before work, offering a few words of comfort before heading to the company to continue his diligent money-making.","However, since Qin Xian was rarely late and the reason was oversleeping, the news spread quickly. After all, the Qin Corporation’s CEO wouldn’t lie about being late, so the reason must be true.","Was their CEO finally succumbing to the charms of his wife?","They didn’t think Qin Xian would oversleep by himself; it must have been because he was with his wife!","Rumors about the couple’s growing affection began to spread, and some started betting on when they would hold their wedding.","They didn’t know that their boss was only just getting started!","Later, Qin Xian didn’t oversleep again. Ji Fei assured him that she was basically impossible to wake up, so he could get up whenever he wanted.","Although the charm of the soft bed was hard to resist, and he really wanted to stay longer, he still knew what his biggest advantage was in Ji Fei’s eyes.","A few days later, Ji Fei returned to Qin Corporation.","This time, she had a reason: to prepare a wedding gift for Cen Ting with Qin Xian, so she came to wait for him to finish work.","On the second-floor terrace, a place prone to accidents.","Qin Xian was in a meeting, and Ji Fei was enjoying some milk tea when she saw a group of people chatting and laughing as they entered.","“Don’t worry, Mr. Jing, the leading actress for this project will definitely be given priority to Wan Ru.”","“There’s no need to prioritize; I’m quite familiar with your Qin Corporation’s CEO. I just feel this is too trivial to mention.”","Ji Fei: ?","Turning to look, she saw a man with a face that resembled Jing Yan’s by about 60%, looking a bit sleazy as he hugged a woman dressed in a sexy, overly cosmetic manner.","The identity was pretty much confirmed.","【I can smell it—it's the scent of drama. Wait, no, Cen Ting once said that this level doesn't count as drama, right? It's just a bit cringe-worthy.】"]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265: Always Being the Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles","paragraphs":["Ji Fei had never met this person named Jing Yu before, although he resembled Jing Yan. Judging by his demeanor, it was clear that Jing Yu was just a spoiled rich second generation with no real worth.","Ji Fei had heard about the Jing Family from Qin Xian before.","The Jing Family had done exceptionally well in business, which was largely due to their family ethos of always prioritizing the family's overall interests. Internal squabbles were relatively rare within the family. The Jing Family's tradition was that the most capable should take the lead.","The current head of the family was Jing Yu's mother, Madam Xie Lifeng.","Jing Yu's father, the second son of the Jing Family, was average in terms of ability. He was essentially a man with small personal hobbies who stood behind his strong wife, completely uninvolved in family matters. His marriage to Madam Xie was arranged by the family, who recognized that Madam Xie, working in the company, was no ordinary woman. They wanted the second son to marry her to help manage the family business in the future.","Over the years, Madam Xie had proven her capabilities, so now, within the Jing Family, she was the one who held absolute authority.","This made Ji Fei question inwardly, *\"Madam Xie's only failure in life is probably having such a worthless son. No wonder she sent him to the entertainment industry, letting him mess around with projects as he pleases, while the main family business is left to Jing Yan. This family ethos is indeed quite clear in distinguishing between public and private matters.\"*","Jing Yan was Jing Yu's cousin, the son of the eldest son of the Jing Family. The eldest son had passed away early, and his mother had remarried, making Jing Yan something of an 'orphan' within the Jing Family. However, from the way he was gradually taking over family affairs, it was clear that the Jing Family highly valued him and intended to groom him as the future head of the family.","Ji Fei watched from a distance as Jing Yu sat down, thinking no one could see him, and placed his hand on the girl's thigh. His repulsive manner made Ji Fei feel truly sorry for Cen Ting. How could she endure marrying such a disgusting waste of a husband, even if it was a loveless marriage? Could she even eat with such a man?","Thinking of this, Ji Fei really wanted to vent his frustration about Jing Yan.","*\"Having been secretly in love for ten years, just because he was greatly cared for and cultivated by Madam Xie, his second aunt, who was willing to hand over the family business to him without any selfish motives, he felt that if he competed with his cousin for the woman his second aunt had chosen as his cousin's wife, it would be a betrayal of her kindness. He didn't want to disappoint or trouble Madam Xie, the elder he respected the most, and felt it would be ungrateful of him. That's why he's been acting like a turtle, watching the woman he loves become his cousin's wife.\"*","In this regard, Ji Fei truly disapproved of Jing Yan's actions. After all, it was a family alliance marriage. If Jing Yan had fought for it, he might have succeeded. After all, Cen Ting had said that she was just joining the Jing Family to maintain the cooperation between the two families. She implied that it didn't matter who she married. She didn't care, and she didn't mind.","But for the sake of gratitude, Jing Yan gave up his love for Cen Ting. Ji Fei could only think that this love wasn't worth much.","Fortunately, Cen Ting wasn't forced into the marriage, and she didn't like Jing Yan either, so this situation wasn't particularly distasteful.","What Ji Fei didn't know was that after she accidentally revealed these thoughts at home, the Qin family was very enthusiastic about urging Qin Xian to persuade Jing Yan. They hoped that Jing Yan and Cen Ting could end up together.","Since both were friends of Qin Xian, and since Cen Ting didn't care, wouldn't it be better for her to marry someone who loved her instead of a man who constantly played around with actresses? Although Cen Ting only wanted to maintain a surface marriage, marrying that problematic playboy would definitely lead to endless trouble.","Moreover, they believed that given the Jing Family's ethos, this wouldn't escalate into a major scandal. It was just that Jing Yan was letting his sense of gratitude tie his hands.","In this regard, Qin Xian shared Ji Fei's principle of not meddling in others' affairs. If it were someone like Luo Fei, who had been deceived and misled, Qin Xian would certainly step in to help his friend.","But this was Jing Yan and Cen Ting's own choice. They were both adults, and whatever future and consequences they faced were their own responsibility.","Ji Fei, for her part, was purely in a spectator mode, just enjoying the drama.","Over there, Jing Yu was still causing trouble for the staff. Ji Fei could tell that the so-called \"priority consideration\" was just a perfunctory gesture from the staff. Qin Corporation, which owned the entertainment company, had strict requirements for its projects. In the past, Ji Fei wouldn't have used her connections to take shortcuts, let alone others.","Moreover, Ji Fei could tell that this Miss Tech Face definitely wasn't leading lady material.","Jing Yu was trying to act like he was on good terms with Qin Xian.","*\"Wow, your cousin and your fiancée are indeed friends of Qin Xian, but it seems Qin Xian has never even met you. What a big ego.\"*","Ji Fei chuckled to herself as she complained. After all, Qin Xian wasn't the type to enjoy socializing. He wouldn't bother getting to know someone who had no real potential to be a business partner or competitor.","But to the staff, the situation was quite tricky. Although Jing Yu seemed like a spoiled second generation, he was still a young master of the Jing Family, and there was indeed a connection through Qin Xian.","Ji Fei sympathized with the staff, knowing he was afraid of offending someone and ending up shouldering the blame. The only way out for him was to be perfunctory, as he couldn't give a definite answer.","But Jing Yu, in front of his woman, insisted on getting an answer.","Seeing the staff being pushed to the brink, Ji Fei stood up and walked directly to them. \"Are you Mr. Jing?\"","The sudden appearance of a naturally beautiful woman caught Jing Yu's eye, and the hand he had placed on Wan Ru's thigh stopped moving.","With such looks, and addressing him as \"Mr. Jing,\" she must be an artist looking to curry favor.","Jing Yu had encountered many such situations, so his first thought was that she was trying to seduce him. \"Oh, and who is this beautiful lady?\"","He even stood up, ready to shake hands with her.","The staff, of course, immediately recognized Ji Fei. After all, they had seen Ji Fei several times before, almost makeup-free, unlike Jing Yu, who didn't recognize her.","Jing Yu just found Ji Fei vaguely familiar, but her natural, innocent appearance made him think she might be a new college student just entering the industry. He immediately put on a successful businessman's demeanor.","Ji Fei observed his reaction and directly exclaimed in surprise, \"Oh, you don't recognize me? I just heard you say you're very familiar with my husband. How could you not know who I am?\"","Jing Yu was stunned, and before he could react, the staff politely stood up to greet her.","\"Madam, nice to meet you.\"","\"Madam? Which madam?\" Wan Ru suddenly spoke up.","The staff immediately felt a sense of relief, knowing that their Madam President, known as the judge of the entertainment industry, the queen of gossip, and the guardian of justice, wouldn't stand by and watch them suffer.","\"This is our CEO's wife. How come Mr. Jing doesn't recognize her?\" the staff subtly mocked.","\"You're Ji Fei!\" Jing Yu was shocked. He had seen Ji Fei's looks in the entertainment industry, and she was a completely different style of beauty now.","Wan Ru, on the other hand, looked Ji Fei up and down, her eyes full of disdain.","Ji Fei hadn't paid much attention to her before, but her attitude was so obvious that even her white eyes were about to roll to the sky. Knowing her identity, she was still so arrogant and ignorant. Ji Fei was immediately curious and couldn't help but check who gave her such confidence.","*\"Huh? I thought she was just a female artist Jing Yu had hooked up with, but it turns out she's a past fling of Qin Xian's!\"*","Qin Xian, knowing his wife was here, quickly finished his meeting and rushed over, only to hear his wife's accusation as soon as he walked in.","Qin Xian: ?"]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266: This is a public challenge to my status","paragraphs":["When Qin Xian entered, his gaze locked onto his wife, almost as if he were about to sprint over.","\"Feifei,\" Qin Xian approached from behind, and before anyone could react, he directly took Ji Fei's hand. \"Sorry to keep you waiting.\"","Ji Fei was startled.","[Speak of the devil, and he shall appear. He's so handsome, it's no wonder he has so many admirers everywhere.]","Qin Xian: ...","I guess my wife is complimenting me.","\"Qin Xian, what a coincidence,\" Jing Yu said uncomfortably.","It was only then that Qin Xian turned to look at him, immediately questioning, \"Why are you here?\"","Qin Xian's tone wasn't one of friendly familiarity but rather a direct inquiry.","Qin Xian had previously learned by chance that today there was a small gathering between the Jing and Cen families, and Jing Yu should have been by Cen Ting's side, not here.","Seeing Qin Xian's unfriendly tone, Jing Yu also became displeased. He didn't consider himself inferior to Qin Xian; he just didn't like talking to him. After all, Qin Xian was close to Jing Yan, and he absolutely detested that cousin.","\"I came to discuss a collaboration, but your staff here is dragging their feet. The efficiency is just too low. A trivial matter, yet it seems I have to come and ask you personally. We do have some acquaintance, don't we? Surely such a small matter shouldn't require my personal intervention. Qin, maybe you should spend more time educating your employees.\"","The background staff member, who had been standing there silently, stiffened at the comment, feeling like he had been hit out of nowhere.","Oh, so he thinks that being from the same social circle means he doesn't need to specify the details? Just a casual mention, and Qin Xian would give him what he wants out of respect for the Jing family? And he wants to teach a lesson to the employee who annoyed him earlier? A hardworking little employee like that just deserves to be a scapegoat, huh? Ugh, I really dislike these privileged types.","Qin Xian: If my wife dislikes it, then I dislike it too.","\"What exactly is the matter? You, explain.\" Qin Xian directly turned to the employee.","The employee became even more nervous, unsure whether he should tell the truth.","\"Go ahead, it's fine,\" Ji Fei said with a smile.","The employee immediately relaxed and quickly recounted the events, also subtly indicating that everything ultimately depended on the director's choice. Even if Wan Ru had a preference, it was only valid under the same conditions. If Wan Ru was similar to other actresses, then Wan Ru, who was bringing investment, would naturally be given priority.","Hearing this, Jing Yu's face turned ugly.","It seemed he had only just realized that he had been duped by a small employee.","What made him even more uncomfortable was that, as the young master of the Jing family and the CEO of an entertainment company, he certainly had his pride. Yet, both Qin Xian and Ji Fei were acting as if they were judging right from wrong.","After listening, Qin Xian spoke directly to the employee, \"In Qin Corporation, we don't play favorites based on connections. Everything is handled fairly.\"","This was Qin Xian's consistent style of management. If a corporation always allowed shortcuts based on relationships, the internal structure would gradually rot. Due to his personality, Qin Xian didn't tolerate such practices, which was why Qin Corporation had been able to rise to new heights under his leadership.","However, in any organization, it was impossible to completely avoid such issues. So, generally, only key matters within the company or those under Qin Xian's direct supervision were handled fairly. The matter at hand was just a project under a subsidiary, which was why someone was here, wasting time with Jing Yu, rather than just rejecting him outright.","The employee, being sharp, understood that Qin Xian's words meant he supported his approach and wouldn't let him suffer because of some privileged person's complaint.","\"Yes, Mr. Qin,\" the employee said, looking at Qin Xian with admiration.","By now, Jing Yu's face was as dark as could be, his expression clearly showing his displeasure. \"Are you saying you won't even give me face?\"","Jing Yu was utterly incredulous. After all, this was someone who would be attending their engagement party in a couple of days.","\"Oh, you didn't know? I used to be an artist at Qin Corporation. No matter how much I begged my husband, he wouldn't help me. It was only after I worked independently and diligently that I got my chance to shine,\" Ji Fei said sarcastically. \"If I couldn't manage it, then you...\"","Qin Xian glanced at Ji Fei awkwardly.","If it were now, Ji Fei could ask for any resource she wanted, and he would give it to her without her even having to ask. He wasn't so rigid; as long as Ji Fei liked it, he would do whatever it took.","But thanks to Ji Fei's words, Jing Yu couldn't even muster the courage to argue, only glaring at the two of them with extreme displeasure.","At that moment, the actress Wan Ru finally spoke up, her voice dripping with artificial sweetness and a pitiful tone. \"Qin Xian gege, can't you help me? This is my first big screen debut! Can't you give me a hand?\"","[Qin Xian gege?! My skin is crawling! And just now, I said that even I, the legitimate wife, couldn't manage it, yet you jump out and ask if you can't either? You're openly challenging my position!]","Qin Xian shuddered. Was this the \"bad peach blossom\" she mentioned earlier?","It was only then that Qin Xian looked at the person in front of him, suddenly frowning. \"Who are you? Please show some restraint. Addressing me like that makes me uncomfortable.\"","\"Pfft!\"","\"Pfft...\"","Why were there two laughs? Because the employee, who had been secretly watching and eating popcorn, also couldn't help but laugh out loud.","This time, Wan Ru's face was even worse than Jing Yu's, as if Qin Xian's words had hit her like a thunderbolt, causing her to sway and her eyes to instantly redden.","\"Qin Xian gege, you...\"","\"Please stop using inappropriate titles,\" Qin Xian said, his tone serious and warning.","\"Qin Xian, are you kidding?\" Even though the girl he brought seemed to have some hidden intentions toward Qin Xian, Jing Yu didn't mind and even defended Wan Ru.","This time, even Ji Fei felt strange, as Qin Xian didn't seem to be deliberately humiliating them.","[Strange, even if they're not close, Qin Xian should recognize her, right? Qin Xian isn't face-blind. Didn't he recognize her as Jing Yan's half-sister from his mother's remarriage? So, she's Jing Yan's half-sister... another half-sibling from the same mother. The intricate web of relationships among the wealthy families is indeed complicated.]","Ji Fei's self-amusing banter caused Qin Xian to pause.","Then, Qin Xian said incredulously, \"Are you Jing Yan's sister?\"","He had seen her before, but hadn't remembered her name.","Wan Ru finally caught her breath, about to feel relieved, when Qin Xian added, puzzled, \"Why do you look so different?\"","\"Pfft!\"","This time, only Ji Fei laughed, while the employee, for the sake of his job, managed to hold it in.","Now, Wan Ru's face alternated between green and white. That's because she had indeed changed her appearance, not just her face but her entire figure, which was full of \"technology.\"","But she never expected that after all her efforts to become beautiful, she would still face such embarrassment.","Finally, she could only force herself to say, \"It's the trend now, Qin Xian gege. Don't you think I've become prettier?\" She even turned around to show off.","Qin Xian shook his head without hesitation and, out of respect for Jing Yan, politely suggested, \"Your taste in aesthetics needs improvement.\""]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267: Maybe Now We're CP Fans","paragraphs":["This was the moment Wan Ru truly couldn't hold it together anymore.","\"Does Brother Qin Xian think I'm ugly?\"","Oh my god, Jing Yan is as cunning as a fox, but this girl is so dense that she keeps humiliating herself over and over again. It's a wonder. I suddenly feel that it's better that Cen Ting and Jing Yan don't have a fate/destiny. Having a sister-in-law like this would be quite difficult to deal with. Normal people speak, but she just doesn't get it.","Qin Xian seemed to ponder his words carefully, but his 36.5-degree mouth still managed to spit out zero-degree words.","\"You look like you were mass-produced, lacking any individuality. As an artist, without distinctiveness, you lose your greatest value. Your expressions while speaking are already very unnatural. I don't think you need to waste time preparing for this project. The most basic requirement for our actors is a natural look.\"","[Wow, making a little girl cry, Qin Xian really has a talent for that.]","Sure enough, the next second, Wan Ru ran out crying miserably.","Qin Xian felt a bit speechless. He was just stating facts, being honest. He hadn't insulted or belittled anyone.","\"Wan Ru!\" Jing Yu was shocked and immediately glared angrily, saying, \"Qin Xian, it seems you don't care about anyone from the Jing family's face (respect) anymore?\"","\"Is she from the Jing family?\" Ji Fei immediately asked in surprise. \"She's not even surnamed Jing, is she?\"","Jing Yu was stumped, probably feeling provoked, and without fear of offending anyone, he directly said, \"So, you don't want to attend my engagement party anymore?!\"","[Wow, here it is, the classic spoiled rich kid routine. Does he really think such threats can achieve anything? He can't see the situation clearly. This is the fate of a cannon fodder character!]","As expected, as soon as Jing Yu finished his blustering, Qin Xian's face darkened.","\"Madam Xie sent the invitation personally. It seems Mr. Jing doesn't want us to attend. I'll give Madam Xie a call later to let her know.\"","It wasn't Jing Yan who handed over the invitation, nor was it Cen Ting. It was Madam Xie herself, representing the respect between two corporate groups and offering the highest level of courtesy.","If Madam Xie knew that Jing Yu had been spouting nonsense here, she would probably force Jing Yu to personally come and apologize, inviting them to the engagement party. It's no wonder some people aren't qualified to inherit the family business.","Jing Yu froze, his face turning every color of the rainbow, like a palette. Finally, he managed to pull back his earlier threats.","\"You can come if you want.\" Jing Yu backed down and quickly left, looking like a walking joke.","Dealing with such a clown wasn't worth the effort.","The two continued with their plan to buy gifts.","\"Let's just buy for Cen Ting. Buying for Jing Yu would be a waste of money,\" Ji Fei said.","\"Alright,\" Qin Xian replied while driving.","\"Cen Ting has to deal with such an awful fiancé. I feel uncomfortable just thinking about it,\" Ji Fei complained. \"If he doesn't care about his fiancée, why did he agree to the engagement in the first place? I thought he might have some rebellious spirit.\"","\"He's rebellious with others, but he's never dared to defy Madam Xie,\" Qin Xian explained. \"And Cen Ting was chosen by Madam Xie.\"","That was a new piece of information.","\"Tell me more,\" Ji Fei immediately leaned over, curious.","Qin Xian explained, \"Because Cen Ting's character is stable and not the type to cause trouble. Marrying her could help Jing Yu mature, or at the very least, she wouldn't create a scene because of his bad behavior. Plus, Madam Xie knows this is a mutually beneficial arrangement for both Cen Ting and Jing Yu. It's not like she's ruining the girl's life. The relationship is based on cooperation. She doesn't expect Cen Ting to help manage the family business; she won't interfere with her freedom. As long as they can live a stable life and have children, that's enough.\"","\"Sounds like it will be a harmonious relationship between mother-in-law and daughter-in-law,\" Ji Fei said.","\"Madam Xie is also quite reasonable. Her personality is similar to Cen Ting's. They discuss everything openly, and the negotiations for the marriage went smoothly. They get along well. As long as Madam Xie is in power, Cen Ting's future should be secure,\" Qin Xian said.","[So, even if Jing Yan takes over, Cen Ting will be protected. It's quite interesting. But what's even more intriguing is the relationship between Jing Yu and Wan Ru.]","Qin Xian was puzzled. What relationship?","However, the fact that the two appeared together did surprise him. After all, Jing Yan and Jing Yu don't get along, and he thought Jing Yu would also dislike Wan Ru. He didn't expect Jing Yu to accompany Wan Ru for her career.","Wait, skipping the family gathering to be with Wan Ru... that seems a bit off.","As he was thinking, his phone rang.","Qin Xian let Ji Fei answer it.","Ji Fei looked at the caller ID and awkwardly said, \"Did you just bully his sister? Is he calling to demand an explanation?\"","Qin Xian was momentarily puzzled, then smiled and said, \"Don't worry, he won't.\"","Ji Fei, skeptical, answered the phone and heard Jing Yan say helplessly, \"Wan Ru just called me crying, complaining about everything. I'm confused. Did you really tell her she's ugly? I know plastic surgery isn't ideal, but she was just trying to look prettier. You've already proven you can be good to your wife, so why are you so cold and heartless to other women? Where's your gentlemanly demeanor?\"","It seemed that although they shared the same mother, Jing Yan inherited the good looks of the Jing family, while Wan Ru only inherited her father's ordinary appearance. So, her family didn't object to her getting plastic surgery.","\"It was me,\" Ji Fei said.","\"Ah, I forgot that Qin Xian's phone might not always be answered by him. My mistake, I should have asked first,\" Jing Yan joked. \"So, did you two run into my sister? Didn't she offend you?\"","It seemed that the awkwardness from last time had passed, and he was back to his usual elegant and casual self.","\"You guessed right,\" Ji Fei said directly.","Jing Yan said, \"It's easy to guess. I'll be honest—my sister had a crush on your husband a long time ago. She was rejected once, but she's not the type to give up easily. I even suspect that all her plastic surgeries are because she's still hoping for your husband. Don't worry, though, I never wanted them to be together.\"","Ji Fei was puzzled. \"You knew each other before I became his wife. Didn't you want to keep the good stuff in the family?\"","\"I wanted to, but I'm not blind or stupid. Even though she's my sister, unless she reincarnates and completely changes her face, mind, and character, there's no way she could match up to Qin Xian,\" Jing Yan said, understanding Qin Xian well. He had never considered matchmaking his sister with Qin Xian, even if it meant enduring her complaints. He wouldn't do something so foolish and thankless.","Ji Fei: ......","[I was careless. I forgot that this guy used to be a CP fan of Qin Xian and Yu Zhi. Now he's a solo fan.]","Qin Xian: Hmm... maybe now he's a CP fan of us two.","Ji Fei, seeing that Jing Yan was so open-minded, decided to tell him everything that had happened today.","This report made Jing Yan fall silent for a long time.","The matter of Wan Ru offending them was no longer the main issue.","When Jing Yan spoke again, he was clearly suppressing his anger.","\"So, you're saying Wan Ru was trying to audition for the lead role? She actually hid from us that she wanted to become an artist, and it was Jing Yu who skipped the family gathering to take her there?\"","Ji Fei added, \"You really didn't know anything about this. But do you know...\"","Ji Fei recalled the scene she had witnessed and, being mischievous, said, \"Their relationship seems... unusual. I saw Jing Yu put his arm around her waist and even touch her thigh.\"","[The two cousins already had a bad relationship, and now there's this with Jing Yan's sister being treated like Jing Yu's mistress. This is juicy! Hehehe. Wait, am I ruining their engagement party? Is this some kind of mystical karma?]"]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268: Can naturally tell me sweet nothings.","paragraphs":["Ji Fei felt that it definitely wasn't her problem. She was merely a simple, selfless disseminator of gossip information, a passionate enthusiast of gossip who enjoyed indulging in juicy tidbits.","However, the people involved were hit hard by the news.","The person on the other end of the phone fell silent once again.","The silence was so thick that one could almost imagine the feeling of a volcano about to erupt.","Not just Jing Yan, even Qin Xian was stunned when he heard about it. When Qin Xian entered the room earlier, the two hadn't crossed any lines, so he hadn't noticed anything amiss, just found it strange that they were together at such a time.","Now it all made sense, and he was equally disgusted by their situation.","\"Jing Yan,\" Qin Xian said, still driving, \"don't act rashly.\"","When Jing Yan spoke again, his voice was hoarse. \"Thanks for letting me know. I'll handle it privately.\"","The call ended, and Ji Fei analyzed, \"Jing Yan is really angry. It's understandable. His own sister being used as a lover by his cousin, even if they aren't blood-related, is pretty disgusting.\"","\"It's more than that,\" Qin Xian said.","\"What do you mean?\" Ji Fei asked, too lazy to check the system and decided to ask Qin Xian directly.","After all, Qin Xian was always eager to share gossip with her.","\"Jing Yu and Jing Yan have never gotten along. They are genuine enemies, with no brotherly affection. Because Madam Xie often praised the more capable Jing Yan and even chose him as the heir, Jing Yu grew up resenting him. He liked to take what Jing Yan had, destroy it, and use it to make Jing Yan miserable.\"","Ji Fei immediately said, \"Could it be that Cen Ting also...\"","Qin Xian shook his head. \"He hid it well. Jing Yu knows nothing about it.\"","Ji Fei had a moment of realization. Perhaps he hid it so meticulously also to protect Cen Ting.","\"So Jing Yu wasn't just being lustful; he did it purely to make Jing Yan miserable by making Wan Ru his lover? That sister of his is too ridiculous, so easily deceived. Can't she tell that the man she's with doesn't like her brother?\" Ji Fei said.","Qin Xian explained, \"Jing Yan has always lived in the Jing family, cared for by the elders. Wan Ru lived in the Wan family. Although they are half-siblings, their relationship isn't close. Jing Yan's care for her mostly comes from his mother's orders. But Wan Ru doesn't like him much.\"","\"Doesn't like Jing Yan, her brother, but likes Jing Yu, this playboy? Uh... did she hurt her brain during plastic surgery?\" Ji Fei said.","Qin Xian's eyes, however, showed a different emotion.","\"It's normal for half-siblings to have a strained relationship. The rejection of each other's biological fathers and the competition for the same mother's love can make their relationship sensitive. Like Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu, who are as close as twins, is rare.\"","Ji Fei remembered how close the two were, often inviting her out to play together. Guo Yalan even said she was helping her sister chase her idols. \"Indeed, it depends on the people.\"","\"Because of the ten-year age gap, Jing Yan's care for Wan Ru is more like a senior's responsibility for a junior. But Wan Ru is a bit spoiled. The few times I saw her, she didn't respect her brother, often throwing tantrums and being unfriendly. So her relationship with Jing Yu might not be entirely out of deception.\"","This time, Ji Fei didn't need Qin Xian to guess; she directly checked the information.","[Wow, they're both villains, colluding just to make Jing Yan miserable. Unbelievable. But Qin Xian missed one reason why Wan Ru is against Jing Yan.]","Qin Xian's eyes flickered. He wasn't unaware, but since Jing Yan had never mentioned it and his brother had gone to great lengths to hide it, he naturally didn't bring it up. And he...","Qin Xian's grip on the steering wheel tightened, and his breathing seemed to stop for a moment, his mind going blank. But Ji Fei's constant stream of gossipy thoughts quickly brought him back to reality.","[Because Madam Wan doesn't like Jing Yan, the little girl picked up on it and followed suit, naturally looking down on and disliking her older brother.]","Qin Xian inwardly scoffed.","Madam Wan is also quite the eccentric. Because Jing Yan's birth was difficult, causing her to hemorrhage and suffer, she's never liked him. After her husband's accident, she consulted a fortune-teller, who said Jing Yan was a curse on their family. She began to hate him, even developing a pattern of abuse, which was quickly discovered and exposed by Madam Xie. The Jing family then took custody of Jing Yan. Fearing Jing Yan's curse, Madam Wan remarried. Though things have been peaceful since, Jing Yan has endured long-term emotional abuse from his mother.","Qin Xian's lips trembled slightly.","This peculiar mother often practiced PUA on Jing Yan, blaming him for her misfortunes and claiming he owed her. She employed various forms of moral blackmail to coerce Jing Yan into cleaning up the messes caused by the Wan family or Wan Ru. Fortunately, Jing Yan was well-educated and never easily manipulated, only fulfilling his responsibilities. Their mother-son relationship has been a constant power struggle.","[An unruly mother, a troublesome sister, and a mother who remarried... a broken Jing Yan. Suddenly, he seems a bit like a tragic hero. Beautiful, strong, and pitiful.]","Ji Fei chuckled at her own thoughts.","They had arrived at the mall.","Ji Fei had grown accustomed to Qin Xian's habit of opening the car door for her.","But this time, Qin Xian unbuckled his seatbelt and then hers, pulling her into a tight embrace right in the car.","This sudden, unprompted hug left Ji Fei stunned.","The hug was unusually tight.","She could feel his heavy breathing.","Ji Fei felt like Qin Xian was hugging her like someone hugging an oxygen tank in high altitude.","\"What's wrong?\" Ji Fei, despite her usual insensitivity, sensed something unusual.","\"I just want to hold you,\" Qin Xian's voice was low and especially seductive in the confined space of the car.","Ji Fei's heart immediately raced.","[Is he flirting with me? We already cuddle every night. I've heard that liking someone can make you feel sudden bursts of affection, wanting to be close. Could my charm be that strong? Hehe~]","Her almost silly thoughts tugged at Qin Xian's lips, making him smile wryly.","\"I want to hold you forever, never let go.\"","Ji Fei was dumbfounded.","[Wow, the once cold and aloof CEO has really opened up quickly. He's so natural at saying sweet nothings, it's making me flustered.]","If anyone else heard this, they might think Ji Fei was ruining the mood.","But to Qin Xian, it was the most endearing thing. Although he gradually blushed at the ears.","Qin Xian, as always, didn't need Ji Fei to respond. He wouldn't put any pressure on her, as if just expressing the overflowing love in his heart before continuing with their daily routine.","He let go, got out of the car, opened the door for his wife, and then chatted about gossip while shopping.","After picking out gifts and sitting down to eat, Ji Fei finally had time to check the follow-up.","[Wow, they fought. Jing Yan hit Jing Yu. He's really cunning, hitting places that won't show bruises. Jing Yu was in so much pain he cried. Hilarious. Jing Yan's punches probably also carried some of his own resentment. But Wan Ru is really a little ingrate, actually defending Jing Yu and hitting her own brother!]"]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269: I Absolutely Won't Let Him Inherit the Jing Family","paragraphs":["Jing Yan was stunned after Wan Ru slapped him. He looked at Wan Ru with a heart full of coldness. Although this sister of his had always been indifferent to him, they were still the closest in terms of blood relations among their siblings. Thinking of the harmony between Guo Yalan and Han Ziyu, Jing Yan couldn't help but laugh in anger.","\"Do you know what you're doing? He's getting engaged in two days, and you're maintaining an inappropriate relationship with a man who has a fiancée.\"","\"What's it to you? Why are you so annoying? I just like being with Yu Ge, what's the problem?\" Wan Ru tried to help Jing Yu, who was lying on the ground, while angrily rebuking Jing Yan, \"Don't think that just because we share the same mother, you can boss me around.\"","Jing Yan took a deep breath and then looked at Jing Yu. Jing Yu was in pain but still glared at Jing Yan with a mocking expression.","Jing Yan's anger surged. If Jing Yu weren't his aunt's son, he might have seriously considered killing him.","\"He's with you just to make me suffer, to get back at me. Do you really think he likes you?\"","Jing Yu didn't bother to explain. He had brought Wan Ru into the entertainment industry, fulfilling her desire to prove her beauty. He had also fueled Wan Ru's resentment towards Jing Yan, giving her opportunities to make Jing Yan uncomfortable. These were enough to make Wan Ru cling to him and continue their entanglement.","Whether Jing Yu loved her or not didn't matter. If Wan Ru truly loved him, would she be able to watch him get engaged?","So Jing Yan's questioning only earned him Wan Ru's mockery.","Wan Ru deliberately said things Jing Yan didn't want to hear. \"I don't care if Yu Ge loves me or not. I love him, and I'm willing to be his mistress. I just like him, a member of the Jing Family, and I hate you. What are you going to do about it?!\"","Seeing Wan Ru's triumphant expression, as if she was delighted by Jing Yan's changing face, Jing Yan realized she was stubborn and unrepentant.","Jing Yan wouldn't let these two clowns push him around. He gave up on trying to educate them and issued a direct warning.","\"Fine. If you don't end this relationship, I'll tell Mom about you entering the entertainment industry and getting involved with him.\"","Jing Yan first threatened Wan Ru, then turned to glare at Jing Yu. \"Auntie might not care about your wild antics outside, but Wan Ru's mother was once Auntie's sister-in-law. Do you think she'll let you ruin Wan Ru like this? So if you touch my sister again, I'll tell Auntie about this.\"","Hitting their sore spots naturally provoked a backlash, with various curses flying out, making Jing Yan extremely irritated.","Jing Yan grabbed Wan Ru's arm and dragged her away.","\"My warning is not a joke. You can try it if you dare!\"","After saying that, he pushed Wan Ru into the car and sent her back to the Wan Family.","Back at the Wan Family, Wan Ru foolishly clung to Madam Wan, crying about how Jing Yan had bullied her.","Madam Wan, without asking for details, started yelling at Jing Yan. \"Unbelievable! So you think you're too good for us now that you're going to take over the Jing Family, huh?\"","\"Mom, I'm disciplining my sister because she made a mistake. If you keep spoiling her like this, she'll make a big mistake.\"","Perhaps as a mother, she should have asked for clarification, but seeing Jing Yan's face, she couldn't help but feel even more furious. \"If your sister makes a mistake, it's your fault. You were born to curse our family!\"","This was nothing new; Jing Yan had heard it so many times that he was numb to it. He knew there was no point in communicating with his mother, so he turned and left.","\"Mom, you'd better keep an eye on Wan Ru. She's been associating with shady characters lately.\"","Wan Ru immediately erupted in denial, and Madam Wan seemed to side with her, but Jing Yan no longer wanted to listen.","As he was about to walk out of the villa, Madam Wan finally suppressed her anger and suddenly spoke up. \"Hey, I heard your aunt is planning to officially announce you as the heir at the engagement party and have you work under her. Is that true?\"","Jing Yan paused, guessing that Madam Wan was probably planning to use him to get benefits for the Wan Family.","\"I'm not sure. And it doesn't seem to concern you, since you've already left the Jing Family.\" Although there had been hints of consulting him, it was basically a done deal, so he let the elders decide.","Madam Wan didn't say anything more. Jing Yan glanced back and saw Madam Wan's face was terrifyingly dark, almost like a demon glaring at him.","Jing Yan's heart froze again. He understood that Madam Wan couldn't stand to see him succeed. The more outstanding he was, the angrier she became, as if his success was at the expense of the entire family's luck and health. He never expected someone could be so superstitious.","After so many disappointments, he no longer felt much pain.","Jing Yan left in silence.","Wan Ru, worried about being questioned by Madam Wan, quickly seized the opportunity to complain. \"Mom, look at his attitude. He's so disrespectful to you. He even hit me and Yu Ge today. If he becomes the head of the Jing Family in the future, I don't know how he'll treat us!\"","Madam Wan was stunned and exclaimed, \"What? He hit you?!\"","Wan Ru knew that Madam Wan hated Jing Yan deeply. Even for Jing Yu, who was from her former sister-in-law's family, she was willing to give a kind look, but she wouldn't spare a glance for Jing Yan.","So Wan Ru wasn't afraid to mention Jing Yu.","Wan Ru quickly fabricated a lie. \"Today, I happened to play with Yu Ge, and he saw us. You know he's always had a grudge against Yu Ge. He probably envied our relationship being better than his, so he mocked and even hit us. He's just too bad. Now he's even telling you that I'm associating with shady people. He's completely crazy.\"","Madam Wan didn't think too much about it, only feeling that Jing Yan was becoming more and more out of control, probably not even regarding her as his own mother anymore. Her face grew even darker.","\"Does he really think he's invincible now? I absolutely won't let him inherit the Jing Family! Trying to escape from me is impossible!\"","With that thought, she had already started plotting. Then she began to worry about their injuries. Wan Ru pretended to have internal injuries, which infuriated Madam Wan, who swore to find a way to break Jing Yan's legs.","When Wan Ru returned to her room, she started contacting Jing Yu again. The two of them were like rotten stones in a gutter, constantly thinking of ways to trip Jing Yan.","Ji Fei, relying on the system, finished watching the drama unfold and couldn't help but complain.","[Jing Yan really chose the wrong approach. Wan Ru is just rebellious. After being humiliated by Qin Xian and scolded by her brother, she's even more determined to stay with Jing Yu just to keep provoking Jing Yan. I wonder if Jing Yan will really tell on them if they cross the line again?]","Qin Xian actually wanted to argue that he hadn't humiliated anyone.","But if those two got back together, Jing Yan would definitely tell on them.","[Damn, he's going to see Cen Ting. Could it be...]","Qin Xian was also a bit surprised. Could it be that his friend had finally decided not to endure it anymore?","But would it be too late?","And based on Qin Xian's understanding of Cen Ting, Cen Ting might not stop the engagement because of this."]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270: Endure, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles","paragraphs":["\"Does the God of Gossip really exist?\"","Qin Xian was lost in his thoughts when Ji Fei suddenly blurted out that question, pulling him along before he could react.","They had just finished dinner and were about to head to the underground parking lot to get their car and leave.","But Ji Fei suddenly dragged him to hide behind a pillar.","Then, the voices of a man and a woman reached their ears.","It was then that Qin Xian remembered that tonight was supposed to be a dinner gathering of the Jing and Cen families. It was likely happening here, as most of the city's top-tier restaurants were located in the mall owned by Qin Corporation.","Although Jing Yan wasn't suitable to attend such a gathering, he would definitely know the location. By the time the dinner ended, Jing Yan would be able to intercept them.","It was really too much of a coincidence that they ended up meeting here.","No doubt, if there was a God of Gossip, he must be favoring Ji Fei.","At this moment, Ji Fei was incredibly excited, peeking from behind a car like a paparazzi who had just caught a juicy piece of gossip.","Even the dignified Qin Xian had to hide with her. If the security guards in the monitoring room saw their boss doing such a thing, they would surely question their own sanity.","\"What exactly is going on?\" Cen Ting asked Jing Yan, who seemed hesitant to speak.","This was the first time the two of them had met alone, and it felt really awkward. Although they had known each other for many years and would eventually be brother-in-law and sister-in-law, Cen Ting doubted whether they could get along well.","She was introverted and slow to warm up to people. All her friends had approached her first, bringing her into their circles. So, she never took the initiative to get close to anyone.","On the other hand, Jing Yan was the type who actively socialized, yet he never took the initiative to socialize with her. As a result, their friendship was very thin, almost non-existent, sustained only by the years they had known each other.","Someone who was so warm and proactive with others was cold and distant towards her, which made her feel that they were just incompatible.","So, being invited out tonight to hear something important in person really surprised her.","Meanwhile, the two hiding behind the car couldn't help but hold their breath.","[Could it be that he's going to confess? Right at this critical moment? Did he get provoked by his sister and Jing Yu? Is there going to be a bride-snatching battle?]","Ji Fei became more and more excited with each passing thought.","Even Qin Xian began to wonder what might happen.","Finally, Jing Yan spoke.","Ji Fei's face gradually showed disappointment, and Qin Xian also became calmer.","Turns out, Jing Yan didn't confess. He just revealed the affair between Jing Yu and Wan Ru.","\"I'm sorry,\" Jing Yan said, his expression complex as he looked at Cen Ting.","Cen Ting was indeed surprised. \"He's really bold. Other women aside, he even dared to touch your sister. Doesn't he fear causing a huge scandal between the families?\"","\"That's the situation. No matter what decision you make, I'll support you,\" Jing Yan said.","Cen Ting paused for a moment. \"What decision should I make? I don't care. The ones who should be worried are the Jing and Wan families. It doesn't really involve me.\"","Jing Yan froze, then laughed bitterly, almost as if mocking himself. \"Of course, it's you. I shouldn't have treated you like a fragile girl.\"","Cen Ting was a bit surprised by the expression on Jing Yan's face. His eyes, gazing at her, seemed to hide some secret.","But she wasn't particularly curious. She shrugged. \"Whether my future husband is a man or a ghost doesn't matter. As long as my mother-in-law is good, that's all that matters.\"","Jing Yan forced a smile, even more bitter this time. \"Auntie is a very good person. She'll treat you well.\"","Cen Ting smiled faintly. \"Thank you for telling me this. If there's nothing else, I'll head back.\"","Being alone with Jing Yan just felt incredibly awkward.","Jing Yan nodded.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian watched as Jing Yan watched sadly as Cen Ting's car drove away.","Once they got into their car, Ji Fei couldn't help but curse, \"Hmph! You wasted my emotions!\"","Qin Xian, however, wasn't surprised.","Ji Fei turned to Qin Xian and asked, \"Do you think he came to tell her this out of concern for Cen Ting, afraid she wouldn't know about this close troublemaker, or did he hope that once Cen Ting knew about this relationship, she wouldn't be able to accept Jing Yu and call off the engagement?\"","Qin Xian replied, \"Both. The main purpose is the former, but deep down, he wishes for the latter. He likes Cen Ting. How could he not want to change the engagement partner?\"","Ji Fei suddenly realized and looked at Qin Xian in surprise. \"You... you knew?\"","Qin Xian immediately pretended to be very knowledgeable. \"I figured it out a long time ago.\"","Then you're really not being helpful! Why didn't you tell me?\" Ji Fei immediately turned the tables on him.","She couldn't say it because of the system, but how could Qin Xian keep such a big piece of gossip from her?","Qin Xian: Shooting oneself in the foot...","Ji Fei didn't hold it against Qin Xian. Now that their information was more or less synchronized, they could gossip properly.","\"If that's the case, then Jing Yan is really despicable. He's too cowardly to try for love himself, yet he hopes that Cen Ting will take the initiative. To be honest, Jing Yan's unrequited love, while long and touching, is ultimately self-indulgent. He's a coward and doesn't deserve Cen Ting,\" Ji Fei said without holding back.","Qin Xian, although understanding Jing Yan's deep gratitude towards Madam Xie for her almost life-saving and mentoring kindness, thought that in this matter, he had indeed handled it poorly.","\"In Jing Yan's view, he has already taken away the possibility of Madam Xie's son inheriting the family business. He can't also take away the most suitable wife Madam Xie arranged for her son. That's why he acts this way...\"","\"But isn't the Jing family business passed to the most capable person?\" Ji Fei rebutted.","\"So he's stuck in a corner, thinking that without Madam Xie, he would have died long ago and wouldn't have been nurtured to his current abilities. He believes that being able to inherit the family business is all due to Madam Xie's benevolence. If she had any selfish intentions and didn't care for him when he was young, then everything in the Jing family would likely have been Jing Yu's. Moreover, he also thinks that Jing Yu becoming such a waste might not be unrelated to his own contrast and pressure.\"","Ji Fei was truly at a loss for words, finding the whole situation a tangled mess.","In this complex relationship, Cen Ting was essentially an outsider, so there was no need to view her from the perspective of a weak victim. Ji Fei was just venting her dissatisfaction with Jing Yan's cowardly unrequited love.","With complicated feelings, they finally arrived at the engagement banquet.","This time, the whole family was present.","The Qin family never missed any opportunity to attend events with Ji Fei.","After all, who knew what juicy gossip they might miss?","It seemed that there were quite a few people with the same mindset.","Ji Fei felt that since arriving at the venue, she had been receiving even more intense stares than usual.","[Huh, why do I suddenly feel so much pressure? Although there are indeed many juicy pieces of gossip, they're all silent gossip that can't explode. At most, I can only secretly observe the undercurrents beneath the surface, like the one in front of me. Even with heavy makeup, the dark circles are still visible. Suffering, aren't you, Ninja Turtle? This is the path you've chosen.]","The Qin family followed Ji Fei's gaze and saw Jing Yan accompanying a very dignified and elegant lady, greeting guests."]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271: How Dare You Secretly Have an Affair","paragraphs":["“That's Xie Lifeng.” Qin Xian, with Ji Fei on his arm, leaned down and whispered the introduction. He had developed the habit of clearly introducing important figures to Ji Fei, so she could match names with faces and enjoy her \"eating melons\" more easily.","Everything was for the sake of letting his wife enjoy her gossip.","Ms. Xie was a powerful businesswoman. She had collaborated with Qin's Father during his tenure, and now, thanks to Qin Xian's capabilities, Qin's Father had retired early to enjoy his golden years, leaving the collaboration with Ms. Xie to Qin Xian.","So, they were quite familiar with each other.","Besides Second Master Jing, who almost acted as a background figure, and the Cen Family members standing nearby, they were all partners. Upon meeting, they greeted each other warmly.","Jing Yan accompanied Ms. Xie, helping to entertain the guests, while Cen Ting was preparing in the back and wouldn't appear until the engagement banquet began.","By rights, Jing Yu should have been here.","However, everyone knew that guy was a rascal, so no one asked why Jing Yu was absent.","Since they didn't bring it up, Ji Fei could only enjoy her gossip on her own.","【How funny, it's as if Jing Yan is the male lead of today's event. Let me see... Oh my, I'm going to puke.】","Although they were engaged in small talk, the Qin family members were all eavesdropping, their ears perked up. They knew that following Ji Fei would always lead to some juicy gossip.","What happened? Did that guy cause trouble at such an important occasion? Was he late? Absent? Or...","【After being threatened like that, Jing Yu and Wan Ru still dared to secretly carry on their affair. It's like picking a fight with the God of Plague. Are they deliberately challenging Jing Yan, or intentionally humiliating Cen Ting?】","The Qin family members were equally disgusted by this revelation.","Qin's Father looked sympathetically at Ms. Xie.","Qin's Mom looked sympathetically at Jing Yan.","Qin Yan looked up at the sky, sighed deeply, and then picked up her phone to share the gossip with her siblings.","【Should we find a way to catch them in the act? Hmm... Forget it. Even when Cen Ting found out, she chose to ignore it, hoping the engagement banquet would go smoothly. Although Jing Yu talked tough, he also meant to handle it discreetly. I'd better not meddle, lest the label of \"mysticism\" sticks to me and never comes off. Let's just have a peaceful day today.】","Qin Xian also thought the same way. Given how things had developed, it was best for them not to get involved.","Entering the venue, the Qin family members dispersed to join their respective circles.","But no matter who sat down, the main topic of gossip was Jing Yu's absence, Cen Ting's misfortune, and the possibility that the Jing family might announce Jing Yan as the official heir today, as most of the Jing family relatives were present.","Meanwhile, in another group, they were also discussing the same thing.","“After Qin Xian, Jing Yan is also going to become Jing Xian.” Yu Yue joked.","Bai Xiaoxi added, “It seems like among us, only they two will inherit their family businesses. Hmm? Guo Yalan, what about you?”","Guo Yalan was also present today.","Guo Yalan replied, “I've already started pressuring my parents to have a child. Trust me, with my parents' capabilities, there will be an heir. Like Cen Ting, I'll focus on my own career, of course, and take care of my sister.”","When the others heard that she was pressuring her parents to have a child, they almost burst out laughing collectively.","Guo Yalan was the first person to pull off such a reverse operation.","“What about Little Yu?” Ji Fei asked as she sat down.","“She's taking an exam,” Guo Yalan replied. “My sister is smarter than me; she's got excellent grades.”","“You can't stop talking about your sister in three sentences,” Luo Fei laughed.","Guo Yalan immediately gloated, “I have a sister, and you don't. Envy me!”","Luo Fei was amused. “The one who should be envious isn't me, but Jing Yan.”","“Oh, don't even mention that ungrateful wretch,” Guo Yalan complained.","“What happened?” Ji Fei immediately became nosy, wondering if they knew that the ungrateful wretch was probably hiding in some lounge somewhere, carrying on with someone.","“Jing Yan's half-sister, from his mother's other marriage, just arrived. Jing Yan only reminded her, 'It's crowded today, don't wander off, stay with your mom.' And then she exploded, mocking Jing Yan in public,” Bai Xiaoxi imitated her tone, “You think you're already in charge of the Jing family? The announcement hasn't even been made yet, and you're already giving me orders?”","Guo Yalan made a gesture indicating someone had a screw loose, mocking her.","Yu Yue disdainfully said, “Although I think Jing Yan's reminder to an eighteen-year-old girl was completely unnecessary, it was still a brother's concern. Wan Ru is just an ungrateful lunatic. I didn't expect that after so many years, her rabies-like behavior hasn't been cured.”","Whenever they met Wan Ru in the past, she never gave Jing Yan a good face, and usually, it was for no reason at all, so they all disliked Wan Ru.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian exchanged a glance, understanding that Jing Yan's reminder was actually a warning to Wan Ru not to go looking for Jing Yu.","Unfortunately, the reminder didn't work, as she continued to do as she pleased.","It was also unclear what kind of mother she had, who didn't even suspect anything and treated her son's reminder as empty words, allowing Wan Ru to sneak off. Jing Yan probably didn't have the time to deal with them.","The group continued to gossip, completely unaware that Wan Ru was doing something even more disgusting.","Ji Fei looked around, and Qin Xian, having poured her some tea, asked, “What are you looking for?”","“I'm curious what that eccentric mother looks like.”","Qin Xian directly pointed her out.","Ji Fei quickly spotted a harsh, cold-hearted face among a group of women.","【Sometimes, the saying 'appearance reflects the heart' really holds true. That face looks like a villain's... If she knew her precious daughter was with Jing Yu, that notorious guy, I wonder what her reaction would be. Maybe the eccentric she is, she'd blame it all on Jing Yan.】","Ji Fei imagined it and felt it might just be the case. Jing Yan was truly the biggest victim here.","Just as she was thinking, the surrounding chatter suddenly grew louder.","“Oh, I thought this guy wouldn't even show up at the engagement banquet,” Yu Yue said.","“I suspect he's still emotionally immature, trying to get his mother's attention in this way,” Luo Fei bluntly stated.","“Not weaned yet?” Guo Yalan exclaimed in shock.","Bai Xiaoxi burst out laughing.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian looked over but didn't see Wan Ru. The two of them still didn't dare to let anyone know.","Jing Yu suddenly appeared and was immediately dragged by one of Ms. Xie's trusted aides to the entrance to greet the guests.","About half an hour later, at a propitious time, the engagement ceremony began.","On the stage, Cen Ting, dressed in a qipao, made her appearance. With her meticulous makeup and attire, she was stunning.","Guo Yalan and Bai Xiaoxi cheered and took photos excitedly.","Ji Fei couldn't help but whisper to Qin Xian, “So... maybe Jing Yu is just blind.”","Qin Xian nodded in agreement.","At that moment, the seemingly blind Jing Yu, dressed up decently, stood beside Cen Ting.","In contrast, Jing Yan, who usually attracted more attention than him, stood at the edge of the stage, in the shadows, where no one could see his expression. He just stood there stiffly, as if his soul had left his body."]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272: As if to Emphasize Ownership","paragraphs":["“Tsk tsk tsk, poor thing,” Ji Fei commented.","Others heard her but didn’t realize she was talking about Jing Yan.","“Yeah, Cen Ting is going to marry someone like that. It’s really pitiful. I really want to sabotage their engagement party,” Guo Yalan boldly chimed in. “Maybe I’ll arrange for a few handsome men to charm Cen Ting away so she doesn’t end up with such trash.”","“I think Cen Ting wouldn’t pay any attention to you,” Luo Fei said.","Guo Yalan pouted, “Cen Ting told me she’s only going to be a nominal wife to Jing Yu. They’ll have kids through IVF later.”","“That makes sense. Cen Ting has a bit of a cleanliness obsession,” Bai Xiaoxi added.","This was the first time Ji Fei had heard of it, and it made her feel much better. Otherwise, she always felt like a good girl was being tainted by something filthy.","However, seeing the two continue with their engagement ceremony and exchange rings still made her feel disgusted.","Finally, Jing Yu picked up the microphone.","“I’m very happy to have entered into an engagement with Cen Ting. I believe it won’t be long before we smoothly step into the marriage hall.”","[He sure knows how to say pretty words. I thought he’d act up and cause a scene at this kind of event.]","Finally, Jing Yu looked at Cen Ting with deep affection and said, “Cen Ting, from now on, you are officially my fiancée.”","After saying that, Jing Yu pulled Cen Ting into a hug.","Cen Ting was taken aback. She found his words strange, as if he was deliberately emphasizing ownership, which made her uncomfortable. She had thought Jing Yu knew their relationship was just a partnership.","However, Cen Ting didn’t call him out and played along perfectly.","Ji Fei was silently watching all this when suddenly Qin Xian, who was beside her, spoke to Guo Yalan, “Yalan, can I borrow your sunglasses?”","Guo Yalan's sunglasses were quite exaggerated (over-the-top), covering half her face. They were part of her look, so she hadn’t taken them off since entering.","Hearing Qin Xian’s serious tone, Guo Yalan didn’t think much of it and handed them over.","Then she saw Qin Xian immediately put the sunglasses on Ji Fei.","Ji Fei: ?","“There are paparazzi,” Qin Xian said with displeasure.","Ji Fei: !","It wasn’t that she was afraid of being photographed. There had been reporters at previous events, but those were all credentialed and knew what not to shoot. Today, however, no reporters had been seen at the entrance, so she thought the Jing family wasn’t arranging any coverage.","If this was the case, then it was a sneaky shoot. Such unauthorized photos could easily be used to fabricate stories and stir up rumors. Ji Fei had been reminded by her manager, Sister Pei, that in such situations, at least covering her face would make dealing with the aftermath easier.","She hadn’t sensed anything, but Qin Xian, her artist, was more sensitive than she was.","Ji Fei obediently wore the sunglasses and asked, “Where are they?”","“What, are there really paparazzi? How could the Jing family do this without saying anything?”","The small group was all surprised.","Qin Xian frowned and said, “Jing Yan didn’t arrange for them. It must be Jing Yu’s doing. They’re from his company’s partner table, sneaking around and taking photos.”","Everyone looked over and indeed saw some people hiding various equipment, clearly up to no good.","“What is Jing Yu trying to do? Is he filming himself?” Yu Yue was incredulous.","Qin Xian didn’t answer but directly contacted Jing Yan via phone to inform him of the situation.","The ceremony had ended, and people were starting to toast. Jing Yan saw the message and immediately went to find Madam Xie.","Madam Xie quickly called Jing Yu over and interrogated him.","“What? I wanted to create some buzz for my own engagement party, isn’t that allowed? Even though my company isn’t up to your standards, Mom, I’ve been putting in effort to manage it.”","Seeing her son’s defiant attitude, Madam Xie felt truly powerless. Why could she raise other people’s children well but her own was a complete mess?","“Hmph, always going to Mom to tattle. You just wait.”","Jing Yu often made empty threats, and Jing Yan usually pretended not to hear them, knowing Jing Yu couldn’t do anything to him anyway.","Madam Xie rubbed her temples in frustration before speaking, “Today is a special day. Don’t cause any trouble. If you insist on filming, then I have only one request: don’t film the guests.”","Jing Yu shrugged indifferently, as if he hadn’t planned to film the guests anyway.","Seeing him not argue for once, Madam Xie breathed a sigh of relief. Then, as if remembering something, she asked Jing Yan to leave so she could speak to Jing Yu alone.","Jing Yu, however, seemed impatient. “What now?”","Madam Xie had wanted to be warm and affectionate, but Jing Yu’s attitude made her unsure how to proceed. “I know you’ve always been at odds with Jing Yan, and I can guess at your feelings. But remember, we are mother and son. I could never like Jing Yan more than you. The reason I’ve invested more effort in him is because he truly has talent and can shoulder the responsibilities of the Jing family.”","Madam Xie felt she was being fair and impartial, but Jing Yu’s expression changed. “So in your eyes, I’m just not as good as him, huh?”","Madam Xie truly couldn’t understand Jing Yu. Her husband and she had a traditional arrangement where he handled internal affairs and she handled external ones. Her husband was like a shadow, never feeling uncomfortable about it, as everyone had their strengths. Why was their son so aggressive?","“You have your own strengths. And as long as Jing Yan takes over the family business, you can do whatever you want. That’s not bad either,” Madam Xie tried to soften her words, not wanting her son to be unhappy on the verge of his marriage.","Jing Yu’s expression faltered. “So today you’re going to announce him as the heir, and you’re here to comfort me beforehand?”","Madam Xie could only say, “This is the decision of the entire family’s elders.”","Jing Yu couldn’t accept that. He only believed that if his mother didn’t support Jing Yan and fully sided with him, the position would be his.","He didn’t care whether he had the ability or not; he just felt he could do it. It was everyone else who looked down on him, and Jing Yan’s existence that blocked his path.","So don’t blame him for dragging everyone down with him.","Jing Yu snorted coldly, “Jing Yan may not be as good as you think. You chose him; don’t regret it.”","With that, Jing Yu walked away without looking back.","Meanwhile, Jing Yan had already sent a message to Qin Xian, who he knew would be worried about his artist wife. He reassured Qin Xian that the reporters wouldn’t dare to film the guests.","Even so, Qin Xian didn’t let Ji Fei take off the sunglasses.","“What’s going on? Is he using this engagement party to boost his company’s hot searches? Is he that ambitious?” Guo Yalan mocked.","“If they’re not filming the guests, then why the sneakiness?” Bai Xiaoxi wondered.","“Something feels off,” Yu Yue said.","Luo Fei thought for a moment and looked at Qin Xian. “Maybe because they were caught and had to give that excuse. But afterward, they probably won’t dare to anymore.”","Ji Fei looked curiously at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian, however, frowned. “It shouldn’t be that simple. He went through so much trouble to arrange this; there must be another purpose.”","Given that, it would be rude not to investigate further.","[This engagement party... Jing Yu isn’t just having an affair, is he also arranging for something else? Let’s see... bringing these paparazzi here is mainly to... what? Catch him cheating?!?!?!?!?]"]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273: My Heavens, My Lord, My Brain's CPU is Overloaded","paragraphs":["Jing Yan, upon hearing that Madam Wan wanted to see him, was already in a bad mood and really didn't want to clash with his mother again. He knew all too well that whenever his mother sought him out, it was never for anything good.","However, Wan Ru kept coming to urge him, and after several attempts, Jing Yan had no choice but to go.","By then, Madam Wan had left the banquet and found a restroom to relax in. When Jing Yan arrived, she gestured for him to sit down.","\"What do you want from me?\" Jing Yan asked.","Madam Wan was about to lose her temper upon seeing him but managed to hold it in and started making small talk instead. When she began inquiring about his plans for finding a partner, Jing Yan grew even more suspicious.","\"I've heard that you're about to be announced as the heir of the Jing Family. Mom, I have no blessings to give you, just hope you don't forget whose child you are.\"","With that, Madam Wan raised her glass, appearing to offer him a toast.","Jing Yan knew there was no good coming after this, but at least he got a blessing from his mother, fulfilling their filial bond. Without much thought, he picked up the wine bottle beside him, poured himself a glass, clinked it with Madam Wan's, and drank it down.","Madam Wan's displeased gaze finally revealed a hint of satisfaction and madness. \"In the future, you should help your sister and your cousin more. The heir's position should have been his. Xie Lifeng is sick to give her child's position to you. You should be grateful and repay your cousin.\"","Jing Yan took a deep breath. As expected, she was here to make him uncomfortable. Today, he had already watched the woman he loved become his cousin's fiancée. What more did she want from him?","Gratitude was something he understood, but why should others dictate it, especially his own mother?","Jing Yan finally couldn't hold back his temper and said, \"Are you really my mother?\"","Madam Wan's eyes widened, and then she erupted in fury. \"What are you talking about!\"","\"Hmph, you want me to take care of Wan Ru, I understand. But you want me to repay Jing Yu? Have you forgotten the rules of the Jing Family? I've never heard that every generation of Jing Family members who lose the competition need to be repaid by the heir. I earned this position because I'm capable, what does it have to do with him? We both studied under Aunt Xie, he was just not as good as me, that's why Aunt Xie chose me, not because Jing Yu gave it to me. The only one I need to be grateful to is Aunt Xie, never Jing Yu.\"","Jing Yan had been holding back all day, and now he let it all out.","In truth, he had never coveted the position of heir. He was raised in this family, and his abilities had placed him in this position. It was a deeply ingrained belief.","The entire Jing Family had never thought he had stolen Jing Yu's future. He had also reflected on why he had such thoughts, realizing it was deeply rooted and impossible to eliminate. He knew it was all because of his mother's constant indoctrination.","The pain of a dysfunctional family was like a spider's web, knowing it was wrong but unable to escape. Even though he knew rationally that he wasn't at fault, he still couldn't help feeling he should step back, even giving up the woman he loved. What more did she want from him?","He felt like his mother was pushing him to the brink of suffocation.","And indeed, he now felt his head spinning, his body growing hot, and his breathing becoming difficult.","Jing Yan immediately sensed something was wrong and looked at Madam Wan in shock. \"You drugged me. What do you want?\"","Because of his earlier words, Madam Wan's face twisted in anger.","\"I knew you were an ungrateful wretch. How dare you have the qualifications to sit on the head of the family. You've wronged your father, wronged me. You should atone, forever atone!\"","As Madam Wan spoke, she seemed to go mad. Only when Jing Yan collapsed to the ground did she come to her senses. She coldly laughed and called for Wan Ru.","Wan Ru excitedly said, \"The effect is so quick?\"","\"What about the next room?\" Madam Wan asked.","\"That woman drank the water Jing Yu gave her. I just checked, and she's completely knocked out.\" Wan Ru replied, then suddenly worried, \"What if they wake up and accuse us?\"","Madam Wan coldly laughed. \"According to the Jing Family's way of handling things, they won't. As for the Cen Family, as long as we can form an alliance, it doesn't matter who we choose.\"","Wan Ru immediately smiled. \"That way, Jing Yu can become the head of the family!\"","Madam Wan nodded with affection.","Wan Ru's eyes began to turn. Would she then become the head of the family's wife? That would be more prestigious than being a Wan Family young lady. Although she couldn't win over Qin Xian, she could make that annoying Ji Fei suffer.","Although Jing Yu wasn't easy to manipulate, she had her own plans. They had already taken photos together.","Once the Jing Family announced that Jing Yu and Cen Ting had broken off their engagement and that Jing Yu would inherit the family, she would immediately tell the Jing Family elders that she and Jing Yu were together. If Jing Yu didn't cooperate, she would show them the photos, forcing the Jing Family to pressure Jing Yu into marrying her.","Of course, she couldn't tell her mother about this. She always felt that while her mother treated Jing Yu like an elder on the surface, it was just for show, especially for Jing Yan. In private, she probably didn't like Jing Yu at all. After all, her mother must have been cursing Jing Yu's mother at home every day.","The relationship between the sisters-in-law must have been terrible. Otherwise, she wouldn't have left the Jing Family and still hated Madam Xie so much. Maybe she thought that without Madam Xie, the head of the family's position would have been her ex-husband's.","Thinking of this, Wan Ru's mind felt a bit conflicted.","If she hated Madam Xie so much, why would she help Jing Yu get the position of heir? But then again, it made sense. Compared to Madam Xie, her mother probably hated Jing Yan even more. After all, Jing Yan was destined to suppress them.","This meant she would rather help Madam Xie's son than let Jing Yan have his way.","Wan Ru didn't find this terrifying but rather found it amusing. She then helped the temporarily unconscious Jing Yan and sneakily carried him to the next room.","She threw Jing Yan onto the bed, directly on top of Cen Ting. Cen Ting let out a muffled groan but couldn't wake up, while Jing Yan began to be roused by the heat in his body.","The scent beneath him, the soft touch, slowly pulled him out of his rationality. As the door closed, he finally struggled to open his eyes.","In an instant, his chest seemed to explode.","It was the person he had been longing for over the past ten years.","In the main hall.","The Qin Family, who were eating and drinking in the distance: Catching adultery?!?!","Qin Xian: Whose adultery are we catching???","【Me, me, me, what should I do? Jing Yu is about to catch Jing Yan and Cen Ting in bed?!?! My god, my brain's CPU is overloaded! What a good brother, what a good gift, right into the heart? No, wait, maybe you didn't need to drug them. If you just asked, Jing Yan would have been happy to take over your engagement! No, no, no, I'm thinking wrong. Those two are drugged and together. Something's going to happen. We need to save them quickly!!!!】"]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274: Oh no, the trap is sprung","paragraphs":["Upon hearing Ji Fei's thoughts, the Qin family was left dumbfounded.","What?!","Jing Yu had schemed to set up his fiancée with his cousin?","It was completely incomprehensible why Jing Yu would pull such a stunt. Did he detest Jing Yan so much that he was willing to sacrifice his fiancée just to frame him?","However, this also confirmed something else: Jing Yu had no idea that Jing Yan was fond of Cen Ting. Otherwise, he definitely wouldn't have made such an arrangement.","Qin Xian's expression also darkened, as he could sense the deeper motives behind those actions.","\"Strange, Cen Ting just texted saying she'd be here soon. Why is it taking so long to change clothes?\" Guo Yalan kept glancing at her phone, eager to vent to Cen Ting about Jing Yu's questionable moves.","After all, Cen Ting disliked being in the spotlight.","Others were also waiting for Jing Yan to arrive, but he was nowhere to be seen.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei was in a panic. Time was running out, and she couldn't think of a proper excuse. She awkwardly pulled Qin Xian's sleeve, saying, \"I feel a bit dizzy. Can you accompany me to rest for a while?\"","Suddenly, Qin Xian's phone lit up.","While cooperating with Ji Fei's actions, Qin Xian glanced at the screen. His pupils dilated as he quickly answered the call.","\"Help...\"","A weak voice came through, but before it could finish, the phone on the other end seemed to drop.","The rest of the Qin family, who were also anxious, saw the couple heading east with purpose. Though nervous, they breathed a sigh of relief. The three of them gathered to discuss, deciding to stay put for now, thinking they might be needed later.","After all, catching someone in the act? They had to keep an eye on Jing Yu and the paparazzi present.","They couldn't help but glance at Madam Wan, who was chatting and laughing with her daughter and others in the distance.","They couldn't help but curse inwardly. What kind of mother was she? Jing Yan was truly unlucky.","[Hurry, hurry! The restroom at the east corridor, third one... third one... We need a reason to barge in.]","Ji Fei was frantically thinking to herself.","Suddenly, she heard Qin Xian say, \"Fei Fei, something's wrong with Jing Yan and Cen Ting. They're in the third restroom at the east corridor. Let's go check it out.\"","Ji Fei had just been racking her brain for an excuse to go to that room when she heard this. She was overjoyed.","[Wow, impressive! I thought Madam Wan must have used some strong measures, but Jing Yan actually held on and even called for help!]","As they thought, they arrived at the third restroom.","For some reason, the door wasn't locked, and it opened with a simple turn of the handle.","As soon as the door opened, a suppressed growl came from inside.","The two exchanged a glance and rushed in.","Inside, they saw Cen Ting lying on the bed, her clothes a bit disheveled but otherwise unharmed.","Jing Yan was curled up on the floor, a broken vase beside him. His palm was clenched around a shard of the vase, the sharp edge cutting into his hand, blood spreading across his palm.","He was using pain to suppress his urges and maintain his sanity.","Seeing this bloody scene, Ji Fei couldn't help but admire Jing Yan.","[He can endure this? He's truly a master of self-control.]","Qin Xian lifted Jing Yan and dragged him to the bathroom, turning on the cold water to help him cool down.","Ji Fei tried to wake Cen Ting, but she was in a deep slumber and wouldn't wake easily.","\"Qin Xian, what should we do? Call the police? An ambulance?\" Ji Fei asked.","Before Qin Xian could answer, Jing Yan, who had regained some clarity, said, \"No, making a big fuss would only expose us. Even if nothing happened, it would be turned into something. We can't let their scheme succeed.\"","Seeing the unreadable pain on Jing Yan's face, Qin Xian said, \"I'll call a private doctor to handle this discreetly. We need to move now...\"","Before Qin Xian could finish, Ji Fei's thoughts screamed in panic.","[Oh no, the trap is starting. What do we do now?]","At that moment, the event was supposed to announce the successor, but Madam Xie had been waiting for Jing Yan for a while without any sign of him. She frowned and ordered someone to look for him.","Jing Yu suddenly approached the Cen family, who were seated with Madam Xie, and asked, \"Where's Cen Ting? I can't find her, and she's not answering my calls. I wanted to introduce her to my friends.\"","The Cen family was also puzzled, as they hadn't seen Cen Ting.","Just then, a female voice whispered, \"I think I saw Brother following Cen Ting to the restrooms earlier. Maybe they're talking in one of the restrooms? But it's been a while.\"","The speaker was Wan Ru. Her seemingly innocent speculation immediately sparked gossip among some.","What could the eldest brother and his future sister-in-law possibly need to discuss alone?","Madam Wan quickly pulled Wan Ru, saying urgently, \"Don't talk nonsense. Your brother isn't close to her.\"","Her attempt to cover it up only fueled more speculation.","Jing Yu's face darkened, and he immediately turned and left.","As soon as he moved, the paparazzi disguised as guests got excited and stood up.","Madam Xie's expression changed. Realizing something was wrong, she quickly grabbed Jing Yu, saying, \"Cen Ting is resting upstairs. By the way, Jing Yu, I've arranged something for Jing Yan. He might not have finished yet. Go help him.\"","Madam Xie wasn't sure what exactly had happened, but she wasn't stupid. She knew something was amiss and wanted to prevent a scandal.","But when Jing Yu shook off Madam Xie's hand, she realized that this was likely Jing Yu's doing, and her face turned pale.","However, Jing Yu was already leading a group of people down the corridor.","The onlookers, unaware of the situation, exchanged curious glances.","\"What's going on? Another scandal?\"","\"Definitely, especially with Ji Fei here!\"","\"Should we go check it out too?\"","\"Looks like it's going to be a dramatic catch!\"","The presence of Ji Fei heightened everyone's interest in gossip, and people who might not usually be so nosy were now eager to be the first to catch the drama.","The small group was stunned by the scene. They caught bits of the conversation, suspecting Jing Yan and Cen Ting.","\"Is Jing Yu out of his mind? How could they possibly...?\" Guo Yalan exclaimed in shock.","\"Something's not right. It's likely a setup,\" Luo Fei said, standing up, suddenly realizing, \"Where are Qin Xian and Ji Fei...?\"","\"They said they were going to rest earlier. Could there really be a scandal?\" Yu Yue was astonished.","Bai Xiaoxi also covered her mouth in surprise.","Luo Fei, however, felt a bit reassured. \"If they're there, things shouldn't get out of hand.\"","Even he found it absurd that he was now relying on such superstition.","But they couldn't sit still. In their view, there was no way Cen Ting and Jing Yan could have an affair. If something was happening, it must be a setup. With Jing Yu's strange arrangements and the presence of paparazzi, they quickly followed suit."]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275: What's there to shoot here, they're a couple","paragraphs":["Hearing Ji Fei's thoughts about the \"catch the adultery\" drama beginning, Qin Xian's expression changed slightly. He immediately said, \"Fei Fei, go to the door and take a quick peek at the situation outside.\"","Ji Fei quickly ran to the door, pulled it open just a crack, and glanced outside before shutting it again. \"Oh no, I saw a group of people heading this way. If we go out now, we'll definitely be spotted immediately.\"","Inside the bathroom, Jing Yan also heard Ji Fei's words and his face turned as pale as paper. Full of despair and resentment, he thought about his mother, sister, and cousin—those closest to him. The actions of his dear relatives made his blood run cold.","\"Why... why must it be like this...\" Jing Yan's thoughts turned to his family, and he felt as if his blood was flowing backward.","\"Now is not the time to think about that,\" Qin Xian said coldly.","Jing Yan knew this in his heart. He tried to force himself to calm down and think of a solution, but his body, controlled by the drugs, wouldn't cooperate. If not for his strong sense of pride, he wouldn't have been able to maintain even this shred of reason.","Seeing that Jing Yan was unable to think straight, Qin Xian took charge.","The water in the bathtub had already submerged Jing Yan's body.","Qin Xian turned off the water and tossed a towel to Jing Yan. \"If you can't hold it in, bite down on this. Don't make a sound and give away your presence here.\"","Qin Xian's steady voice naturally carried a sense of authority, making Jing Yan, despite his muddled mind, almost instinctively follow orders.","Qin Xian stepped out, and Ji Fei was trying to wake up Cen Ting. After glancing around, Qin Xian said, \"Fei Fei, put her in the wardrobe. Pretend it's just the two of us in this room.\"","Ji Fei's eyes lit up.","[Damn, no wonder he's the CEO. I didn't think of that. If those people barge in and see it's just us two, they wouldn't dare search the room thoroughly. And if they do, Qin Xian will just glare them into submission!]","Qin Xian: ...","Ji Fei quickly lifted Cen Ting and stuffed her into the wardrobe nearby.","Turning her head, she saw Qin Xian cleaning up the room—picking up the shattered vase and covering up the blood Jing Yan had accidentally spilled on the floor.","Meanwhile, outside, Jing Yu was leading a group of people with great momentum towards the east corridor.","Suddenly, the Qin family trio passed by and directly stopped Jing Yu. They seemed not to notice the others gathering behind them.","\"Oh, just in time. You're Jing Yu, right? Have you seen our son and daughter-in-law? We've been looking for them everywhere, but their phones are unreachable. We have something urgent to discuss with them!\" Qin's Father said.","Qin's Mom added, \"It's really urgent. Maybe you could use a megaphone to help us call them?\"","Qin Yan also chipped in to stall, \"Or help us check the surveillance footage?\"","Jing Yu, who was in a hurry to catch the adulterers, was infuriated by these three oblivious people. But despite his anger, he didn't dare to lose his temper, knowing their status. He could only curse in his heart.","\"Go find my mom to handle this,\" Jing Yu said impatiently.","The Qin family wasn't about to let this little ingrate get away so easily. Whether their son and daughter-in-law were up to something or not, they had to buy them time.","At that moment, Madam Xie, seeing an opportunity, quickly stepped forward to engage the Qin family in conversation.","But they underestimated the shamelessness of some people. For the sake of success, Jing Yu didn't even bother with pretenses. He pushed past everyone and charged toward the lounge, his actions practically confirming the adultery plot, making everyone following behind excited.","Especially the entertainment reporters, eager for the first scoop, completely disregarded order and rushed forward like a swarm.","As the door was opened, even before Jing Yu could see what was inside, he angrily shouted, \"What are you doing in here!\"","A short female voice cried out, \"Ah!\"","\"Oh my, could it really be Brother and Cen Ting?\" Wan Ru immediately exclaimed from the back of the crowd.","The Jing and Cen families all turned pale and pushed their way to the front. Madam Xie's face darkened like a pot left on the stove too long. She suddenly turned to look at Madam Wan at the very back and saw the cold smile on her lips.","Madam Xie, connecting the dots, felt as if she had fallen into an icy abyss. She had never expected that this sister-in-law, due to her superstition, disliked her son to such an extreme.","Cen Ting had just officially agreed to marry Jing Yu, and if she were now caught in a relationship with Jing Yan, the scandal would ruin Jing Yan's reputation. Not only would he be disqualified from inheriting the Jing family, but he would also be branded with the crime of adultery with his sister-in-law.","Madam Xie felt utterly desperate, realizing that this situation might be beyond repair.","The onlookers, however, were thrilled. The buzz of conversation grew louder, drawing even more spectators eager to join the gossip.","The small circle of friends also rushed forward, worried that their friend might really be in trouble. After all, these two individuals weren't exactly known for their moral integrity, but there was no karmic justice at play here.","The scene at the very front, however, was somewhat bizarre.","The flashbulbs, which should have been flashing non-stop, suddenly stopped after just one burst, as if an icy thread was spreading from the doorway.","Then came the collective gasp of the crowd.","Accompanying this was a cold voice that carried an underlying fury, causing everyone to take a step back in fear.","\"Entering my and my wife's resting place without knocking. The Jing family's manners are truly something to behold. Get out!\"","The Qin family and the small circle of friends were stunned. That was Qin Xian's voice. So, the female voice that had cried out earlier must have been Ji Fei's.","The entertainment reporters at the very front turned pale. Seeing the man's imposing presence, they knew he wasn't someone they could afford to offend. Besides, the couple was clearly just resting here; there was nothing to film. They quickly backed away.","\"Delete any photos you've taken. You wouldn't want to deal with Qin Corporation's legal team,\" Qin Xian sternly warned.","At this, the reporters forgot to retreat and frantically deleted the photos from their cameras.","Qin Corporation's legal team? Who would dare to mess with them unless they wanted to end up in jail?","Some seasoned reporters quickly guessed the identities of the couple. Although they didn't dare to report it, some still recognized them.","It seemed those two were none other than Qin Corporation's CEO, Qin Xian, and the entertainment industry's judge, Ji Fei.","Previously, there had been rumors that they were married, but others didn't believe it. Now, it seemed true. No wonder Ji Fei had always been unscathed despite causing so much trouble—her family background was that powerful! Jing Yu had really put them in a tough spot. They needed to retreat quickly before this couple remembered their faces.","Standing at the very front, Jing Yu seemed to have lost his soul, staring blankly at the scene inside.","\"What's going on?\" Wan Ru exclaimed in surprise and squeezed her way to the front. She saw Qin Xian sitting on the sofa, holding Ji Fei in his arms. Ji Fei seemed to have been startled and was hiding her face in Qin Xian's shoulder.","The two clearly looked like they had been in the middle of an intimate moment, possibly hugging or even kissing, when a crowd suddenly burst in. Not even someone of Qin Xian's status could remain calm under such rude intrusion. It was utterly humiliating.","And in this room, besides the two of them, there was no one else."]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276: What Shit and Urine Bowls Are All Thrown at Jing Yan","paragraphs":["“How could it be you?!” Wan Ru shrieked, the shock hitting her the hardest as the last person to see Cen Ting and Jing Yan.","Those two had been in bed just moments ago, unable to resist her plans, so how could they have been replaced within ten minutes?","“Where are Cen Ting and Jing Yan?!” Jing Yu also realized something was off and quickly scanned the room again, almost doubting whether the two had somehow become invisible.","Qin Xian frowned, already visibly displeased. He had no interest in wasting words with these people, his cold gaze pressing down on the room, making the atmosphere tense and oppressive.","“I have no idea what you’re talking about. If you’re in such a hurry to find someone, why don’t you leave?” Qin Xian said, his tone indifferent, leaving no doubt that he was telling the truth.","“There’s no way they’re not here. Did you...” Before Jing Yu could finish his rant, there was a sharp slap.","Madam Xie stepped forward and slapped her son, who was acting out of control. “That’s enough. I think you’ve had too much to drink and are causing a scene with our guests.”","After scolding him, she immediately turned to Qin Xian and Ji Fei, apologizing profusely. “I’m so sorry, I must have overlooked something. I’ll come back later to apologize properly.”","“There’s no need for that, Madam Xie. Whoever caused the trouble should apologize.” Ji Fei’s voice came out muffled.","Madam Xie smiled and nodded, then gave Qin Xian a meaningful look. Both were sharp enough to understand that Qin Xian and Ji Fei had helped the Jing family avoid a disaster.","Madam Xie had no idea where the two were now, but getting everyone out of the room was the safest move.","“Get out!” She pushed Jing Yu, who was still standing by the door.","Jing Yu, however, seemed to finally snap out of his embarrassment from being publicly slapped. His face burning with shame, he glared furiously. “This doesn’t make sense! Those two...”","“You!” Madam Xie was shocked. Her son was acting like a madman, trying to frame others with such low tactics. Was this really her child?","Just as the mother and son were about to clash, Jing Family’s second son finally squeezed in to mediate.","“What’s going on all of a sudden? Is there some kind of misunderstanding?”","“Today is your engagement party. Don’t let this turn into a disaster!” Madam Xie’s tone was stern, finally having some effect on Jing Yu.","Everyone assumed it was a misunderstanding and didn’t want to offend anyone, so they began to leave.","“No, they’re not here, they must be somewhere else.” Wan Ru was getting desperate. After all, she had drugged them, and even if they had woken up halfway, they shouldn’t have been able to leave the villa.","She started blurting out whatever came to mind. “I saw them having an affair with my own eyes. Keep looking, we’ll find them!”","“This is absurd!” A Cen Family Member was furious. “Who let this lunatic in? Get her out of here!”","Being called a lunatic, Wan Ru immediately started making a scene. Her mother, Madam Wan, who had been suspicious before, was now furious. “Who are you calling a lunatic?!”","Madam Xie called the security guards to escort everyone out before the situation escalated.","If Cen Ting and Jing Yan didn’t leave soon, this mess would never end.","The last to leave were the Qin Family. They had been watching the drama unfold and were now smiling happily as they saw their son holding his wife. It was rare to see them so close, and it was truly sweet.","Once the door was closed, Qin Xian finally let go of Ji Fei.","Ji Fei’s eyes lit up, clearly finding the whole situation thrilling and exciting.","“You’re amazing. Everything was under your control!” Ji Fei praised without holding back.","Qin Xian, rarely feeling any sense of vanity, couldn’t help but let a small smile escape.","“Let’s check on their condition first. We shouldn’t let them out yet to avoid anyone else coming in. We’ll wait for the private doctor to handle it.”","Ji Fei nodded and went to check on Cen Ting. She was shocked by how heavily drugged he was; there was no sign of him waking up.","Qin Xian checked on Jing Yan while also contacting their group of friends to explain the situation and arrange for the doctor to come in secretly. Madam Xie would make sure everything went smoothly.","The others, though mostly just guessing, were furious in the group chat.","How dare they scheme against two of their friends like this? They must be out of their minds.","They assured Qin Xian that they would monitor the situation and make the necessary arrangements.","However, Madam Xie was likely too busy dealing with the chaos in the hall, where people were attacking each other and arguing loudly.","Qin Xian also heard Ji Fei’s thoughts.","[Is Wan Ru really that stupid, or is she just desperate? She’s sticking to her story, insisting she saw it with her own eyes, and even starting to fabricate lies. She’s trying to paint her brother as a perverted predator who’s obsessed with his sister-in-law. Even if they can’t catch them in the act, she’s determined to smear Jing Yan’s reputation. How stupid and malicious. She’s just like her mother. Because it’s Wan Ru saying this, despite how ridiculous it is, it’s still swaying some people’s beliefs. It’s infuriating!]","At the same time, Qin Xian received updates from their group and family members. Although they were trying to refute the rumors, most people were more inclined to believe the sensational gossip.","It really was true that it’s easy to spread rumors but hard to dispel them.","Especially since the two people involved were currently missing, making it even more difficult to defend them.","[These lunatics are unstoppable. Jing Yu is acting like he’s been struck by the truth, insisting on searching the entire villa. They must know the drug’s effects are still in play and will only get worse as time goes on. Damn, I just realized—if this is the case, Cen Ting, who’s still unconscious, could end up in a terrible state. They’re not just trying to frame them for adultery; they’re trying to completely destroy Jing Yan. If Cen Ting ends up hating Jing Yan, they could even end up estranged. How vicious! They’re trying to ruin them completely!]","Qin Xian stood outside the bathroom, watching Jing Yan, who was completely out of control, struggling in the bathtub. If not for the smooth surface, he might have caused even more trouble.","[Madam Xie is really smart. She knows the two are safe with us, so she’s not panicking and letting people think she’s guilty. She’s just letting Jing Yu and the others act like clowns.]","Qin Xian also received messages from everyone, agreeing that this was the best approach. They could better time the arrival of the doctor.","All they had to do now was wait.","“How is he?” Ji Fei asked Qin Xian, curious.","Qin Xian didn’t let Ji Fei get too close. Instead, he pulled her to sit down and explained the current situation.","Ji Fei finally couldn’t help but ask, “Are they insane? Forget about their twisted reasons for doing this, but how could they act so openly? Jing Yan and Cen Ting won’t forget what happened. Once the truth comes out, they’ll have nowhere to run. Do they think they can just deny it? Other people aren’t stupid!”"]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277: Oh ho, the show is starting","paragraphs":["They were indeed not crazy; they were just more audacious than others.","Even if it meant losing eight hundred to win a thousand, they didn't care, as long as they achieved their goal.","When Qin Xian saw Ji Fei looking puzzled, he explained it to her.","\"If this incident were exposed in front of everyone, even if Cen Ting and Jing Yan later accused them, it would be meaningless. Because under their manipulation, Jing Yan and Cen Ting would indeed end up in a relationship. Do you remember Jing Yu's cooperation during the engagement?\"","Ji Fei realized. \"If these things had happened before the engagement, there would still be room for reversal, and we could argue that they were already in love and decided to be together. But once the engagement was announced, their identities changed, and the consequences would be entirely different.\"","Qin Xian nodded. \"Even if the Jing family knew that Jing Yan was framed, they wouldn't want to endure more scandal and loss. They would have to make a choice, to protect one and sacrifice the other. Since Jing Yan is already ruined, they would only choose to protect Jing Yu, the apparent victim in this situation. As for Cen Ting, they would have to settle for breaking the engagement and finding her a new match. Justice doesn't matter; what matters is the family's interests. And for the Cen family, they have no other choice.\"","Ji Fei was so angry that her breathing grew heavy. \"That's so vicious! I can understand them wanting to harm Jing Yan, but to do this to an innocent girl for their own selfish desires, to make her go through such pain—have their consciences been eaten by dogs?\"","Qin Xian sneered. \"They indeed have no conscience.\"","\"Now that we've stopped them, can we still expose them?\" Ji Fei really didn't want the villains to get away with it.","Qin Xian said, \"That's up to them. It depends on how they choose to handle it.\"","As they were talking, Qin Xian's phone vibrated.","After glancing at it, he went to open the window, and soon, shadows approached in the darkness.","Then they saw Guo Yalan and Luo Fei, who had brought a doctor with them, climbing in.","As soon as Guo Yalan entered, she quickly took Cen Ting out of the room. Seeing Cen Ting unconscious, she angrily pounded the pillow. \"I'm going to beat those bastards to death!\"","The examination was quick. After a shot of medicine, Cen Ting showed signs of waking up.","Jing Yan's situation was a bit more complicated; he needed a shot and wound treatment.","While waiting for Jing Yan to be treated, Cen Ting woke up.","As soon as she woke up, she sat up abruptly, clearly feeling that something was wrong. She had fallen asleep too quickly and deeply, and upon waking, she immediately went into a state of alert.","But as soon as she sat up, she saw a room full of people.","This unusual situation made her face change drastically. \"What happened to me?\"","Ji Fei quickly recounted the events, and then asked, \"Did Jing Yu drug you?\"","Cen Ting's face lost all color, and she was almost trembling as she clenched her teeth. \"It was him!\"","Just as she was about to ask more, a low growl came from the bathroom.","Cen Ting's face turned even paler.","Ji Fei thought she was worried about that incident and swore, \"You weren't harmed at all. Don't worry, he held himself back.\"","Guo Yalan, in a more playful mood, joked, \"Maybe Jing Yu doesn't know Jing Yan's sexual orientation?\"","Ji Fei was momentarily speechless and immediately looked at Guo Yalan.","Luo Fei was discussing the outside situation with Qin Xian when he heard this and said, exasperated, \"You really shouldn't spread rumors about Jing Yan being into men.\"","Guo Yalan shrugged. \"Isn't that the case? The guy's been single for so long. I've always suspected he likes someone in our little group, but since he can't get them, he's stayed single.\"","Then, she smiled at Ji Fei and said, \"I especially suspect it's your husband.\"","Ji Fei couldn't hold back and burst out laughing.","[Sister Yalan is truly a talent. She guessed half of it right! He does like someone in the group, and that's why he's stayed single, knowing he can't get them. But... the deviation is huge! If Jing Yu had that kind of imagination, tonight's plan's victim might have been a guy in our little group. Hahaha!]","Qin Xian: ...Your imagination is pretty big too.","\"What are you laughing at? Do you think my analysis is far-fetched?\" Guo Yalan pointed at Cen Ting. \"Isn't this solid evidence? With that kind of drug, he didn't even touch her, hurting himself instead. Where else would that kind of willpower come from except if he likes men? I can't think of any other reason.\"","[Or maybe it's because he really likes her so much that he can restrain himself! Because he's afraid of hurting her and seeing her disgusted look!]","\"Is... is that so? Hahaha, I'll have to keep a closer eye on my husband from now on.\"","Guo Yalan laughed hysterically.","Even Luo Fei chuckled.","Qin Xian: ...","As they joked around, Cen Ting's emotions stabilized. As for Guo Yalan's random speculation, she naturally didn't believe it. She trusted Jing Yan's character more.","At that moment, a noise came from the bathroom, and the doctor called them in to help.","Luo Fei went in and soon helped Jing Yan, who had changed clothes, out of the bathroom.","Jing Yan's brows were filled with fatigue, but he still looked up at Cen Ting the moment he was able to.","That single glance made Cen Ting stiffen, her eyes flickering, as if a possibility had begun to take root in her heart.","\"Cen Ting, are you okay?\" Jing Yan said awkwardly. \"Don't worry, nothing happened between us.\"","Cen Ting nodded, then her eyes gradually turned cold. \"I've heard about what happened. No matter what you think, I won't let this go.\"","Jing Yan was stunned, then slowly recalled the despair he had felt earlier. His eyes also grew firm. \"I... agree with you, but you should know that if we expose this publicly...\"","\"I don't care about rumors. No one can set me up like this!\"","Jing Yan looked at Cen Ting and finally nodded.","Ji Fei looked around and thought, [Oh, the show's about to begin.]","Just as she was thinking, she felt Guo Yalan pat her on the shoulder.","Ji Fei looked over, puzzled.","Guo Yalan said admiringly, \"You really have a bit of mysticism in you. Following you really pays off with big scoops.\"","Ji Fei: ...Uh.","The rest of the arrangements were left to Jing Yan and Cen Ting, and the others left to wait and watch the drama unfold.","When they went outside, they found that everyone had apparently finished dealing with Jing Yu's antics, but he was still missing. The situation was getting worse, as they had discovered a room with clear signs of post-coital activity.","Jing Yu and Wan Ru insisted that Jing Yan and Cen Ting must have moved here to commit such a disgraceful act and had now fled.","Their smug expressions made it seem as if their plan had already succeeded.","With both of them missing and this suspicious evidence, even those who didn't believe it before began to entertain doubts.","Madam Xie's face was not good, until she saw Ji Fei and Qin Xian appear in the hall.","At the same time, the Cen family's call finally went through.","As soon as it connected, Cen Ting's calm and cool voice came through. \"Dad, what's going on? Why did you call so many times?\""]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278: This time he went too far, I can't let him off","paragraphs":["Cen Ting's father was getting anxious and immediately demanded, \"Where have you been? We couldn't find you. Who are you with right now? Why didn't you pick up your phone!\"","Cen Ting remained silent for a moment, and everyone's hearts were in their throats.","\"What's the situation? I just suddenly got inspired and went to the car to create. My phone was on silent, as it often is. Isn't my presence not needed here anymore?\"","The person speaking sounded a bit bewildered.","The Cen family members remembered that Cen Ting was indeed like this and immediately relaxed. They quickly said, \"Daughter, come back first. There are some troublesome matters. By the way, have you seen Jing Yan?\"","\"No, what's the matter?\"","The Cen family members on the phone seemed to find it hard to speak, so they just said, \"Come back and we'll talk.\"","After the call ended, the Cen family immediately confronted Wan Ru and Jing Yu, \"You heard that.\"","Wan Ru and Jing Yu's faces were not looking good. It felt too fast, and something was off.","\"Who knows,\" Wan Ru stubbornly retorted.","Jing Yu, though not speaking, was full of disbelief.","\"Then I'll just have to see how you continue to spread rumors during the confrontation later. I think this engagement might need to be reconsidered.\"","After being so insulted, the engagement was indeed worth reconsidering.","At that moment, Cen Ting didn't return, but Jing Yan did.","As soon as he arrived, all eyes were on him.","Seeing Jing Yan in different clothes, everyone couldn't help but think the worst.","Madam Xie trusted Jing Yan, so she directly asked, \"Didn't I ask you to handle something? What happened? You were gone for so long and couldn't be reached.\"","Jing Yan put on an innocent expression and raised his hand, which had just been bandaged, with blood seeping through the bandage.","\"Sorry, Auntie, I went to handle it, but I accidentally fell. Not only did I get my clothes wet, but I also injured my hand. I had no choice but to deal with it first before returning. My phone... it got wet and seems to be broken,\" Jing Yan said, holding up his dripping phone with a helpless expression.","Madam Xie was satisfied and let out a sigh of relief.","But Jing Yu couldn't hold back and jumped out, \"What a coincidence! I don't believe it. Both of you just happened to be out, and both of your phones happened to have issues. Are you treating us like three-year-olds?\"","\"What? Why are you bringing up Cen Ting?\" Jing Yan asked, puzzled.","\"Stop acting! Did you sleep with my fiancée? You actually did that to me, on my engagement day! You're a beast!\" Jing Yu shouted.","Jing Yan immediately became furious. \"What are you talking about? Can someone tell me what's going on here?\"","Madam Xie coldly looked at Jing Yu, realizing that he still didn't know when to stop. He was really going to ruin the reputation of the Jing family.","A kind acquaintance explained the situation.","Jing Yan laughed directly. \"Just because of these baseless speculations, you've decided to convict us? You should try calling everyone's phones here. If someone left early or was out playing and didn't pick up, would you also accuse them of having an affair?\"","\"I saw it with my own eyes,\" Wan Ru retorted, not giving Jing Yan a chance to argue.","Jing Yan looked at his sister. He thought his heart wouldn't hurt anymore, but it still felt like being pricked by a needle. His sister actually hated him so much? That ugly, vicious expression was just like their mother's.","Not to mention, the mastermind behind this was his mother.","He felt incredibly tired, utterly exhausted.","\"Just because I told Mother about your misbehavior and stopped you from entering the entertainment industry, you're treating me this way? Although it's well known that our relationship is bad, we're still siblings! Pranks should have limits!\" Jing Yan's tone carried genuine disappointment.","This made people believe him a bit more. After all, Wan Ru did seem like a selfish and malicious girl who didn't care about others' feelings. And their sibling relationship was indeed strained.","\"You!\" Wan Ru, though purely malicious, still stammered a bit. She could only stubbornly shout, \"I'm telling the truth! It's the truth! You're both unclear! You're coveting your brother's fiancée!\"","Jing Yan's face darkened immediately.","Seeing this, Jing Yu made up his mind. Judging from Jing Yan's reaction, something must have happened. If something happened, there was a way to deal with it!","\"Hmph, I don't believe anything you say. We'll confront each other when Cen Ting returns!\" Jing Yu didn't believe they could get away with it. There was no such thing as a coincidence in the world, unless the heavens were helping him.","As soon as he said that, Jing Yan's eyes flashed with panic. This made Jing Yu even more smug.","\"We're innocent. You can make a fuss all you want, but now you need to come with me. Auntie gave me a task that hasn't been completed. Come and help me,\" Jing Yan said.","This move puzzled people.","Some thought he was confident in his innocence, so he prioritized important matters.","Others thought Jing Yan might be feeling guilty and wanted to settle things privately with his cousin, using threats or bribes.","Jing Yu thought the latter. Seeing the usually composed Jing Yan so eager, he felt truly satisfied.","\"What could be more important than proving your innocence?\" Jing Yu said, raising his chin.","\"Family matters. Come with me,\" Jing Yan said, his tone a bit anxious. Jing Yu felt even more triumphant.","\"I'm not going. I'll wait here for Cen Ting to return,\" Jing Yu said, feeling like he was on top of the world.","\"Auntie, I can't do it alone. I need Jing Yu's help,\" Jing Yan directly appealed to Madam Xie.","Madam Xie was also guessing that Jing Yan might be trying to find a way to get Jing Yu to change his story, to downplay the matter. So she nodded and cooperated, \"Jing Yu, go. Don't be willful. We'll talk about it later.\"","Jing Yu became even more resentful of his mother, feeling that she was always biased towards Jing Yan. But then he thought, it didn't matter. As long as he went with Jing Yan, the suspicion about Jing Yan and Cen Ting would be planted in everyone's minds forever. Even if they had any tricks to force him to change his story, it wouldn't matter.","Unexpectedly, in his panic, Jing Yan had made the worst move.","So he'll go with him. He just wanted to see Jing Yan's ugly defeat.","\"I have to make it clear. If you want me to cover up your scandal, I won't agree,\" Jing Yu said boldly, making the onlookers even more inclined to believe the rumors.","As Jing Yu passed by Jing Yan, Jing Yan didn't immediately follow. Instead, he came to Madam Xie's side, his expression unreadable. Finally, he whispered in a voice only the two of them could hear, \"I'm sorry, Auntie. This time, he's gone too far. I can't let him off.\"","Madam Xie's body swayed, and her wise eyes gradually filled with helplessness and sorrow. \"I understand.\""]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279: Excessive Pride Comes at a Cost","paragraphs":["Madam Xie understood Jing Yan's intentions. In the past, Jing Yan had often been targeted, and she knew that Jing Yan, because of her, rarely quarreled with Jing Yu.","In fact, she always felt somewhat guilty towards Jing Yan, so she had to double her efforts in nurturing this child.","But this time, things had gone too far, involving innocent people, and Jing Yan wouldn't tolerate it any longer.","This was a good thing; only then could Jing Yan become the future heir of the Jing family.","Moreover, Madam Xie felt that her education of her son had been quite a failure. This time, she would let her son face the consequences of his actions, which might truly teach him a lesson, as small scuffles were no longer enough to change Jing Yu.","Even if Jing Yu refused to repent, suppressing him this time would likely prevent him from causing major trouble in the future.","This was the right approach.","Ji Fei, who had witnessed everything and already knew the plan through the system, couldn't help but sigh.","[A kind mother often spoils her son. Even though Madam Xie isn't exactly a kind mother but rather a strict one, how did Jing Yu still turn into such a scoundrel? Could it be that some people are just born bad, and they were born into the wrong family? Maybe they really were born into the wrong family. It feels like Jing Yan is more like Madam Xie's son, while Jing Yu, being so vicious, seems more like Madam Wan's son. It's just like Madam Wan doesn't treat Jing Yan well, haha, this melodramatic plot just came to me out of nowhere.]","Ji Fei chuckled at her own thoughts, deciding not to delve too deeply into people's family relationships.","Qin Xian didn't think much of it either, as Madam Wan's attitude towards Jing Yu was okay but not particularly warm. Her mistreatment of Jing Yan had its reasons, though it was criticized, it made sense.","\"What's going on? What exactly are they planning to do?\" The little group had started discussing.","\"Are they going to fight back or compromise?\"","\"Please don't compromise! They have to give them a proper slap in the face!\"","However, Luo Fei and Guo Yalan, who had returned with them, didn't know the specifics either; it was all arranged by Cen Ting and Jing Yan.","At that moment, the hall became noisy again. Everyone turned to look and saw that Cen Ting had returned.","The Cen family members immediately stepped forward to explain the situation, but Cen Ting cut them off, saying, \"I know what everyone wants to ask. I'll show you the truth right now.\"","With that, Cen Ting walked up to the stage where they had held the engagement ceremony and approached the control panel, picking up his phone and starting to operate it.","[Oh, big screen live broadcast is here, big screen live broadcast is on duty, big screen live broadcast will shatter the darkness for you.]","Qin Xian and the other Qin family members had already guessed what was coming.","But the onlookers were still confused, unsure of what Cen Ting was about to do.","Madam Wan and Wan Ru, however, began to feel uneasy.","The paparazzi, who hadn't left yet, once again started secretly preparing to film.","The big screen originally displayed a photo of Cen Ting and Jing Yu.","Suddenly, it switched to a video call screen, though no one was visible, only the surrounding scenery, which was undoubtedly nearby.","Then, the voices of two people came through.","Jing Yan led Jing Yu to the back garden and, filled with anger, spoke, \"Why did you do this?!\"","\"I have no idea what you're talking about,\" Jing Yu replied, not foolish enough to admit anything.","Jing Yan countered, \"You don't need to act. There are no cameras around here, you know that. I know you wouldn't let me off, and I did indeed fall for your trap. I just want to know why you're doing this to me. Is our relationship so bad that you'd use your fiancée's reputation to set me up?\"","Jing Yan's expression was a mix of pain and struggle. If it weren't for the desire to see Jing Yan defeated, Jing Yu might have been more cautious. But now, he couldn't resist the urge to gloat in front of Jing Yan, enjoying the feeling of success and even imagining Jing Yan begging for mercy later.","Jing Yu, who had been suppressed for years, finally had his chance to rise and found it hard to contain his excitement.","He quickly scanned the area to make sure everything was safe, then burst into laughter. \"Jing Yan, Jing Yan, no matter how much Mom and those old fogeys praise you for being excellent, you still fell into my hands!\"","The conversation was broadcasted to the hall, and everyone fell silent at that moment.","But soon, the crowd became excited.","\"Wow! That's explosive! Is there a big scandal?\"","\"So, the two of them really did sleep together, but it was Jing Yu who set them up?\"","\"Why would Jing Yu give himself a green hat? Is he crazy?\"","Meanwhile, Madam Wan and Wan Ru's faces turned pale. They immediately stood up to stop it, but before they could even get up, four bodyguards pushed them back down.","\"What are you doing? Let us go!\" Madam Wan tried to shout, but her voice couldn't carry that far, failing to serve any warning purpose. She only ended up hoarse, looking like a madwoman.","\"Let go, let go! Ahhh, help!\" Wan Ru was even more frantic.","Madam Xie waved her hand, and the two were silenced, preventing anyone from misinterpreting the information.","[Well done. Madam Xie is determined to expose her son. Jing Yu is too funny, though. Jing Yan must know him well enough to set this trap. After all, villains always talk too much and end up paying the price for their arrogance.]","Qin Xian knew that this was the best solution Jing Yan could think of. Unless Jing Yu confessed himself, no matter how they accused him, it would lead to endless arguments, and their reputations would never be cleared. But using this method, the effect might be better than expected. Everything depended on Jing Yan's persuasion skills.","Jing Yan naturally wouldn't let the other two off, so he directly asked, \"I didn't lose to you; I lost to my mother and sister. How did you convince them to drug me? Did you threaten them or promise them something?\"","This made Jing Yu laugh even harder. \"Look at you, such a pitiful wretch, still making excuses for your mother and sister. Let me make it clear to you. The idea actually came from your mother. She didn't want you to be the head of the Jing family, so she teamed up with me to deal with you. As long as your reputation is ruined, the Jing family will never let you be the heir. They are your closest relatives, but they hate you so much that they want to destroy everything you have. You've failed as a person, haha.\"","Jing Yu, because of Madam Xie's favoritism towards Jing Yan, liked to use the topic of their mother to hurt Jing Yan, not realizing that he had completely exposed their ugly scheme.","The onlookers in the hall were already in an uproar.","Madam Wan and Wan Ru forgot to struggle, staring in disbelief at the big screen, their heads buzzing. They never expected their plot to be exposed in such a way, as if everything had vanished in an instant.","When the overwhelming gazes of the crowd fell upon them, they finally felt the panic."]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280: Crazy Self-Destruction","paragraphs":["“No wonder he was so energetic before, quite the actor!”","“The way she desperately tried to smear her own brother before, thinking about it now makes me sick.”","“They're both sick, this mother and daughter, treating their own family like this.”","“Not just sick, but vicious. The word 'vicious' should be carved into their foreheads. It's a curse for Jing Yan to have such relatives.”","“Joining forces with outsiders to deal with her own son is truly not a behavior that can be understood by ordinary people.”","“Jing Yu isn't any better, just now he was calling Jing Yan an animal, but I think he fits the description more.”","“Trying to pretend to be the victim, let's see if you even have the brain for it!”","“A scumbag, actually sacrificing his fiancée to frame his cousin. Look at the faces of the Cen family, they're livid. This is utterly humiliating.”","The expressions of the Jing family members were also quite grim. Everyone turned to look at Madam Xie, expecting her, as Jing Yu's mother, to explode in anger. Yet, at this moment, she sat there calmly.","This calmness infuriated Madam Wan even more, her eyes turning red with rage. She struggled violently, and if not for the gag in her mouth and the hands holding her down, she would have charged over to Madam Xie and started shouting.","Ji Fei, who had been watching the spectacle, suddenly felt something was off. Madam Wan's hatred for Madam Xie was completely unmasked. Was it just because Madam Xie had her people restrain them?","By now, Jing Yu had revealed everything he had planned. Seeing Jing Yan's troubled expression, he laughed and said, “I didn't shortchange you. I didn't even touch Cen Ting, I left her for you. Consider it my exchange for the position of heir. Anyway, you're finished, and when Cen Ting returns, everything will be over.”","At this, Jing Yu arrogantly added, “Maybe, if you kneel down and beg me now, I might consider changing my story and leave you some dignity. But the position of heir? Don't even think about it. You'll always be my defeated rival.”","At this point, Jing Yan's aura finally began to change. He sneered, “Defeated rival? Winning by such despicable means, do you really think it's something to be proud of? You really let down your late aunt.”","“Shut up! I gave you a chance, and you didn't take it, did you? Fine, I'll make sure to pin the charge of forcing Cen Ting on you!” Jing Yu, seeing Jing Yan's defiance, instantly erupted in anger.","“Ha, do you really think Cen Ting will cooperate with you after you drugged her?”","“She's a woman who got involved with her fiancé's cousin at the engagement party. If she's smart, she'll play the victim. Otherwise, she'll be ruined. But even if she pretends nothing happened, it won't matter. I won't let her off the hook.” Jing Yu boasted.","Jing Yan was almost amused by his arrogance. “You really think you're something, don't you?”","Jing Yu didn't notice that Jing Yan's tone had completely changed. He was too engrossed in his own plan to see it.","“What, you think I can't do it? It's simple. Just get a doctor to examine Cen Ting's body and see if she's been slept with recently! That's not something you can argue against. If she refuses the exam, it just proves her guilt!”","As soon as he finished, a loud punch was heard.","“What gives you the right? Who do you think you are!” Jing Yan roared in anger.","The calm facade he had maintained while setting traps was shattered by Jing Yu's shameless proposal.","Even Ji Fei and the others hadn't anticipated that Jing Yu would resort to moral blackmail. Such a move was a complete humiliation for Cen Ting, a young lady from a prestigious family.","Everyone turned to look at Cen Ting on the stage. She lowered her eyes, her expression as cold as ice.","“Hit me harder! The harder you hit, the worse people will think you are when they see you later. Hahaha!” Jing Yu, unable to fight back physically, resorted to provoking Jing Yan.","Jing Yan breathed heavily, then let out a cold laugh. “Jing Yu, you're beyond redemption. But don't get too smug. Do you really think you can succeed? Let me tell you, Cen Ting and I didn't do anything.”","Jing Yu was stunned, then quickly retorted, “Impossible! If nothing happened, why were you hiding?”","“Don't you know how long the effects of the drug you gave me would last? If something had really happened, would I be awake now?” Jing Yan said coldly.","As he said this, Jing Yu began to doubt, unable to refute.","“I was indeed drugged, and Cen Ting was also incapacitated by you. But I still had my wits about me and hurt my hand to stay awake until help arrived,” Jing Yan continued.","Jing Yu seemed to have a moment of clarity. “It was Qin Xian and Ji Fei!”","“Yes, our friends brought a doctor and got us treatment, which is why we're back now.” Jing Yan said, “So your plan failed. Cen Ting is still a pure and good girl. You can't hurt her.”","Jing Yu's scheme was disrupted, and his face turned ugly. He glared viciously at Jing Yan, then suddenly smiled as if he thought of something.","“If that's the case, why did you ask me out alone? Isn't it because you're unsure inside? Even if you keep saying nothing happened, who would believe you? We found a crime scene! I can still demand Cen Ting be examined. Whether she agrees or not, I'll express my doubts and suspicions. I don't believe the Jing family will still announce you as the heir with such a suspicious cloud over you!”","“What crime scene?” Jing Yan immediately frowned.","Jing Yu became smug again.","“Naturally, the place where you two left after your 'fun'.”","“Bullshit, so it was another room you set up.”","“So what if it was? You were just unlucky. You see... that was the room I used with your sister. Since you were hiding there, we just gave it to you. Hahaha!”","Jing Yu still habitually tried to hurt Jing Yan by involving his family. Boasting about sleeping with his sister and conspiring with her against him, Jing Yu was deeply satisfied.","But for Jing Yan, it no longer mattered. His heart had already broken with the betrayal by that mother and daughter.","However, the hall was in shock.","Everyone was exclaiming, no wonder the ungrateful sister would treat her own brother like this; she was clearly siding with outsiders.","Again, they exclaim, the rich really are messy, and Jing Yan is really unlucky.","At this moment, Wan Ru's face turned the color of pork liver. Although she had been willing, she didn't want to be brought up in public like this. Jing Yu also had a loose tongue; how could he just blurt everything out.","It was truly over.","No one noticed that Madam Wan, who had been struggling violently just moments ago, went completely still upon hearing Jing Yu's words, as if her soul had left her body."]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281: As long as it doesn't kill you, keep going until you die","paragraphs":["【Oh, oh, oh, the big idiot has blown himself up completely, I can't even imagine what expression he'll have when he comes back and realizes he's destroyed his own plan. It must be absolutely priceless.】","Ji Fei was laughing heartily while watching the live broadcast. This turn of events not only exposed Jing Yu's despicable nature but also revealed the malicious intentions of Madam Wan and her daughter, completely ruining their reputation.","\"Cutting ties decisively, I always felt that mother and daughter weren't worthy of being Jing Yan's relatives. Now that such things have come to light, even if Jing Yan doesn't deal with them, they won't be able to use morality to manipulate him anymore,\" Yu Yue said.","Bai Xiaoxi nodded in agreement, \"That mother and daughter are truly heartless. Jing Yan treated them so well, yet instead of being grateful, they plotted against him at every turn.\"","\"Jing Yan getting rid of that mother and daughter, and Cen Ting getting rid of Jing Yu—it's a win-win situation!\" Guo Yalan even wanted to clap her hands in celebration.","Luo Fei also nodded, \"The engagement is definitely going to be called off this time.\"","The Cen family needed Cen Ting for a political marriage, but the marriage partner absolutely couldn't bring such a huge negative impact.","This led the small group to start gossiping.","\"So, is it possible that the engagement partner might be changed?\" Bai Xiaoxi speculated.","\"Baby's right, after all, they're both victims,\" Yu Yue immediately agreed.","\"What, my girl who was just about to regain her single status is going to be tied down again?\" Guo Yalan was astonished.","\"Although the self-exposure has mostly cleared up certain things, some people will still secretly harbor doubts, and rumors will spread even more,\" Luo Fei said, \"Moreover, the engagement was originally decided by the elders of both families. There's still a possibility of changing the partner.\"","No way, wouldn't that mean Jing Yan gets a double win? Not only will he reclaim his position as the heir, but he might even get the girl. Jing Yu and that mother-daughter duo are basically the ultimate big losers who are just handing out benefits, aren't they?!","Although the situation sounded quite dramatic, Qin Xian couldn't deny that it was indeed highly possible.","After all, the marriage alliance between the two families wasn't concerned with the children's feelings but needed a title to strengthen the bond between them. It was said that several cooperation projects were waiting for this marriage to be finalized.","Everyone was letting their imaginations run wild, as the situation had basically been settled, so there was no need to worry anymore.","But the next moment, Madam Wan created a huge commotion.","No one knew where she found the strength, but she managed to push away the bodyguards holding her and regained her freedom, shouting, \"It's impossible! This is absolutely impossible! My daughter could never... it's impossible, it's impossible!\"","At this point, Madam Wan suddenly charged furiously towards Madam Xie, \"Did you do this? Did you set this up to frame us?\"","Everyone watching felt that Madam Wan was acting abnormally.","Even Wan Ru was shocked by her mother's outburst, unable to understand why her mother was reacting so violently. Even if she had something with Jing Yu, it shouldn't have driven her mother to such madness. Could it be that deep down, her mother hated Jing Yu because he was Madam Xie's son? Was her mother so opposed to Madam Xie that she absolutely refused any connection between them?","But Jing Yu had already confessed, so there was nothing she could do about it.","Madam Wan's outburst was completely ignored by Madam Xie. She was about to have someone escort Madam Wan out, as a mother like her was probably not someone Jing Yan would want to see. As for the scheme involving Jing Yan and Cen Ting, the two families would discuss and come up with a plan to make Madam Wan pay for her actions.","But before Madam Xie could arrange for someone to act, Madam Wan suddenly froze, her body trembling uncontrollably, as if she were terribly afraid, and then she became eerily quiet.","Everyone again felt that Madam Wan was acting strangely, as if she were having some kind of episode.","Meanwhile, on the big screen, Jing Yan was already smiling calmly as he said to Jing Yu, \"Thank you for your cooperation. You've helped Cen Ting and me prove our innocence.\"","\"What did you say?\" Jing Yu was stunned.","Jing Yan took out his previously wet phone and ended the video call.","Jing Yu's face changed instantly.","\"Without surveillance, you didn't think about the phone? Or were you stupid enough to believe that I was telling the truth when I said my phone had gotten wet and stopped working? Jing Yu, you really have no brain,\" Jing Yan said.","\"You... you... how dare you?! You must be bluffing...\"","\"Go back and check,\" Jing Yan said calmly.","Jing Yu panicked. The joy of triumph turned into despair so quickly. Just a moment ago, he was boasting and gloating, but now it felt like he had been pushed off a high building. He could no longer care about anything else and rushed back to the hall in disbelief, trying to recall everything he had said.","The wind rushing past seemed to slap him in the face.","In a state of panic, he racked his brains, wondering if there was any chance of a comeback if everyone knew what he had done.","But when he appeared in the hall, the entire audience looked at him with scorn and disdain, and he could hardly stand.","His expression twisted gradually, from confusion to anger, and then to fear and despair.","【Wow, that expression could be included in a film textbook.】","Not only Ji Fei thought so, but some entertainment journalists also couldn't resist. Although they were paid by Jing Yu to capture the big scoop, they didn't expect their boss to become the main story himself. They were very professional, and such a sensational event couldn't be left undocumented.","The flash of a camera went off.","Jing Yu suddenly woke up, roaring in fury, \"Who, who the hell is taking photos!\"","Everyone chuckled, as after the incident of a group of entertainment journalists blocking the door, they understood that this was his own arrangement. He had wanted to frame his cousin and fiancée, but ended up reaping what he sowed—what a fitting retribution.","The faint sounds of ridicule seemed like waves washing over Jing Yu. He couldn't help but look at his accomplices. Madam Wan was as pale as a ghost, her soul seemingly departed, not even daring to look at him. Wan Ru was both anxious and angry, her eyes full of blame.","Jing Yu's mentality finally collapsed. Especially when he looked up and saw Cen Ting standing on the stage, towering above him.","\"Damn it, you bitch, you set me up!\" Jing Yu completely shifted the blame and charged towards Cen Ting.","Others wanted to stop him, but surprisingly, the usually aloof and distant Cen Ting also charged towards Jing Yu.","This was so out of character for her that even Jing Yu was momentarily stunned and stopped in his tracks.","But he stopped, and Cen Ting didn't. She rushed forward and slapped Jing Yu across the face.","Jing Yu, who had already been hit by his mother and Jing Yan, couldn't believe that Cen Ting dared to lay a hand on him.","He glared back viciously, ready to retaliate, but was completely disoriented by Cen Ting's continuous slaps.","The sound was almost rhythmic, leaving everyone watching in shock.","\"She actually knows how to hit people?\" Bai Xiaoxi exclaimed in astonishment.","\"Wow, Cen Ting doesn't strike often, but when she does, she really makes an impact!\" Yu Yue gave a thumbs up.","\"I've never seen such a violent side of Cen Ting,\" Guo Yalan also marveled.","\"She must have been pushed to her limit,\" Luo Fei said.","【Hit well, hit brilliantly, hit like a champ! Scumbags like him deserve to be slapped like this. Even if the harm was not carried out, it's still harm, so as long as it doesn't kill him, slap him until he's half-dead.】"]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282: Cen Ting wants to do whatever, and the Jing family will accept it.","paragraphs":["“Cen Ting, you vile creature!” Jing Yu was initially caught off guard by the slap, but as soon as he regained his senses, he certainly wasn’t going to let a mere woman strike him without retaliation.","However, before he could raise his hand, his wrist was seized. Jing Yu turned his head and found himself face-to-face with Jing Yan, who had somehow appeared by his side.","This only fueled Jing Yu’s fury further, and he was now consumed with a desire to kill Jing Yan. “You’re so protective of her! You two must have something going on. I was tricked into saying those things by you. The truth is, you’ve been coveting my fiancée. You two are shameless, committing incest!”","Jing Yan, caught off guard by Jing Yu’s persistence in spewing such accusations, almost laughed in anger. “Do you think everyone here is a fool?”","Jing Yu didn’t care. He was determined to pin this accusation on them no matter what.","“You dare say you haven’t touched her! I’d never believe it. You two must have...”","Suddenly, another slap landed, this one even harder.","Jing Yu was knocked to the ground by the force of the blow. He clutched his aching face, stunned, as he looked up at Madam Xie, who had struck him.","“Poisoning, scheming, framing, and now this shameless defense. Jing Yu, you’ve truly disappointed me.” Madam Xie, though not outwardly hysterical, was inwardly shattered. She had long known her son was no good, but she never imagined he had rotted to the core.","Jing Yu’s gaze toward Madam Xie changed as well. He had always harbored resentment toward her, but now it had turned into outright hatred.","Having seen the video and knowing what had transpired, his mother not only didn’t try to help him but instead chose to condemn him and support Jing Yan. Normally, he could have tolerated this, but this was a critical moment where either he or Jing Yan would emerge victorious. If only his mother had sided with him, the situation could have been turned around!","But she chose to favor someone else, and Jing Yu was filled with a hatred so deep it consumed him. “Mom, why are you treating me like this?”","Madam Xie couldn’t bear to meet her son’s hostile gaze and stepped forward to take control of the situation.","“I apologize for the spectacle today. It’s my failure as a mother that led my son to behave in such a manner. I hereby formally announce the cancellation of Jing Yu’s engagement to Cen Ting.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Cen Ting’s eyes sparkled, and she finally released the breath she had been holding.","Although everyone had anticipated this outcome, hearing Madam Xie’s announcement still felt surreal. The engagement, which had been set just an hour ago, was now canceled.","The Jing and Cen families exchanged complex glances. While they certainly wouldn’t allow Cen Ting to continue her engagement with that beast, what about the collaboration between their families?","Madam Xie turned to Cen Ting and apologized. “You’re a good child, and it’s our Jing family that has wronged you. As compensation, if your family still wishes to form a union with ours, you may choose any unmarried member of the Jing family.”","Cen Ting was taken aback, and Jing Yan stiffened immediately, his eyes involuntarily darting toward Cen Ting. Meanwhile, the Cen and Jing families below were overjoyed.","【Madam Xie is truly remarkable. She’s going to replace Cen Ting’s fiancé on the spot!】","The small crowd erupted in excitement. Although there were many unmarried members of the Jing family, the most prominent and likely candidate was none other than Jing Yan. Could it be that their speculation was correct?","Madam Xie spoke with utmost seriousness. “Of course, you can choose the heir.”","As soon as these words were uttered, the room erupted in excitement.","Cen Ting, unable to help herself, looked up at Jing Yan, only to find that their eyes met.","The Cen family immediately grew excited. “The heir?”","They had never considered the possibility of their daughter becoming the heir, not because their family wasn’t qualified, but because they understood their daughter’s personality. She preferred to immerse herself in her own world and pursue her dreams, so she wouldn’t make a good matriarch.","In any prominent family, the matriarch couldn’t ignore the family’s affairs, even if she didn’t work in the company. She would still be involved in social circles. Cen Ting, however, didn’t want that, which was why she had previously been suited only for someone like Jing Yu, who didn’t take over the family business. They had been a match of mutual indifference.","Now, with Madam Xie’s offer, it seemed they were willing to compromise. Cen Ting could still live freely, and they were offering her the position as compensation.","This left the Cen family in a difficult position. They wanted to demand justice for their daughter’s suffering, but with such a sincere apology, it was hard to press further.","Madam Xie directly announced, “In light of this, I hereby officially declare that the future heir of the Jing family has been chosen.” She exchanged nods with the elders of the Jing family and pointed to Jing Yan. “Jing Yan, step forward.”","Jing Yan took a step forward.","Madam Xie then formally declared, “From today onward, Jing Yan will gradually take over my responsibilities. I hope you will all continue to support our Jing family’s child.”","The atmosphere, which had been awkward as people watched the drama unfold, suddenly shifted into one of succession announcement. It seemed that Jing Yu’s antics had indeed fulfilled the old saying: losing both his wife and his military strength.","【I can’t believe it! Did Jing Yan really just get this opportunity? My emotions are so mixed. It’s like watching a couple I never shipped suddenly announce they’re official. I’d love to interview Jing Yu now. How does it feel to lose everything you tried to gain?】","Everyone was eager to see Jing Yu’s reaction, but instead, Jing Yu suddenly burst out, shouting, “Mom, how can you be so biased? Am I not your son? Is he? You’re even trying to pair them together. How can you treat me like this?!”","Jing Yu was so enraged that his eyes turned red. The cancellation of the engagement and the loss of his position as heir were things he could still endure, but to have what was rightfully his snatched away and given to Jing Yan was something he could never accept.","This time, Wan Ru finally saw her chance. Initially feeling like she had no way to turn things around, she now became ecstatic. “I know, I know! You must have known about their affair and are using this opportunity to whitewash them! So I wasn’t lying. I’ve often seen them acting suspiciously. I’m a witness!”","【This girl is hell-bent on destroying her brother. Is she just stubbornly refusing to admit defeat?】","Qin Xian: One could say she’s refusing to cry until she sees the coffin.","“Wan Ru, are you a goldfish? Have you forgotten that Jing Yu just admitted they drugged and framed them?” Jing Yan sternly warned.","But some people are like that—they can ignore what just happened and continue to make baseless accusations. “Then why would she suddenly change her fiancé? Who would believe there’s nothing going on?”","Wan Ru was like a shadowy figure hiding behind the internet, spreading vague rumors to stir up trouble.","However, most people had their own judgment and saw her for what she was—a petty clown.","Madam Xie also stepped forward and said, “We haven’t even pursued what you and your mother did yet. You’d best behave. And I haven’t finished speaking yet. Who said I was trying to pair them together? I merely offered Cen Ting a choice.”","With that, Madam Xie looked at Cen Ting, who was slightly frowning.","“That was just one suggestion. If you don’t wish to marry into the Jing family, I’ll adopt you as my daughter. If you truly don’t want to deal with anything related to the Jing family, I’ll compensate you in other ways.”","Madam Xie never believed that simply replacing a woman’s partner was compensation. True compensation was giving her the confidence to make her own choices.","Adopting her as a daughter could still maintain the connection between the two families. If she truly didn’t want that, there were other ways. In short, whatever Cen Ting wanted, the Jing family would accept."]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283: I Want to Be Your Godchild","paragraphs":["Madam Xie's proposal came as a surprise to everyone, yet it was also admirable. She showed Cen Ting the utmost respect.","Cen Ting was slightly moved. Just moments ago, she had been feeling troubled. After experiencing such an ordeal, she truly felt repelled by the idea, not to mention her suspicions about Jing Yan's feelings toward her...","But now, because of Madam Xie's words, Cen Ting felt as if she had been reborn, with all the shackles on her soul lifted.","Madam Xie smiled and said, \"Which one will you choose? Or shall I give you more time to think it over?\"","After all, Cen Ting was the one she had chosen, and because of her son, Cen Ting had suffered. She had to take responsibility for this.","Madam Xie's reasoning was accepted by both the Jing and Cen families, though they still leaned toward the idea of a marriage alliance, as it seemed more stable and reassuring. The Cen family members were subtly hinting at Cen Ting to choose that option.","Onlookers thought Cen Ting had actually come out ahead in this situation.","Small groups began discussing what Cen Ting might choose.","Ji Fei whispered to Qin Xian, \"What do you think?\"","Qin Xian shook his head. \"I have no idea.\"","Ji Fei's eyes sparkled as she said, \"How about we make a bet? You pick one, I pick one. Whoever guesses right can ask the other to do something.\"","[Hehe, I already know what Cen Ting is thinking. She's going to choose to be Madam Xie's goddaughter. I'm definitely going to win! Now, let me think about what to make Qin Xian do... hehe...]","Ji Fei's inner laughter grew increasingly mischievous.","Qin Xian, though unsure of what Ji Fei had in mind, blushed first at the mere thought.","\"Alright... alright,\" he said. \"I'll choose the first option, the marriage alliance.\"","Ji Fei immediately beamed. \"Then I'll be nice and let you have the second option. I choose the goddaughter!\"","Seeing Ji Fei smile as if she had hit the jackpot, Qin Xian couldn't help but smile too.","Their tablemates overheard their conversation and joined in the betting.","\"I wonder what Jing Yan thinks about this,\" Luo Fei said, considering his friend's feelings.","\"He likes...\" Guo Yalan started to say something about Jing Yan possibly liking men, but Luo Fei quickly cut her off.","[Playful banter is one thing, but don't joke about a friend's orientation.] Ji Fei caught on and struggled not to laugh.","[It's hilarious how his unrequited crush is so secret that even his friends don't know about it, and now people are questioning his sexuality. Poor Jing Yan. If his friends knew how he felt, they'd probably be trying to set him up with Cen Ting right now.]","As they were thinking this, Cen Ting spoke up. She wasn't one to hesitate. Before, she had no choice, but now that she could choose...","\"Auntie, I...\"","\"Cen Ting,\" Jing Yan finally couldn't hold back any longer.","He had been too afraid to fight for her before, considering Aunt Er's kindness. Now the marriage was something Jing Yu had ruined on his own. If he hesitated to move forward at this point, it would truly show he had no courage. After ten years of affection, he needed to fight for himself this time.","This was the closest he had ever been to holding the hand of the girl he had been secretly in love with for ten years.","Just as Jing Yan was about to speak, Cen Ting said, \"I've made my decision.\"","Her cold tone stopped Jing Yan in his tracks. Their eyes met, and without a word, it felt as though the answer was already clear.","Cen Ting knew his feelings.","But Cen Ting had made her choice.","And he had no right to interfere.","Jing Yan fell silent, looking even more dejected than after being set up. He was utterly heartbroken.","Such a simple exchange didn't raise any suspicions of romance. People were just curious about Cen Ting's choice.","Madam Xie was also curious, surprised at how quickly Cen Ting had made her decision.","\"I want to be your goddaughter,\" Cen Ting said directly.","The moment the words left her mouth, many people gasped in disbelief.","They had really thought Cen Ting would choose to marry Jing Yan, considering they had known each other for years and were both of good character and ability. It seemed Cen Ting wouldn't find a better match.","The Cen family was particularly disappointed, but they couldn't force the wronged girl.","The small group at the table didn't feel too bad about it, as they still thought the two had no feelings for each other.","Ji Fei immediately grinned at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian smiled. \"You win. What do you want me to do?\"","Ji Fei said, \"I'll think about it slowly.\"","\"Alright.\"","Of course, recognizing a godchild wouldn't be done so casually. They would need to pick a lucky day for the ceremony.","After handling this matter, Madam Xie turned her attention to the three culprits.","\"Jing Yu, do you admit your mistake?\"","Seeing his enemies so well taken care of, Jing Yu was furious. He stood up and said, \"Admit my mistake? You treat Jing Yan like your own son, and Cen Ting like your goddaughter, but you don't want me, Xie Lifeng! You're doing great! You don't see the grievances I've suffered, you look down on me, and I don't care about you either. Today, I'm cutting ties with you! Go be a mother to them.\"","Jing Yu's father was so shocked he jumped out. \"How dare you talk to your mother like that! You've done wrong, apologize right now!\"","\"Are you threatening me?\" Madam Xie was hurt again by her son's words, but she managed to keep her emotions in check.","Jing Yu's vicious expression showed he was determined to outlast his mother in this battle, to see who would back down first.","\"If that's your decision, I don't object,\" Madam Xie said calmly. She wouldn't be threatened. Ever since she knew Jing Yu had ruined everything, she had decided to take drastic measures.","Even now, Madam Xie still wanted to save her son. Cutting ties, cutting off his financial support—perhaps only when he suffered enough would he grow up. To correct her son, she was willing to go this far.","\"You... you you...\" Jing Yu was so shocked by Madam Xie's agreement that he felt dizzy and almost fell.","\"How can you be so heartless? How can you treat Brother Yu like this?\" Wan Ru couldn't keep quiet. \"Are you really his mother?\"","Wan Ru's words almost made the onlookers laugh out loud.","Everyone had the same thought.","[What a hypocrite! You and your mother were even harsher to Jing Yan. What kind of person could raise a daughter with such twisted values? Oh, right, it's her mother. She's just as bizarre.]","Wan Ru didn't notice, but because of her words, Madam Wan suddenly snapped out of it, trying to pull Wan Ru back.","But Madam Xie had already locked eyes with Wan Ru. Her cold gaze and the aura of someone in power made Wan Ru freeze.","\"You're not part of our family, yet you're meddling in our affairs? Remember, what you and your mother did could be reported to the police.\"","Wan Ru was immediately silenced. She tried to pull her mother for help, but felt her mother pulling her back.","\"Mom!\" Wan Ru panicked and looked over.","She met the furious gaze of Madam Wan, who looked like she wanted to hit her, scold her, all while being overwhelmed with regret and fear. Her veins bulged, her eyes bloodshot, on the verge of breaking down."]},{"number":284,"title":"Chapter 284: They Absolutely Cannot Be Together","paragraphs":["Wan Ru was truly frightened this time. \"Mom, you...\"","\"Shut up, don't speak. Let's go, let's leave this place,\" Madam Wan said, her voice trembling with urgency.","Wan Ru was reluctant, but she was pulled to her feet by Madam Wan.","\"Hold on, without an explanation, who allowed you to leave?\" Madam Xie said.","\"He's my son, I don't need to explain how I treat him. Just as you don't need to explain how you treat Jing Yu to us!\" Madam Wan suddenly shouted.","\"We're not the same. If Jing Yu does something wrong, I punish him. But what has Jing Yan done wrong? Why are you treating him like this? Moreover, your actions involve Miss Cen from the Cen family. Do you think you can avoid responsibility? Jing Yu just said it—you're the mastermind! My former sister-in-law, what exactly are you trying to do?!\"","In truth, Madam Xie genuinely felt sorry for Jing Yan. She couldn't understand how a mother could harm her own son to this extent.","The crowd couldn't help but murmur among themselves. Some people knew about how Madam Wan had mistreated Jing Yan when she was in the Jing family. The general consensus was that a difficult childbirth and the death of her husband had driven Madam Wan to psychological imbalance, finding solace in tormenting her son and making his life miserable.","But this time, she had gone too far.","Not only did she want to completely ruin her son's reputation, but she also wanted to destroy his future.","Had this psychological imbalance reached the point where she needed to be sent to a mental institution?","Jing Yan was still reeling from the rejection of his unrequited love, unable to snap out of it. So, he had no interest in probing into what his mother and sister had done. After all, it was the same old story, and he was already numb to it.","Madam Wan, however, didn't seem inclined to explain herself. She just glared fiercely at Madam Xie. \"If you want to pursue this, fine. I'm his mother, and she's his sister. If you want to pursue anything, go talk to my son.\"","[Shameless, too shameless. She's resorting to moral blackmail again! In this situation, it's really hard to call the police. After all, it's a crime that didn't succeed, and it's between family members. This is tricky.]","\"So, you're not willing to take responsibility,\" Madam Xie said coldly.","Just then, a voice suddenly broke the stalemate.","\"Responsibility must be taken, but it's not as serious as everyone thinks.\"","A man strode quickly into the hall.","Without needing to ask, Qin Xian immediately spoke up, \"Mr. Wan, Wan Quan.\"","[Pfft, I can't wait to see if he has some perfect plan to save this mother and daughter.]","Wan Quan had been overseas negotiating business and had just returned. Upon receiving his daughter's distress call that they were being detained by the Jing family, he rushed over while also sending people to investigate the situation.","Wan Quan was cunning. \"Actually, there's been a misunderstanding.\"","\"Mr. Wan, you don't seem to know what's happened. So many people witnessed it. Do you really think it's just a misunderstanding?\" someone from the Jing family retorted.","Wan Quan smiled and said, \"The truth is, my daughter and Jing Yu were already in a relationship. Jing Yu, under pressure from Madam Xie, didn't dare to refuse the engagement. My wife couldn't bear to see the young couple separated, so she came up with this clumsy plan. It was also meant to give our rebellious son a small lesson. We didn't expect things to escalate this much.\"","[I see. Shamelessness really is hereditary. Not a family, not a door! How can he spin it like this?]","Qin Xian, however, frowned slightly, sensing that Wan Quan's intentions might not be as straightforward as his explanation.","Sure enough, the next moment, Wan Quan said, \"They made a mistake, and they'll apologize later. I also have a proposal. My wife and Jing Yan have an unbreakable mother-son relationship. Why not strengthen the bond and turn hostility into harmony? Since Jing Yu and Wan Ru are in a relationship, why not announce their engagement today? From now on, we'll all be one family. What conflicts can't be resolved then?\"","After Wan Quan finished speaking, everyone was stunned. Although they had known about the affair between the two, their attention had been diverted. Now, hearing Wan Quan's proposal... well, it was hard to comment!","The Wan family wasn't a particularly powerful elite family. They had only risen slightly due to their connection with Jing Yan. Now, Wan Quan was trying to marry his daughter into the Jing family. The sound of his calculating was loud and clear to everyone present.","Wan Ru and Cen Ting were not on the same level. Under normal circumstances, such a marriage would be impossible. But now, with Wan Quan's convincing words, it seemed plausible.","Since the affair had been indirectly admitted, if they were to marry, it could help salvage some of their reputation. After all, time would speak for itself, and some in the Jing family were open to the idea.","[Goodness, there's no limit to human shamelessness. Wan Quan's 'perfect plan' really is perfect. He knows his daughter's reputation is ruined and she doesn't even like Jing Yu, but if she marries into the Jing family and has Jing Yu's child, that child would be Madam Xie's grandchild. With proper upbringing, it could even become the next heir. Then, as the child's maternal family, the Wan family would naturally rise in status. This old fox really has long-term vision!]","Qin Xian: ...Indeed, he only knows how to use underhanded tactics. It's easy to imagine that if Wan Ru were to marry Jing Yu, the Wan family would immediately shift their focus to target Jing Yan, and they would be even more ruthless than Madam Wan.","Wan Quan stared at Madam Xie, who remained unmoved, and said, \"My daughter is young, and Jing Yu is her first boyfriend. I don't want my daughter to be used and toyed with.\"","[Is this an insinuation? The mastermind is said to be Madam Wan, but perhaps it's actually Jing Yu manipulating them. Too cunning! And it's also a threat to Madam Xie. If she doesn't agree, all the blame will be placed on Jing Yu.]","Madam Xie's expression indeed darkened. Unless she were to sever ties with Jing Yu, she would never allow a woman like Wan Ru into the family. Qin Xian could see it, and so could she.","Wan Quan, however, gave Wan Ru a look. Wan Ru pondered for a moment. Her reputation was already ruined today. It might be better to marry Jing Yu. She didn't believe Madam Xie would abandon Jing Yu. Then, they could slowly plot against Jing Yan and Cen Ting.","Jing Yu, however, was in a daze and wanted to protest. He definitely didn't want to marry Wan Ru. He was fine with playing around, but marriage was out of the question. And why should some random person dictate his fate? He refused. Moreover, he could tell that this old man was threatening him.","But before Jing Yu could speak, a voice roared out first.","\"No way!\"","The crowd, who had been enjoying the drama, was stunned. Madam Wan, as if possessed, shouted at Wan Quan, \"They absolutely cannot be together!\"","[How strange. Madam Wan's reaction is too intense. It's almost as if... wait? Could it really be that dramatic? Let me dig a little deeper...]"]},{"number":285,"title":"Chapter 285: So, did Jing Yu and Jing Yan get switched","paragraphs":["Not only did Ji Fei find it strange, but even Qin Xian felt that Madam Wan's reaction was off.","The Qin family, following Ji Fei's lead in gossiping, gradually mastered the essence of gossiping—without being outrageous or melodramatic, could it even be called gossip?","Hearing Ji Fei's exclamation, the Qin family couldn't help but start a heated discussion.","Qin's Father: \"Her reaction doesn't seem to suggest that she thinks Jing Yu is unworthy of Wan Ru.\"","Qin's Mom: \"Do you remember that soap opera we watched not long ago?\"","\"The one where the mother tried to stop the male lead from getting together with the second female lead?\" Qin Yan's elegant face was already glowing with excitement. \"Indeed, Madam Wan's expression now looks like she's about to burst into tears and shout...\"","[You can't be together because you're siblings with different fathers... My goodness, what did I just see?! So, Jing Yu and Jing Yan were switched at birth?!?]","Ji Fei's inner voice screamed first.","The Qin family: ......","!!!!!!!","Originally just gossiping and speculating wildly, now that Ji Fei had confirmed it, the Qin family's expressions were a mix of astonishment and disbelief.","While gossiping was fun, it was a bit too absurd for the people involved.","Qin Xian, hearing the conclusion, also instantly froze, his face turning icy. This revelation proved one thing.","All the psychological abuse Jing Yan had endured over the years was a complete joke.","Qin Xian's sharp gaze shot toward Madam Wan, whose face had already turned pale.","No matter the reason, abusing a child was unforgivable.","Ji Fei, too shocked by the juicy gossip, was fully focused on digging deeper for more truths and didn't notice the sudden change in Qin Xian's aura. However, others at the table felt the chill emanating from Qin Xian and couldn't help but shiver.","\"What's wrong?\" Luo Fei asked in surprise.","\"What else? He's just disgusted by the shamelessness of the Wan family,\" Guo Yalan said, exasperated. \"But what's Madam Wan's deal? Everyone can see that Wan Quan is trying to secure a bright future for the Wan family and Wan Ru. It seems like Wan Ru is willing to agree, but then Madam Wan pulls this stunt. It's really strange.\"","Bai Xiaoxi said, \"Could it be that one is playing the bad cop and the other the good cop, acting it out?\"","Yu Yue added, \"If that's the case, then this old lady's acting skills are top-notch. Her face is as pale as a corpse's.\"","\"Speaking of which, it doesn't seem like she's disgusted; it's more like she's afraid,\" Luo Fei suddenly frowned, unable to help but glance at Qin Xian again.","Qin Xian, however, was already thinking about how to expose this matter. He couldn't just stand by and do nothing.","Meanwhile, Madam Wan was truly caught between a rock and a hard place. Her mind was on the verge of collapse, but under immense pressure, she managed to hold herself together.","How could Jing Yu marry Wan Ru? Absolutely not!","But Wan Quan's expression was already very displeased, and even Wan Ru was beginning to resent her mother.","\"Don't be foolish. I know you think our daughter is still young and you don't want her to marry so early, but sooner or later, she will have to marry. It's better to marry into a family we know well, so we can rest assured, right?\" Wan Quan said, while giving his wife a meaningful look, hinting at her foolishness.","No, no, no! Who's being foolish? Madam Wan dares not be foolish! Right now, no one is clearer than Madam Wan, but she can't come up with a single reason to refute! Should she say that she switched the two children, and Jing Yu is actually her child and the eldest son of the Jing family, so he absolutely cannot marry Wan Ru, his half-sister?!?","After Ji Fei finished digesting all the gossip and hearing this, she finally couldn't hold back her complaints.","The Qin family's expressions became even more wonderful. Stop, stop, this is too much for our worldview.","What is called \"reaping the fruits of one's own actions,\" they truly experienced it deeply from Madam Wan.","Indeed, Madam Wan could only shake her head vigorously, her whole body trembling, and said, \"No, I don't agree, absolutely not! Husband, let's go home, I'm tired, let's go.\"","\"Mom, what are you doing!\" Wan Ru tried to pull her mother, trying to make her see reason.","Wan Quan also wanted to ask Madam Wan what she was so opposed to, but as long as Madam Wan didn't give a clear reason, Wan Quan and Wan Ru would not budge.","[How could she dare to say what she had done? Let alone now, when everyone knows about Jing Yu and Wan Ru... Oh my god, oh my god, oh my god! Don't let me think about those explosive details, I really don't want my worldview shattered! I know nothing, I know nothing!] Ji Fei hypnotized herself for a moment, then started muttering again. [Even if you were to pry open Madam Wan's mouth now, she wouldn't dare to refute with the truth, but without the truth, all her refutations seem so weak.]","The Qin family nodded in agreement as they listened to Ji Fei's thoughts. Wan Quan, having finally caught a break, wouldn't let it go.","Qin Xian's brow relaxed slightly at this point. Wan Quan was determined to secure this alliance, and even if Madam Wan were to act crazy, she wouldn't escape. She had trapped herself in a dead end, with no way out. Now, all they had to do was wait for the situation to unfold and intervene at the right moment...","Meanwhile, before the Wan family could sort things out themselves, Jing Yu exploded first.","Jing Yu hadn't expected his opposition to be voiced by Madam Wan, but he wasn't happy about it. Looking at the people around him and the occasional snippets of whispered conversations, it was clear that everyone was mocking him, mocking him not only for not getting Cen Ting but also for being rejected by Madam Wan for Wan Ru, of all people.","Jing Yu was almost furious with embarrassment.","What did that mean? Was he not good enough for Wan Ru? It was Wan Ru who wasn't good enough for him, and it should be him rejecting her, not the other way around. How dare Madam Wan look down on him?","Usually, Madam Wan treated him quite kindly, often privately praising him for being better than Jing Yan. She even willingly helped him and plotted against Jing Yan together. But now, when it came to her precious daughter, she revealed her true face, playing him like a fool.","Because neither Madam Xie nor Cen Ting had ever looked at him favorably, being rejected by them didn't feel like a huge insult. But being rejected by someone who often praised him like this triggered his biggest reaction.","\"What? Does Madam Wan look down on me?\" Jing Yu, who would usually call her \"Auntie,\" now used the formal title, indicating he was enraged and being sarcastic.","[Oh, she doesn't look down on you; she looks down on you too much!] Ji Fei also chimed in sarcastically in her mind.","Seeing Madam Wan's increasingly unsteady stance due to Jing Yu's mockery, Ji Fei couldn't help but want to spit out loud.","Indeed, evil begets evil!"]},{"number":286,"title":"Chapter 286: Is There Really a Problem with the Previous Generation's Emotions","paragraphs":["【The karma one creates will eventually come back to haunt them. Who could have imagined that Madam Wan would weave such a colossal lie and orchestrate a scheme that could tear the heavens apart? Originally, she could have basked in the satisfaction of revenge, but her own children proved to be so capable that they turned her grand performance into a scandal, forcing her into a corner where she had to endure unbearable truths and pressures. In the end, she was left to clean up the mess she had created, preventing the illusion from crumbling.】","The Qin Family, upon hearing this, grasped the key point: what kind of revenge could bring such satisfaction? It must be related to the reason behind switching the children.","However, Ji Fei was unable to provide any gossip services at the moment, as she was busy watching the drama unfold and muttering to herself.","Jing Yu glared menacingly, while Madam Wan could only lower her head and avoid eye contact, trying to take her daughter away. But no one was cooperating with her, leaving her no choice but to face Jing Yu. In a moment of desperation, she mustered her wits.","\"No, no, my child, it's... it's that my daughter is not worthy of you. I know, you two didn't actually... you didn't have any relationship at all. Naturally, you don't need to take any responsibility. Everything I said earlier was just to set up Jing Yan.\" As Madam Wan spoke, she became more convinced of her own reasoning and even started to smile with relief.","To the others, her words sounded bizarre. Even though they knew she had schemed against Jing Yan, it was strange that she would so casually admit it, just to clarify that Jing Yu and Wan Ru had no relationship.","This seemed to lack a sense of proportion.","Was she losing her mind?","Even Jing Yan, who had been drifting in his own thoughts, couldn't help but give a bitter smile upon hearing this. In his mother's eyes, being set up by her didn't seem to matter at all.","【She must be delusional. The blow must have been too great. It's as if, as long as it's not exposed, everything can be treated as if it never happened. After all, it's such a secret matter, known only to her. As long as she never acknowledges Jing Yu, she can take this secret to her grave... and thus, avoid facing the blunder caused by her own selfish motives.】","Seeing the spark of excitement in Madam Wan's eyes, Ji Fei really wanted to say: Sorry, but this secret is known to someone else, and she plans to let more people know.","If it weren't for Madam Wan's relentless schemes against Jing Yan, causing such a commotion, Ji Fei wouldn't have dug so deep and uncovered the truth.","Thinking of this, Ji Fei decided to take action. Her first instinct was to find her husband.","Unknown to her, Qin Xian had already become her go-to person for solving problems.","\"Don't you think Madam Wan seems a bit nervous?\" Ji Fei tried to hint, taking a roundabout approach.","Qin Xian, however, couldn't bear to see his wife struggle and directly said, \"I've had my suspicions for a while.\"","Ji Fei: ?","Qin Xian: \"Perhaps, Jing Yan and Jing Yu's identities are not what they seem.\"","Ji Fei: !","Qin Xian: \"We need to verify this.\"","Ji Fei was at a loss for words. She could only respond with, \"Really... really?\"","Qin Xian nodded, taking over Ji Fei's role in the drama.","Ji Fei was left in awe.","【Wow, Qin Xian is so smart! Looks like I don't need to help after all. I'll just keep enjoying the show.】","The Qin Family, overhearing this, could guess the context and began to look down on Qin Xian's actions, rolling their eyes at the back of his head.","Meanwhile, Jing Yu was momentarily stunned by Madam Wan's words. Although he felt she was still looking down on him and making excuses, her explanation saved face for him and spared him trouble.","Jing Yu calmed down, knowing he didn't want to marry Wan Ru, as that would be beneath him.","As long as he went along with Madam Wan's story, Mr. Wan couldn't threaten him.","\"That's more like it,\" Jing Yu sneered, no longer showing any respect for Madam Wan. Her heart ached even more, but she had no choice but to endure, only to find that she couldn't handle the situation completely.","\"Mom, what do you mean by that? How could you say such a thing about me?!\" Wan Ru was furious, her eyes turning red.","Madam Wan's forehead immediately throbbed with veins, the frustration of being unable to express her true feelings making her want to faint on the spot. It was a mix of anger, annoyance, and helplessness.","Ji Fei couldn't help but laugh.","【Hahaha, Wan Ru doesn't understand that Madam Wan is actually trying to cover up their embarrassment. If today's events were to confirm Madam Wan's story, even if something were to be exposed later, it wouldn't be a fatal blow to these two fools. But they're determined to pull away this lifeline. Madam Wan must be on the verge of a breakdown.】","The Qin Family also struggled to suppress their laughter: It's both infuriating and hilarious. Every cause has its effect, and Madam Wan's karma is her own children.","For Wan Ru, all she knew was that her mother was belittling her, saying she wasn't worthy of marrying Jing Yu.","Being told this by her own mother was unbearable. How could she not be worthy of a playboy like Jing Yu? And she had also realized that Jing Yu didn't want to marry her either.","Her mother wasn't helping; she was sabotaging her!","Madam Wan, in a panic, shouted at her, \"Shut up!\"","Wan Ru, in turn, shouted back, \"You can't just oppose me marrying Jing Yu because you hate Madam Xie! This is just you being selfish and gambling with my future!\"","Madam Wan hadn't expected her daughter to say such things in public, her face contorting with anger, yet she was left speechless.","The onlookers were also surprised. Although they knew the relationship between the former sisters-in-law was strained, they had never heard that Madam Wan hated Madam Xie.","Even Madam Xie was momentarily confused, looking at Madam Wan in disbelief. Although they had clashed earlier, it was over the children's affairs.","Back when they were sisters-in-law in the Jing Family, they rarely interacted. Madam Xie, being the heir, focused on external affairs, while Madam Wan handled internal matters. Their spheres of influence didn't overlap, so why would Madam Wan harbor such animosity?","At this moment, Second Master Jing, who had been standing in the background, glanced around with a slightly awkward expression. Since his older brother had passed away, he naturally couldn't tell his wife about that incident.","The Qin Family was struck with a realization, immediately connecting it to the reason behind the child swap.","Luckily, Ji Fei's thoughts soon provided the answer.","【Tsk tsk tsk, back then, the Jing Family had arranged for the eldest son to marry Madam Xie. But Madam Wan, wanting to get the eldest son for herself, drugged him and got him to sleep with her, ruining the engagement plan. This was done on a whim, so Madam Xie and outsiders were unaware, only the people involved knew.】","Qin Family: What? There was a love triangle in the previous generation?","【Although the eldest son had long been fond of Madam Xie, he couldn't resist the pressure from the family and eventually married Madam Wan. Madam Xie married the second son. Naturally, the eldest son and Madam Wan often clashed, with constant conflicts.】","Qin Family: Of course, there would be conflicts. Who could accept being manipulated like that?","But Madam Wan believed that the eldest son still harbored feelings for Madam Xie. With both of them working in the family business and frequently interacting, Madam Wan became even more suspicious and sensitive, convinced that Madam Xie was constantly enticing the eldest son's attention away from her. That's why she always held a grudge against Madam Xie, eventually leading to..."]},{"number":287,"title":"Chapter 287: Everyone is Fried on the Outside and Tender on the Inside","paragraphs":["The Qin family was left speechless. Madam Xie was truly wronged.","Even now, Madam Xie hadn't realized that she had been secretly admired by her elder brother-in-law. It was clear that the eldest son of the Jing family, after getting married, had never really crossed any boundaries.","Yet, Madam Wan blamed all her failures on Madam Xie.","She didn't even consider what she herself had done.","Qin Xian, however, didn't dwell on these thoughts. Upon hearing the truth, he understood why Madam Wan dared to make such a bold plan. It was because she had a precedent and knew what choices the Jing family would make in such situations, which emboldened her to frame Jing Yan and Cen Ting without fear.","But unfortunately, things didn't go as smoothly this time as they had in the past.","When faced with her daughter's defiance, Madam Wan panicked and resorted to her usual tactics against Jing Yu, even using them on Wan Ru.","\"Are you coming or not? If you don't, I won't recognize you anymore!\"","If Wan Ru had looked closely, she might have seen her mother's collapse and the crazed blood vessels in her eyes. But Wan Ru, spoiled by her upbringing, only became more rebellious. She even forcefully pushed Madam Wan away.","In the end, it was Mr. Wan who couldn't stand it anymore. He stepped forward, grabbing Madam Wan's arm and warning her in a low voice, \"Enough, don't go crazy at the wrong time.\"","After saying that, Mr. Wan ignored Madam Wan, even when she begged with the most humble expression. Instead, he turned to Madam Xie, who had a displeased look on her face, and said with a smile, \"I think Madam Xie has considered it carefully. What do you think of this marriage?\"","Madam Xie let out a cold laugh, ready to speak, but was interrupted by Jing Yu.","\"Didn't you hear what your wife just said? Nothing happened between me and your daughter. Are you trying to blackmail me?\" Jing Yu mocked, \"Want me to marry her? Dream on!\"","Mr. Wan, being an elder, was completely humiliated by being spoken to like this by a younger generation. But clearly, Jing Yu was a reckless person, so Mr. Wan's usual tricks wouldn't work on him. He had to take a direct approach.","He pushed his daughter forward to confront Jing Yu, and Wan Ru, propelled by her father, immediately gained confidence.","\"Brother Yu, how can you say that?!\" Wan Ru, wanting to be an actress, immediately launched into a performance accusing a heartless man.","But this performance...","【If she auditioned like this, she would definitely be kicked out by the director.】","The Qin family nodded silently, finding the scene extremely awkward.","Jing Yu also quickly realized that Wan Ru was trying to blackmail him by taking advantage of this opportunity.","\"What's wrong with me? Do you have any evidence that we have a relationship? Don't think that just because I ended my engagement, you have a chance to be my fiancée. You're Jing Yan's sister, and I have a hundred reasons to dislike you!\" Jing Yu was dead set against admitting anything.","Everyone was surprised by how things had escalated. Just a moment ago, the two were working together to deal with Jing Yan and Cen Ting, but now they had turned against each other, biting each other like dogs. It was truly laughable.","This drama was so ridiculous that Ji Fei wanted to complain, but there were too many points to criticize that she didn't know where to start. In the end, she could only shift her gaze to Madam Wan's face, savoring the wonderful changes. The more she thought about it, the more absurd it seemed, making her laugh and cry at the same time.","Seeing her own children arguing over such an immoral affair, openly revealed to everyone, Madam Wan must have wanted to die at that moment.","Yet, they continued to act like clowns, harming others and then sealing their own doom.","Wan Ru didn't expect Jing Yu to deny everything so resolutely, realizing that he had been using her all along. Enraged, she took out her phone and said, \"You dare deny it? Very well, very well!\"","【Wait, she actually... Is she really... It seems she's determined to nail herself to the pillar of shame.】","The Qin family was confused, their heads full of question marks, eager to know what was going on.","What? What? Was it some ambiguous text message, or...","Then they saw Wan Ru take out her phone, showing photos. Others couldn't see them, but those close by could. Jing Yu's face changed instantly, and he immediately lunged forward to snatch the phone.","He inwardly cursed, realizing that Wan Ru had secretly taken photos in the room.","Mr. Wan, seeing the photos, was satisfied, thinking his daughter had skill. He had no idea how big of a disaster this was.","Wan Ru was even more smug, dodging Jing Yu while showing the photos to everyone around her.","This scene left Ji Fei and the Qin family numb.","【Is this called... digging one's own grave? Harm others and ultimately harm oneself.】","Madam Wan, who had been deceiving herself, froze the moment she saw the photos. The rationality she had finally managed to pull back fled, and she began to uncontrollably retch.","She simply couldn't accept such a thing, even if no one else knew. Madam Wan's belief was collapsing.","Finally, she let out a crazy scream.","This strange reaction left everyone puzzled, staring at Madam Wan in confusion.","Did Madam Wan hate Jing Yu that much? Or did she hate Madam Xie that much?","Then they saw Madam Wan, like a madwoman, rush forward and slap her daughter hard, snatching the phone.","【Is she trying to destroy the evidence?】","Ji Fei was guessing, but in an instant, Madam Wan suddenly froze, staring blankly at the phone, her eyes flashing with a crazy color.","\"No, this isn't Jing Yu...\"","Madam Wan suddenly burst into wild laughter.","Pointing at the photo, she said, \"This isn't Jing Yu, this is Jing Yan!\"","Those words were like a thunderclap, shocking everyone.","Even Ji Fei and the Qin family, who had been the most informed and avid spectators, were stunned by this move.","Not to mention the people involved.","Jing Yu was confused.","Wan Ru was astonished.","Jing Yan's anger surged, and he felt like he was about to drown, gasping for air.","Many people saw the photos, which were taken secretly, showing only Jing Yu's bare back and a small part of his side profile.","Jing Yu and Jing Yan looked somewhat similar, so the photos, if seen by someone unaware, could indeed be mistaken for Jing Yan.","But those present had been following the drama from the beginning. Even if they liked gossip and curiosities, they wouldn't be that ridiculous. Was Madam Wan treating them like fools?","\"Mom!\" Wan Ru exclaimed, completely unable to understand her mother.","However, Madam Wan pulled Wan Ru along, as if possessed, saying, \"Mom knows you're feeling wronged. You were forced by your brother, and you couldn't face it, so you wanted to marry Jing Yu, pretending everything was Jing Yu's doing. But that's wrong. Since your brother wronged you, we should report him to the police. Trust Mom, Mom won't harm you!\"","Wan Ru's face twisted. Was this not harming her? Having such a relationship with her half-brother would be far more unforgivable than any entanglement with Jing Yu."]},{"number":288,"title":"Chapter 288: To Do a Paternity Test or Not","paragraphs":["Wan Ru was shocked by her mother's crazed appearance and frantically shoved away Madam Wan's hand that was pulling her.","She looked at her father, using her eyes to convey her disbelief: was her mother really going mad, turning into a mental case, to do something so absurd?","Mr. Wan was also stunned by his wife's behavior. Although he was uncomfortable with the existence of Jing Yan, he didn't think it was worth sacrificing his daughter's reputation to harm Jing Yan in such an unreasonable way.","And Jing Yan, finally regaining his voice amidst the stimulation created by his mother, stepped forward, glaring at Madam Wan.","\"I think you've truly lost it. She's my sister, how could we possibly... Is it that you hate me so much that you're willing to pin such absurd accusations on me?\" Jing Yan sneered.","In Jing Yan's view, Madam Wan was simply unable to accept that tonight's events didn't unfold as she wished, so she became obsessive. And because he had always been submissive to her, she thought he could tolerate any harm she inflicted upon him without limits.","But even if he was indecisive when it came to his mother, there were some things he simply couldn't bear.","Yet, Madam Wan insisted he take the blame. Only by doing so could her own children escape this calamity.","“It's you, it's you! You won't admit it, but I'm the witness. I've seen you force yourself on your sister. You're nothing but a despicable beast. Otherwise... otherwise, I wouldn't treat you like this. No one knows, but I do. You're a natural-born evil, insane...” As Madam Wan spoke, her expression grew more and more twisted.","Everyone present couldn't bear to listen anymore.","\"What the hell, is she crazy?\" Guo Yalan couldn't help but curse.","\"She's sick,\" Luo Fei said coldly.","\"This is actually not bad. It will completely break Jing Yan's heart, and he won't have to show off any 'birth debt' in the future,\" Yu Yue sneered.","Bai Xiaoxi was so angry her cheeks puffed up. \"How can she be like this! Jing Yan is so pitiful.\"","How can one describe her as merely evil? Clearly, he's not her child, yet she can smear so confidently, as if any flaw in her own children can be shifted entirely to Jing Yan. Jing Yan deserves to bear all the mistakes of her children.","The Qin family listened and sighed: Previously, they felt sorry for her children encountering such a misunderstanding, but now they truly think it's karma. Who had malicious intentions?","Qin Xian raised his eyebrows, sensing the moment was right.","Even though Jing Yan had long been heartbroken by Madam Wan, the continuous accusations greatly upset him. His face turned pale, and his body swayed uncontrollably as he took a step back.","A hand steadied him from behind. Jing Yan, bewildered, turned around to see Cen Ting's always cold face.","Cen Ting rarely took the initiative to step forward.","\"Madam Wan, if you're going to slander someone, at least use your brain. Earlier, during the reception, Jing Yan was under everyone's watchful eyes. After being drugged by you, he was with me, then rescued by friends. Meanwhile, your daughter was always with you in the hall. When could he have had the time?\"","In truth, Cen Ting didn't need to say these words, as anyone with sense would understand. But she wanted to directly burst the balloon of lies Madam Wan was desperately trying to inflate.","As soon as she finished speaking, Madam Wan looked as if her veil had been torn off, her expression vicious as she glared at Cen Ting.","\"Shut up, you little brat! He's my son, and I say he's guilty, so he's guilty. Can a mother's words be false?!\"","Madam Wan's roar silenced everyone present.","Suddenly, a voice rang out.","\"But what if you're not his real mother?\"","In an instant, Madam Wan froze, and all eyes turned toward the direction of the voice.","Initially, everyone thought it was some random gossipmonger making wild guesses, but when they saw the speaker, their minds went blank.","Qin Xian was not one to speak without basis.","Moreover, he was accompanied by Ji Fei, the \"Oracle of the Entertainment Industry,\" known for uncovering the juiciest scandals among the wealthy.","Meanwhile, the seemingly profound Ji Fei was looking at Qin Xian in astonishment.","【What? Just say it outright? No evidence? Is Qin Xian so sure of his guess? Luckily, it's true, or else this round of the CEO's showmanship would be a joke.】","Ji Fei secretly exhaled, making the Qin family chuckle.","It almost made Qin Xian lose his composure. He glanced at his wife with helplessness, then met the shocked gazes of the crowd, especially Jing Yan.","Jing Yan trusted Qin Xian's abilities deeply, so he widened his eyes, almost pleading, \"What do you mean by that?\"","Never had Jing Yan felt such a strong desire to distance himself from Madam Wan, even wishing for a miracle from Qin Xian.","Qin Xian had no evidence, but he spoke calmly and confidently, \"If Madam Wan isn't insane and her actions can be explained, then there's only one possibility: you're not her child. That's why she can hurt you, use you, and shamelessly ruin your reputation to seize your position as heir without hesitation.\"","Many people had similar thoughts, but they were just idle speculations. How could it possibly be true?","\"Nonsense, you're talking nonsense!\" Madam Wan, like a madwoman, screamed and yelled before Qin Xian could finish. \"I treat him like this because he deserves it. Because of him, I had a difficult labor. Because of him, my husband died. Everything is his fault. Why should I treat him well?\"","【Wow, she actually believes Jing Yan owes her, just because she thinks his birth caused the death of her husband, making her a widow and her child fatherless... What nonsense, it's all bullshit.】","The Qin family was also stunned.","\"Then what about the accusation of incest with Wan Ru? You'd even do something so unreasonable, unless...\" Qin Xian said calmly, watching Madam Wan's growing panic, then coldly continued, \"Unless it's to cover up the real incest.\"","With this statement and the earlier claim that Jing Yan wasn't her real child, everyone began to make bold speculations.","\"Could it be that Jing Yu is actually Madam Wan's child, and Jing Yan is Madam Xie's? Maybe the children were switched when they were young?! After all, they look so much alike, and maybe even more so when they were younger. Perhaps no one would have noticed if they were switched!\" Guo Yalan, never one to shy away from drama, shouted enthusiastically. \"Jing Yan, want to do a paternity test? I know someone, I can introduce you!\"","\"No, no, I didn't! I didn't! Jing Yan is my child, Jing Yu and Wan Ru are not siblings, no!\" Madam Wan, like a cornered beast, shouted incoherently with bloodshot eyes.","Her frantic, disjointed words only made everything seem more suspicious.","Mr. Wan, who knew his wife best, was the most shocked. He staggered, realizing Madam Wan's guilt.","The involved parties looked at each other in astonishment.","Finally, Wan Ru let out a scream and began pulling at Madam Wan frantically, shouting, \"It's not true, me and Jing Yu aren't siblings, right? Mom, tell them, prove it!\"","The phones that had captured the ugly truth were also dropped to the ground during the commotion."]},{"number":289,"title":"Chapter 289: Is this finally going to self-destruct","paragraphs":["Madam Wan frantically shook her head, \"No, no, it's not true.\"","But Wan Ru was still frightened, as she also felt this was the most likely possibility.","\"Let's do a paternity test then,\" Madam Xie suddenly suggested.","Madam Xie's eyes were slightly red as she turned to look at Jing Yan, who was bowing his head and looking down, and her heart instinctively ached.","\"I also find the situation suspicious. Since Madam Wan cannot communicate rationally and explain the reasons, let's just verify the most likely assumption.\"","As the person in power, Madam Xie shouldn't make such a rash decision. If the facts prove they were wrong, it would be an irreparable harm to her maternal feelings for Jing Yu.","Perhaps driven by Jing Yu's stimulation, at this moment, Madam Xie also wanted to follow her intuition and make a rash decision for once. She had never considered how wonderful it would be if Jing Yan were her own child, but she had often vaguely felt that the child was very similar to herself. Back then, she believed it was merely because she had personally taught Jing Yan that they resembled each other.","Now it seems it might have been innate.","Jing Yu, compared to herself, was more like her short-sighted and narrow-minded elder sister-in-law.","“Mom, are you doubting me?” Jing Yu's mind was in chaos, but seeing his mother actively demanding a paternity test greatly upset him, as if he were the one being despised and unwanted. “You obviously wish Jing Yan were your child. Fine, if we do this and prove I'm your son, don't expect me to acknowledge you anymore. From now on, you're not my mom!”","Madam Xie coldly laughed in her heart. Stripped of maternal love, Jing Yu's words became crystal clear.","She knew Jing Yu's reaction was actually out of guilt, because he also suspected, but he didn't want to face it—facing the reality that his mother was that crazy woman, and that he was completely stolen from Jing Yan, ultimately not measuring up to Jing Yan.","\"If you really can keep your word and have that kind of backbone, then you do have a bit of me in you,\" Madam Xie said coolly, then waved her hand, and security guards stepped forward. It seemed they were going to forcibly take samples.","You... you can't do this!\" Madam Wan was anxious. \"Jing Yan, are you just going to stand by and watch? If you let them do this, I'll kill myself!\"","Jing Yan lifted his head but numbly watched everything unfold. \"I also want to know the truth. Why are you treating me like this? If you threaten to kill yourself, haha, I won't be held legally responsible anyway. Compared to what you've falsely accused me of, the charge of being unfilial is really nothing.\"","Madam Wan was stunned, astonished to see Jing Yan, who could no longer be threatened. By the time she reacted and tried to grab a table knife to threaten her own life, the security guards were already prepared and once again subdued Madam Wan.","Madam Wan looked up at Madam Xie approaching and was utterly humiliated. She could only desperately seek help from her husband.","Mr. Wan was still in shock. He was very shrewd and knew the tide had turned; the appraisal was inevitable, and his wife's reaction had already revealed the truth.","It's over, the Wan family is finished, and their daughter is finished too.","Wan Ru was still anxiously watching everything unfold, while Jing Yu, his expression fierce, was being suppressed by the security guards, shouting and screaming.","Madam Xie approached Madam Wan and said to her, \"Resisting is useless. You should know my temper; I won't stop. If you confess now, you'll suffer less.\"","She was determined to verify it, but the more she thought about it, the more impatient she became to get an answer quickly.","Madam Wan's veins bulged on her face. Just when everyone thought she would stubbornly refuse to speak, Madam Wan suddenly burst into hysterical laughter.","\"Xie Lifeng, you deserve it, this is what you deserve!\"","Madam Xie's face changed drastically, and the surrounding people also exclaimed in surprise. Only Jing Yu and Wan Ru momentarily stared blankly at Madam Wan.","【Is she finally going to confess?!】Ji Fei excitedly grabbed Qin Xian's hand.","Qin Xian, having accomplished his role, stood by his wife's side, quietly accompanying her to watch the drama unfold.","Madam Wan was now completely insane, throwing caution to the wind as she mocked Madam Xie, \"You're just a fool, helping me raise my son for over twenty years, while your real son suffered for over twenty years, with no father to protect him, no mother to love him, forced to carefully survive under your roof, desperately trying to please me for just a little maternal love. His pathetic demeanor was so laughable, not even daring to compete with Jing Yu for anything. This is your karma, manifesting in your child.\"","These words were so venomous, they stabbed straight into the heart.","Even a strong woman like Madam Xie, at this moment, her eyes were filled with tears that uncontrollably rolled down. She turned to look at Jing Yan, whose expression was empty, tears streaming down his face.","Madam Xie's heart clenched, and she grabbed Madam Wan's collar, almost choking her to death. \"Why? What did I ever do to you that you would be so vicious? Why, just why!\"","\"Was it because of my older brother?\" Second Master Jing suddenly spoke in a hoarse voice, \"Was it because of my older brother, wasn't it?!\"","This was the first time Second Master Jing had raised his voice in anger, despite his lack of presence and having handed over most of the power to his wife. At this moment, the father's instinct to protect his child surfaced, his fists bulging with veins.","“What?” Madam Xie looked at her husband in confusion.","Second Master Jing looked at Madam Xie with sorrow and said, \"I really didn't know this woman was so insane to do such a thing. I just didn't want you to feel awkward at home, so I never told you. In fact, back then...\"","As Second Master Jing recounted, everyone learned about the events of that year and the unreasonable hatred of Madam Wan.","Madam Xie and Jing Yan seemed unable to react appropriately; they simply couldn't imagine that just because of the contradiction between Jing Laoda and Madam Wan, it had implicated them as mother and son. How laughable.","Madam Xie turned to see Madam Wan still glaring at her with hatred, her whole body trembling with anger. \"I had nothing to do with my older brother, I didn't even know about this! You clearly knew, you clearly knew! How could you be so vicious? You hate me, even hate Jing Yan, what right do you have... what right do you have!\"","\"What right don't I have to hate you? You got married, you shouldn't have let my husband continue to like you. It's all your fault, and your son's too. If it weren't for his birth, I wouldn't have gone through those sufferings.\" Madam Wan retorted arrogantly, as if she were so wronged and justified.","Not just Madam Xie, almost everyone was incredulous at this lunatic.","\"Do you know why I had a difficult labor? Because we gave birth around the same time, and that man was worried about you, staying by your bedside, making me so furious that it caused Jing Yu to be born prematurely and nearly cost me my life. Isn't this your fault, you and your son?\""]},{"number":290,"title":"Chapter 290: How old is Jing Yan, she has slapped Madam Wan that many times.","paragraphs":["Such an unreasonable accusation, as if she were the victim.","And the one who answered her was Second Master Jing: \"No, I wasn't home at the time. Madam Wan's health indicators were already risky during childbirth. As my older brother, it was his duty to keep an eye on things. It was your own pettiness that caused the trouble, leading to your premature labor due to an accident. You did this to yourself!\"","【Well said. At this moment, Second Master Jing is my mouthpiece. People who like to shift the blame should be confronted with the truth by those involved. Look at Madam Wan's face, it's turning green with anger. She probably knows she's not on solid ground, even if she's trying to hide her insecurity by raising her voice.】","The Qin family found Ji Fei's comments quite accurate, as Madam Wan was now raising her voice to mask her own guilt.","\"No, it's all their fault! I gave birth to Ah Yu, and after waiting so long for that man to come, he didn't even glance at our son. He only cared about going to see your son, treating him as if he were his own flesh and blood. His favoritism was so blatant, it completely disregarded me. I hated him! He should have treated my son better!\"","\"So you switched them.\" Madam Xie clenched her teeth in anger.","\"Fortunately, fate was on my side. The two children grew more and more alike. I took the opportunity while you were away on a business trip to switch them. No one noticed. Let him go and treat his own son well! Isn't that reasonable? But then he died. Not long after I switched the children, he was killed by Jing Yan.\"","\"You're insane, absolutely insane!\" Second Master Jing immediately retorted, \"I remember now. That day, my older brother got into a car accident because he had an argument with you. He left in a hurry and that's when the accident happened. If we're counting, it was you who caused it!\"","\"No, it was Jing Yan. It was because he was going to find Jing Yan that he got into the accident.\" Madam Wan snarled.","Suddenly, someone from the Jing family shouted, \"I remember now. It was because you lost Jing Yan. The eldest was in a hurry to go out and look for him, which is why... Even though Jing Yan was found later, by the time everyone went to look for the eldest, they heard about the car accident. That's why there was a rumor that Jing Yan was cursed and brought misfortune to his relatives. Now that I think about it...\"","\"Because of the switch, I was ignored. Maybe you even wished I had been lost. But he thought I was Jing Yu, his child. Even though, due to your insistence, he might not have liked this child, he still took on the responsibility of being a father and rushed out to look for me... Heh, it was you who killed him! Yet you blamed it on me, making me bear the shadow of being cursed to kill my father all these years. How can you face the ugly truth of your actions that led to the death of someone you loved?\"","Jing Yan muttered as he analyzed the truth, then looked coldly and mockingly at Madam Wan.","Madam Wan, however, screamed in response, as he had torn off her last shred of dignity.","\"No, it's all your fault, your fault!\"","But the looks from the crowd said it all.","What a ridiculous truth.","It turned out that the tragedy of Madam Wan's family was all her own doing.","You can't argue about right and wrong with a lunatic. So Madam Xie let go of everything and took matters into her own hands.","For every year of Jing Yan's life, she slapped Madam Wan once.","By the time everyone came to their senses, Madam Wan's face was swollen, her wrinkles stretched tight.","Madam Wan, drooling a mix of saliva and blood, was first stunned, then furious, her words slurred: \"How dare you hit me?\"","The next second, she shouted, \"Jing Yan, are you just going to stand there and let her bully your mother?\"","Jing Yan, who had been lost in thought due to the revelation of the truth and filled with various emotions, was genuinely amused by this.","\"Who are you talking to? You should be asking your real son, Jing Yu, for help.\" Jing Yan sneered, glancing at Jing Yu.","Jing Yu, who seemed to have just snapped out of it, looked at Madam Wan in shock and disgust. \"No, she's not my mother, absolutely not! Crazy woman, you need to explain yourself.\"","Madam Wan was hurt by the disdain in his words. \"Why are you saying that? I did everything I could to give you an advantage! I sent you to the best position, yet you couldn't even beat Jing Yan. Why couldn't my son beat her son!\"","\"Shut up!\" Jing Yu, touched on a nerve, didn't care about this person's true identity and directly snapped back.","Madam Wan was stunned by the shout, then went into a frenzy. \"No, it's not your fault. It's Xie Lifeng...\" She looked at Madam Xie.","\"You treated Ah Yu like your own son, yet you didn't give him the position of heir. You're truly wicked.\" Madam Wan absurdly blurted out.","This time, even the onlookers couldn't stand it.","\"Guess heaven really has eyes.\"","\"Like father, like son. A rat's child digs holes.\"","\"With her genes, what good could she produce? Jing Yu and Wan Ru are both oddballs. Even if they wear a dragon robe, they can't be princes.\"","\"Seriously, if not for her meddling, that sibling pair...\"","\"Ugh, it's disgusting. Don't mention it. Thinking about their family's antics before, I can't help but laugh. No wonder she wanted to blame Jing Yan. She probably can't even accept it herself.\"","\"Indeed, something like this could happen. Obviously, the root of the problem was already twisted.\"","\"Karma, it's all karma. Even heaven couldn't stand her antics. Yet she still feels wronged. Doesn't she see what her wicked intentions have done to her children?\"","\"Thinking about that room earlier, wow, don't they feel disgusted themselves?\"","\"Supposedly, they've been together for a long time, and it was just to deliberately make Jing Yan uncomfortable.\"","\"Wow, truly, evil begets evil. You reap what you sow.\"","A sudden scream broke through all the chatter. Wan Ru finally couldn't take it anymore and screamed frantically, \"No, my brother is Jing Yan, not...\"","She couldn't even look at Jing Yu anymore, and Jing Yu, of course, also realized it. At this moment, he was too disgusted to look at Wan Ru.","What had they done?","And why had all this happened?","“Brother!” Wan Ru, just like her mother, was merciless when it came to bullying and dealing with Jing Yan, but when things went wrong, her first reaction was to look for Jing Yan.","Jing Yan's response was the same, \"I'm not your brother. Your brother is that one. Your relationship... isn't that good? You should be asking him for help.\" He pointed at Jing Yu. He had no intention of covering up for them and even wanted to repay all the suffering he had endured over the years a hundredfold.","Wan Ru finally couldn't take the blow and ran away in a frenzy.","Jing Yu also wanted to escape. He couldn't face the crowd's gaze, let alone the shift in his identity.","Mr. Wan shuddered and couldn't stay any longer. He didn't bother with his wife and pretended to be concerned about his daughter, chasing after her.","Madam Wan also had a moment of clarity, worriedly shouting, yet she couldn't break free from the security guards' restraint.","She habitually turned her anger toward Jing Yan.","\"It's all your fault, all your fault! You knew about them... Why didn't you tell me? Why didn't you warn me earlier! If you had, none of this would have happened... How could you be so vicious!\" Madam Wan screamed, completely unable to face the consequences of her actions, so she grabbed at Jing Yan to shift the blame and absolve herself of responsibility."]},{"number":291,"title":"Chapter 291: Gossip is the Spiritual Food of Humanity","paragraphs":["【No way, no way, is this woman still thinking she can use her motherly identity to force Jing Yan to take the blame for her? Clean up her mess? Her brain must really be waterlogged.】 Ji Fei couldn't help but complain.","Ji Fei wasn't the only one; almost everyone present looked at Madam Wan with a mix of disbelief and disdain.","Faced with Madam Wan's accusation, Jing Yan's lips curled into the most mocking smile.","It was truly the countless times of past concessions that had made her incapable of ever seeing clearly.","\"I warned you, didn't I? She was associating with dubious characters, but you turned a deaf ear and just kept scolding me, didn't you? Maybe this is karma.\" Jing Yan spoke slowly.","Madam Wan froze, her face almost entirely covered in regret, her pupils trembling, still unable to accept the reality.","Jing Yan's gaze towards Madam Wan had turned icy. She truly loved her own children, but unfortunately, her stupidity and selfishness had completely ruined them.","\"You should be worrying about yourself now. All the things you've done to me, we'll have to settle them one by one!\"","Madam Wan took a step back, startled by Jing Yan's sudden shift in tone.","Madam Xie also chimed in, her voice cold and menacing: \"Yes, settle it all.\"","Second Master Jing's heart was also filled with resentment. Accepting Jing Yan as his child hadn't been difficult; after his elder brother's death, he had become Jing Yan's closest relative in the Jing family and had always treated Jing Yan as his own child.","Now, knowing that his child had been stolen for over twenty years, he felt immense guilt. At that moment, he stood firmly by his son's side without hesitation.","He took a step forward, and for the first time, they were truly a family of three.","Everyone present couldn't help but exclaim.","【Indeed, looks do reflect one's heart. This family of three feels just right.】 Ji Fei was thoroughly satisfied.","Qin Xian also chuckled softly, feeling that everything had turned out well.","On the opposite side were Madam Wan and Jing Yu, who were clearly overpowered.","Madam Wan was in a daze. Habitually, she still tried to order people around.","But Jing Yan was no longer the son she could vent her anger on at will.","She stared blankly, her eyes gradually filling with fear, as if she had finally realized that everything was over.","Her trembling lips tried to say something, but unexpectedly, Jing Yu, who was being restrained not far away, suddenly broke free and charged towards her.","His expression was fierce, like a crazed dog, and he slammed into Madam Wan's stomach with full force.","\"Crazy woman, it's all your fault, you crazy woman! You ruined everything for me, you ruined everything! Why don't you just die, die!\"","The sudden impact was so strong that even the security guards couldn't hold Madam Wan, who was knocked to the ground. Her painful expression contorted, and after a moment, she coughed up a mouthful of blood before she could catch her breath.","Everyone was shocked by this scene, and Jing Yu's murderous gaze towards Madam Wan showed that his emotions had completely collapsed.","Madam Wan, however, felt aggrieved and cried out, \"I did all this for you, and you're just like your father, always choosing that bitch Xie Lifeng!\"","But Jing Yu roared back, \"Shut up! Do you think I'm as stupid as Jing Yan? Everything for me? It's all for yourself! You're just bitter, so you swapped me. What kind of mother would give away her own son to someone else?\"","【Tsk tsk tsk, Jing Yu finally hates the right person. He realizes that his own mother is the mastermind behind all this.】","Qin Xian looked over and saw Madam Wan's face turn ashen in an instant.","Everyone present truly felt some sympathy for Jing Yu's plight.","\"Yeah, a mother giving away her own son to someone else just to be jealous.\"","\"And she even caused the death of his real father. It's unimaginable.\"","\"Not to mention how it led to his own children ending up in an incestuous relationship by mistake.\"","\"And the funniest part is, it all started because of her stolen marriage, yet she still demanded love from him. When he didn't love her, she didn't look for reasons within herself but instead blamed external factors.\"","\"I've never seen such shamelessness.\"","\"She even wanted to compare herself to Madam Xie. How laughable. She's blind and brainless, does she think Jing Yan's father was too?\"","\"If I were Jing Yan's father, I would never have looked at her either.\"","The surrounding whispers were like thunderclaps exploding around her, piercing her to the core, burning her soul. Not to mention the child before her, who now looked at her with such hatred.","It was as if she had aged decades in an instant, yet she still shook her head desperately, as if denying something.","The farce had no reason to continue.","Jing Yan, however, had already signaled the housekeeper to call the police. Whether it was tonight or the events of twenty years ago, everything deserved a fair judgment.","Of course, besides the law, the Jing family of three would not let anything go easily.","The original engagement banquet came to a complete end. The guests, having gorged themselves on the drama, left satisfied, escorted by the Jing family.","What was most interesting was that the entertainment journalists Jing Yu had invited were not asked to delete their photos or videos as they left. It seemed everything was tacitly allowed.","Even if it meant exposing the scandal, Madam Xie wanted the outside world to know who her son really was and who was behind the scenes, causing all this tragedy.","\"Won't this affect Jing Yan and Cen Ting negatively?\" Ji Fei asked, seeing Qin Xian arrange for someone to warn the journalists not to mention anything about them.","Qin Xian patiently explained to his wife, \"Madam Xie is afraid that without a complete report, someone might take advantage of partial information to slander Jing Yan and Cen Ting, targeting both families. By going public, they're just letting the public watch a joke. If opponents seize the opportunity to prematurely leak information and shape public opinion first...\"","\"That would be 'a lie spreads far and wide, but the truth takes a hundred steps to catch up,'\" Luo Fei chimed in.","“This kind of thing is about seizing the initiative. It also leverages public opinion to build momentum for Jing Yan's position as heir and Cen Ting's status as Madam Xie's adopted daughter,” Guo Yalan added with a smile, putting her arm around Ji Fei's shoulder.","After saying that, she looked at Ji Fei with a smile and clicked her tongue twice.","\"What?\" Ji Fei asked, puzzled.","Qin Xian glanced at Guo Yalan's arm around Ji Fei.","\"What else? Haven't you noticed all the eyes focused on you?\" Bai Xiaoxi also came up, grinning and putting her arm around Ji Fei, \"Hey, next time you go to eat some gossip, take me with you, okay? It's super interesting.\"","Qin Xian watched as Bai Xiaoxi clung to Ji Fei, his brow furrowing even more.","Seeing Bai Xiaoxi's gossiping little eyes, Ji Fei was speechless. Indeed, if you paid a little attention, you could feel the intense gaze focused on them.","It seemed her titles were getting longer and longer—Judge of the entertainment industry, King of Melons among the wealthy families. Could it be her fault? Could it be her fault? Clearly, these people were the ones who kept feeding her gossip.","【The lives of the wealthy and celebrities are naturally more dramatic. This is unavoidable because the rich are just bored. If ordinary people were busy working to support themselves, even if dramatic, it would just be ordinary melodrama. Where would they have so many plots? Still watching? Indeed, gossip is the spiritual food of humanity. Everyone's gaze on me is practically starving for it.】","Qin Xian's mouth twitched, and finally, he couldn't help but step forward, using the back of his hand to push away the two women clinging to his wife. With his tall figure, he blocked most of the view, almost shielding Ji Fei in his embrace."]},{"number":292,"title":"Chapter 292: Not talking about Bai Xiaoxi anymore, I'm already confused just listening to it.","paragraphs":["Everyone was originally engaged in a lively discussion of gossip, but after Qin Xian's interruption, they all fell silent and stared at him.","It's really becoming harder to recognize him. Then, looking at Ji Fei, she showed no reaction, as if she hadn't noticed anything at all.","Who could remember how not long ago, Ji Fei was madly infatuated and constantly chasing after Qin Xian?","Now, it seems to be the opposite.","Given the current situation between the two, it's likely they'll be planning a wedding soon.","Speaking of weddings, Luo Fei and Guo Yalan couldn't help but look sympathetically at Yu Yue. Although it might be a bit rude to think so, if Ji Fei were to attend any event now and there wasn't any gossip, they'd find it quite unbelievable.","Yu Yue, feeling the gaze, maintained a relaxed and carefree expression, wrapping his arm around the neck of his beloved Bai Xiaoxi, and jokingly said, \"The next round of gossip will probably be about my family. I wonder what kind of drama awaits us.\"","\"You really are something,\" Bai Xiaoxi laughed, playfully slapping Yu Yue. \"Behave yourself.\"","\"That depends on whether they behave or not. Frankly, I'm a bit suspicious about whether the new arrival's child is really my brother. Luckily, Ji Fei can help me verify that.\" Yu Yue said, as if as long as there was something wrong with the person, Ji Fei's mere contact would surely expose the truth.","[Am I some kind of human lie detector? You should be looking for a doctor!]","No sooner had Yu Yue finished speaking than he saw Qin Xian's eyes narrow slightly, his displeasure evident as he looked over, clearly unhappy with someone speaking about his wife like that.","Yu Yue quickly offered a conciliatory smile.","\"What? Your father's new wife is pregnant?\" Guo Yalan reacted, her voice rising in surprise.","Not just Guo Yalan, even Luo Fei widened his eyes in astonishment.","Yu Yue raised an eyebrow and chuckled, \"Exactly, so you also think there's something fishy, right? And it's not through IVF, it's a natural pregnancy. I'm not disrespecting the new arrival, but it's just too unbelievable.\"","Ji Fei's eyes lit up at this. She knew this detail from accidentally overhearing Yu Yue's gossip earlier.","[The Yu Family is a typical example of a family that values having many children. The more sons a member has, the greater their contribution to the family and the more property they receive. So, Mr. Yu had many siblings, over a dozen, with the youngest brother only a few years older than Yu Yue.]","[Influenced by such a family environment, Mr. Yu also liked having many children and had a competitive mindset with his brothers. So, not long after the birth of his first child, Yu Yue, he made his wife pregnant again. Probably because her body hadn't fully recovered, the rapid pregnancy led to complications during childbirth, resulting in the death of both mother and child, leaving Yu Yue without a mother.]","When Qin Xian first met Yu Yue, he was the typical rebellious teenager without parental guidance.","Having lost his mother and with his father preoccupied with marrying and having more children, even with the status of the 'eldest grandson,' Yu Yue lacked love and care.","[Afterwards, no matter how many wives Mr. Yu married, he never had any more children. Doctors said his body was naturally infertile. It seems Yu Yue's mother was the only one with a fertile body type; otherwise, Mr. Yu might not have had any descendants at all. Given that he's now over fifty and still has this condition, even if he meets another fertile woman, it would be difficult for her to get pregnant. No wonder Yu Yue is suspicious.]","Since Ji Fei hadn't met Mr. Yu or the new Mrs. Yu, she couldn't draw any conclusions, only analyzing based on limited information.","Meanwhile, Yu Yue continued to vent, \"Xiaoxi and I have both met that woman. She seems gentle and kind, treating us quite nicely, not aggressive at all, and even a bit eager to please me. But what kind of decent person could she be to get involved with my dad? A secretary climbing up to replace the previous wife—I've lost count of how many times this has happened. If it weren't for the family rules that include prenuptial agreements, my dad would probably have gone bankrupt from all these marriages.\"","At this point, Bai Xiaoxi's expression momentarily froze.","Bai Xiaoxi is the epitome of a cute, naive, and sweet girl, rarely showing such a troubled and confused expression. This brief moment was clearly noticed by Ji Fei and Qin Xian, who were standing opposite.","Qin Xian isn't one to meddle in others' affairs, but Ji Fei is quite the gossip enthusiast.","Seeing this expression, she immediately sensed something was up and couldn't resist digging into the matter.","So it turns out that Xiaoxi is a bit confused about her perception of the new Lady. She finds the new Lady easy to get along with and very gentle. But during their first meeting over dinner, when Yu Yue mentioned wanting to marry Bai Xiaoxi, the new Lady privately said something rather cryptic to Xiaoxi.","Qin Xian, hearing this, also became curious.","Could it be that because of the pregnancy, the new lady sees Yu Yue as a competitor in her belly and is trying to intimidate Bai Xiaoxi?","She said: Although marriage emphasizes matching social status, using an arranged marriage to bind someone who is already pitiful is quite cruel. If you truly like him, it's better to set him free. Once I join the Yu Family, I will do my best to ensure the next generation has the power to choose their own lovers, hoping they can all find true happiness and true love. I also hope you can find someone who truly loves you.","Qin Xian: ?","[Okay, not talking about Bai Xiaoxi, even I'm confused.]","Qin Xian: Indeed, it's confusing. It sounds like the kind of criticism of arranged marriages that someone not from the high society might make, advocating for marriage freedom. But...","[But how can she be sure they aren't in a free love relationship?]","Ji Fei looked at Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue across from her. Yu Yue was practically like an octopus, being extremely clingy, and the two of them together were so sweet it was almost sickeningly sweet. Anyone would see they are truly in love.","Is the new lady's eyesight bad? Or is there some hidden meaning?","No wonder Bai Xiaoxi had such a conflicted first impression of the new lady.","However, there's no need to worry. After all, Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi don't need to interact much with their elders. After attending the wedding, they'll probably head abroad again.","Currently, they haven't gotten married for two reasons: first, every time they return, Mr. Yu causes various scandals, which is considered inauspicious; second, Bai Xiaoxi's parents adore their daughter and don't want her to marry early.","Naturally, Ji Fei, through her gossip system, also knows the hidden reasons, but since this is Bai Xiaoxi's privacy and even Qin Xian's friends seem unaware, Ji Fei pretends she doesn't know either. As long as the couple is sweet and loving, that's all that matters.","However, now that they're both twenty-eight, it's about time. It's likely they'll settle things during this trip.","Yu Yue continued to vent, not caring at all about whether someone might contest his inheritance. After all, all he wants is to be with his beloved Bai Xiaoxi. Purely in love, with no ambition.","Just as they were gossiping, Yu Yue suddenly received an unfamiliar call.","\"Hello, is this Yu Yue? It's me.\"","It was a young woman's voice. Yu Yue was momentarily puzzled and asked, \"Who is this?\"","The other party seemed quite surprised, her tone lowering as if hurt, \"You didn't even save my number? It's Ke Yun'er.\"","Yu Yue's expression was momentarily confused, \"New aunt? What's the matter? Did my dad want to contact me?\""]},{"number":293,"title":"Chapter 293: What's up with this new wife So weird","paragraphs":["Yu Yue was speaking while making a helpless expression at everyone. He was in a playful mood and decided to put the call on speaker so everyone could listen in.","\"...It's like this, I need to go for a prenatal check-up, but your dad is busy. Could you accompany me?\" Ke Yun'er said hesitantly, \"You know this pregnancy is quite risky.\"","Everyone was a bit surprised. If it were a harmonious stepmother-stepson relationship, such a request would be understandable, but weren't they not very close?","Yu Yue's expression was already quite exasperated. He stuck his tongue out at Bai Xiaoxi but didn't hold back his words, \"Not really. Since you're the one at risk, I should stay far away. What if something goes wrong and my dad's late-in-life joy of having a child is cut short? He'd blame me, and I don't want any part of that. You'd better find someone else. Let's avoid suspicion and both feel at ease.\"","After saying that, he covered the phone's microphone and said to everyone, \"Is she trying to play palace intrigue with me?\"","No one knew what went on in wealthy families, but if you stretched the point, this situation wasn't too strange.","After all, it was said that the new madame didn't have any family to rely on, so asking Yu Yue for help in such a situation could be somewhat justified, considering he was the young master of the household.","Luo Fei mouthed, \"Is this your dad's idea?\"","Sure enough, the next second they heard Ke Yun'er say, \"It's your dad's idea.\"","Guo Yalan immediately gave Luo Fei a thumbs up, and Luo Fei shrugged.","Ji Fei also looked admiringly at Luo Fei, [As expected of a policeman, his reaction is so fast, even faster than Qin Xian's brain!]","Qin Xian: ...No, he just didn't speak up yet. He had already thought of it!","Qin Xian looked a bit aggrieved at his wife, wanting to show off but not being the type to boast. Seeing his wife admiring Luo Fei, he felt quite sour inside.","When Yu Yue heard the answer, he pouted. It didn't matter whose idea it was, not even his own mother would make him accompany a woman for a prenatal check-up. Did he look that free?","Just as he was about to refuse, Ke Yun'er spoke again, her tone sounding a bit sad, \"And after all, this child... is your kin. Do you really not care at all?\"","Yu Yue suddenly felt a shiver run down his spine.","[Goodness, this tone. If you didn't know better, you'd think she's talking about Yu Yue's own child, not his half-sibling. What's up with this new madame? So weird.]","In this regard, women are more sensitive than men.","Guo Yalan immediately raised an eyebrow, her expression one of disgust.","Bai Xiaoxi blinked, though not as perceptive, she also felt uncomfortable.","\"Care? Do you mean care if he comes to compete for the family fortune or my father's love? Don't worry, I don't care about either.\" Yu Yue didn't know what the other party was testing, so he decided to lay everything out.","\"I... I'm not talking about that. How could this child compete with you? Don't worry, absolutely not.\" Ke Yun'er sounded flustered, then gradually calmed down with apparent effort, \"I just... my body is really not feeling well right now. I was hoping you could... help me out, just this once, is that too much to ask?\"","The more Ke Yun'er acted like this, the more Yu Yue felt she was pretending to be weak, setting a trap to harm him.","Just as he was about to refuse, Bai Xiaoxi tugged at him.","Clearly, besides the way the other person spoke making her reflexively uncomfortable, she was also a bit worried, as the baby in that belly could be Yu Yue's future brother or sister. That was the closest kin Yu Yue had.","Yu Yue had also expressed that he didn't mind having more siblings, as long as they behaved and could have some brotherly or sisterly affection.","The last time Bai Xiaoxi saw Ke Yun'er, she could clearly see that Ke Yun'er was very careful with her belly, loving her child.","Excluding these discomforts, maybe she was really just worried about her condition, and since Mr. Yu was busy, she wanted a mainstay to help accompany her.","\"Let's go together,\" Bai Xiaoxi mouthed.","Yu Yue was about to object but seemed to think of something and his eyes changed slightly. He affectionately rubbed Bai Xiaoxi's head and mouthed, \"Whatever my dear wants.\"","Bai Xiaoxi immediately smiled.","So Yu Yue told the phone that he would handle it and then hung up.","By the time Cen Ting came looking for them, Bai Xiaoxi and Yu Yue had already left.","The others were discussing the upcoming wedding in the Yu family and Ke Yun'er.","Cen Ting was a bit surprised. She thought they would be discussing today's gossip.","\"You're talking about this?\" Cen Ting exclaimed, clearly thinking their speed in moving on to new gossip was too fast.","\"We've gotten used to eating gossip. No matter how explosive the situation, it's just another day for us,\" Guo Yalan boasted, stepping forward to hug Cen Ting, \"How's it going, future half-member of the Jing family?\"","Cen Ting said, \"It's like this. I'm preparing to go back. Are you coming?\"","\"Jing Yan isn't coming out?\" Luo Fei asked.","\"With such a big matter, the Jing family needs to discuss it thoroughly, and...\" Cen Ting was saying, when the sound of police sirens came from outside the villa. The guests who hadn't left yet watched as Madam Wan and Jing Yu were roughly taken away in handcuffs.","They could see the new family of three standing at the door, watching the people who had harmed them leave.","Naturally, the small group was concerned about Jing Yan's situation. Seeing him with a calm expression, it was clear he was holding it together, his strong pride not allowing him to show any vulnerability.","Everyone gave a distant greeting and left together.","\"Hey, sis, you're really going to be Madam Xie's goddaughter? That means you'll be Jing Yan's god-sister, right?\" Guo Yalan pointed out the detail she was most interested in. \"Either an fiancée or a god-sister, you really have a connection with him. Why don't you just get together already, tsk tsk.\"","Cen Ting frowned slightly, not knowing what to say, her expression no longer as calm as before.","[Pfft, before not knowing Jing Yan's background it was hard to say, but now, it's hilarious. Secret crush turned into god-sister...]","Qin Xian raised an eyebrow. Given Jing Yan's character... once he adjusted to this, as long as Cen Ting wasn't with someone else, he would probably fully unleash himself and try hard to pursue Cen Ting.","But Cen Ting might not fall for it.","Sure enough, they heard Cen Ting say, \"Don't joke about it. I can complete my family mission under free conditions. Why would I want to go to prison?\"","\"Hahaha, as expected of my sis. Although our personalities are worlds apart, we have the same view on marriage,\" Guo Yalan laughed.","\"Exactly, exactly. Marriage is a cage,\" Ji Fei also chimed in.","When she said that, everyone looked at her, then suspiciously at Qin Xian.","Qin Xian: ...","He tugged on his wife's sleeve, a bit aggrieved.","Ji Fei immediately realized, oh right, she was already married. She shouldn't be complaining like that.","\"Happy marriages aren't!\" Ji Fei quickly tried to cover up."]},{"number":294,"title":"Chapter 294: Fei Jie is the God of Eating Watermelons in Ancient Greece","paragraphs":["Everyone burst out laughing.","\"So, your marriage with Qin Xian is a happy one, huh?\" Guo Yalan teased.","Ji Fei was momentarily stunned, not knowing how to respond. She glanced at Qin Xian, and instead of his usual dark, brooding eyes, she saw a pair that resembled a clear lake, shimmering with tiny specks of light under the moonlight. Upon closer inspection, those specks seemed to form her entire figure, incredibly captivating, making Ji Fei's heart race.","【It's... not bad so far.】","Qin Xian's heart swelled with emotion, and he couldn't help but reach out to hold Ji Fei's hand, intertwining their fingers. This made Ji Fei feel a bit embarrassed.","【Why are you suddenly holding my hand!】","Even though he heard her, Qin Xian didn't let go. Instead, he pretended to be calm and changed the subject casually.","“Mom and Dad, along with my eldest sister, are waiting for us. Let's hurry up.” With that, Qin Xian led Ji Fei quickly away from the “third wheels.”","Once they were sure the others wouldn't follow without any sense of propriety, Qin Xian slowed down, almost dragging his feet as he held his wife's hand, walking back to the car, where three more \"third wheels\" were waiting for them.","The three Qin family members: ...Why are they walking so slowly?","On the way home, everyone was discussing the juicy gossip about the Jing Family. The scandal was so explosive, spanning across multiple lifetimes of several individuals.","The Qin family looked at Ji Fei with even more admiration. Without their precious Ji Fei, some people's lives would have been ruined.","Yet, they couldn't talk about it openly, given the immense gratitude involved. They also couldn't help but look down on Qin Xian, since on the surface, it was Qin Xian who had exposed everything. The Jing Family would probably find a way to thank Qin Xian properly.","The Qin trio: Tsk~ A man living off his wife's fortune!","Once home, everyone naturally returned to their usual social circles.","Of course, the Jing Family's scandal about the switched child had already exploded in every social circle, even more sensational than past high-profile scandals. This wasn't just because the scandal itself was powerful, but also due to the Jing Family's deliberate efforts to fan the flames.","\"Madam Xie must have arranged for people to guide the narrative in various circles,\" Qin Xian said, stepping out of the bathroom after his shower, hearing Ji Fei's mumbling.","Qin Xian was now quite accomplished, basically living with Ji Fei, even moving all his toiletries and clothes to her place.","It was the result of his relentless efforts.","However, in the eyes of the other Qin family members, he was just too pathetic. After all this time, all he had achieved was sleeping in the same bed. Who would believe that?","Ji Fei, seeing Qin Xian come out, immediately complained, \"You know, with tonight's scandal being so huge, why are so many netizens still focusing on me?\"","Qin Xian leaned over to take a look. Ji Fei was surfing the web on his work computer. Besides the Jing Family's dramatic saga of love and revenge, Ji Fei's popularity was still quite high.","It was as if the saying was true: Even when she's not in the spotlight, the world is full of Ji Fei's legends.","\"Fei Jie, how did you end up at the scene again!\"","\"Fei Jie's gossip field must have so many surprises I don't even know about!\"","\"Fei Jie's fans are enjoying the world first, Fei Jie's gossip field is even more dramatic than I imagined.\"","This is the kind of heat that other celebrities can't latch onto; only the Fei Gate Followers are in a frenzy.","\"Fei Jie is the goddess of gossip in ancient Greece!\"","...","Then, there were lists of various scandalous events where Ji Fei was present, making it clear that certain labels were impossible to shake off.","【At this rate, everyone will start avoiding me, and how will I get to enjoy the thrill of being at the scene for more gossip? Sure, eating gossip through the system is fine, but it's not as exciting as being there in person.】","Ji Fei was quite resentful.","Although Qin Xian had already contacted Sister Pei to manage the public opinion, the fans' admiration was still hard to diminish.","He could only pat Ji Fei's head and say, \"Don't worry, I'll take you to any gossip scene you want to be at.\"","Using his CEO powers for this purpose, Qin Xian was definitely the first of his kind.","Ji Fei couldn't help but laugh.","The next day, the Jing Family trio came to their door, bringing heavy gifts to thank Qin Xian. Qin Xian immediately said it was all Ji Fei's merit, as she reminded him.","Jing Yan, though not fully recovered, still smiled and said, \"Don't worry, your affection for your wife is already well-known in the circle, so the gifts we prepared were originally for Ji Fei.\"","Jing Yan was also very thoughtful, having seen Qin Xian prepare gifts for Ji Fei before, so this time, the gifts were carefully chosen to be collectible and with potential for appreciation.","Ji Fei was so happy when she counted them that night that her mouth couldn't stop smiling.","Later, Cen Ting also came to give thanks, as they had saved her.","A few days later, it was rumored that the Jing Family was determined to sue Madam Wan, who was sure to go to prison for a long time.","Several of Wan's important business deals had been secured through Jing Yan, so when Jing Yan expressed his stance, Wan's company almost immediately faced a broken capital chain, causing the tree to fall and the monkeys scatter. Wan's husband directly fled, leaving Madam Wan with nothing, his only conscience being taking the mentally and emotionally damaged Wan Ru abroad with him.","Madam Wan's family of origin also cut ties with her, stating they were unaware of her actions and would not intervene in the future.","So, no one would come to Madam Wan's rescue. It was said that Madam Wan was constantly going crazy and causing trouble, but the Jing Family was keeping a tight lid on it, ensuring she couldn't use a mental illness excuse to escape her punishment.","With Wan Ru's departure, the responsibility for the drug-induced framing fell solely on Jing Yu, who suffered some consequences. Eventually, he would be released, but the Jing Family had already decided, out of consideration for the eldest son's only heir, to send him abroad and keep him under control.","Soon after, the Jing Family held a grand ceremony to officially adopt a child, inviting guests to show that their family would remain stable and still a powerful force.","Ji Fei and Qin Xian also attended, but everything went smoothly, with no new gossip.","It was from Yu Yue that they heard a piece of gossip.","Although it was kept secret, Yu Yue didn't care about his father's embarrassment and shared it with his friends.","【Shocking, taking medication to boost his masculinity and ending up with problems—this Yu father is really going all out... Wait, isn't his new wife pregnant? Why would he need to take medication? Oh... He took medication for his wife before, but after stopping, the residual effects piled up and exploded, tsk tsk.】","Yu Yue complained, \"Hmph, his body is ruined, and though he's not completely impotent, he'll never be a father again. His only descendants are me and the child that hasn't been born yet, meaning he'll always lose to his uncles. I wonder if it's karma.\"","\"Don't say that,\" Bai Xiaoxi frowned slightly, sounding serious.","Yu Yue quickly comforted his wife.","The others didn't say much, just curious if the previous wedding could still happen since he was hospitalized.","Yu Yue shrugged, indicating that he didn't know.","But soon, they received a notice: the wedding would be delayed by a week, the reason being that Ke Yun'er was unwell and needed to take care of her pregnancy.","But in reality..."]},{"number":295,"title":"Chapter 295: Cash the Bet","paragraphs":["Yu's father is scared to death, so he specially went abroad for treatment. He really has an obsession with having children. It's not easy to find a woman who can help him have a baby, and he definitely doesn't want anything to go wrong.","Upon hearing the truth, the Qin Family silently shook their heads and remarked: \"The He family must be scared because they have a throne to inherit.\"","【Currently, it seems hopeless.】","The Qin Family isn't too concerned, just the wedding being postponed, and there hasn't been any big gossip lately, so their interest is minimal.","However, recently, Ji Fei seems very busy. When asked what she's busy with, she remains secretive.","Only Qin Xian is uneasy.","Until this night, when he came out of the shower, he was met with Ji Fei's smiling expression.","Ji Fei's eyes sparkled like a cat who had just caught a fish, and she said with a smile, \"May the best man win, Qin Xian, can we start now?\"","Last time, due to Cen Ting's choice, Ji Fei won the bet, and now it's time to fulfill the bet.","Qin Xian's expression was awkward, but he obediently sat down in front of the dressing table.","He felt a bit disappointed and helpless.","\"Do we really have to do this? Can't we do something else?\" Qin Xian protested a little.","Originally, he thought Ji Fei would want to do something to him since she won the bet, but instead...","Ji Fei excitedly picked up her makeup bag and said, \"The clothes and wigs are all prepared. I specially learned from Tang to ensure I can turn you into a great beauty.\"","【Hehe, Qin Xian's beautiful face, if he were a woman, would definitely be devastatingly beautiful, capable of toppling cities and kingdoms. From childhood photos, you can see that was a face destined to be beautiful. I must see what Qin Xian looks like in women's clothing now! Then I can cuddle with the beautiful sister!】","Qin Xian's expression was indescribable, and for a moment, he could only sigh and blame his parents for giving Ji Fei such a strange idea.","It was also from Ji Fei's thoughts that he learned that a week ago, Ji Fei saw the Qin Family's photo album and seemed to have come across a photo of him as a child dressed as a little princess.","He didn't even know he had worn a skirt as a child, only remembered seeing Qin Zhao being dressed as a girl by his mother. Qin's Mom seemed to have this hobby, so he didn't think much of it, just assuming he had forgotten, as he had memory issues as a child.","In a distant room, Qin's Mom sneezed.","\"What's wrong? Are you catching a cold?\" Qin's Father asked.","Qin's Mom, while inserting recent photos into the album, rubbed her nose and said, \"No... oh, look at this photo. Your son's gaze at Fei Fei, it's melting this old mother's heart.\"","Qin's Father leaned over to look. It was a recent photo of the living room. Ji Fei and Qin Yan were talking animatedly, while Qin Xian, though not participating in the conversation, was constantly looking at Ji Fei. The love in his eyes was so clear, even through the still photo, it was evident. He was truly full of love for her.","“Actually, Xian has changed a lot, all thanks to Fei Fei. In the past, Xian wouldn't spend so much time with us, chatting and gossiping. He was always working quietly, immersed in his own world,” Qin's father sighed.","Yes, thanks to Fei Fei. I knew Fei Fei was our Qin Xian's little lucky star,\" Qin's Mom said with a smile as she inserted the photo, then looked at the previous ones, including a photo from a year ago, when the two were the most tense.","Qin's Mom's gaze fell on Ji Fei in different periods, feeling something strange. Flipping through and comparing, she felt... although it was the same face, it seemed like two completely different people.","Naturally, her son in the photos was also completely different—one cold and detached, the other purely lovesick. But as a mother, Qin's Mom knew they were all Qin Xian. However, Ji Fei... Qin's Mom only thought she didn't know her as well as her own mother, which was why she felt strange.","But when she flipped to the very beginning and saw a photo.","It was rare, a photo of young Qin Xian looking at the camera.","In fact, he wasn't looking at the camera but at the person taking the photo.","This photo had a flaw; the top right corner was blocked by something. That was Fei Fei's first time holding a camera as a child. Because she couldn't hold it steady, her finger accidentally blocked the lens when taking the photo.","And Fei Fei had taken on the task of taking photos because of her mischievousness. She had forced Qin Xian to wear her princess dress, wanting to capture this moment.","The blue puffy dress, with blue lace tied in his black hair, his lips red and teeth white, looking truly androgynous and beautiful.","Fei Fei had happily hugged young Qin Xian for a long time, as if she had gotten a huge doll.","Because of this small accident, Qin's Mom also developed a habit of dressing her son as a girl, but Qin Xian didn't cooperate, so she ended up torturing the younger Qin Zhao.","Now that the children have grown up, it's impossible to play like that anymore.","Qin's Mom expressed her regret, not knowing that her daughter-in-law was currently playing with this.","At the dressing table, feeling his face being layered upon layer, it had been nearly an hour.","Qin Xian couldn't help but feel heartbroken and said, \"Is your hand sore? If you really want me to dress up, we could hire a makeup artist...\"","“How could that be? How can Qin Xian's female disguise be seen by others? Although it's a bet, I can't let you lose face,” Ji Fei said.","Although it was a bit embarrassing, Qin Xian didn't want his wife to suffer. After all, Ji Fei usually didn't wear makeup, and her skills in this area were still basic. Everything was a crash course. Initially, Qin Xian saw her enjoying herself and didn't stop her, but now that he saw her wrist trembling, he couldn't help but speak up.","Before he could say anything, he heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","【Besides, how could I let anyone else touch Qin Xian's face?】","Qin Xian was stunned. That simple sentence made his heart race, and he couldn't say anything more.","Yes, only Ji Fei could touch his face.","Soon, the makeup was done, the wig was in place, and the hands working on his face finally stopped.","Qin Xian opened his eyes to look at Ji Fei, but met with a pair of dazed eyes.","Qin Xian immediately felt uneasy and said, \"Is it strange?\"","Ji Fei, however, gradually blushed, her eyes lighting up with excitement, and she said, \"Quick, quick, change clothes.\"","Qin Xian was pushed to stand up. He had already taken a shower earlier and was wearing a bathrobe. Ji Fei had prepared a female nightgown for him, pure white with a sense of design. After putting it on, it felt a bit strange, but once he lay down on the bed, with the blanket and pillows covering most of his masculine muscle lines, it was almost indistinguishable.","Looking over, it seemed like a secluded, cold goddess, a high-altitude flower sleeping on the bed.","If Sister Pei saw this, she would beg him to become an artist, even if she had to kneel.","No need for acting, no need for professional skills, just his face would be enough to dominate everywhere. Ji Fei frantically took photos with her phone, looking for angles. Qin Xian didn't know how to pose, so he could only cooperate and look in Ji Fei's direction.","Ahhh, indeed, Qin Xian's attractiveness, whether in male or female form, can be breathtaking!","\"Ahhh, my wife, I'm coming!\" Ji Fei finished taking photos, threw her phone aside, and shouted playfully before pouncing on him."]},{"number":296,"title":"Chapter 296: Kiss Once, Then Kiss Again","paragraphs":["It wasn't clear whether it was the female outfit that made Qin Xian seem more vulnerable and approachable, but Ji Fei suddenly lunged toward the bed, landing on the beautiful Qin Xian.","Qin Xian let out a muffled groan as she suddenly fell into his arms. Coming to his senses, he simply indulged her with a tender and permissive embrace.","\"What did you call me?\" Qin Xian raised an eyebrow, a hint of helplessness in his tone.","Ji Fei lay on Qin Xian's abs, feeling the smooth texture of the nightgown, which only added to the contrast and made her laugh.","Ji Fei propped herself up, looking down at the beauty with a mischievous smile. \"With such beauty, you must be my wife.\"","【Who else could have the luck to have both the handsomest husband and the most beautiful wife? It's me!!】","Ji Fei was so overwhelmed by the beauty that she was almost intoxicated.","Qin Xian's eyes darkened as he received this \"claim.\" Ji Fei's lively demeanor struck a chord in Qin Xian's heart, resonating deeply within his soul, as if he had once witnessed such a beautiful scene.","Qin Xian's heart raced, the thumping vibrations transmitted through the thin nightgown to Ji Fei.","Ji Fei was slightly startled, finally meeting his gaze. The eyes, softened by makeup, had lost their usual aloofness, transforming into a pair of tender, loving eyes that left Ji Fei completely blank.","The scene in front of her seemed to align with the photos Qin's Mom had shown her.","Whether it was an illusion or not, a strong impulse suddenly surged within her.","Such a beautiful being deserved to be hugged and kissed, and... it seemed like this wasn't the first time she had done so.","Before Qin Xian could react, everything seemed to spin.","Ji Fei's face suddenly loomed large, her lips coated with slightly cool lip gloss pressing against a different warmth. Their breaths intertwined, and it felt as if their souls were soaring.","Qin Xian felt as if he had suddenly fallen into a furnace, his blood boiling, his energy surging through his body like a poised leopard. Yet he still restrained himself, carefully enduring, fearing that this beautiful moment might be an illusion, and that any sudden movement might wake her.","Even though Qin Xian remained still, the pressure on his lips suddenly disappeared.","Instinctively, Qin Xian lifted his head, wanting to chase that kiss and continue the entanglement.","【Ahhh, how did I just kiss him?!】","Qin Xian didn't catch up; Ji Fei had already covered her face and rolled to the side.","【Ahhh, maybe the female-clad CEO looks really kissable, less intimidating, so I just went ahead and teased him?!】","【But his lips are so soft and sweet, I really like them, hehe... But what if he thinks I'm irresponsible for suddenly kissing him!】","【Ahhh, what if he asks me... What should I say?!】","【But... I really want to kiss him again.】","Hearing Ji Fei's chaotic thoughts, Qin Xian could only let out a helpless sigh.","Turning around, he reached out and pulled Ji Fei into his arms. Sure enough, the person in his arms stiffened slightly. Qin Xian could see Ji Fei's normally pale neck turning red with embarrassment.","Ji Fei was a bit nervous, but then she heard Qin Xian say, \"Are you satisfied?\"","\"Uh... Yes, very satisfied.\" Ji Fei almost stammered.","\"Can I go and remove the makeup now?\" Qin Xian said calmly.","Ji Fei quickly scrambled up, lowering her head. \"You go change first, and I'll help you later.\"","【Weird, why doesn't he say anything?】","Qin Xian didn't want Ji Fei to feel any pressure. In their relationship, Ji Fei always held the initiative, but... he also had a little grievance that needed to be soothed.","Accompanying Qin Xian to the bathroom, he leaned down, allowing Ji Fei to help him remove the makeup. As the handsome CEO gradually returned to his usual self, Ji Fei's hands moved slower and slower.","Because it was time to clean the lip makeup, and thinking about her mischief earlier, Ji Fei felt guilty.","Just as she was about to suggest that Qin Xian do it himself to avoid awkwardness, she steeled her resolve and decided to finish the task quickly.","Perhaps in her haste, she wasn't as meticulous, leaving Qin Xian's lips slightly swollen after the cleanup.","Ji Fei was about to awkwardly move her hand away when her wrist was suddenly caught.","At that moment, Qin Xian opened his eyes. Because of the close proximity during the makeup removal, the distance between their eyes was so short that it seemed to raise the temperature around them.","Ji Fei hadn't recovered yet, stuttering slightly. \"W-what are you doing?\"","\"Do you like men or women?\"","The abrupt question left Ji Fei's little brain frozen.","\"Ah? Of course, men.\"","Qin Xian's eyes flickered, and he swallowed hard. \"Is that so? I was a bit worried...\"","The last word disappeared again between their pressed lips.","Ji Fei's eyes widened, her pupils shaking even more than before. After all, the first kiss had been in a blur, facing what felt like a half-imaginary figure.","But now, facing the real Qin Xian, in her fully awake state, she was pulled closer by Qin Xian...","It was still the most innocent kiss, yet it felt like a city of fireworks exploding in their hearts.","When Ji Fei came to her senses, she heard a low, magnetic voice, suppressing delight yet still overflowing with joy, but with a tone pretending to be calm. \"Now, I'm not worried anymore.\"","Ji Fei didn't know how she fell asleep, only feeling that when she was half-awake the next morning, the usual good morning kiss that landed on her forehead this time lightly brushed her lips, tickling her so much that she couldn't help licking her lips, as if she heard a swallowing sound.","In her dream, Ji Fei sensed some kind of danger and curled up under the blanket, continuing her sweet dream.","Someone, however, had to go to the bathroom before they could leave the room.","The slow-moving couple.","But the wedding day for the Yu family was finally approaching.","Although Yu's Father was no longer able to have children, the wedding still had to go on.","That evening, everyone was in the living room discussing tomorrow's wedding attendance when Ji Fei got distracted because Guo Yalan was contacting her, with messages popping up constantly.","Ji Fei thought it might be something urgent, but when she opened it, the first message was Guo Yalan asking if she knew what had happened recently between Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi.","Ji Fei was full of question marks. Upon closer inspection, it turned out that Guo Yalan and Cen Ting had been contacting Bai Xiaoxi to send wedding gifts, but although they could reach her, the usually enthusiastic and cheerful Bai Xiaoxi would hang up after a few words, her tone sounding listless, and she hardly responded on the chat software, which was very strange.","Ji Fei wanted to say, with your decades-long relationship, if you don't know, how would I know?","But Guo Yalan didn't need her to say anything, directly asking, \"Gossip Queen, tell me, is there any gossip?\"","Ji Fei: ...","Ji Fei handed the phone to Qin Xian, who thought for a moment and said, \"Recently, Yu Yue has also been very inactive, seems to be busy.\"","This caught the attention of the whole family, who asked what was going on.","Meanwhile, Ji Fei took the opportunity to open the system to check.","【What could be going on? Let me see... Ah?!?!?!】","The whole family immediately straightened up, what's the situation, really gossip? Could it be something other than Yu's Father's inability to have children?","【Holy crap, how did this happen?! The new aunt had a miscarriage, caused by an accident involving Bai Xiaoxi! Now Yu's Father doesn't know his last hope is gone, and because of his inability to have children, he's even more concerned about the last child, Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi both know. If Yu's Father finds out the truth, it will really be bad.】"]},{"number":297,"title":"Chapter 297: You're More Influential Than Your Husband Now","paragraphs":["The Qin Family froze in an instant, realizing the gravity of the situation. Given how much the Yu Family valued their offspring, and considering Yu's Father's current health... if this got out, it would be disastrous.","Bai Xiaoxi had inadvertently caused the loss of her future brother-in-law and sister-in-law. Before the marriage even took place, a rift had already formed.","The Qin Family knew Bai Xiaoxi well and understood that this was an accident, just incredibly bad luck. How could things align so perfectly to create such a mess?","They could only hope that Yu Yue and Bai Xiaoxi wouldn't harbor any resentment towards each other.","Based on Qin Xian's understanding of Yu Yue, it was likely that Yu Yue wouldn't hold a grudge, but Bai Xiaoxi might.","Ji Fei was thinking along the same lines as Qin Xian.","【Given Bai Xiaoxi's personality, she's probably blaming herself and feeling deeply sorry for Yu Yue. Yu Yue, not wanting her to suffer, has asked her to stay at home while he handles everything. Right now, Yu Yue is accompanying Ke Yun'er at the hospital, trying to help her recover before the wedding to avoid revealing her recent miscarriage. He's already discussed with Ke Yun'er to keep this under wraps for now, at least to prevent Bai Xiaoxi from being implicated. They'll figure out a solution later. Hmm?】","The Qin Family was equally puzzled upon hearing this. They had assumed that regardless of the relationship between the new bride and Yu Yue, such a serious matter would not be covered up. Could the new bride really be that selfless?","【Huh... is she a saint?】","Ji Fei found it incredulous, perhaps influenced by her previous impressions of Bai Xiaoxi, making her more suspicious of Ke Yun'er's motives.","In cases like Yu's Father, who frequently remarried and had difficulty conceiving, a child would be the biggest guarantee for Ke Yun'er to secure her position in the Yu Family. Why would she be so willing to cooperate with Yu Yue?","Qin Xian also pondered this. He thought that perhaps without the child, Ke Yun'er felt more vulnerable. With Yu's Father's reputation for being unfaithful, she could be easily discarded. For now, keeping the truth hidden and proceeding with the wedding would be more advantageous for her.","【If such a problem arises before the wedding, will... tomorrow's wedding... uh... will it be another chaotic affair?】","Ji Fei suddenly voiced this thought, her expression a mix of emotions.","The Qin Family felt equally conflicted. After all, a new bride's miscarriage, caused by their son's girlfriend, was not a pleasant topic.","Onlookers, who preferred to gossip about amusing stories, hoped that Yu Yue could manage everything smoothly, allowing the young couple to navigate this difficult situation.","With a mixture of curiosity and anxiety, they finally arrived at the wedding the next day.","As soon as they reached the venue, they were surprised.","There were many people, far more than they had expected.","Yu's Father often remarried, so many influential people in their social circle usually skipped the event, sending a gift as a formality.","But this time, the guest list was extensive.","\"What's going on?\" Qin's Father was astonished.","Qin's Mom added, \"When did Old Yu build such strong relationships?\"","This time, Qin Xi was on vacation, so Qin Yan brought Qin Xi along to the wedding. Qin Yan looked around, equally confused. Qin Xi, being observant, noted, \"It seems like many people are glancing at us.\"","For the child, the reason was simple: it must be because of Second Uncle and Second Aunt, who were quite famous.","But the adults realized the attention was on Ji Fei.","Ji Fei innocently blinked.","【Could it be because they heard I was coming? That seems a bit exaggerated!】","\"Wow, so many people. It seems everyone inquired and knew Ji Fei would be here, so they came for a chance to see her,\" Guo Yalan joked. \"What's that saying? 'Fear of a peaceful world'?\"","\"You're here for the same reason, aren't you?\" Cen Ting calmly remarked.","Guo Yalan stuck out her tongue and waved at a family that had arrived earlier.","\"Ji Fei, your influence now surpasses even your husband's,\" Guo Yalan laughed.","Ji Fei smirked, \"Would you like this influence?\"","【Being the center of attention for gossipers is not ideal. It makes future gossip-hunting much less convenient. So frustrating.】","The Qin Family stifled their laughter upon hearing her thoughts.","As they entered the venue together, they saw Yu's Father with a pleasant smile. By his side stood a young man who resembled him but was not Yu Yue.","\"I knew Yu Yue wouldn't be bothered to entertain guests for his philandering father,\" Guo Yalan whispered gossipingly.","Ji Fei became curious.","【Apparently, he's with Ke Yun'er, still discussing that matter... I wonder what the outcome will be.】","By now, they had greeted the hosts.","It was only then that Ji Fei recognized the young man standing beside Yu's Father, the one who had replaced Yu Yue.","【Impressive, Yu's Old Man really... This young man, about the same age as Yu Yue, is actually Yu Yue's uncle, Yu's Father's youngest brother, Yu Yi. Judging by his impatient expression, he was probably dragged here to help, since his older siblings are all inside as guests, and only he was left to assist with hosting.】","Once inside the venue, they saw Luo Fei and Jing Yan waving at them from a distance; they had arrived earlier.","Ji Fei's gossiping gaze flitted between Jing Yan and Cen Ting, noticing a subtle difference. Jing Yan's gaze, which previously never lingered on Cen Ting, now openly focused on her.","However, since they had left Jing Family together but didn't travel together, it seemed Cen Ting was inexplicably averse to her foster brother.","Ji Fei quickly shifted her attention elsewhere.","At that moment, Bai Xiaoxi was sitting with them. Rarely did they see Bai Xiaoxi without Yu Yue by her side.","Observing Bai Xiaoxi's dazed expression, it was clear she hadn't recovered yet; she seemed to have lost some weight.","Her distress was evident to everyone at a glance.","Although Luo Fei and Jing Yan had arrived earlier and asked Bai Xiaoxi about it, she didn't want to talk, and as men, they didn't press further.","As the others arrived, Luo Fei and Jing Yan quickly signaled them.","Besides Ji Fei and Qin Xian, the others were unaware of the truth. So Guo Yalan, without any hesitation, bluntly asked, \"What's going on? You've been acting strange lately. Did you have a fight with Yu Yue?\"","Bai Xiaoxi forced a smile, \"Don't talk nonsense. I'm fine, it's just... I didn't sleep well last night.\"","\"Little girl, you've got a lot on your mind. I'll just ask Yu Yue directly later,\" Guo Yalan said, not wanting to pressure Bai Xiaoxi. \"By the way, where's Yu Yue? Not at the entrance, nor guarding his precious one. What's he up to?\"","As soon as she said that, Luo Fei and Jing Yan exchanged subtle glances.","Guo Yalan, being perceptive, immediately sensed something was off. \"What happened?\"","\"Nothing much. He was called away by his new stepmother,\" Luo Fei replied, regaining his composure.","Jing Yan also managed a smile, \"It seems she's feeling unwell and is worried about issues during the wedding, so she asked Yu Yue for help.\""]},{"number":298,"title":"Chapter 298: Adopting a Stepchild for Procreation","paragraphs":["Qin Xian was quite familiar with them, so when he saw their expressions, he knew they were hiding something.","It wasn't exactly a secret, but more of a gut feeling shared by two men, who felt that the scene of Ke Yun'er coming to find Yu Yue was rather peculiar.","At that time, Yu Yue was trying to comfort Bai Xiaoxi, the two of them whispering to each other. Jing Yan and Luo Fei assumed that Bai Xiaoxi was just upset about something, so they naturally didn't eavesdrop.","Then, Ke Yun'er, the bride of the wedding, came over. Her tone was full of grievance, and her expression was pleading. \"I've been looking for you. Why didn't you pick up the phone?\"","To be honest, Jing Yan and Luo Fei felt a shiver run down their spines. It was as if their friend's girlfriend had come looking for him.","Yu Yue was also taken aback, but he and Bai Xiaoxi were both hiding something, so they didn't react the same way as Luo Fei and Jing Yan.","\"What?\" Yu Yue asked.","\"I... I'm not feeling well. I'm a bit worried. Can you come over?\"","Yu Yue's expression changed slightly. Without saying much, he got up and followed Ke Yun'er.","This scene left Jing Yan and Luo Fei dumbfounded.","Was Ke Yun'er really okay? If she wasn't feeling well, she should have gone to her husband! It wasn't that they were overly self-confident, but the way Ke Yun'er looked at their friend was so strange that it could only be interpreted in a suspicious way.","And their friend's reaction was also surprising. Normally, he was completely indifferent to other women, and he never showed any extra care to any of his previous stepmothers. Why was he treating Ke Yun'er differently? Was it just because she might be carrying his half-siblings?","Looking at Bai Xiaoxi, she didn't seem to have a strong reaction either. Could it be that they were overreacting?","So for the moment, they didn't say anything.","Naturally, their encounter didn't escape Ji Fei's attention. Ji Fei had already finished \"eating the melon\" (gossiping), and Qin Xian and the other Qin family members had also heard the gist of it.","Although they felt something was off, they didn't want to jump to conclusions about a bizarre relationship, especially since they knew the reason behind it.","But the next moment, Guo Yalan tore off the veil of shame.","\"What the heck? Why is this stepmother always looking for her stepson for everything? Is she marrying the dad or the son? Isn't she trying to pull off some kind of stepmother romance novel?\"","This remark made Cen Ting, who was sipping tea, spray it out without any regard for her image.","Jing Yan quickly handed over a napkin.","Cen Ting glared at Guo Yalan, the culprit.","\"Why are you all looking at me like that? A young stepmother and a handsome stepson, that's not uncommon abroad.\" Guo Yalan smirked. \"Besides, there's no blood relation, and they're about the same age, so they should avoid suspicion. That woman's behavior is already inappropriate, but what's even more messed up is Yu Yue. When did he start being so polite and filial? Instead of helping his dad greet the guests, he leaves his girlfriend behind to deal with his stepmother's issues. That's not like him. I suspect something's up.\"","Normally, Ji Fei would be complaining along with Guo Yalan about Yu Yue and Ke Yun'er, but they knew the truth—it was because of the miscarriage incident that Yu Yue was cooperating. So they couldn't really blame them and could only laugh awkwardly.","After Guo Yalan finished her rant, she ignored the stunned looks of everyone present and reached out to Bai Xiaoxi. \"Xiaoxi, don't worry. If Yu Yue dares to wrong you, we'll stand up for you!\"","Bai Xiaoxi finally managed to catch her breath and waved her hand. \"No, you're really misunderstanding.\"","Guo Yalan shrugged. \"I hope it's just my imagination running wild.\"","Bai Xiaoxi wanted to deny it all at once, but something made her pause. Her pupils trembled slightly, and then she said firmly, \"Yu Yue wouldn't!\"","【Strange, Bai Xiaoxi's reaction seems to suggest she's also suspicious of some stepmother romance, doesn't it?】 Ji Fei couldn't help but wonder, as sometimes a girlfriend's intuition is the truth.","This thought startled the Qin family trio nearby.","What kind of stepmother romance? Was it what they thought it was?","Wasn't it because of the miscarriage?","【Wait, what? A photo?】","Qin family: A photo? What kind of photo? The stepmother romance kind?","Qin Xian was also intrigued, and even paused while adjusting his wife's coat.","【A photo from a few years ago, showing Ke Yun'er and Yu Yue sitting together drinking. Bai Xiaoxi had been impulsive and pulled on Ke Yun'er's phone, causing her to be startled and fall, leading to the miscarriage. Because of the bigger incident, Bai Xiaoxi had forgotten about the photo, but now it came back to her... So she's not entirely sure if Yu Yue's claim that he doesn't know Ke Yun'er is true or not.】","Qin Xian frowned: Do those two know each other?","Qin family: Could they have been a couple? Is this that kind of drama?","【If Yu Yue has been lying to her, she'll be heartbroken, because she still remembers the scene of Ke Yun'er falling and clinging to Yu Yue, who came to help. Ke Yun'er was sobbing pitifully in Yu Yue's arms, trembling and calling out his name, saying, 'My child, my child...' That scene is like an invisible thorn, making Bai Xiaoxi unsure how to define it. After all, she was the one who caused the death of an innocent child. She feels she's too guilty to focus on other details.】","Qin family: ...Well, this is getting more and more dramatic.","Qin Xian, who wasn't very perceptive about delicate emotions, just felt that if it were him, he would find Ke Yun'er's behavior annoying and wouldn't want to get involved.","【Huh, I'm getting a weak, white lotus vibe from her. Oddly enough, from Yu Yue's side, it seems he genuinely doesn't know Ke Yun'er. All his concern for her now is just to make sure she doesn't expose Bai Xiaoxi.】","Qin family: Good, good. It's not some ridiculous relationship.","Qin Xian: ...Not necessarily.","Because he knew Ji Fei's \"eating melon\" system was from a personal perspective. If Yu Yue genuinely didn't remember, or in his consciousness, he never knew this person, then for Yu Yue, it's as if he doesn't know her.","Like a passerby you met on the street, you didn't leave an impression, so you don't know them. But the other person has a deep impression of you and even has a photo of the encounter. It's hard to explain the situation.","Bai Xiaoxi was uneasy, so she got up and went to find Yu Yue.","Her reaction seemed a bit anxious to everyone present. They had all watched this couple come this far and naturally wanted to help maintain their relationship. So they all thought about talking to Yu Yue later, reminding him to be careful about his relationship with his stepmother.","Meanwhile, Yu Yue was utterly stunned.","He looked at the woman in front of him, who had the demeanor of a clinging vine, gazing at him with pleading eyes. He couldn't believe it and even dug his ear, \"Did I hear you wrong just now?\"","Ke Yun'er's eyes were full of grievance. \"Do you have to pretend you don't understand? Fine, I'll be straightforward. I want you to father another child with me, so we can cover this up.\"","【Let me see if they've reached a conclusion... Ahhh!】","Ji Fei's thoughts made the Qin family collectively lose their heartbeat. What happened?!","【This stepmother-stepson relationship really has a hidden bomb! Is she planning to use her stepson to have a child?!】","Qin family: What? What? Use what? Have what? What did I just hear? My ears feel dirty."]},{"number":299,"title":"Chapter 299: Li Pi Sister Just Can't Resist Yu Yue's Body","paragraphs":["Yu Yue probably never expected that his private conversations with others could be overheard by someone like Ji Fei, who seems to have a knack for finding loopholes. If he had known, he would have been so embarrassed that he could have dug out a dream castle with his toes.","It was just too shameful.","\"Are you sick?\" Yu Yue snapped back to reality and immediately cursed.","Fortunately, Yu Yue had cursed like that, otherwise Ji Fei would have started to doubt Yu Yue's innocence.","The other Qin family members, who had been listening through Ji Fei's thoughts, also finally breathed a sigh of relief.","What kind of explosive situation would it be if something like borrowing a stepson to have a child had actually happened? It would have been a huge scandal that could have ruined Yu Yue's life.","[Wait, Ke Yun'er just said 'again'? What does that mean? Could the previous child have been...]","The Qin family members were shocked: No way!!","Qin Xian, however, remained calm. After all, if the child had been Yu Yue's, Ji Fei's gossip system would have had some clues.","Sure enough, the next second, they heard Ji Fei's thoughts.","[I was scared for a moment, but at least Yu Yue has only ever had Bai Xiaoxi as a woman.]","The Qin family members breathed a huge sigh of relief: This roundabout way of proving Yu Yue's innocence was quite something. Who would have thought that the gossip system could be used like this? Brilliant!","Qin Xian remembered his own past where he had been identified as a virgin, and was thankful for the gossip system that had proven his innocence. Otherwise, who would have believed him? If he had been suspected, his wife might have looked down on him.","After all, a man's innocence is the best dowry.","Qin Xian felt a sense of inexplicable pride and couldn't help but pull his wife closer.","But Ji Fei was fully focused on the gossip.","[Since Yu Yue is innocent, why did Ke Yun'er say that? Was it a slip of the tongue? Ugh, I'm so annoyed. I really want to meet Ke Yun'er soon. I want to see what this woman is thinking. How could she make such a ridiculous request? Could it be that she doesn't like me but likes her stepson instead? Does she want to stir up trouble in the inner courtyard, play the stepmother trope, and then pull off a switcheroo right under Yu Yue's father's nose?]","Meanwhile, Yu Yue was too shocked to think carefully about what Ke Yun'er had said.","When Ke Yun'er said, \"Have another child with me,\" Yu Yue instinctively thought the subject of the conversation was Ke Yun'er herself, who had miscarried and wanted to have another child. He didn't realize that the subject could have been both of them, having lost a child and wanting another.","\"I know there are some things you don't want to face, and I don't need you to take responsibility, but can't you just give me this one thing to make up for it?\" Ke Yun'er looked at Yu Yue as if he were a heartless man.","Yu Yue was covered in goosebumps and was full of questions, trying his best to understand what Ke Yun'er meant.","What he didn't want to face probably referred to the fact that Bai Xiaoxi had caused Ke Yun'er to miscarry.","Responsibility and compensation should also be for Bai Xiaoxi's sake.","It should be like that... but beyond that, he really couldn't figure it out.","No, no, he still couldn't figure it out. Compensation and responsibility were understandable, but why use this method? Could it be...","Yu Yue's expression turned grim as he looked at Ke Yun'er, even taking a step back.","[It seems Yu Yue is also suspicious. It's pretty much confirmed! This is explosive! The absurd sister wants to have her cake and eat it too!]","The Qin family members were excited, finding this gossip incredibly thrilling.","Listening to someone's secret plot unfold in real-time, witnessing the birth of a scandal—who wouldn't be excited?","Ke Yun'er lowered her eyes and wept, not noticing Yu Yue's reaction of avoidance. She sobbed, \"Marrying your father wasn't my choice, but now that it's done, I have no other options. You know your father's temper. With his current health, if he finds out I've miscarried...\"","Yu Yue's expression changed, but he didn't respond.","Ke Yun'er continued, \"You know, the best solution is for me to get pregnant again quickly.\"","Yu Yue narrowed his eyes and quickly said, \"You can find someone else. I'll keep it a secret for you, or...\" There were many ways.","But before Yu Yue could finish, Ke Yun'er looked betrayed and hurt. \"How can you say that? What do you think I am? Do you want me to sleep with another man?\"","Seeing Ke Yun'er's red eyes, Yu Yue was dumbfounded.","[So you want to sleep with Yu Yue! Where's your shame? What do you want others to think of you? Yu Yue's fists are clenched. I suddenly feel so sympathetic towards him!]","The Qin family members also felt a bit sympathetic towards Yu Yue. What kind of misfortune is this?","Before Yu Yue went to university, his life was quite difficult. After all, his stepmother kept changing, and each one treated him as a thorn in their side, making things difficult for him. This one was no different.","Qin Xian felt that his friend would probably prefer some palace intrigue right now.","Ke Yun'er, seeing that Yu Yue wasn't speaking, got anxious.","She thought that in a sober state, Yu Yue probably wouldn't accept such a thing.","\"This secret must be kept strictly confidential, and you wouldn't want someone else's bloodline to mix with yours, would you? So, doing this together is the best choice. Your own child wouldn't compete with you for the family inheritance. We can keep this secret forever.\"","Yu Yue couldn't believe that Ke Yun'er could so confidently justify this act that goes against ethical principles.","He thought of the misfortunes of his previous friends and felt a chill run down his spine.","What? Is it now trendy to have two fathers for a child—one in name and one biologically?","Yu Yue still looked at Ke Yun'er in disbelief. Ke Yun'er's cheeks, however, slowly turned red, as if she were shy. \"Don't worry, this will only be known to the two of us. It will be our secret. As long as you stay at home for a while, I'll definitely get pregnant.\"","Ke Yun'er stepped forward, as if she was about to throw herself into Yu Yue's arms.","Yu Yue quickly dodged, taking several steps back, only to meet Ke Yun'er's resentful and embarrassed gaze.","Now it was certain. This crazy woman really had her sights on him. She wanted to kill two birds with one stone—pull him into this mess to get a bloodline that wouldn't be suspected by the Yu family, and also sleep with him.","[This is almost conclusive evidence. The absurd sister is lusting after Yu Yue's body and wants to develop this improper relationship with him. There are so many ways to go about this—technology exists, and one could pay for a child. Even if there was a reason to choose Yu Yue, if Ke Yun'er didn't have any feelings for him, she could have used technology. Why would she need to offer herself? Even without the gossip system, I can see through this.]","The Qin family members nodded silently. Indeed, Ke Yun'er's intentions were very clear.","Qin Xian, however, found it strange. So, did Ke Yun'er really want Yu Yue that much that she was willing to take such a risk? After all, a miscarriage might not lead to being abandoned, but if her affair with Yu Yue was discovered, her fate would be tragic, while Yu Yue wouldn't be affected.","He had heard about the photo incident before, which suggested that Yu Yue and Ke Yun'er might have had some unknown connection. To make it easier for his wife to gossip, he had already sent someone to investigate Ke Yun'er's past.","The information should come soon, and then he could tell Yu Yue to be on guard."]},{"number":300,"title":"Chapter 300: Yu Yi Suspects the Child is His Own","paragraphs":["Yu Yue was feeling absolutely disgusted and uncomfortable all over. After all, the woman in front of him was the one who had slept with his father—she was his stepmother! His moral compass wasn't that twisted!","Despite her looking about the same age as him, in Yu Yue's eyes, Ke Yun'er was a middle-aged auntie, a generation older than him. The thought of this auntie trying to sleep with him was enough to give him nightmares.","However, Ke Yun'er had indeed managed to hit his soft spot. Although she hadn't explicitly said so, Yu Yue knew that if he didn't cooperate, Ke Yun'er would expose the truth about the miscarriage.","If his father found out that it was Xiao Xi who caused Ke Yun'er to miscarry, given how much his father currently valued the child in Ke Yun'er's womb, he definitely wouldn't let it go. Moreover, the Yu Family placed great importance on progeny, and they would surely think Xiao Xi was extremely unlucky to be involved in such a situation. If an investigation revealed that Xiao Xi was...","Thinking of this, Yu Yue's face darkened. He absolutely couldn't let Xiao Xi get hurt.","This risk was too great. He had to stabilize this crazy woman first.","Ke Yun'er still gazed at Yu Yue with a mix of infatuation and heartbreak, but no resentment.","\"I can give you time to think about it, but you should know that time is running out. If it's too late, even if you get pregnant, it will raise suspicions. Yu Yue, I've already made many concessions. Don't be so harsh on me. I can get hurt and sad too.\"","[Reject her! Scream at her, tell her she's crazy and shameless!]","Ji Fei's inner voice suddenly became sharp, startling the Qin family members. Why was she so emotionally invested all of a sudden?","Yu Yue's expression was grim, but after a moment of hesitation, he said, \"I'll consider it. I'll give you an answer after the wedding.\"","Ke Yun'er's eyes flickered, but she eventually nodded. Yu Yue quickly escaped the room.","The Qin family was anxiously waiting for the outcome.","Then they heard Ji Fei mutter softly, [Yu Yue, you're done for. You actually agreed to consider it!]","The Qin family: !!!!!","Qin Xian frowned. That wasn't like Yu Yue. Even if he were to break all ties with his father and leave the Yu Family, he wouldn't care. How could he possibly agree to such a thing?","Then they heard Ji Fei complain.","[Although the so-called \"consideration\" was just a stalling tactic to placate this seemingly deranged, crazy woman, Yu Yue had already planned that if things couldn't be resolved, he'd just run away. He only wanted Bai Xiaoxi, so he planned to attend the wedding, then leave without telling anyone, taking Bai Xiaoxi abroad. Screw everything else.]","The Qin family breathed a sigh of relief, even chuckling a bit. That was so Yu Yue—brilliant!","Qin Xian was puzzled, though. If that was the case, why was Ji Fei so anxious?","Then they felt Ji Fei suddenly stir in their arms, as if she was about to get up.","[Yu Yue, you unlucky fool, don't you know what \"walls have ears\" means? You just blurted out everything, and Bai Xiaoxi in the next room overheard you!]","The Qin family: Ouch... what?!","Qin Xian seemed to recall the layout of the villa when they first entered. Each room upstairs had its own open balcony. If the balcony doors were open, someone in the next room could definitely hear what was being said.","But since the wedding was being held downstairs, no one should be in the rooms. Especially since Yu Yue and Ke Yun'er must have known the rooms were empty, so they didn't bother closing the balcony doors.","It really was a cruel twist of fate.","[Yu Yue left in a hurry and didn't notice anyone in the next room. Bai Xiaoxi has been hiding on the balcony, crying. No way, I can't just sit by and do nothing. I hate these kinds of misunderstandings the most when watching TV. First, find the two of them, then encourage them to confront each other. Bai Xiaoxi is so pure-hearted, she won't be able to hide anything.]","The Qin family also felt this mix-up was quite annoying. While it's usually best not to meddle in others' lives, this was something they couldn't ignore.","\"I...\" Ji Fei hadn't even found an excuse yet when she suddenly heard Qin Xian say, \"Where do you want to go? I'll come with you.\"","Ji Fei looked at Qin Xian and felt that there was no need to hide things from him. \"I want to find Xiaoxi and Yu Yue.\"","Qin Xian... seemed like someone she could share small secrets with.","Of course, this was just Ji Fei's instinctive thought. She didn't bother making up an excuse, and since Qin Xian didn't ask further and just offered to accompany her, they decided to act together.","[Hmm, Qin Xian is so smart, maybe he can figure things out quickly and analyze the truth. If he takes the lead, I won't have to worry about people thinking it's strange that I know things I shouldn't.]","Qin Xian pulled Ji Fei up and, while finding an excuse to leave, secretly grinned to himself.","Great, his wife was becoming more and more reliant on him. This proved that Ji Fei had him in her heart. He was happy!","Earlier, it was mentioned that Yu Yue was accompanying the bride, and Xiaoxi would also go to the room prepared for the bride when she came to find him. So, asking anyone would tell them where to go.","It was an upstairs room, and since there were elevators downstairs, Qin Xian and Ji Fei didn't run into Yu Yue, who was heading downstairs.","Ji Fei wasn't worried, knowing that Bai Xiaoxi was still hiding in that room, crying. They headed there first.","As they were about to reach the designated room, they turned a corner and saw a man enter the room.","They both stopped and exchanged a glance.","\"Is that...?\" Ji Fei wasn't sure. She had only seen a side profile for a second.","\"Yu Yue's uncle, Yu Yi,\" Qin Xian said, his tone a bit odd.","It wasn't that he doubted why the uncle would suddenly enter his sister-in-law's room, but the look of anger on Yu Yi's face as he entered was unmistakable.","Soon, Ji Fei provided the answer.","[Oh my god, this guy was eavesdropping in the next room! Yu Yue, you really need to be more careful. Your family's rooms are like sieves!]","Qin Xian was also speechless.","The Qin family members were confused. Who was it?","[Is he going to threaten someone? Let me check...]","Qin Xian, however, decided to take Ji Fei to Bai Xiaoxi's room first.","They wanted to knock, but the door was already open. Qin Xian had a hunch that something was off with Yu Yi, so to avoid alerting anyone, he just led Ji Fei inside.","Bai Xiaoxi was still on the balcony, but her expression showed she had just heard something else, as she was covering her mouth in shock. She didn't even have time to react to the two suddenly appearing in her room.","At the same time, Ji Fei was shocked in her mind.","[Oh my god! These two are involved! Yu Yi suspects that Ke Yun'er's child is his. After hearing that the child was lost and that they planned to have another child to replace it, he finally stormed in for an explanation! What on earth is going on here!]"]}]);
